msgstr "r\\[input.syntax\\]"

#: src/input-format.md:5
msgid ""
"```grammar,lexer\n"
"CHAR -> [U+0000-U+D7FF U+E000-U+10FFFF] // a Unicode scalar value\n"
"\n"
"ASCII -> [U+0000-U+007F]\n"
"\n"
"NUL -> U+0000\n"
"\n"
"EOF -> !CHAR  // End of file or input\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```grammar,lexer\n"
"CHAR -> [U+0000-U+D7FF U+E000-U+10FFFF] // a Unicode scalar value\n"
"\n"
"ASCII -> [U+0000-U+007F]\n"
"\n"
"NUL -> U+0000\n"
"\n"
"EOF -> !CHAR  // End of file or input\n"
"```"

#: src/input-format.md:15
msgid ""
"r\\[input.intro\\] This chapter describes how a source file is interpreted "
"as a sequence of tokens."
msgstr "r\\[input.intro\\] 本章描述如何将源文件解释为一系列 token。"

#: src/input-format.md:18
msgid ""
"See [Crates and source files](crates-and-source-files.md) for a description "
"of how programs are organised into files."
msgstr ""
"关于程序如何组织成文件，参见 [crate 和源文件](crates-and-source-files.md)。"

#: src/input-format.md:20
msgid "r\\[input.encoding\\]"
msgstr "r\\[input.encoding\\]"

#: src/input-format.md:21
msgid "Source encoding"
msgstr "源码编码"

#: src/input-format.md:23
msgid ""
"r\\[input.encoding.utf8\\] Each source file is interpreted as a sequence of "
"Unicode characters encoded in UTF-8."
msgstr ""
"r\\[input.encoding.utf8\\] 每个源文件都被解释为一个以 UTF-8 编码的 Unicode 字"
"符序列。"

#: src/input-format.md:26
msgid ""
"r\\[input.encoding.invalid\\] It is an error if the file is not valid UTF-8."
msgstr "r\\[input.encoding.invalid\\] 如果文件不是有效的 UTF-8，则为错误。"

#: src/input-format.md:29
msgid "r\\[input.byte-order-mark\\]"
msgstr "r\\[input.byte-order-mark\\]"

#: src/input-format.md:30
msgid "Byte order mark removal"
msgstr "字节顺序标记移除"

#: src/input-format.md:32
msgid ""
"If the first character in the sequence is `U+FEFF` ([BYTE ORDER MARK]"
"(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_order_mark#UTF-8)), it is removed."
msgstr ""
"如果序列中的第一个字符是 `U+FEFF` ([BYTE ORDER MARK](https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Byte_order_mark#UTF-8))，则移除它。"

#: src/input-format.md:34
msgid "r\\[input.crlf\\]"
msgstr "r\\[input.crlf\\]"

#: src/input-format.md:35
msgid "CRLF normalization"
msgstr "CRLF 规范化"

#: src/input-format.md:37
msgid ""
"Each pair of characters `U+000D` (CR) immediately followed by `U+000A` (LF) "
"is replaced by a single `U+000A` (LF). This happens once, not repeatedly, so "
"after the normalization, there can still exist `U+000D` (CR) immediately "
"followed by `U+000A` (LF) in the input (e.g. if the raw input contained \"CR "
"CR LF LF\")."
msgstr ""
"每一对由 `U+000D` (CR) 后紧跟 `U+000A` (LF) 组成的字符都会替换为单个 "
"`U+000A` (LF)。此操作只发生一次，而非反复进行，因此在规范化之后，输入中仍可能"
"存在 `U+000D` (CR) 后紧跟 `U+000A` (LF) 的情况（例如原始输入包含 \"CR CR LF "
"LF\" 时）。"

#: src/input-format.md:39
msgid ""
"Other occurrences of the character `U+000D` (CR) are left in place (they are "
"treated as [whitespace](whitespace.md))."
msgstr ""
"字符 `U+000D` (CR) 的其他出现位置会保留原样（它们会被视为 [空白]"
"(whitespace.md)）。"

#: src/input-format.md:41
msgid "r\\[input.shebang\\]"
msgstr "r\\[input.shebang\\]"

#: src/input-format.md:42
msgid "Shebang removal"
msgstr "Shebang 移除"

#: src/input-format.md:44
msgid ""
"r\\[input.shebang.removal\\] If a [shebang](shebang.md) is present, it is "
"removed from the input sequence (and is therefore ignored)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[input.shebang.removal\\] 如果存在 [shebang](shebang.md)，则会从输入序列中"
"移除它（因而会忽略它）。"

#: src/input-format.md:47
msgid "r\\[input.tokenization\\]"
msgstr "r\\[input.tokenization\\]"

#: src/input-format.md:48
msgid "Tokenization"
msgstr "词法单元化"

#: src/input-format.md:50
msgid ""
"The resulting sequence of characters is then converted into tokens as "
"described in the remainder of this chapter."
msgstr "然后，得到的字符序列会按照本章其余部分的描述转换为词法单元。"

#: src/input-format.md:52
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The standard library \\[`include!`\\] macro applies the "
"following transformations to the file it reads:"
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 标准库 \\[`include!`\\] 宏会对其读取的文件应用以下转换："

#: src/input-format.md:55
msgid "Byte order mark removal."
msgstr "字节顺序标记移除。"

#: src/input-format.md:56
msgid "CRLF normalization."
msgstr "CRLF 规范化。"

#: src/input-format.md:57
msgid ""
"Shebang removal when invoked in an item context (as opposed to expression or "
"statement contexts)."
msgstr "在项上下文中调用时移除 shebang（区别于表达式或语句上下文）。"

#: src/input-format.md:59
msgid ""
"The \\[`include_str!`\\] and \\[`include_bytes!`\\] macros do not apply "
"these transformations."
msgstr "\\[`include_str!`\\] 和 \\[`include_bytes!`\\] 宏不会应用这些转换。"

