"keyword when used in a type position followed by a path that does not start "
"with `::` or `<`, a lifetime, a question mark, a `for` keyword or an opening "
"parenthesis."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2015 edition 中，当 [`dyn`](types/trait-object.md) 用"
"于类型位置，并后跟一个不以 `::` 或 `<` 开头的路径、生命周期、问号、`for` 关键"
"字或左括号时，它是一个关键字。"

