"\\[!EDITION-2021\\] Raw C string literals are accepted in the 2021 edition "
"or later. In earlier editions the token `cr\"\"` is lexed as `cr \"\"`, and "
"`cr#\"\"#` is lexed as `cr #\"\"#` (which is non-grammatical)."
