#: src/tokens.md:557
msgid ""
"r\\[lex.token.literal.int.empty-with-radix\\] It is an error for a radix "
"prefix to not be followed, after any optional leading underscores, by at "
"least one valid digit for its radix."
msgstr ""
"r\\[lex.token.literal.int.empty-with-radix\\] 基数前缀后面在任意可选的前导下"
"划线之后，若未跟随至少一个对其进制有效的数字，则是错误。"

