#: src/tokens.md:796
msgid ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-prefix.id\\] Source input which would otherwise be "
"lexically interpreted as a non-raw identifier (or a keyword) which is "
"immediately followed by a `#`, `'`, or `\"` character (without intervening "
