"识别为保留前缀。"

#: src/tokens.md:799
msgid ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-prefix.raw-token\\] Note that raw identifiers, raw "
"string literals, and raw byte string literals may contain a `#` character "
"but are not interpreted as containing a reserved prefix."
