"immediately followed by a `#` character (without intervening whitespace) is "
"identified as a reserved lifetime prefix."
msgstr ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-prefix.life\\] 如果源输入本来会被词法解释为非原始生命"
"周期（或关键字），并且其后立即跟随 `#` 字符（中间没有空白），则会被识别为保留"
"生命周期前缀。"

#: src/tokens.md:808
msgid "r\\[lex.token.reserved-prefix.edition2021\\]"
msgstr "r\\[lex.token.reserved-prefix.edition2021\\]"

#: src/tokens.md:809
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2021\\] Starting with the 2021 edition, reserved prefixes are "
"reported as an error by the lexer (in particular, they cannot be passed to "
"macros)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2021\\] 从 2021 edition 开始，保留前缀会由词法分析器报告为错误"
"（特别是，它们不能传给宏）。"

#: src/tokens.md:812
msgid ""
"Before the 2021 edition, reserved prefixes are accepted by the lexer and "
"interpreted as multiple tokens (for example, one token for the identifier or "
"keyword, followed by a `#` token)."
msgstr ""
"在 2021 edition 之前，保留前缀会被词法分析器接受，并解释为多个 token（例如，"
"一个表示标识符或关键字的 token，后跟一个 `#` token）。"

#: src/tokens.md:814
msgid "Examples accepted in all editions:"
msgstr "在所有 edition 中都被接受的示例："

#: src/tokens.md:819 src/tokens.md:829
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr "\"...\""

#: src/tokens.md:820
msgid "// three tokens: r#let # foo\n"
msgstr "// 三个记号：r#let # foo\n"

#: src/tokens.md:824
msgid "Examples accepted before the 2021 edition but rejected later:"
msgstr "在 2021 edition 之前被接受、但之后被拒绝的示例："

#: src/tokens.md:833
msgid "r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards\\]"
msgstr "r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards\\]"

#: src/tokens.md:834
msgid "Reserved guards"
msgstr "保留防护"

#: src/tokens.md:836
msgid "r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.syntax\\]"

#: src/tokens.md:843
msgid ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.intro\\] The reserved guards are syntax "
"reserved for future use, and will generate a compile error if used."
msgstr ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.intro\\] 保留防护是为将来使用而保留的语法；如果"
"使用，将产生编译错误。"

#: src/tokens.md:846
msgid ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.string-literal\\] The _reserved guarded string "
"literal_ is a token of one or more `U+0023` (`#`) immediately followed by a "
"\\[STRING_LITERAL\\]."
msgstr ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.string-literal\\] *保留带防护字符串字面量*是由"
"一个或多个 `U+0023`（`#`）后面立即跟随一个 \\[STRING_LITERAL\\] 所构成的 "
"token。"

#: src/tokens.md:849
msgid ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.pounds\\] The _reserved pounds_ is a token of "
"two or more `U+0023` (`#`)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.pounds\\] *保留井号序列*是由两个或更多 `U+0023`"
"（`#`）构成的 token。"

#: src/tokens.md:852
msgid "r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.edition2024\\]"
msgstr "r\\[lex.token.reserved-guards.edition2024\\]"

#: src/tokens.md:853
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2024\\] Before the 2024 edition, reserved guards are accepted by "
"the lexer and interpreted as multiple tokens. For example, the `#\"foo\"#` "
"form is interpreted as three tokens. `##` is interpreted as two tokens."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2024\\] 在 2024 edition 之前，保留防护会被词法分析器接受，并解释"
"为多个 token。例如，`#\"foo\"#` 形式会被解释为三个 token。`##` 会被解释为两"
"个 token。"

#: src/macros.md:1
msgid "r\\[macro\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro\\]"

#: src/macros.md:4
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.intro\\] The functionality and syntax of Rust can be extended with "
"custom definitions called macros. They are given names, and invoked through "
"a consistent syntax: `some_extension!(...)`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.intro\\] Rust 的功能和语法可以通过称为宏的自定义定义来扩展。宏具有"
"名称，并通过一致的语法调用：`some_extension!(...)`。"

#: src/macros.md:7
msgid "There are two ways to define new macros:"
msgstr "定义新宏有两种方式："

#: src/macros.md:9
msgid ""
"[Macros by Example](macros-by-example.md) define new syntax in a higher-"
"level, declarative way."
msgstr "[示例宏](macros-by-example.md)以更高层次的声明式方式定义新的语法。"

#: src/macros.md:10
msgid ""
"[Procedural Macros](procedural-macros.md) define function-like macros, "
"custom derives, and custom attributes using functions that operate on input "
"tokens."
msgstr ""
"[过程宏](procedural-macros.md)使用对输入 token 进行操作的函数，定义类函数宏、"
"自定义派生和自定义属性。"

