msgstr "[过程宏](procedural-macros.md)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:1
msgid "r\\[macro.decl\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:4
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.syntax\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:42
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.intro\\] `macro_rules` allows users to define syntax "
"extension in a declarative way.  We call such extensions \"macros by "
"example\" or simply \"macros\"."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.intro\\] `macro_rules` 允许用户以声明式方式定义语法扩展。我们"
"称这类扩展为“示例宏”或简称“宏”。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:45
msgid ""
"Each macro by example has a name, and one or more _rules_. Each rule has two "
"parts: a _matcher_, describing the syntax that it matches, and a "
"_transcriber_, describing the syntax that will replace a successfully "
"matched invocation. Both the matcher and the transcriber must be surrounded "
"by delimiters. Macros can expand to expressions, statements, items "
"(including traits, impls, and foreign items), types, or patterns."
msgstr ""
"每个示例宏都有一个名称，以及一条或多条*规则*。每条规则有两部分：*匹配器*，描"
"述它所匹配的语法；以及*转录器*，描述将替换成功匹配的调用的语法。匹配器和转录"
"器都必须由定界符包围。宏可以展开为表达式、语句、项（包括 trait、impl 和外部"
"项）、类型或模式。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:47
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.transcription\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.transcription\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:48
msgid "Transcribing"
msgstr "转录"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:50
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.transcription.intro\\] When a macro is invoked, the macro "
"expander looks up macro invocations by name, and tries each macro rule in "
"turn. It transcribes the first successful match; if this results in an "
"error, then future matches are not tried."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.transcription.intro\\] 调用宏时，宏展开器会按名称查找宏调用，"
"并依次尝试每条宏规则。它会转录第一个成功匹配的规则；如果这导致错误，则不会再"
"尝试后续匹配。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:53
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.transcription.lookahead\\] When matching, no lookahead is "
"performed; if the compiler cannot unambiguously determine how to parse the "
"macro invocation one token at a time, then it is an error. In the following "
"example, the compiler does not look ahead past the identifier to see if the "
"following token is a `)`, even though that would allow it to parse the "
"invocation unambiguously:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.transcription.lookahead\\] 匹配时不会进行向前看；如果编译器无"
"法一次一个 token 地无歧义确定如何解析宏调用，那么这就是错误。在下面的示例中，"
"编译器不会越过标识符向前查看下一个 token 是否为 `)`，即使那样能让它无歧义地解"
"析该调用："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:61
msgid "// Error: local ambiguity\n"
msgstr "// Error: 局部歧义\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:64
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.transcription.syntax\\] In both the matcher and the "
"transcriber, the `$` token is used to invoke special behaviours from the "
"macro engine (described below in [Metavariables](#metavariables) and "
"[Repetitions](#repetitions)). Tokens that aren't part of such an invocation "
"are matched and transcribed literally, with one exception. The exception is "
"that the outer delimiters for the matcher will match any pair of delimiters. "
"Thus, for instance, the matcher `(())` will match `{()}` but not `{{}}`. The "
"character `$` cannot be matched or transcribed literally."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.transcription.syntax\\] 在匹配器和转录器中，`$` token 用于调用"
"宏引擎的特殊行为（下文的[元变量](#metavariables)和[重复](#repetitions)中会描"
"述）。不属于这类调用的 token 会按字面方式匹配和转录，但有一个例外。例外是，匹"
"配器的外层定界符会匹配任意一对定界符。因此，例如匹配器 `(())` 会匹配 `{()}`，"
"但不会匹配 `{{}}`。字符 `$` 不能按字面方式匹配或转录。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:67
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.transcription.fragment\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.transcription.fragment\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:68
msgid "Forwarding a matched fragment"
msgstr "转发已匹配的片段"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:70
msgid ""
"When forwarding a matched fragment to another macro-by-example, matchers in "
"the second macro will see an opaque AST of the fragment type. The second "
"macro can't use literal tokens to match the fragments in the matcher, only a "
"fragment specifier of the same type. The `ident`, `lifetime`, and `tt` "
"fragment types are an exception, and _can_ be matched by literal tokens. The "
"following illustrates this restriction:"
msgstr ""
"将已匹配的片段转发给另一个示例宏时，第二个宏中的匹配器会看到该片段类型的不透"
"明 AST。第二个宏不能用字面 token 来匹配匹配器中的这些片段，只能使用相同类型的"
"片段说明符。`ident`、`lifetime` 和 `tt` 片段类型是例外，*可以*由字面 token 匹"
"配。下面展示了这一限制："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:74
msgid "// ERROR:               ^^ no rules expected this token in macro call\n"
msgstr "// ERROR:               ^^ 宏调用中没有规则预期此记号\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:85
msgid ""
"The following illustrates how tokens can be directly matched after matching "
"a `tt` fragment:"
msgstr "下面展示了在匹配 `tt` 片段之后，token 如何可以被直接匹配："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:88
msgid "// compiles OK\n"
msgstr "// 编译通过\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:100
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.meta\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.meta\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:101
msgid "Metavariables"
msgstr "元变量"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:103
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.meta.intro\\] In the matcher, `$` _name_ `:` _fragment-"
"specifier_ matches a Rust syntax fragment of the kind specified and binds it "
"to the metavariable `$`_name_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.meta.intro\\] 在匹配器中，`$` _name_ `:` _fragment-specifier_ "
"会匹配指定种类的 Rust 语法片段，并将其绑定到元变量 `$`_name_。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:106
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.meta.specifier\\] Valid fragment specifiers are:"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.meta.specifier\\] 有效的片段说明符包括："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:109
msgid "`block`: a \\[BlockExpressionNoInnerAttributes\\]"
msgstr "`block`：一个 \\[BlockExpressionNoInnerAttributes\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:110
msgid "`expr`: an \\[Expression\\]"
msgstr "`expr`：一个 \\[Expression\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:111
msgid ""
"`expr_2021`: an \\[Expression\\] except \\[UnderscoreExpression\\] and \\"
"[ConstBlockExpression\\] (see \\[macro.decl.meta.edition2024\\])"
msgstr ""
"`expr_2021`：一个 \\[Expression\\]，但不包括 \\[UnderscoreExpression\\] 和 \\"
"[ConstBlockExpression\\]（见 \\[macro.decl.meta.edition2024\\]）"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:112
msgid ""
"`ident`: an \\[IDENTIFIER_OR_KEYWORD\\] except `_`, \\[RAW_IDENTIFIER\\], or "
"[`$crate`](macro.decl.hygiene.crate)"
msgstr ""
"`ident`：一个 \\[IDENTIFIER_OR_KEYWORD\\]，但不包括 `_`、\\"
"[RAW_IDENTIFIER\\] 或 [`$crate`](macro.decl.hygiene.crate)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:113
msgid "`item`: an \\[Item\\]"
msgstr "`item`：一个 \\[Item\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:114
msgid "`lifetime`: a \\[LIFETIME_TOKEN\\]"
msgstr "`lifetime`：一个 \\[LIFETIME_TOKEN\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:115
msgid "`literal`: matches `-`<sup>?</sup>\\[LiteralExpression\\]"
msgstr "`literal`：匹配 `-`<sup>?</sup>\\[LiteralExpression\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:116
msgid "`meta`: an \\[Attr\\], the contents of an attribute"
msgstr "`meta`：一个 \\[Attr\\]，即属性的内容"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:117
msgid "`pat`: a \\[Pattern\\] (see \\[macro.decl.meta.edition2021\\])"
msgstr "`pat`：一个 \\[Pattern\\]（见 \\[macro.decl.meta.edition2021\\]）"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:118
msgid "`pat_param`: a \\[PatternNoTopAlt\\]"
msgstr "`pat_param`：一个 \\[PatternNoTopAlt\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:119
msgid "`path`: a \\[TypePath\\]"
msgstr "`path`：一个 \\[TypePath\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:120
msgid ""
"`stmt`: a \\[Statement\\]\\[grammar-Statement\\] without the trailing "
"semicolon (except for item statements that require semicolons)"
msgstr ""
"`stmt`：一个不带尾随分号的 \\[Statement\\]\\[grammar-Statement\\]（需要分号的"
"项语句除外）"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:121
msgid ""
"`tt`: a \\[TokenTree\\] (a single [token](tokens.md) or tokens in matching "
"delimiters `()`, `[]`, or `{}`)"
msgstr ""
"`tt`：一个 \\[TokenTree\\]（单个 [token](tokens.md)，或匹配定界符 `()`、`[]` "
"或 `{}` 中的 token）"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:122
msgid "`ty`: a \\[Type\\]\\[grammar-Type\\]"
msgstr "`ty`：一个 \\[Type\\]\\[grammar-Type\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:123
msgid "`vis`: a possibly empty \\[Visibility\\] qualifier"
msgstr "`vis`：一个可能为空的 \\[Visibility\\] 限定符"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:125
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.meta.transcription\\] In the transcriber, metavariables are "
"referred to simply by `$`_name_, since the fragment kind is specified in the "
"matcher. Metavariables are replaced with the syntax element that matched "
"them. Metavariables can be transcribed more than once or not at all."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.meta.transcription\\] 在转录器中，元变量只需用 `$`_name_ 引"
"用，因为片段种类已在匹配器中指定。元变量会被替换为与之匹配的语法元素。元变量"
"可以被转录多次，也可以完全不被转录。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:128
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.meta.dollar-crate\\] The keyword metavariable [`$crate`]"
"(macro.decl.hygiene.crate) can be used to refer to the current crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.meta.dollar-crate\\] 关键字元变量 [`$crate`]"
"(macro.decl.hygiene.crate) 可用于指代当前 crate。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:131
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.meta.edition2021\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.meta.edition2021\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:132
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2021\\] Starting with the 2021 edition, `pat` fragment-"
"specifiers match top-level or-patterns (that is, they accept \\[Pattern\\])."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2021\\] 从 2021 edition 开始，`pat` 片段说明符会匹配顶层 or-"
"pattern（也就是说，它们接受 \\[Pattern\\]）。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:135
msgid ""
"Before the 2021 edition, they match exactly the same fragments as "
"`pat_param` (that is, they accept \\[PatternNoTopAlt\\])."
msgstr ""
"在 2021 edition 之前，它们匹配的片段与 `pat_param` 完全相同（也就是说，它们接"
"受 \\[PatternNoTopAlt\\]）。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:137
msgid ""
"The relevant edition is the one in effect for the `macro_rules!` definition."
msgstr "相关 edition 是 `macro_rules!` 定义所处的 edition。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:139
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.meta.edition2024\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.meta.edition2024\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:140
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2024\\] Before the 2024 edition, `expr` fragment specifiers do "
"not match \\[UnderscoreExpression\\] or \\[ConstBlockExpression\\] at the "
"top level. They are allowed within subexpressions."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2024\\] 在 2024 edition 之前，`expr` 片段说明符在顶层不匹配 \\"
"[UnderscoreExpression\\] 或 \\[ConstBlockExpression\\]。它们允许出现在子表达"
"式内部。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:143
msgid ""
"The `expr_2021` fragment specifier exists to maintain backwards "
"compatibility with editions before 2024."
msgstr ""
"`expr_2021` 片段说明符的存在是为了维持与 2024 之前 edition 的向后兼容性。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:145
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.repetition\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.repetition\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:146
msgid "Repetitions"
msgstr "重复"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:148
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.repetition.intro\\] In both the matcher and transcriber, "
"repetitions are indicated by placing the tokens to be repeated inside `$(`…"
"`)`, followed by a repetition operator, optionally with a separator token "
"between."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.repetition.intro\\] 在匹配器和转录器中，重复通过将要重复的 "
"token 放在 `$(`…`)` 内并跟随一个重复运算符来表示，中间还可以选择性地带有一个"
"分隔符 token。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:151
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.repetition.separator\\] The separator token can be any token "
"other than a delimiter or one of the repetition operators, but `;` and `,` "
"are the most common. For instance, `$( $i:ident ),*` represents any number "
"of identifiers separated by commas. Nested repetitions are permitted."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.repetition.separator\\] 分隔符 token 可以是除定界符或重复运算"
"符之外的任何 token，但 `;` 和 `,` 最常见。例如，`$( $i:ident ),*` 表示任意数"
"量的标识符，以逗号分隔。允许嵌套重复。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:154
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.repetition.operators\\] The repetition operators are:"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.repetition.operators\\] 重复运算符包括："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:157
msgid "`*` --- indicates any number of repetitions."
msgstr "`*` —— 表示任意次数的重复。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:158
msgid "`+` --- indicates any number but at least one."
msgstr "`+` —— 表示任意次数，但至少一次。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:159
msgid "`?` --- indicates an optional fragment with zero or one occurrence."
msgstr "`?` —— 表示出现零次或一次的可选片段。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:161
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.repetition.optional-restriction\\] Since `?` represents at "
"most one occurrence, it cannot be used with a separator."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.repetition.optional-restriction\\] 由于 `?` 表示至多出现一次，"
"所以它不能与分隔符一起使用。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:164
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.repetition.fragment\\] The repeated fragment both matches and "
"transcribes to the specified number of the fragment, separated by the "
"separator token. Metavariables are matched to every repetition of their "
"corresponding fragment. For instance, the `$( $i:ident ),*` example above "
"matches `$i` to all of the identifiers in the list."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.repetition.fragment\\] 重复片段会匹配并转录为指定数量的片段，"
"这些片段由分隔符 token 分隔。元变量会匹配其对应片段的每一次重复。例如，上面"
"的 `$( $i:ident ),*` 例子会将 `$i` 匹配到列表中的所有标识符。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:167
msgid ""
"During transcription, additional restrictions apply to repetitions so that "
"the compiler knows how to expand them properly:"
msgstr "转录期间，对重复还会施加额外限制，以便编译器知道如何正确展开它们："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:169
msgid ""
"A metavariable must appear in exactly the same number, kind, and nesting "
"order of repetitions in the transcriber as it did in the matcher. So for the "
"matcher `$( $i:ident ),*`, the transcribers `=> { $i }`, `=> { $( $"
"( $i )* )* }`, and `=> { $( $i )+ }` are all illegal, but `=> { $( $i );* }` "
"is correct and replaces a comma-separated list of identifiers with a "
"semicolon-separated list."
msgstr ""
"元变量在转录器中出现时，必须与它在匹配器中一样，处于完全相同数量、种类和嵌套"
"顺序的重复中。因此，对于匹配器 `$( $i:ident ),*`，转录器 `=> { $i }`、`=> { $"
"( $( $i )* )* }` 和 `=> { $( $i )+ }` 都是非法的，但 `=> { $( $i );* }` 是正"
"确的，它会把逗号分隔的标识符列表替换为分号分隔的列表。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:170
msgid ""
"Each repetition in the transcriber must contain at least one metavariable to "
"decide how many times to expand it. If multiple metavariables appear in the "
"same repetition, they must be bound to the same number of fragments. For "
"instance, `( $( $i:ident ),* ; $( $j:ident ),* ) => (( $( ($i,$j) ),* ))` "
"must bind the same number of `$i` fragments as `$j` fragments. This means "
"that invoking the macro with `(a, b, c; d, e, f)` is legal and expands to "
"`((a,d), (b,e), (c,f))`, but `(a, b, c; d, e)` is illegal because it does "
"not have the same number. This requirement applies to every layer of nested "
"repetitions."
msgstr ""
"转录器中的每个重复都必须包含至少一个元变量，以决定它应展开多少次。如果同一个"
"重复中出现多个元变量，它们必须绑定到相同数量的片段。例如，`( $"
"( $i:ident ),* ; $( $j:ident ),* ) => (( $( ($i,$j) ),* ))` 必须将 `$i` 片段"
"和 `$j` 片段绑定到相同数量。这意味着用 `(a, b, c; d, e, f)` 调用该宏是合法"
"的，并会展开为 `((a,d), (b,e), (c,f))`，但 `(a, b, c; d, e)` 是非法的，因为它"
"们的数量不相同。此要求适用于嵌套重复的每一层。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:172
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.scope\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.scope\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:173
msgid "Scoping, exporting, and importing"
msgstr "作用域、导出和导入"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:175
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.intro\\] For historical reasons, the scoping of macros "
"by example does not work entirely like items. Macros have two forms of "
"scope: textual scope, and path-based scope. Textual scope is based on the "
"order that things appear in source files, or even across multiple files, and "
"is the default scoping. It is explained further below. Path-based scope "
"works exactly the same way that item scoping does. The scoping, exporting, "
"and importing of macros is controlled largely by attributes."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.intro\\] 由于历史原因，示例宏的作用域并不完全像项那样工"
"作。宏有两种形式的作用域：文本作用域和基于路径的作用域。文本作用域基于事物在"
"源文件中出现的顺序，甚至可以跨多个文件，并且是默认作用域。下文会进一步说明"
"它。基于路径的作用域与项作用域的工作方式完全相同。宏的作用域、导出和导入很大"
"程度上由属性控制。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:178
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.unqualified\\] When a macro is invoked by an "
"unqualified identifier (not part of a multi-part path), it is first looked "
"up in textual scoping. If this does not yield any results, then it is looked "
"up in path-based scoping. If the macro's name is qualified with a path, then "
"it is only looked up in path-based scoping."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.unqualified\\] 当通过非限定标识符（不是多段路径的一部"
"分）调用宏时，会首先在文本作用域中查找。如果这没有产生任何结果，则会在基于路"
"径的作用域中查找。如果宏的名称带有路径限定，则只会在基于路径的作用域中查找。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:183
msgid "// Path-based import.\n"
msgstr "// 基于路径的导入。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:185
msgid "// Textual definition.\n"
msgstr "// 文本定义。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:189
msgid "// Textual lookup finds our macro first.\n"
msgstr "// 文本查找首先找到我们的宏。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:190
msgid "// Path-based lookup ignores our macro, finds imported one.\n"
msgstr "// 基于路径的查找会忽略我们的宏，找到导入的宏。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:193
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.scope.textual\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.scope.textual\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:194
msgid "Textual scope"
msgstr "文本作用域"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:196
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.textual.intro\\] Textual scope is based largely on the "
"order that things appear in source files, and works similarly to the scope "
"of local variables declared with `let` except it also applies at the module "
"level. When `macro_rules!` is used to define a macro, the macro enters the "
"scope after the definition (note that it can still be used recursively, "
"since names are looked up from the invocation site), up until its "
"surrounding scope, typically a module, is closed. This can enter child "
"modules and even span across multiple files:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.textual.intro\\] 文本作用域很大程度上基于事物在源文件中"
"出现的顺序，其工作方式类似于用 `let` 声明的局部变量的作用域，只不过它也适用于"
"模块级别。当使用 `macro_rules!` 定义宏时，该宏会在定义之后进入作用域（注意，"
"它仍然可以递归使用，因为名称是从调用位置查找的），直到其外围作用域（通常是一"
"个模块）闭合为止。这可以进入子模块，甚至跨越多个文件："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:201
msgid "//// src/lib.rs\n"
msgstr "//// src/lib.rs\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:203 src/macros-by-example.md:212
msgid "// m!{} // Error: m is not in scope.\n"
msgstr "// m!{} // 错误：m 不在作用域内。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:208
msgid "// OK: appears after declaration of m.\n"
msgstr "// OK：出现在 m 的声明之后。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:214
msgid "//// src/has_macro/uses_macro.rs\n"
msgstr "//// src/has_macro/uses_macro.rs\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:217
msgid "// OK: appears after declaration of m in src/lib.rs\n"
msgstr "// OK：出现在 src/lib.rs 中 m 的声明之后\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:220
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.textual.shadow\\] It is not an error to define a macro "
"multiple times; the most recent declaration will shadow the previous one "
"unless it has gone out of scope."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.textual.shadow\\] 多次定义同一个宏并不是错误；除非最近的"
"声明已经离开作用域，否则它会遮蔽之前的声明。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:236
msgid "// m!(1); // Error: no rule matches '1'\n"
msgstr "// m!(1); // 错误：没有规则匹配 '1'\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:248
msgid ""
"Macros can be declared and used locally inside functions as well, and work "
"similarly:"
msgstr "宏也可以在函数内部局部声明和使用，其工作方式类似："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:252 src/macros-by-example.md:258
msgid "// m!(); // Error: m is not in scope.\n"
msgstr "// m!(); // 错误：m 不在作用域内。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:262
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.textual.shadow.path-based\\] Textual scope name "
"bindings for macros shadow path-based scope bindings to macros."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.textual.shadow.path-based\\] 宏的文本作用域名称绑定会遮"
"蔽宏的基于路径的作用域绑定。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:268
msgid "\"m2\""
msgstr "\"m2\""

#: src/macros-by-example.md:271
msgid "// Resolves to path-based candidate from use declaration below.\n"
msgstr "// 解析为来自下方 use 声明的基于路径的候选项。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:273
msgid "// prints \"m2\\n\"\n"
msgstr "// 打印 \"m2\\n\"\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:274
msgid ""
"// Introduce second candidate for `m` with textual scope.\n"
"//\n"
"// This shadows path-based candidate from below for the rest of this\n"
"// example.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 引入具有文本作用域的 `m` 的第二个候选项。\n"
"//\n"
"// 这会在本示例余下部分中遮蔽来自下方的\n"
"// 基于路径的候选项。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:281
msgid "\"m\""
msgstr "\"m\""

#: src/macros-by-example.md:284
msgid ""
"// Introduce `m2` macro as path-based candidate.\n"
"//\n"
"// This item is in scope for this entire example, not just below the\n"
"// use declaration.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 引入 `m2` 宏作为基于路径的候选项。\n"
"//\n"
"// 此项在整个示例中都在作用域内，不仅仅是在\n"
"// use 声明下方。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:290
msgid ""
"// Resolves to the textual macro candidate from above the use\n"
"// declaration.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 解析为来自 use 声明\n"
"// 上方的文本宏候选项。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:293
msgid "// prints \"m\\n\"\n"
msgstr "// 打印 \"m\\n\"\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:296
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] For areas where shadowing is not allowed, see [name resolution "
"ambiguities](names/name-resolution.md#r-"
"names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 对于不允许遮蔽的区域，见[名称解析歧义](names/name-"
"resolution.md#r-names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:299
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.scope.path-based\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.scope.path-based\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:302
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.path-based.intro\\] By default, a macro has no path-"
"based scope. Macros can gain path-based scope in two ways:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.path-based.intro\\] 默认情况下，宏没有基于路径的作用域。"
"宏可以通过两种方式获得基于路径的作用域："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:305
msgid "[Use declaration re-export](items/use-declarations.md#use-visibility)"
msgstr "[use 声明重导出](items/use-declarations.md#use-visibility)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:306
msgid "[`macro_export`](#the-macro_export-attribute)"
msgstr "[`macro_export`](#the-macro_export-attribute)"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:308
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.path.reexport\\] Macros can be re-exported to give them "
"path-based scope from a module other than the crate root."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.path.reexport\\] 宏可以被重导出，从而让它们从 crate 根以"
"外的模块获得基于路径的作用域。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:312
msgid "// OK: Path-based lookup finds `m` in the mac module.\n"
msgstr "// OK：基于路径的查找会在 mac 模块中找到 `m`。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:315
msgid "// Introduce macro `m` with textual scope.\n"
msgstr "// 引入具有文本作用域的宏 `m`。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:320
msgid "// Reexport with path-based scope from within `m`'s textual scope.\n"
msgstr "// 从 `m` 的文本作用域内以基于路径的作用域重新导出。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:325
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.path-based.visibility\\] Macros have an implicit "
"visibility of `pub(crate)`. `#[macro_export]` changes the implicit "
"visibility to `pub`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.path-based.visibility\\] 宏具有隐式的 `pub(crate)` 可见"
"性。`#[macro_export]` 会将隐式可见性改为 `pub`。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:329 src/macros-by-example.md:345
msgid "// Implicit visibility is `pub(crate)`.\n"
msgstr "// 隐式可见性为 `pub(crate)`。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:333 src/macros-by-example.md:350
msgid "// Implicit visibility is `pub`.\n"
msgstr "// 隐式可见性为 `pub`。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:340 src/macros-by-example.md:341
#: src/macros-by-example.md:356 src/macros-by-example.md:357
#: src/attributes/diagnostics.md:492 src/attributes/diagnostics.md:538
#: src/attributes/diagnostics.md:539 src/names/name-resolution.md:88
#: src/names/name-resolution.md:89 src/names/name-resolution.md:90
#: src/names/name-resolution.md:91 src/names/name-resolution.md:94
#: src/names/name-resolution.md:95 src/names/name-resolution.md:191
#: src/names/name-resolution.md:224 src/names/name-resolution.md:256
msgid "// OK.\n"
msgstr "// 正确。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:359
msgid ""
"// ERROR: `private_m` is only public within\n"
"                   // the crate and cannot be re-exported outside.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 错误：`private_m` 仅在\n"
"                   // crate 内是公开的，不能重新导出到外部。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:364
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:365
msgid "The `macro_use` attribute"
msgstr "`macro_use` 属性"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:367
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.intro\\] The _`macro_use` \\[attribute\\]\\"
"[attributes\\]_ has two purposes: it may be used on modules to extend the "
"scope of macros defined within them, and it may be used on \\[`extern "
"crate`\\]\\[items.extern-crate\\] to import macros from another crate into "
"the [`macro_use` prelude](names/preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.intro\\] *`macro_use` \\[属性\\]\\"
"[attributes\\]* 有两个用途：它可以用在模块上，以扩展其中定义的宏的作用域；也"
"可以用在 \\[`extern crate`\\]\\[items.extern-crate\\] 上，以将另一个 crate 中"
"的宏导入 [`macro_use` prelude](names/preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:386
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.syntax\\] When used on modules, the "
"`macro_use` attribute uses the \\[MetaWord\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.syntax\\] 用在模块上时，`macro_use` 属性使用 "
"\\[MetaWord\\] 语法。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:389
msgid ""
"When used on `extern crate`, it uses the \\[MetaWord\\] and \\"
"[MetaListIdents\\] syntaxes. For more on how these syntaxes may be used, see "
"\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.prelude\\]."
msgstr ""
"用在 `extern crate` 上时，它使用 \\[MetaWord\\] 和 \\[MetaListIdents\\] 语"
"法。关于这些语法可如何使用的更多信息，见 \\"
"[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.prelude\\]。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:391
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.allowed-positions\\] The `macro_use` "
"attribute may be applied to modules or `extern crate`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.allowed-positions\\] `macro_use` 属性可以应用"
"于模块或 `extern crate`。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:394 src/macros-by-example.md:481
#: src/items/extern-crates.md:87 src/items/external-blocks.md:414
#: src/attributes/testing.md:112 src/attributes/testing.md:170
#: src/attributes/derive.md:99 src/attributes/diagnostics.md:376
#: src/attributes/codegen.md:41 src/attributes/codegen.md:105
#: src/attributes/codegen.md:871 src/attributes/limits.md:77
#: src/names/preludes.md:173
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `rustc` ignores use in other positions but lints against it. "
"This may become an error in the future."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `rustc` 会忽略在其他位置的使用，但会对此发出 lint。将来这可能会变"
"成错误。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:397
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.extern-crate-self\\] The `macro_use` "
"attribute may not be used on [`extern crate self`](items.extern-crate.self)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.extern-crate-self\\] `macro_use` 属性不能用于 "
"[`extern crate self`](items.extern-crate.self)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:400
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.duplicates\\] The `macro_use` attribute may "
"be used any number of times on a form."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.duplicates\\] `macro_use` 属性可以在一种形式上"
"使用任意多次。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:403
msgid ""
"Multiple instances of `macro_use` in the \\[MetaListIdents\\] syntax may be "
"specified. The union of all specified macros will be imported."
msgstr ""
"可以指定多个使用 \\[MetaListIdents\\] 语法的 `macro_use` 实例。所有指定宏的并"
"集将被导入。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:405
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] On modules, `rustc` lints against any \\[MetaWord\\] `macro_use` "
"attributes following the first."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 在模块上，`rustc` 会对第一个之后的任何 \\[MetaWord\\] "
"`macro_use` 属性发出 lint。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:408
msgid ""
"On `extern crate`, `rustc` lints against any `macro_use` attributes that "
"have no effect due to not importing any macros not already imported by "
"another `macro_use` attribute. If two or more \\[MetaListIdents\\] "
"`macro_use` attributes import the same macro, the first is linted against. "
"If any \\[MetaWord\\] `macro_use` attributes are present, all \\"
"[MetaListIdents\\] `macro_use` attributes are linted against. If two or more "
"\\[MetaWord\\] `macro_use` attributes are present, the ones following the "
"first are linted against."
msgstr ""
"在 `extern crate` 上，`rustc` 会对任何无效果的 `macro_use` 属性发出 lint；这"
"些属性之所以无效果，是因为它们没有导入任何尚未由另一个 `macro_use` 属性导入的"
"宏。如果两个或更多 \\[MetaListIdents\\] `macro_use` 属性导入同一个宏，则会对"
"第一个发出 lint。如果存在任何 \\[MetaWord\\] `macro_use` 属性，则会对所有 \\"
"[MetaListIdents\\] `macro_use` 属性发出 lint。如果存在两个或更多 \\"
"[MetaWord\\] `macro_use` 属性，则会对第一个之后的那些发出 lint。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:410
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.mod-decl\\] When `macro_use` is used on a "
"module, the module's macro scope extends beyond the module's lexical scope."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.mod-decl\\] 当 `macro_use` 用在模块上时，该模"
"块的宏作用域会延伸到模块的词法作用域之外。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:424
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.prelude\\] Specifying `macro_use` on an "
"`extern crate` declaration in the crate root imports exported macros from "
"that crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.prelude\\] 在 crate 根中的 `extern crate` 声明"
"上指定 `macro_use`，会从该 crate 导入已导出的宏。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:427
msgid ""
"Macros imported this way are imported into the [`macro_use` prelude](names/"
"preludes.md#macro_use-prelude), not textually, which means that they can be "
"shadowed by any other name. Macros imported by `macro_use` can be used "
"before the import statement."
msgstr ""
"以这种方式导入的宏会导入到 [`macro_use` prelude](names/preludes.md#macro_use-"
"prelude)，而不是按文本方式导入；这意味着它们可以被任何其他名称遮蔽。由 "
"`macro_use` 导入的宏可以在导入语句之前使用。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:429
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `rustc` currently prefers the last macro imported in case of "
"conflict. Don't rely on this. This behavior is unusual, as imports in Rust "
"are generally order-independent. This behavior of `macro_use` may change in "
"the future."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 发生冲突时，`rustc` 目前偏向最后导入的宏。不要依赖这一点。此行为"
"并不寻常，因为 Rust 中的导入通常与顺序无关。`macro_use` 的此行为将来可能会改"
"变。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:432
msgid ""
"For details, see [Rust issue #148025](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/148025)."
msgstr ""
"详情见 [Rust issue #148025](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/"
"148025)。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:434
msgid ""
"When using the \\[MetaWord\\] syntax, all exported macros are imported. When "
"using the \\[MetaListIdents\\] syntax, only the specified macros are "
"imported."
msgstr ""
"使用 \\[MetaWord\\] 语法时，会导入所有已导出的宏。使用 \\[MetaListIdents\\] "
"语法时，只会导入指定的宏。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:439
msgid "// Or `#[macro_use]` to import all macros.\n"
msgstr "// 或使用 `#[macro_use]` 导入所有宏。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:443
msgid ""
"// self::lazy_static!{} // ERROR: lazy_static is not defined in `self`.\n"
msgstr "// self::lazy_static!{} // 错误：lazy_static 未在 `self` 中定义。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:446
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.export\\] Macros to be imported with "
"`macro_use` must be exported with \\[`macro_export`\\]\\"
"[macro.decl.scope.macro_export\\]."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_use.export\\] 要用 `macro_use` 导入的宏必须用 \\"
"[`macro_export`\\]\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export\\] 导出。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:450
msgid "r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export\\]"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:451
msgid "The `macro_export` attribute"
msgstr "`macro_export` 属性"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:453
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.intro\\] The _`macro_export` \\"
"[attribute\\]\\[attributes\\]_ exports the macro from the crate and makes it "
"available in the root of the crate for path-based resolution."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.intro\\] *`macro_export` \\[属性\\]\\"
"[attributes\\]* 会从 crate 中导出宏，并使其可在 crate 根中用于基于路径的解"
"析。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:459
msgid "//  ^^^^ OK: Path-based lookup finds `m` in the current module.\n"
msgstr "//  ^^^^ OK：基于路径的查找会在当前模块中找到 `m`。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:460 src/expressions/block-expr.md:56
#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:66 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1220
#: src/destructors.md:546 src/destructors.md:548 src/destructors.md:620
#: src/const_eval.md:102
msgid "// As above.\n"
msgstr "// 同上。\n"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:475
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.syntax\\] The `macro_export` attribute "
"uses the \\[MetaWord\\] and \\[MetaListIdents\\] syntaxes. With the \\"
"[MetaListIdents\\] syntax, it accepts a single \\[`local_inner_macros`\\]\\"
"[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.local_inner_macros\\] value."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.syntax\\] `macro_export` 属性使用 \\"
"[MetaWord\\] 和 \\[MetaListIdents\\] 语法。使用 \\[MetaListIdents\\] 语法时，"
"它接受单个 \\[`local_inner_macros`\\]\\"
"[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.local_inner_macros\\] 值。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:478
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.allowed-positions\\] The `macro_export` "
"attribute may be applied to `macro_rules` definitions."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.allowed-positions\\] `macro_export` 属性可"
"以应用于 `macro_rules` 定义。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:484
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.duplicates\\] Only the first use of "
"`macro_export` on a macro has effect."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.duplicates\\] 在一个宏上，只有第一次使用 "
"`macro_export` 会有效果。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:487 src/attributes/derive.md:105
#: src/attributes/codegen.md:156 src/attributes/codegen.md:220
#: src/names/preludes.md:104 src/names/preludes.md:179 src/abi.md:61
msgid "\\[!NOTE\\] `rustc` lints against any use following the first."
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] `rustc` 会对第一次之后的任何使用发出 lint。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:490
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.path-based\\] By default, macros only have "
"\\[textual scope\\]\\[macro.decl.scope.textual\\] and cannot be resolved by "
"path. When the `macro_export` attribute is used, the macro is made available "
"in the crate root and can be referred to by its path."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.path-based\\] 默认情况下，宏只有\\[文本作用"
"域\\]\\[macro.decl.scope.textual\\]，不能通过路径解析。使用 `macro_export` 属"
"性时，宏会在 crate 根中可用，并且可以通过它的路径引用。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:493
msgid ""
"\\[!EXAMPLE\\] Without `macro_export`, macros only have textual scope, so "
"path-based resolution of the macro fails."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EXAMPLE\\] 没有 `macro_export` 时，宏只有文本作用域，因此该宏的基于路径的"
"解析会失败。"

