"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.export\\] The `macro_export` attribute "
"causes a macro to be exported from the crate root so that it can be referred "
"to in other crates by path."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.decl.scope.macro_export.export\\] `macro_export` 属性会使宏从 "
"crate 根导出，从而可以在其他 crate 中通过路径引用它。"

#: src/macros-by-example.md:520 src/macros-by-example.md:542
msgid "\\[!EXAMPLE\\] Given the following in a `log` crate:"
msgstr "\\[!EXAMPLE\\] 给定 `log` crate 中的以下内容："

#: src/macros-by-example.md:526 src/macros-by-example.md:548
msgid "\"WARN: {}\""
