msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.syntax\\] The `proc_macro` attribute uses the \\"
"[MetaWord\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.syntax\\] `proc_macro` 属性使用 \\[MetaWord\\] 语"
"法。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:91
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.allowed-positions\\] The `proc_macro` attribute "
"may only be applied to a `pub` function of type `fn(TokenStream) -> "
"TokenStream` where [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) comes from the "
"[`proc_macro` crate](proc_macro). It must have the \\[\"Rust\" ABI\\]\\"
"[items.fn.extern\\]. No other function qualifiers are allowed. It must be "
"located in the root of the crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.allowed-positions\\] `proc_macro` 属性只能应用于类"
"型为 `fn(TokenStream) -> TokenStream` 的 `pub` 函数，其中 [`TokenStream`]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) 来自 [`proc_macro` crate](proc_macro)。它必须具有 "
"\\[\"Rust\" ABI\\]\\[items.fn.extern\\]。不允许使用其他函数限定符。它必须位"
"于 crate 根。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:94
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.duplicates\\] The `proc_macro` attribute may only "
"be specified once on a function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.duplicates\\] `proc_macro` 属性在一个函数上只能指定"
"一次。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:97
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.namespace\\] The `proc_macro` attribute publicly "
"defines the macro in the [macro namespace](names/namespaces.md) in the root "
"of the crate with the same name as the function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.namespace\\] `proc_macro` 属性会在 crate 根的[宏命"
"名空间](names/namespaces.md)中公开定义一个与该函数同名的宏。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:100
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.behavior\\] A function-like macro invocation of a "
"function-like procedural macro will pass what is inside the delimiters of "
"the macro invocation as the input [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) "
"argument and replace the entire macro invocation with the output "
"[`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) of the function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.behavior\\] 对类函数过程宏进行类函数宏调用时，会将"
"宏调用定界符内的内容作为输入 [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) 实参传"
"递，并用该函数的输出 [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) 替换整个宏调"
"用。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:103
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.invocation\\] Function-like procedural macros may "
"be invoked in any macro invocation position, which includes:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.proc_macro.invocation\\] 类函数过程宏可以在任何宏调用位置调"
"用，包括："

