msgstr "[Trait 定义](items/traits.md)"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:115
msgid "r\\[macro.proc.derive\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.derive\\]"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:116
msgid "The `proc_macro_derive` attribute"
msgstr "`proc_macro_derive` 属性"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:118
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.intro\\] Applying the _`proc_macro_derive` [attribute]"
"(attributes.md)_ to a function defines a _derive macro_ that can be invoked "
"by the [`derive` attribute](attributes/derive.md). These macros are given "
"the token stream of a [struct](items/structs.md), [enum](items/"
"enumerations.md), or [union](items/unions.md) definition and can emit new "
"[items](items.md) after it. They can also declare and use [derive macro "
"helper attributes](#derive-macro-helper-attributes)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.intro\\] 将 *`proc_macro_derive` [属性]"
"(attributes.md)* 应用于函数会定义一个 *derive 宏*，该宏可以由 [`derive` 属性]"
"(attributes/derive.md)调用。这些宏会收到 [struct](items/structs.md)、[enum]"
"(items/enumerations.md) 或 [union](items/unions.md) 定义的 token 流，并可以在"
"其后发出新的[项](items.md)。它们还可以声明和使用 [derive 宏辅助属性](#derive-"
"macro-helper-attributes)。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:121
msgid ""
"\\[!EXAMPLE\\] This derive macro ignores its input and appends tokens that "
"define a function."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EXAMPLE\\] 这个 derive 宏会忽略其输入，并追加用于定义一个函数的 token。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:136 src/procedural-macros.md:202
msgid "To use it, we might write:"
msgstr "要使用它，可以这样写："

#: src/procedural-macros.md:151
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.syntax\\] The syntax for the `proc_macro_derive` "
"attribute is:"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.derive.syntax\\] `proc_macro_derive` 属性的语法为："

#: src/procedural-macros.md:164
msgid ""
"The name of the derive macro is given by \\[DeriveMacroName\\]. The optional "
"`attributes` argument is described in \\[macro.proc.derive.attributes\\]."
msgstr ""
"derive 宏的名称由 \\[DeriveMacroName\\] 给出。可选的 `attributes` 实参在 \\"
"[macro.proc.derive.attributes\\] 中描述。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:166
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.allowed-positions\\] The `proc_macro_derive` attribute "
"may only be applied to a `pub` function with the \\[Rust ABI\\]\\"
"[items.fn.extern\\] defined in the root of the crate with a type of "
"`fn(TokenStream) -> TokenStream`  where [`TokenStream`]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) comes from the [`proc_macro` crate](proc_macro). "
"The function may be `const` and may use `extern` to explicitly specify the "
"Rust ABI, but it may not use any other \\[qualifiers\\]\\"
"[FunctionQualifiers\\] (e.g. it may not be `async` or `unsafe`)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.allowed-positions\\] `proc_macro_derive` 属性只能应用于"
"在 crate 根定义、具有 \\[Rust ABI\\]\\[items.fn.extern\\]、类型为 "
"`fn(TokenStream) -> TokenStream` 的 `pub` 函数，其中 [`TokenStream`]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) 来自 [`proc_macro` crate](proc_macro)。该函数可以"
"是 `const`，也可以使用 `extern` 显式指定 Rust ABI，但不得使用任何其他 \\[限定"
"符\\]\\[FunctionQualifiers\\]（例如不得为 `async` 或 `unsafe`）。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:169
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.duplicates\\] The `proc_macro_derive` attribute may be "
"used only once on a function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.duplicates\\] `proc_macro_derive` 属性在一个函数上只能"
"使用一次。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:172
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.namespace\\] The `proc_macro_derive` attribute "
"publicly defines the derive macro in the [macro namespace](names/"
"namespaces.md) in the root of the crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.namespace\\] `proc_macro_derive` 属性会在 crate 根的[宏"
"命名空间](names/namespaces.md)中公开定义该 derive 宏。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:175
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.output\\] The input [`TokenStream`]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) is the token stream of the item to which the "
"`derive` attribute is applied. The output [`TokenStream`]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) must be a (possibly empty) set of items. These "
"items are appended following the input item within the same [module](items/"
"modules.md) or [block](expressions/block-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.output\\] 输入 [`TokenStream`]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) 是应用了 `derive` 属性的项的 token 流。输出 "
"[`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) 必须是一个（可能为空的）项集合。这些"
"项会在同一[模块](items/modules.md)或[块](expressions/block-expr.md)中追加到输"
"入项之后。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:178
msgid "r\\[macro.proc.derive.attributes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.derive.attributes\\]"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:179 src/names/scopes.md:288
msgid "Derive macro helper attributes"
msgstr "派生宏辅助属性"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:181
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.attributes.intro\\] Derive macros can declare _derive "
"macro helper attributes_ to be used within the scope of the [item](items.md) "
"to which the derive macro is applied. These [attributes](attributes.md) are "
"[inert](attributes.md#active-and-inert-attributes). While their purpose is "
"to be used by the macro that declared them, they can be seen by any macro."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.attributes.intro\\] derive 宏可以声明 *derive 宏辅助属"
"性*，供应用该 derive 宏的[项](items.md)作用域内使用。这些[属性]"
"(attributes.md)是[惰性的](attributes.md#active-and-inert-attributes)。虽然它"
"们的用途是供声明它们的宏使用，但任何宏都可以看到它们。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:184
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.attributes.decl\\] A helper attribute for a derive "
"macro is declared by adding its identifier to the `attributes` list in the "
"`proc_macro_derive` attribute."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.attributes.decl\\] derive 宏的辅助属性通过将其标识符添"
"加到 `proc_macro_derive` 属性中的 `attributes` 列表来声明。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:187
msgid "\\[!EXAMPLE\\] This declares a helper attribute and then ignores it."
msgstr "\\[!EXAMPLE\\] 这会声明一个辅助属性，然后忽略它。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:212
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.attributes.scope\\] When a derive macro invocation is "
"applied to an item, the helper attributes introduced by that derive macro "
"become in scope 1) for attributes that are applied to that item and are "
"applied lexically after the derive macro invocation and 2) for attributes "
"that are applied to fields and variants inside of the item."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.derive.attributes.scope\\] 当 derive 宏调用应用于某个项时，由"
"该 derive 宏引入的辅助属性会在以下位置进入作用域：1) 应用于该项且在词法上位于"
"该 derive 宏调用之后的属性；2) 应用于该项内部字段和变体的属性。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:215
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] rustc currently allows derive helpers to be used before the "
"macro that introduces them. Such derive helpers used out of order may not "
"shadow other attribute macros. This behavior is deprecated and slated for "
"removal."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] rustc 目前允许在引入 derive 辅助属性的宏之前使用这些辅助属性。以"
"这种乱序方式使用的 derive 辅助属性不得遮蔽其他属性宏。此行为已弃用，并计划移"
"除。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:220
msgid "// Deprecated, hard error in the future.\n"
msgstr "// 已弃用，将来会成为硬错误。\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:227
msgid ""
"For more details, see [Rust issue #79202](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/79202)."
msgstr ""
"更多详细信息，请参见 [Rust issue #79202](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/79202)。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:231
msgid "r\\[macro.proc.attribute\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.attribute\\]"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:232
msgid "The `proc_macro_attribute` attribute"
msgstr "`proc_macro_attribute` 属性"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:234
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.intro\\] The _`proc_macro_attribute` [attribute]"
"(attributes.md)_ defines an _attribute macro_ which can be used as an [outer "
"attribute](attributes.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.intro\\] *`proc_macro_attribute` [属性]"
"(attributes.md)* 定义一个可用作[外部属性](attributes.md)的 *属性宏*。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:237
msgid ""
"\\[!EXAMPLE\\] This attribute macro takes the input stream and emits it as-"
"is, effectively being a no-op attribute."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EXAMPLE\\] 这个属性宏接受输入流并原样发出它，实际上是一个无操作属性。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:252
msgid ""
"\\[!EXAMPLE\\] This shows, in the output of the compiler, the stringified "
"[`TokenStream`s](proc_macro::TokenStream) that attribute macros see."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EXAMPLE\\] 这会在编译器输出中显示属性宏看到的 [`TokenStream`s]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) 的字符串化形式。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:257
msgid "// my-macro/src/lib.rs\n"
msgstr "// my-macro/src/lib.rs\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:262
msgid "\"attr: \\\"{attr}\\\"\""
msgstr "\"attr: \\\"{attr}\\\"\""

#: src/procedural-macros.md:263
msgid "\"item: \\\"{item}\\\"\""
msgstr "\"item: \\\"{item}\\\"\""

#: src/procedural-macros.md:270 src/names/name-resolution.md:520
#: src/names/name-resolution.md:545
msgid "// src/lib.rs\n"
msgstr "// src/lib.rs\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:275
msgid "// Example: Basic function.\n"
msgstr "// 示例：基本函数。\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:278
msgid "// out: attr: \"\"\n"
msgstr "// out: attr: \"\"\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:279
msgid "// out: item: \"fn invoke1() {}\"\n"
msgstr "// out: item: \"fn invoke1() {}\"\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:281
msgid "// Example: Attribute with input.\n"
msgstr "// 示例：带输入的属性。\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:284
msgid "// out: attr: \"bar\"\n"
msgstr "// out: attr: \"bar\"\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:285
msgid "// out: item: \"fn invoke2() {}\"\n"
msgstr "// out: item: \"fn invoke2() {}\"\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:287
msgid "// Example: Multiple tokens in the input.\n"
msgstr "// 示例：输入中的多个 token。\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:290
msgid "// out: attr: \"multiple => tokens\"\n"
msgstr "// out: attr: \"multiple => tokens\"\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:291
msgid "// out: item: \"fn invoke3() {}\"\n"
msgstr "// out: item: \"fn invoke3() {}\"\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:293
msgid "// Example: Delimiters in the input.\n"
msgstr "// 示例：输入中的定界符。\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:296
msgid "// out: attr: \"delimiters\"\n"
msgstr "// out: attr: \"delimiters\"\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:297
msgid "// out: item: \"fn invoke4() {}\"\n"
msgstr "// out: item: \"fn invoke4() {}\"\n"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:300
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.syntax\\] The `proc_macro_attribute` attribute uses "
"the \\[MetaWord\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.syntax\\] `proc_macro_attribute` 属性使用 \\"
"[MetaWord\\] 语法。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:303
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.allowed-positions\\] The `proc_macro_attribute` "
"attribute may only be applied to a `pub` function of type `fn(TokenStream, "
"TokenStream) -> TokenStream` where [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) "
"comes from the [`proc_macro` crate](proc_macro). It must have the \\"
"[\"Rust\" ABI\\]\\[items.fn.extern\\]. No other function qualifiers are "
"allowed. It must be located in the root of the crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.allowed-positions\\] `proc_macro_attribute` 属性只能"
"应用于类型为 `fn(TokenStream, TokenStream) -> TokenStream` 的 `pub` 函数，其"
"中 [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) 来自 [`proc_macro` crate]"
"(proc_macro)。它必须具有 \\[\"Rust\" ABI\\]\\[items.fn.extern\\]。不允许使用"
"其他函数限定符。它必须位于 crate 根。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:306
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.duplicates\\] The `proc_macro_attribute` attribute "
"may only be specified once on a function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.duplicates\\] `proc_macro_attribute` 属性在一个函数"
"上只能指定一次。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:309
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.namespace\\] The `proc_macro_attribute` attribute "
"defines the attribute in the [macro namespace](names/namespaces.md) in the "
"root of the crate with the same name as the function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.namespace\\] `proc_macro_attribute` 属性会在 crate "
"根的[宏命名空间](names/namespaces.md)中定义一个与该函数同名的属性。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:312
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.use-positions\\] Attribute macros can only be used "
"on:"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.attribute.use-positions\\] 属性宏只能用于："

#: src/procedural-macros.md:316
msgid "Items in [`extern` blocks](items/external-blocks.md)"
msgstr "[`extern` 块](items/external-blocks.md)中的项"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:320
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.behavior\\] The first [`TokenStream`]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) parameter is the delimited token tree following "
"the attribute's name but not including the outer delimiters. If the applied "
"attribute contains only the attribute name or the attribute name followed by "
"empty delimiters, the [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) is empty."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.attribute.behavior\\] 第一个 [`TokenStream`]"
"(proc_macro::TokenStream) 参数是位于属性名称之后的带定界符 token 树，但不包含"
"外层定界符。如果应用的属性只包含属性名称，或者属性名称后跟空定界符，则该 "
"[`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) 为空。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:323
msgid ""
"The second [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) is the rest of the [item]"
"(items.md), including other [attributes](attributes.md) on the [item]"
"(items.md)."
msgstr ""
"第二个 [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) 是该[项](items.md)的其余部"
"分，包括该[项](items.md)上的其他[属性](attributes.md)。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:325
msgid ""
"The item to which the attribute is applied is replaced by the zero or more "
"items in the returned [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream)."
msgstr ""
"应用该属性的项会被返回的 [`TokenStream`](proc_macro::TokenStream) 中的零个或"
"多个项替换。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:327
msgid "r\\[macro.proc.token\\]"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.token\\]"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:328
msgid "Declarative macro tokens and procedural macro tokens"
msgstr "声明式宏 token 与过程宏 token"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:330
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.intro\\] Declarative `macro_rules` macros and "
"procedural macros use similar, but different definitions for tokens (or "
"rather [`TokenTree`s](proc_macro::TokenTree).)"
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.intro\\] 声明式 `macro_rules` 宏和过程宏对 token（更准确"
"地说是 [`TokenTree`s](proc_macro::TokenTree)）使用相似但不同的定义。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:333
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.macro_rules\\] Token trees in `macro_rules` "
"(corresponding to `tt` matchers) are defined as"
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.macro_rules\\] `macro_rules` 中的 token 树（对应于 `tt` "
"匹配器）定义为："

#: src/procedural-macros.md:335 src/procedural-macros.md:346
msgid "Delimited groups (`(...)`, `{...}`, etc)"
msgstr "带定界符的组（`(...)`、`{...}` 等）"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:336
msgid ""
"All operators supported by the language, both single-character and multi-"
"character ones (`+`, `+=`)."
msgstr "语言支持的所有运算符，包括单字符和多字符运算符（`+`、`+=`）。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:337
msgid "Note that this set doesn't include the single quote `'`."
msgstr "注意，此集合不包括单引号 `'`。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:338 src/procedural-macros.md:348
msgid "Literals (`\"string\"`, `1`, etc)"
msgstr "字面量（`\"string\"`、`1` 等）"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:339
msgid ""
"Note that negation (e.g. `-1`) is never a part of such literal tokens, but a "
"separate operator token."
msgstr ""
"注意，取负（例如 `-1`）绝不会是此类字面量 token 的一部分，而是一个单独的运算"
"符 token。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:340 src/procedural-macros.md:350
msgid "Identifiers, including keywords (`ident`, `r#ident`, `fn`)"
msgstr "标识符，包括关键字（`ident`、`r#ident`、`fn`）"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:341
msgid "Lifetimes (`'ident`)"
msgstr "生命周期（`'ident`）"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:342
msgid ""
"Metavariable substitutions in `macro_rules` (e.g. `$my_expr` in "
"`macro_rules! mac { ($my_expr: expr) => { $my_expr } }` after the `mac`'s "
"expansion, which will be considered a single token tree regardless of the "
"passed expression)"
msgstr ""
"`macro_rules` 中的元变量替换（例如 `mac` 展开后 `macro_rules! mac "
"{ ($my_expr: expr) => { $my_expr } }` 中的 `$my_expr`，无论传入的表达式是什"
"么，它都会被视为单个 token 树）"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:344
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.tree\\] Token trees in procedural macros are defined as"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.token.tree\\] 过程宏中的 token 树定义为："

#: src/procedural-macros.md:347
msgid ""
"All punctuation characters used in operators supported by the language (`+`, "
"but not `+=`), and also the single quote `'` character (typically used in "
"lifetimes, see below for lifetime splitting and joining behavior)"
msgstr ""
"语言支持的运算符中使用的所有标点字符（`+`，但不是 `+=`），以及单引号 `'` 字符"
"（通常用于生命周期；生命周期的拆分和合并行为见下文）"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:349
msgid ""
"Negation (e.g. `-1`) is supported as a part of integer and floating point "
"literals."
msgstr "取负（例如 `-1`）支持作为整数字面量和浮点字面量的一部分。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:352
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.conversion.intro\\] Mismatches between these two "
"definitions are accounted for when token streams are passed to and from "
"procedural macros. Note that the conversions below may happen lazily, so "
"they might not happen if the tokens are not actually inspected."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.conversion.intro\\] 当 token 流传入过程宏或从过程宏传出"
"时，会处理这两种定义之间的不匹配。注意，下面的转换可能会惰性发生，因此如果 "
"token 未被实际检查，这些转换可能不会发生。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:355
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.conversion.to-proc_macro\\] When passed to a proc-macro"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.token.conversion.to-proc_macro\\] 传递给过程宏时"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:357
msgid "All multi-character operators are broken into single characters."
msgstr "所有多字符运算符都会被拆分为单个字符。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:358
msgid "Lifetimes are broken into a `'` character and an identifier."
msgstr "生命周期会被拆分为一个 `'` 字符和一个标识符。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:359
msgid ""
"The keyword metavariable [`$crate`](macro.decl.hygiene.crate) is passed as a "
"single identifier."
msgstr ""
"关键字元变量 [`$crate`](macro.decl.hygiene.crate) 会作为单个标识符传递。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:360
msgid ""
"All other metavariable substitutions are represented as their underlying "
"token streams."
msgstr "所有其他元变量替换都表示为其底层 token 流。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:361
msgid ""
"Such token streams may be wrapped into delimited groups ([`Group`]"
"(proc_macro::Group)) with implicit delimiters ([`Delimiter::None`]"
"(proc_macro::Delimiter::None)) when it's necessary for preserving parsing "
"priorities."
msgstr ""
"在需要保留解析优先级时，这类 token 流可以被包装进带隐式定界符"
"（[`Delimiter::None`](proc_macro::Delimiter::None)）的带定界符组（[`Group`]"
"(proc_macro::Group)）中。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:362
msgid ""
"`tt` and `ident` substitutions are never wrapped into such groups and always "
"represented as their underlying token trees."
msgstr ""
"`tt` 和 `ident` 替换绝不会被包装进这类组中，而始终表示为其底层 token 树。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:364
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.conversion.from-proc_macro\\] When emitted from a proc "
"macro"
msgstr "r\\[macro.proc.token.conversion.from-proc_macro\\] 从过程宏发出时"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:366
msgid ""
"Punctuation characters are glued into multi-character operators when "
"applicable."
msgstr "适用时，标点字符会被粘合为多字符运算符。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:367
msgid "Single quotes `'` joined with identifiers are glued into lifetimes."
msgstr "与标识符连接的单引号 `'` 会被粘合为生命周期。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:368
msgid ""
"Negative literals are converted into two tokens (the `-` and the literal) "
"possibly wrapped into a delimited group ([`Group`](proc_macro::Group)) with "
"implicit delimiters ([`Delimiter::None`](proc_macro::Delimiter::None)) when "
"it's necessary for preserving parsing priorities."
msgstr ""
"负字面量会被转换为两个 token（`-` 和该字面量），并且在需要保留解析优先级时，"
"可能被包装进带隐式定界符（[`Delimiter::None`](proc_macro::Delimiter::None)）"
"的带定界符组（[`Group`](proc_macro::Group)）中。"

#: src/procedural-macros.md:370
msgid ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.doc-comment\\] Note that neither declarative nor "
"procedural macros support doc comment tokens (e.g. `/// Doc`), so they are "
"always converted to token streams representing their equivalent `#[doc = "
"r\"str\"]` attributes when passed to macros."
msgstr ""
"r\\[macro.proc.token.doc-comment\\] 注意，声明式宏和过程宏都不支持文档注释 "
"token（例如 `/// Doc`），因此在传给宏时，它们总是会被转换为表示等价 `#[doc = "
"r\"str\"]` 属性的 token 流。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:1
msgid "r\\[crate\\]"
msgstr "r\\[crate\\]"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:4
msgid "r\\[crate.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[crate.syntax\\]"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:11
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Although Rust, like any other language, can be implemented by an "
"interpreter as well as a compiler, the only existing implementation is a "
"compiler, and the language has always been designed to be compiled. For "
"these reasons, this section assumes a compiler."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 虽然 Rust 和任何其他语言一样，既可以由解释器实现，也可以由编译器"
"实现，但现有的唯一实现是编译器，并且该语言一直被设计为用于编译。基于这些原"
"因，本节假定使用编译器。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:14
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.compile-time\\] Rust's semantics obey a _phase distinction_ "
"between compile-time and run-time.[^phase-distinction] Semantic rules that "
"have a _static interpretation_ govern the success or failure of compilation, "
"while semantic rules that have a _dynamic interpretation_ govern the "
"behavior of the program at run-time."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.compile-time\\] Rust 的语义遵循编译时和运行时之间的*阶段区分*。"
"[^phase-distinction] 具有*静态解释*的语义规则支配编译的成功或失败，而具有*动"
"态解释*的语义规则支配程序在运行时的行为。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:17
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.unit\\] The compilation model centers on artifacts called "
"_crates_. Each compilation processes a single crate in source form, and if "
"successful, produces a single crate in binary form: either an executable or "
"some sort of library.[^cratesourcefile]"
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.unit\\] 编译模型以称为 _crate_ 的制品为中心。每次编译都会处理一个源"
"代码形式的 crate，并且如果成功，就生成一个二进制形式的 crate：要么是可执行文"
"件，要么是某种库。[^cratesourcefile]"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:20
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.module\\] A _crate_ is a unit of compilation and linking, as well "
"as versioning, distribution, and runtime loading. A crate contains a _tree_ "
"of nested [module](items/modules.md) scopes. The top level of this tree is a "
"module that is anonymous (from the point of view of paths within the module) "
"and any item within a crate has a canonical [module path](paths.md) denoting "
"its location within the crate's module tree."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.module\\] _crate_ 是编译和链接的单元，也是版本控制、分发和运行时加"
"载的单元。crate 包含一棵嵌套的[模块](items/modules.md)作用域*树*。这棵树的顶"
"层是一个匿名模块（从该模块内的路径角度来看），并且 crate 内的任何项都有一个规"
"范[模块路径](paths.md)，表示其在 crate 模块树中的位置。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:23
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.input-source\\] The Rust compiler is always invoked with a single "
"source file as input, and always produces a single output crate. The "
"processing of that source file may result in other source files being loaded "
"as modules. Source files have the extension `.rs`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.input-source\\] 调用 Rust 编译器时，始终以单个源文件作为输入，并且"
"始终生成单个输出 crate。处理该源文件可能导致其他源文件作为模块被加载。源文件"
"使用 `.rs` 扩展名。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:26
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.module-def\\] A Rust source file describes a module, the name and "
"location of which — in the module tree of the current crate — are defined "
"from outside the source file: either by an explicit \\[Module\\]\\[grammar-"
"Module\\] item in a referencing source file, or by the name of the crate "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.module-def\\] Rust 源文件描述一个模块；该模块在当前 crate 的模块树"
"中的名称和位置，是从源文件外部定义的：要么由引用它的源文件中的显式 \\"
"[Module\\]\\[grammar-Module\\] 项定义，要么由 crate 本身的名称定义。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:29
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.inline-module\\] Every source file is a module, but not every "
"module needs its own source file: [module definitions](items/modules.md) can "
"be nested within one file."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.inline-module\\] 每个源文件都是一个模块，但并非每个模块都需要自己的"
"源文件：[模块定义](items/modules.md)可以嵌套在一个文件内。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:32
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.items\\] Each source file contains a sequence of zero or more \\"
"[Item\\] definitions, and may optionally begin with any number of "
"[attributes](attributes.md) that apply to the containing module, most of "
"which influence the behavior of the compiler."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.items\\] 每个源文件都包含由零个或多个 \\[Item\\] 定义组成的序列，并"
"且可以可选地以任意数量的[属性](attributes.md)开始，这些属性应用于包含它们的模"
"块，其中大多数会影响编译器的行为。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:35
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.attributes\\] The anonymous crate module can have additional "
"attributes that apply to the crate as a whole."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.attributes\\] 匿名 crate 模块可以拥有额外的属性，这些属性应用于整"
"个 crate。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:38
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The file's contents may be preceded by a [shebang](shebang.md)."
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 文件内容之前可以有一个 [shebang](shebang.md)。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:42
msgid "// Specify the crate name.\n"
msgstr "// 指定 crate 名称。\n"

