#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:100
msgid "r\\[crate.uncaught-foreign-unwinding\\]"
msgstr "r\\[crate.uncaught-foreign-unwinding\\]"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:101
msgid "Uncaught foreign unwinding"
msgstr "未捕获的外部展开"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:103
msgid ""
"When a \"foreign\" unwind (e.g. an exception thrown from C++ code, or a "
"`panic!` in Rust code using a different panic handler) propagates beyond the "
"`main` function, the process will be safely terminated. This may take the "
"form of an abort, in which case it is not guaranteed that any `Drop` calls "
"will be executed, and the error output may be less informative than if the "
"runtime had been terminated by a \"native\" Rust `panic`."
msgstr ""
"当“外部”展开（例如从 C++ 代码抛出的异常，或使用不同 panic handler 的 Rust 代"
"码中的 `panic!`）传播越过 `main` 函数时，进程会被安全终止。这可能采取 abort "
"的形式，在这种情况下，不保证会执行任何 `Drop` 调用，并且错误输出可能不如由“原"
"生”Rust `panic` 终止运行时时那样信息丰富。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:105
msgid ""
"For more information, see the [panic documentation](panic.md#unwinding-"
"across-ffi-boundaries)."
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参阅 [panic 文档](panic.md#unwinding-across-ffi-boundaries)。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:107
msgid "r\\[crate.no_main\\]"
msgstr "r\\[crate.no_main\\]"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:108
msgid "The `no_main` attribute"
msgstr "`no_main` 属性"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:110
msgid ""
"The _`no_main` [attribute](attributes.md)_ may be applied at the crate level "
"to disable emitting the `main` symbol for an executable binary. This is "
"useful when some other object being linked to defines `main`."
msgstr ""
"*`no_main` [属性](attributes.md)* 可以应用在 crate 级别，用于禁止为可执行二进"
"制文件发出 `main` 符号。当要链接的某个其他对象定义了 `main` 时，这很有用。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:112
msgid "r\\[crate.crate_name\\]"
msgstr "r\\[crate.crate_name\\]"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:113
msgid "The `crate_name` attribute"
msgstr "`crate_name` 属性"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:115
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.crate_name.general\\] The _`crate_name` [attribute]"
"(attributes.md)_ may be applied at the crate level to specify the name of "
"the crate with the \\[MetaNameValueStr\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.crate_name.general\\] *`crate_name` [属性](attributes.md)* 可以应用"
"在 crate 级别，用 \\[MetaNameValueStr\\] 语法指定 crate 的名称。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:119
msgid "\"mycrate\""
msgstr "\"mycrate\""

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:122
msgid ""
"r\\[crate.crate_name.restriction\\] The crate name must not be empty, and "
"must only contain [Unicode alphanumeric](char::is_alphanumeric) or `_` "
"(U+005F) characters."
msgstr ""
"r\\[crate.crate_name.restriction\\] crate 名称不得为空，并且必须只包含 "
"[Unicode 字母数字](char::is_alphanumeric)或 `_` (U+005F) 字符。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:125
msgid ""
"This distinction would also exist in an interpreter. Static checks like "
"syntactic analysis, type checking, and lints should happen before the "
"program is executed regardless of when it is executed."
msgstr ""
"这种区分在解释器中同样存在。无论程序何时执行，语法分析、类型检查和 lint 等静"
"态检查都应当在程序执行之前发生。"

#: src/crates-and-source-files.md:127
msgid ""
"A crate is somewhat analogous to an _assembly_ in the ECMA-335 CLI model, a "
"_library_ in the SML/NJ Compilation Manager, a _unit_ in the Owens and Flatt "
"module system, or a _configuration_ in Mesa."
msgstr ""
"crate 在某种程度上类似于 ECMA-335 CLI 模型中的 _assembly_、SML/NJ "
"Compilation Manager 中的 _library_、Owens 和 Flatt 模块系统中的 _unit_，或 "
"Mesa 中的 _configuration_。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:1
msgid "r\\[cfg\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:4
msgid "r\\[cfg.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.syntax\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:30
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.intro\\] _Conditionally compiled source code_ is source code that is "
"compiled only under certain conditions."
msgstr "r\\[cfg.intro\\] *条件编译的源代码* 是只在特定条件下才编译的源代码。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:33
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.attributes-macro\\] Source code can be made conditionally compiled "
"using the [`cfg`](#the-cfg-attribute) and [`cfg_attr`](#the-cfg_attr-"
"attribute) [attributes](attributes.md) and the built-in [`cfg!`](#the-cfg-"
"macro) and [`cfg_select!`](#the-cfg_select-macro) [macros](macros.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.attributes-macro\\] 可以使用 [`cfg`](#the-cfg-attribute) 和 "
"[`cfg_attr`](#the-cfg_attr-attribute) [属性](attributes.md)，以及内置的 "
"[`cfg!`](#the-cfg-macro) 和 [`cfg_select!`](#the-cfg_select-macro) [宏]"
"(macros.md)，使源代码进行条件编译。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:36
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.conditional\\] Whether to compile can depend on the target "
"architecture of the compiled crate, arbitrary values passed to the compiler, "
"and other things further described below."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.conditional\\] 是否编译可以取决于被编译 crate 的目标架构、传递给编译"
"器的任意值，以及下文进一步描述的其他因素。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:39
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.predicate\\] Each form of conditional compilation takes a "
"_configuration predicate_ that evaluates to true or false. The predicate is "
"one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.predicate\\] 每种条件编译形式都接受一个求值为 true 或 false 的 *配置"
"谓词*。该谓词是以下之一："

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:42
msgid "r\\[cfg.predicate.option\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.predicate.option\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:43
msgid ""
"A configuration option. The predicate is true if the option is set, and "
"false if it is unset."
msgstr "配置选项。如果该选项已设置，则谓词为 true；如果未设置，则为 false。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:45
msgid "r\\[cfg.predicate.all\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.predicate.all\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:46
msgid ""
"`all()` with a comma-separated list of configuration predicates. It is true "
"if all of the given predicates are true, or if the list is empty."
msgstr ""
"`all()` 加上以逗号分隔的配置谓词列表。如果给定的所有谓词均为 true，或者列表为"
"空，则它为 true。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:48
msgid "r\\[cfg.predicate.any\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.predicate.any\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:49
msgid ""
"`any()` with a comma-separated list of configuration predicates. It is true "
"if at least one of the given predicates is true. If there are no predicates, "
"it is false."
msgstr ""
"`any()` 加上以逗号分隔的配置谓词列表。如果给定谓词中至少一个为 true，则它为 "
"true。如果没有谓词，则它为 false。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:51
msgid "r\\[cfg.predicate.not\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.predicate.not\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:52
msgid ""
"`not()` with a configuration predicate. It is true if its predicate is false "
"and false if its predicate is true."
msgstr ""
"`not()` 加上一个配置谓词。如果其谓词为 false，则它为 true；如果其谓词为 "
"true，则它为 false。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:54
msgid "r\\[cfg.predicate.literal\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.predicate.literal\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:55
msgid ""
"`true` or `false` literals, which are always true or false respectively."
msgstr "`true` 或 `false` 字面量，分别始终为 true 或 false。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:57
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.option-spec\\] _Configuration options_ are either names or key-value "
"pairs, and are either set or unset."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.option-spec\\] *配置选项* 要么是名称，要么是键值对，并且要么已设置，"
"要么未设置。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:60
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.option-name\\] Names are written as a single identifier, such as "
"`unix`."
msgstr "r\\[cfg.option-name\\] 名称写作单个标识符，例如 `unix`。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:63
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.option-key-value\\] Key-value pairs are written as an identifier, "
"`=`, and then a string, such as `target_arch = \"x86_64\"`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.option-key-value\\] 键值对写作一个标识符、`=`，然后是一个字符串，例"
"如 `target_arch = \"x86_64\"`。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:66
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Whitespace around the `=` is ignored, so `foo=\"bar\"` and `foo "
"= \"bar\"` are equivalent."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `=` 周围的空白会被忽略，因此 `foo=\"bar\"` 与 `foo = \"bar\"` 等"
"价。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:69
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.option-key-uniqueness\\] Keys do not need to be unique. For example, "
"both `feature = \"std\"` and `feature = \"serde\"` can be set at the same "
"time."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.option-key-uniqueness\\] 键不需要唯一。例如，`feature = \"std\"` 和 "
"`feature = \"serde\"` 可以同时被设置。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:72
msgid "r\\[cfg.options.set\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.options.set\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:73
msgid "Set configuration options"
msgstr "设置配置选项"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:75
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.options.intro\\] Which configuration options are set is determined "
"statically during the compilation of the crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.options.intro\\] 哪些配置选项被设置，是在 crate 编译期间静态确定的。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:78
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.options.target\\] Some options are _compiler-set_ based on data "
"about the compilation."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.options.target\\] 某些选项会基于编译相关数据而 *由编译器设置*。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:81
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.options.other\\] Other options are _arbitrarily-set_ based on input "
"passed to the compiler outside of the code."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.options.other\\] 其他选项会基于代码之外传递给编译器的输入而 *任意设置"
"*。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:84
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.options.crate\\] It is not possible to set a configuration option "
"from within the source code of the crate being compiled."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.options.crate\\] 无法从正在编译的 crate 的源代码内部设置配置选项。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:87
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] For `rustc`, arbitrary-set configuration options are set using "
"the [`--cfg`](../rustc/command-line-arguments.html#--cfg-configure-the-"
"compilation-environment) flag. Configuration values for a specified target "
"can be displayed with `rustc --print cfg --target $TARGET`."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 对于 `rustc`，任意设置的配置选项使用 [`--cfg`](../rustc/command-"
"line-arguments.html#--cfg-configure-the-compilation-environment) 标志设置。可"
"以用 `rustc --print cfg --target $TARGET` 显示指定目标的配置值。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:90
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Configuration options with the key `feature` are a convention "
"used by [Cargo](../cargo/reference/features.html) for specifying compile-"
"time options and optional dependencies."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 键为 `feature` 的配置选项是 [Cargo](../cargo/reference/"
"features.html) 用来指定编译时选项和可选依赖项的一种约定。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:93
msgid "r\\[cfg.target_arch\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.target_arch\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:94
msgid "`target_arch`"
msgstr "`target_arch`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:96
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.target_arch.def\\] Key-value option set once with the target's CPU "
"architecture. The value is similar to the first element of the platform's "
"target triple, but not identical."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.target_arch.def\\] 键值选项，按目标的 CPU 架构设置一次。该值类似于平"
"台目标三元组的第一个元素，但并不完全相同。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:99
msgid "r\\[cfg.target_arch.values\\] Example values:"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.target_arch.values\\] 示例值："

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:102
msgid "`\"x86\"`"
msgstr "`\"x86\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:103
msgid "`\"x86_64\"`"
msgstr "`\"x86_64\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:104
msgid "`\"mips\"`"
msgstr "`\"mips\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:105
msgid "`\"powerpc\"`"
msgstr "`\"powerpc\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:106
msgid "`\"powerpc64\"`"
msgstr "`\"powerpc64\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:107
msgid "`\"arm\"`"
msgstr "`\"arm\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:108
msgid "`\"aarch64\"`"
msgstr "`\"aarch64\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:110
msgid "r\\[cfg.target_feature\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.target_feature\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:111
msgid "`target_feature`"
msgstr "`target_feature`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:113
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.target_feature.def\\] Key-value option set for each platform feature "
"available for the current compilation target."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.target_feature.def\\] 键值选项，会为当前编译目标可用的每个平台特性分"
"别设置。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:116
msgid "r\\[cfg.target_feature.values\\] Example values:"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.target_feature.values\\] 示例值："

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:119
msgid "`\"avx\"`"
msgstr "`\"avx\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:120
msgid "`\"avx2\"`"
msgstr "`\"avx2\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:121
msgid "`\"crt-static\"`"
msgstr "`\"crt-static\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:122
msgid "`\"rdrand\"`"
msgstr "`\"rdrand\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:123
msgid "`\"sse\"`"
msgstr "`\"sse\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:124
msgid "`\"sse2\"`"
msgstr "`\"sse2\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:125
msgid "`\"sse4.1\"`"
msgstr "`\"sse4.1\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:127
msgid ""
"See the [`target_feature` attribute](attributes/codegen.md#the-"
"target_feature-attribute) for more details on the available features."
msgstr ""
"关于可用特性的更多细节，见 [`target_feature` 属性](attributes/codegen.md#the-"
"target_feature-attribute)。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:129
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.target_feature.crt_static\\] An additional feature of `crt-static` "
"is available to the `target_feature` option to indicate that a [static C "
"runtime](linkage.md#static-and-dynamic-c-runtimes) is available."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.target_feature.crt_static\\] `target_feature` 选项还可使用一个附加特"
"性 `crt-static`，用于表示有[静态 C 运行时](linkage.md#static-and-dynamic-c-"
"runtimes)可用。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:132
msgid "r\\[cfg.target_os\\]"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.target_os\\]"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:133
msgid "`target_os`"
msgstr "`target_os`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:135
msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.target_os.def\\] Key-value option set once with the target's "
"operating system. This value is similar to the second and third element of "
"the platform's target triple."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.target_os.def\\] 键值选项，按目标的操作系统设置一次。该值类似于平台目"
"标三元组的第二和第三个元素。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:138
msgid "r\\[cfg.target_os.values\\] Example values:"
msgstr "r\\[cfg.target_os.values\\] 示例值："

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:141 src/conditional-compilation.md:162
msgid "`\"windows\"`"
msgstr "`\"windows\"`"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:142
msgid "`\"macos\"`"
