"`libc` used. For historical reasons, this value is only defined as not the "
"empty-string when actually needed for disambiguation. Thus, for example, on "
"many GNU platforms, this value will be empty. This value is similar to the "
"fourth element of the platform's target triple. One difference is that "
"embedded ABIs such as `gnueabihf` will simply define `target_env` as "
"`\"gnu\"`."
msgstr ""
