"[atomic\\]\\[core::sync::atomic\\] 类型与对应整数类型具有相同对齐的每个位宽分"
"别设置。"

#: src/conditional-compilation.md:265
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The alignment is usually the same for a given bit width. "
"However, on some targets such as 32-bit x86, 64-bit atomic types such as \\"
"[`AtomicI64`\\]\\[core::sync::atomic::AtomicI64\\] have an alignment of 8 "
"bytes while `i64` is only aligned to 4 bytes. In this situation, "
"`target_has_atomic_primitive_alignment = \"64\"` is not set."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 对于给定位宽，对齐通常相同。但是，在某些目标（例如 32 位 x86）"
"上，诸如 \\[`AtomicI64`\\]\\[core::sync::atomic::AtomicI64\\] 的 64 位原子类"
"型具有 8 字节对齐，而 `i64` 只对齐到 4 字节。在这种情况下，不会设置 "
"`target_has_atomic_primitive_alignment = \"64\"`。"

