msgid ""
"r\\[cfg.cfg_select.intro\\] The built-in \\[`cfg_select!`\\]\\"
"[std::cfg_select\\] macro can be used to select code at compile-time based "
"on multiple configuration predicates."
msgstr ""
"r\\[cfg.cfg_select.intro\\] 内置的 \\[`cfg_select!`\\]\\[std::cfg_select\\] "
"宏可用于基于多个配置谓词在编译时选择代码。"

