msgstr "[trait 定义](items/traits.md)"

#: src/items.md:52
msgid "[implementations](items/implementations.md)"
msgstr "[实现](items/implementations.md)"

#: src/items.md:53
msgid "[`extern` blocks](items/external-blocks.md)"
msgstr "[`extern` 块](items/external-blocks.md)"

#: src/items.md:55
msgid ""
"r\\[items.locations\\] Items may be declared in the [root of the crate]"
"(crates-and-source-files.md), a [module](items/modules.md), or a [block "
"expression](expressions/block-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.locations\\] 项可以在 [crate 的根](crates-and-source-files.md)、[模"
"块](items/modules.md)或[块表达式](expressions/block-expr.md)中声明。"

#: src/items.md:58
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated-locations\\] A subset of items, called [associated "
"items](items/associated-items.md), may be declared in [traits](items/"
"traits.md) and [implementations](items/implementations.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated-locations\\] 项的一个子集称为[关联项](items/associated-"
"items.md)，可以在 [trait](items/traits.md) 和[实现](items/implementations.md)"
"中声明。"

#: src/items.md:61
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-locations\\] A subset of items, called external items, may "
"be declared in [`extern` blocks](items/external-blocks.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-locations\\] 项的一个子集称为外部项，可以在 [`extern` 块]"
"(items/external-blocks.md)中声明。"

#: src/items.md:64
msgid ""
"r\\[items.decl-order\\] Items may be defined in any order, with the "
"exception of [`macro_rules`](macros-by-example.md) which has its own scoping "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.decl-order\\] 项可以按任意顺序定义，但具有自身作用域行为的 "
"[`macro_rules`](macros-by-example.md) 除外。"

#: src/items.md:67
msgid ""
"r\\[items.name-resolution\\] [Name resolution](names/name-resolution.md) of "
"item names allows items to be defined before or after where the item is "
"referred to in the module or block."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.name-resolution\\] 项名称的[名称解析](names/name-resolution.md)允许"
"项定义在模块或块中引用该项的位置之前或之后。"

#: src/items.md:70
msgid ""
"See [item scopes](names/scopes.md#item-scopes) for information on the "
"scoping rules of items."
msgstr ""
"有关项的作用域规则的信息，参见[项作用域](names/scopes.md#item-scopes)。"

