"r\\[items.mod.outlined.intro\\] A module without a body is loaded from an "
"external file. When the module does not have a `path` attribute, the path to "
"the file mirrors the logical [module path](../paths.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.mod.outlined.intro\\] 没有主体的模块会从外部文件加载。当模块没有 "
"`path` 属性时，文件路径会对应逻辑上的[模块路径](../paths.md)。"

