#: src/items/modules.md:122
msgid "r\\[items.mod.attributes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.mod.attributes\\]"

#: src/items/modules.md:123
msgid "Attributes on modules"
msgstr "模块上的属性"

#: src/items/modules.md:125
msgid ""
"r\\[items.mod.attributes.intro\\] Modules, like all items, accept outer "
"attributes. They also accept inner attributes: either after `{` for a module "
"with a body, or at the beginning of the source file, after the optional BOM "
"and shebang."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.mod.attributes.intro\\] 模块与所有项一样，接受外部属性。它们也接受"
"内部属性：对于带有主体的模块，内部属性位于 `{` 之后；或者位于源文件开头，在可"
"选的 BOM 和 shebang 之后。"

#: src/items/modules.md:128
msgid ""
"r\\[items.mod.attributes.supported\\] The built-in attributes that have "
"meaning on a module are [`cfg`](../conditional-compilation.md), "
"[`deprecated`](../attributes/diagnostics.md#the-deprecated-attribute), "
"[`doc`](../../rustdoc/the-doc-attribute.html), [the lint check attributes]"
"(../attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes), [`path`](#the-path-"
"attribute), and [`no_implicit_prelude`](../names/preludes.md#the-"
"no_implicit_prelude-attribute). Modules also accept macro attributes."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.mod.attributes.supported\\] 在模块上有意义的内置属性包括 [`cfg`]"
"(../conditional-compilation.md)、[`deprecated`](../attributes/"
"diagnostics.md#the-deprecated-attribute)、[`doc`](../../rustdoc/the-doc-"
"attribute.html)、[lint 检查属性](../attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-"
"attributes)、[`path`](#r-items.mod.outlined.path) 和 [`no_implicit_prelude`]"
"(../names/preludes.md#the-no_implicit_prelude-attribute)。模块也接受宏属性。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:1
msgid "r\\[items.extern-crate\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern-crate\\]"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:2
msgid "Extern crate declarations"
msgstr "`extern crate` 声明"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:4
msgid "r\\[items.extern-crate.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern-crate.syntax\\]"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:13
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.intro\\] An _`extern crate` declaration_ specifies a "
"dependency on an external crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.intro\\] *`extern crate` 声明* 指定对外部 crate 的依"
"赖。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:16
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.namespace\\] The external crate is then bound into "
"the declaring scope as the given [identifier](../identifiers.md) in the "
"[type namespace](../names/namespaces.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.namespace\\] 随后，该外部 crate 会在声明所在作用域中，"
"作为给定的[标识符](../identifiers.md)绑定到[类型命名空间](../names/"
"namespaces.md)。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:19
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.extern-prelude\\] Additionally, if the `extern crate` "
"appears in the crate root, then the crate name is also added to the [extern "
"prelude](../names/preludes.md#extern-prelude), making it automatically in "
"scope in all modules."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.extern-prelude\\] 此外，如果 `extern crate` 出现在 "
"crate 根中，则 crate 名也会被加入 [extern prelude](../names/"
"preludes.md#extern-prelude)，使其在所有模块中自动进入作用域。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:22
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.as\\] The `as` clause can be used to bind the "
"imported crate to a different name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.as\\] `as` 子句可用于将导入的 crate 绑定到另一个名称。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:25
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.lookup\\] The external crate is resolved to a "
"specific `soname` at compile time, and a runtime linkage requirement to that "
"`soname` is passed to the linker for loading at runtime. The `soname` is "
"resolved at compile time by scanning the compiler's library path and "
"matching the optional `crate_name` provided against the [`crate_name` "
"attributes](../crates-and-source-files.md#the-crate_name-attribute) that "
"were declared on the external crate when it was compiled. If no `crate_name` "
"is provided, a default `name` attribute is assumed, equal to the [identifier]"
"(../identifiers.md) given in the `extern crate` declaration."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.lookup\\] 外部 crate 会在编译时解析为特定的 `soname`，"
"并且对该 `soname` 的运行时链接需求会被传递给链接器，以便在运行时加载。"
"`soname` 的编译时解析方式是扫描编译器的库路径，并将可选提供的 `crate_name` 与"
"外部 crate 编译时声明的 [`crate_name` 属性](../crates-and-source-"
"files.md#the-crate_name-attribute)进行匹配。如果未提供 `crate_name`，则假定有"
"一个默认的 `name` 属性，其值等于 `extern crate` 声明中给出的[标识符](../"
"identifiers.md)。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:28
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.self\\] The `self` crate may be imported which "
"creates a binding to the current crate. In this case the `as` clause must be "
"used to specify the name to bind it to."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.self\\] 可以导入 `self` crate，这会创建到当前 crate 的"
"绑定。在这种情况下，必须使用 `as` 子句指定要将其绑定到的名称。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:31
msgid "Three examples of `extern crate` declarations:"
msgstr "`extern crate` 声明的三个示例："

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:37
msgid "// equivalent to: extern crate std as std;\n"
msgstr "// 等价于：extern crate std as std;\n"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:39
msgid "// linking to 'std' under another name\n"
msgstr "// 以另一个名称链接到 'std'\n"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:42
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.name-restrictions\\] When naming Rust crates, hyphens "
"are disallowed. However, Cargo packages may make use of them. In such case, "
"when `Cargo.toml` doesn't specify a crate name, Cargo will transparently "
"replace `-` with `_` (Refer to [RFC 940](https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/"
"blob/master/text/0940-hyphens-considered-harmful.md) for more details)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.name-restrictions\\] 命名 Rust crate 时，不允许使用连"
"字符。不过，Cargo 包可以使用连字符。在这种情况下，如果 `Cargo.toml` 未指定 "
"crate 名，Cargo 会透明地将 `-` 替换为 `_`（更多细节参见 [RFC 940](https://"
"github.com/rust-lang/rfcs/blob/master/text/0940-hyphens-considered-"
"harmful.md)）。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:45 src/attributes/diagnostics.md:335
msgid "Here is an example:"
msgstr "下面是一个示例："

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:49
msgid "// Importing the Cargo package hello-world\n"
msgstr "// 导入 Cargo 包 hello-world\n"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:50
msgid "// hyphen replaced with an underscore\n"
msgstr "// 连字符替换为下划线\n"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:53
msgid "r\\[items.extern-crate.underscore\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern-crate.underscore\\]"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:54 src/items/use-declarations.md:328
msgid "Underscore imports"
msgstr "下划线导入"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:56
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.underscore.intro\\] An external crate dependency can "
"be declared without binding its name in scope by using an underscore with "
"the form `extern crate foo as _`. This may be useful for crates that only "
"need to be linked, but are never referenced, and will avoid being reported "
"as unused."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.underscore.intro\\] 可以使用下划线以 `extern crate "
"foo as _` 的形式声明外部 crate 依赖，而不在作用域中绑定其名称。对于只需要被链"
"接、但从不被引用的 crate，这可能很有用，并且可以避免被报告为未使用。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:59
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.underscore.macro_use\\] The [`macro_use` attribute]"
"(../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-attribute) works as usual and imports "
"the macro names into the [`macro_use` prelude](../names/"
"preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.underscore.macro_use\\] [`macro_use` 属性](../macros-"
"by-example.md#the-macro_use-attribute)照常工作，并将宏名称导入 [`macro_use` "
"prelude](../names/preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:63
msgid "r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link\\]"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:64
msgid "The `no_link` attribute"
msgstr "`no_link` 属性"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:66
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link.intro\\] The _`no_link` \\[attribute\\]\\"
"[attributes\\]_ may be applied to an `extern crate` item to prevent linking "
"the crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link.intro\\] *`no_link` \\[属性\\]\\"
"[attributes\\]* 可以应用于 `extern crate` 项，以阻止链接该 crate。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:69
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This is helpful, e.g., when only the macros of a crate are "
"needed."
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 例如，当只需要某个 crate 的宏时，这会很有用。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:81
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link.syntax\\] The `no_link` attribute uses the \\"
"[MetaWord\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link.syntax\\] `no_link` 属性使用 \\[MetaWord\\] 语"
"法。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:84
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link.allowed-positions\\] The `no_link` attribute "
"may only be applied to an `extern crate` declaration."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link.allowed-positions\\] `no_link` 属性只能应用于 "
"`extern crate` 声明。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:90
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link.duplicates\\] Only the first use of `no_link` "
"on an `extern crate` declaration has effect."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern-crate.no_link.duplicates\\] 在 `extern crate` 声明上，只有第"
"一次使用 `no_link` 会产生效果。"

#: src/items/extern-crates.md:93 src/attributes/testing.md:40
#: src/attributes/testing.md:118 src/attributes/diagnostics.md:382
#: src/attributes/codegen.md:61 src/attributes/codegen.md:116
#: src/attributes/limits.md:83 src/runtime.md:69
