#: src/items/use-declarations.md:1
msgid "r\\[items.use\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:4
msgid "r\\[items.use.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.syntax\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:14
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.intro\\] A _use declaration_ creates one or more local name "
"bindings synonymous with some other [path](../paths.md). Usually a `use` "
"declaration is used to shorten the path required to refer to a module item. "
"These declarations may appear in [modules](modules.md) and [blocks](../"
"expressions/block-expr.md), usually at the top. A `use` declaration is also "
"sometimes called an _import_, or, if it is public, a _re-export_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.intro\\] *use 声明* 会创建一个或多个与某个其他[路径](../"
"paths.md)同义的局部名称绑定。通常，`use` 声明用于缩短引用模块项所需的路径。这"
"些声明可以出现在[模块](modules.md)和[块](../expressions/block-expr.md)中，通"
"常位于开头。`use` 声明有时也称为 *导入*；如果它是公开的，则称为 *重导出*。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:21
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.forms\\] Use declarations support a number of convenient "
"shortcuts:"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.forms\\] `use` 声明支持若干便捷的简写形式："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:24
msgid "r\\[items.use.forms.multiple\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.forms.multiple\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:25
msgid ""
"Simultaneously binding a list of paths with a common prefix, using the brace "
"syntax `use a::b::{c, d, e::f, g::h::i};`"
msgstr ""
"使用花括号语法 `use a::b::{c, d, e::f, g::h::i};`，同时绑定一组具有共同前缀的"
"路径"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:27
msgid "r\\[items.use.forms.self\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.forms.self\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:28
msgid ""
"Simultaneously binding a list of paths with a common prefix and their common "
"parent module, using the `self` keyword, such as `use a::b::{self, c, d::e};`"
msgstr ""
"使用 `self` 关键字，同时绑定一组具有共同前缀的路径及其共同父模块，例如 `use "
"a::b::{self, c, d::e};`"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:30
msgid "r\\[items.use.forms.as\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.forms.as\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:31
msgid ""
"Rebinding the target name as a new local name, using the syntax `use p::q::r "
"as x;`. This can also be used with the last two features: `use a::b::{self "
"as ab, c as abc}`."
msgstr ""
"使用语法 `use p::q::r as x;`，将目标名称重新绑定为新的局部名称。这也可以与前"
"两个特性结合使用：`use a::b::{self as ab, c as abc}`。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:33
msgid "r\\[items.use.forms.glob\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.forms.glob\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:34
msgid ""
"Binding all paths matching a given prefix, using the asterisk wildcard "
"syntax `use a::b::*;`."
msgstr "使用星号通配符语法 `use a::b::*;`，绑定所有匹配给定前缀的路径。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:36
msgid "r\\[items.use.forms.nesting\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.forms.nesting\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:37
msgid ""
"Nesting groups of the previous features multiple times, such as `use a::b::"
"{self as ab, c, d::{*, e::f}};`"
msgstr ""
"多次嵌套前述特性的分组，例如 `use a::b::{self as ab, c, d::{*, e::f}};`"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:39
msgid "An example of `use` declarations:"
msgstr "`use` 声明的示例："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:48
msgid "// use declarations can also exist inside of functions\n"
msgstr "// use 声明也可以存在于函数内部\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:51
msgid ""
"// Equivalent to 'foo(vec![std::option::Option::Some(1.0f64),\n"
"    // std::option::Option::None]);'\n"
msgstr ""
"// 等价于 'foo(vec![std::option::Option::Some(1.0f64),\n"
"    // std::option::Option::None]);'\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:55
msgid "// Both `hash_map` and `HashMap` are in scope.\n"
msgstr "// `hash_map` 和 `HashMap` 都在作用域内。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:62
msgid "r\\[items.use.visibility\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.visibility\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:63
msgid "`use` Visibility"
msgstr "`use` 可见性"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:65
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.visibility.intro\\] Like items, `use` declarations are private "
"to the containing module, by default. Also like items, a `use` declaration "
"can be public, if qualified by the `pub` keyword. Such a `use` declaration "
"serves to _re-export_ a name. A public `use` declaration can therefore "
"_redirect_ some public name to a different target definition: even a "
"definition with a private canonical path, inside a different module."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.visibility.intro\\] 与项一样，`use` 声明默认对包含它的模块私"
"有。同样与项一样，如果带有 `pub` 关键字限定，`use` 声明可以是公开的。这样的 "
"`use` 声明用于 *重导出* 一个名称。因此，公开的 `use` 声明可以将某个公开名称 *"
"重定向* 到不同的目标定义：甚至可以是另一个模块中、具有私有规范路径的定义。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:68
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.visibility.unambiguous\\] If a sequence of such redirections "
"form a cycle or cannot be resolved unambiguously, they represent a compile-"
"time error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.visibility.unambiguous\\] 如果这样的一系列重定向形成循环，或者"
"不能无歧义地解析，则它们表示一个编译时错误。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:71
msgid "An example of re-exporting:"
msgstr "重导出的示例："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:88
msgid ""
"In this example, the module `quux` re-exports two public names defined in "
"`foo`."
msgstr "在此示例中，模块 `quux` 重导出了在 `foo` 中定义的两个公开名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:90
msgid "r\\[items.use.path\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.path\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:91
msgid "`use` Paths"
msgstr "`use` 路径"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:93
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.path.intro\\] The [paths](../paths.md) that are allowed in a "
"`use` item follow the \\[SimplePath\\] grammar and are similar to the paths "
"that may be used in an expression. They may create bindings for:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.path.intro\\] `use` 项中允许的[路径](../paths.md)遵循 \\"
"[SimplePath\\] 语法，并且类似于可以在表达式中使用的路径。它们可以为以下内容创"
"建绑定："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:96
msgid "Nameable [items](../items.md)"
msgstr "可命名的[项](../items.md)"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:97
msgid "[Enum variants](enumerations.md)"
msgstr "[枚举变体](enumerations.md)"

