msgstr "[Derive 宏](macro.proc.derive)"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:101
msgid "[`macro_rules`](../macros-by-example.md)"
msgstr "[`macro_rules`](../macros-by-example.md)"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:103
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.path.disallowed\\] They cannot import [associated items]"
"(associated-items.md), [generic parameters](generics.md), [local variables]"
"(../variables.md), paths with [`Self`](../paths.md#self), or [tool "
"attributes](../attributes.md#tool-attributes). More restrictions are "
"described below."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.path.disallowed\\] 它们不能导入[关联项](associated-items.md)、"
"[泛型参数](generics.md)、[局部变量](../variables.md)、带有 [`Self`](../"
"paths.md#self) 的路径，或[工具属性](../attributes.md#tool-attributes)。下面还"
"会描述更多限制。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:106
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.path.namespace\\] `use` will create bindings for all "
"[namespaces](../names/namespaces.md) from the imported entities, with the "
"exception that a `self` import will only import from the type namespace (as "
"described below). For example, the following illustrates creating bindings "
"for the same name in two namespaces:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.path.namespace\\] `use` 会为被导入实体的所有[命名空间](../"
"names/namespaces.md)创建绑定，但 `self` 导入除外，它只会从类型命名空间导入"
"（如下所述）。例如，下面展示了如何在两个命名空间中为同一个名称创建绑定："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:113
msgid "// Imports the `Foo` type and the `Foo` constructor.\n"
msgstr "// 导入 `Foo` 类型和 `Foo` 构造器。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:118
msgid "// Uses `Foo` from the value namespace.\n"
msgstr "// 使用值命名空间中的 `Foo`。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:119
msgid "// Uses `Foo` From the type namespace.\n"
msgstr "// 使用类型命名空间中的 `Foo`。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:123
msgid "r\\[items.use.path.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.path.edition2018\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:124
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] In the 2015 edition, `use` paths are relative to the "
"crate root. For example:"
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2015 edition 中，`use` 路径相对于 crate 根。例如："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:133
msgid "// Resolves `foo` from the crate root.\n"
msgstr "// 从 crate 根解析 `foo`。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:135
msgid "// The `::` prefix explicitly resolves `foo`\n"
msgstr "// `::` 前缀会将 `foo` 显式地解析\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:136
msgid "// from the crate root.\n"
msgstr "// 为 crate 根中的项。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:143
msgid ""
"The 2015 edition does not allow use declarations to reference the [extern "
"prelude](../names/preludes.md#extern-prelude). Thus, [`extern crate`](extern-"
"crates.md) declarations are still required in 2015 to reference an external "
"crate in a `use` declaration. Beginning with the 2018 edition, `use` "
"declarations can specify an external crate dependency the same way `extern "
"crate` can."
msgstr ""
"2015 edition 不允许 `use` 声明引用 [extern prelude](../names/"
"preludes.md#extern-prelude)。因此，在 2015 中，若要在 `use` 声明中引用外部 "
"crate，仍然需要 [`extern crate`](extern-crates.md) 声明。从 2018 edition 开"
"始，`use` 声明可以像 `extern crate` 一样指定外部 crate 依赖。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:145
msgid "r\\[items.use.as\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.as\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:146
msgid "`as` renames"
msgstr "`as` 重命名"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:148
msgid ""
"The `as` keyword can be used to change the name of an imported entity. For "
"example:"
msgstr "`as` 关键字可用于更改被导入实体的名称。例如："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:151
msgid "// Creates a non-public alias `bar` for the function `foo`.\n"
msgstr "// 为函数 `foo` 创建非公开别名 `bar`。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:159
msgid "r\\[items.use.multiple-syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.multiple-syntax\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:160
msgid "Brace syntax"
msgstr "花括号语法"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:162
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.multiple-syntax.intro\\] Braces can be used in the last "
"segment of the path to import multiple entities from the previous segment, "
"or, if there are no previous segments, from the current scope. Braces can be "
"nested, creating a tree of paths, where each grouping of segments is "
"logically combined with its parent to create a full path."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.multiple-syntax.intro\\] 花括号可以用在路径的最后一个段中，以从"
"前一个段导入多个实体；如果没有前面的段，则从当前作用域导入。花括号可以嵌套，"
"从而创建一个路径树，其中每组段都会在逻辑上与其父级组合，以创建完整路径。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:166
msgid ""
"// Creates bindings to:\n"
"// - `std::collections::BTreeSet`\n"
"// - `std::collections::hash_map`\n"
"// - `std::collections::hash_map::HashMap`\n"
msgstr ""
"// 为以下项创建绑定：\n"
"// - `std::collections::BTreeSet`\n"
"// - `std::collections::hash_map`\n"
"// - `std::collections::hash_map::HashMap`\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:173
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.multiple-syntax.empty\\] An empty brace does not import "
"anything, though the leading path is validated that it is accessible."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.multiple-syntax.empty\\] 空花括号不会导入任何内容，但会验证前导"
"路径是可访问的。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:177
msgid "r\\[items.use.multiple-syntax.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.multiple-syntax.edition2018\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:178
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] In the 2015 edition, paths are relative to the crate "
"root, so an import such as `use {foo, bar};` will import the names `foo` and "
"`bar` from the crate root, whereas starting in 2018, those names are "
"relative to the current scope."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2015 edition 中，路径相对于 crate 根，因此像 `use "
"{foo, bar};` 这样的导入会从 crate 根导入名称 `foo` 和 `bar`；而从 2018 "
"edition 开始，这些名称相对于当前作用域。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:181
msgid "r\\[items.use.self\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.self\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:182
msgid "`self` imports"
msgstr "`self` 导入"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:184
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.self.intro\\] The keyword `self` may be used within [brace "
"syntax](items.use.multiple-syntax) to create a binding of the parent entity "
"under its own name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.self.intro\\] 关键字 `self` 可以在[花括号语法]"
"(items.use.multiple-syntax)中使用，以父实体自身的名称创建其绑定。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:193
msgid "// Creates a binding for `stuff` and `foo`.\n"
msgstr "// 为 `stuff` 和 `foo` 创建绑定。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:203
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `self` may also be used as the first segment of a path. The use "
"of `self` as the first segment and inside a `use` brace is logically the "
"same; it means the current module of the parent segment, or the current "
"module if there is no parent segment. See [`self`](../paths.md#self) in the "
"paths chapter for more information on the meaning of a leading `self`."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `self` 也可以用作路径的第一个段。将 `self` 用作第一个段，与在 "
"`use` 的花括号内使用它在逻辑上是相同的；它表示父段的当前模块，或者在没有父段"
"时表示当前模块。关于前导 `self` 含义的更多信息，参见路径章节中的 [`self`](../"
"paths.md#self)。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:206
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.self.trailing\\] `self` may appear as the last segment of a "
"`use` path, preceded by `::`. A path of the form `P::self` is equivalent to "
"`P::{self}`, and `P::self as name` is equivalent to `P::{self as name}`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.self.trailing\\] `self` 可以出现在 `use` 路径的最后一个段，前面"
"带有 `::`。形式为 `P::self` 的路径等价于 `P::{self}`，而 `P::self as name` 等"
"价于 `P::{self as name}`。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:213
msgid "// Equivalent to `use m::{self as _};`.\n"
msgstr "// 等价于 `use m::{self as _};`。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:214
msgid "// Equivalent to `use m::E::{self};`.\n"
msgstr "// 等价于 `use m::E::{self};`。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:218
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] See \\[paths.qualifiers.mod-self.trailing\\] for restrictions on "
"the preceding path."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 关于前置路径的限制，参见 \\[paths.qualifiers.mod-"
"self.trailing\\]。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:221
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.self.module\\] When `self` is used within [brace syntax]"
"(items.use.multiple-syntax), the path preceding the brace group must resolve "
"to a [module](items.mod), [enumeration](items.enum), or [trait]"
"(items.traits)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.self.module\\] 当 `self` 在[花括号语法](items.use.multiple-"
"syntax)中使用时，花括号组之前的路径必须解析为[模块](items.mod)、[枚举]"
"(items.enum)或 [trait](items.traits)。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:229 src/paths.md:247
msgid "// OK: Modules can be parents of `self`.\n"
msgstr "// OK: 模块可以作为 `self` 的父项。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:230
msgid "// OK: Enums can be parents of `self`.\n"
msgstr "// OK: 枚举可以作为 `self` 的父项。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:231 src/paths.md:250
msgid "// OK: Traits can be parents of `self`.\n"
msgstr "// OK: trait 可以作为 `self` 的父项。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:237 src/paths.md:256
msgid "// ERROR: Structs cannot be parents of `self`.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: 结构体不能作为 `self` 的父项。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:241
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.self.namespace\\] `self` only creates a binding from the [type "
"namespace](../names/namespaces.md) of the parent entity. For example, in the "
"following, only the `foo` mod is imported:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.self.namespace\\] `self` 只会从父实体的[类型命名空间](../names/"
"namespaces.md)创建绑定。例如，在下面的代码中，只导入了 `foo` mod："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:249
msgid ""
"// This only imports the module `foo`. The function `foo` lives in\n"
"// the value namespace and is not imported.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这只导入模块 `foo`。函数 `foo` 位于\n"
"// 值命名空间中，因此未被导入。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:255
msgid "//~ ERROR `foo` is a module\n"
msgstr "//~ ERROR `foo` 是一个模块\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:259
msgid "r\\[items.use.glob\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.glob\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:260
msgid "Glob imports"
msgstr "glob 导入"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:262
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.glob.intro\\] The `*` character may be used as the last "
"segment of a `use` path to import all importable entities from the entity of "
"the preceding segment. For example:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.glob.intro\\] 字符 `*` 可以用作 `use` 路径的最后一个段，以从前"
"一个段所指的实体导入所有可导入实体。例如："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:266
msgid "// Creates a non-public alias to `bar`.\n"
msgstr "// 创建一个指向 `bar` 的非公开别名。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:276
msgid ""
"// Creates local aliases to `V1` and `V2`\n"
"        // of the `Example` enum.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 创建指向 `V1` 和 `V2` 的局部别名，\n"
"        // 它们属于 `Example` 枚举。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:284
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.glob.shadowing\\] Items and named imports are allowed to "
"shadow names from glob imports in the same [namespace](../names/"
"namespaces.md). That is, if there is a name already defined by another item "
"in the same namespace, the glob import will be shadowed. For example:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.glob.shadowing\\] 项和命名导入允许遮蔽同一[命名空间](../names/"
"namespaces.md)中来自 glob 导入的名称。也就是说，如果同一命名空间中已有由另一"
"个项定义的名称，则 glob 导入会被遮蔽。例如："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:288
msgid ""
"// This creates a binding to the `clashing::Foo` tuple struct\n"
"// constructor, but does not import its type because that would\n"
"// conflict with the `Foo` struct defined here.\n"
"//\n"
"// Note that the order of definition here is unimportant.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这会创建一个指向 `clashing::Foo` 元组结构体\n"
"// 构造器的绑定，但不会导入其类型，因为那会\n"
"// 与这里定义的 `Foo` 结构体冲突。\n"
"//\n"
"// 注意，这里的定义顺序并不重要。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:299
msgid "// Uses the constructor from `clashing::Foo`.\n"
msgstr "// 使用来自 `clashing::Foo` 的构造器。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:301
msgid ""
"// The struct expression uses the type from\n"
"    // the `Foo` struct defined above.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 结构体表达式使用来自\n"
"    // 上面定义的 `Foo` 结构体的类型。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:304
msgid "// `Bar` is also in scope due to the glob import.\n"
msgstr "// 由于 glob 导入，`Bar` 也在作用域内。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:314
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] For areas where shadowing is not allowed, see [name resolution "
"ambiguities](names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 对于不允许遮蔽的区域，见[名称解析歧义]"
"(names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:317
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.glob.last-segment-only\\] `*` cannot be used as the first or "
"intermediate segments."
msgstr "r\\[items.use.glob.last-segment-only\\] `*` 不能用作第一个段或中间段。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:320
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.glob.self-import\\] `*` cannot be used to import a module's "
"contents into itself (such as `use self::*;`)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.glob.self-import\\] `*` 不能用于将模块的内容导入其自身（例如 "
"`use self::*;`）。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:323
msgid "r\\[items.use.glob.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.glob.edition2018\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:324
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] In the 2015 edition, paths are relative to the crate "
"root, so an import such as `use *;` is valid, and it means to import "
"everything from the crate root. This cannot be used in the crate root itself."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2015 edition 中，路径相对于 crate 根，因此像 `use *;` "
"这样的导入是有效的，其含义是从 crate 根导入所有内容。这不能在 crate 根自身中"
"使用。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:327
msgid "r\\[items.use.as-underscore\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.as-underscore\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:330
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.as-underscore.intro\\] Items can be imported without binding "
"to a name by using an underscore with the form `use path as _`. This is "
"particularly useful to import a trait so that its methods may be used "
"without importing the trait's symbol, for example if the trait's symbol may "
"conflict with another symbol. Another example is to link an external crate "
"without importing its name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.as-underscore.intro\\] 可以使用下划线以 `use path as _` 的形式"
"导入项，而不将其绑定到名称。这对于导入 trait 尤其有用，这样就可以使用其方法而"
"不导入该 trait 的符号，例如当该 trait 的符号可能与另一个符号冲突时。另一个例"
"子是链接外部 crate 而不导入其名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:333
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.as-underscore.glob\\] Asterisk glob imports will import items "
"imported with `_` in their unnameable form."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.as-underscore.glob\\] 星号 glob 导入会以不可命名的形式导入通过 "
"`_` 导入的项。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:346
msgid "// Underscore import avoids name conflict with this item.\n"
msgstr "// 下划线导入避免了与此项发生名称冲突。\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:354
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.as-underscore.macro\\] The unique, unnameable symbols are "
"created after macro expansion so that macros may safely emit multiple "
"references to `_` imports. For example, the following should not produce an "
"error:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.as-underscore.macro\\] 唯一且不可命名的符号会在宏展开之后创建，"
"因此宏可以安全地发出对 `_` 导入的多个引用。例如，以下代码不应产生错误："

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:362
msgid ""
"// This expands to:\n"
"// use std as _;\n"
"// use std as _;\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这会展开为：\n"
"// use std as _;\n"
"// use std as _;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:368
msgid "r\\[items.use.restrictions\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.use.restrictions\\]"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:369 src/items/enumerations.md:163
msgid "Restrictions"
msgstr "限制"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:371
msgid "The following rules are restrictions for valid `use` declarations."
msgstr "以下规则是对有效 `use` 声明的限制。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:373
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.crate-alias\\] When using `crate` to import the "
"current crate, you must use `as` to define the binding name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.crate-alias\\] 使用 `crate` 导入当前 crate 时，必"
"须使用 `as` 定义绑定名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:381 src/items/use-declarations.md:408
#: src/items/use-declarations.md:427
msgid "// Not allowed:\n"
msgstr "// 不允许：\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:382
msgid "// use crate;\n"
msgstr "// use crate;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:383
msgid "// use crate::{self};\n"
msgstr "// use crate::{self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:386
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.macro-crate-alias\\] When using [`$crate`]"
"(paths.qualifiers.macro-crate) in a macro transcriber to import the current "
"crate, you must use `as` to define the binding name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.macro-crate-alias\\] 在宏转录器中使用 [`$crate`]"
"(paths.qualifiers.macro-crate) 导入当前 crate 时，必须使用 `as` 定义绑定名"
"称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:399
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.self-alias\\] When using `self` to import the "
"current module, you must use `as` to define the binding name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.self-alias\\] 使用 `self` 导入当前模块时，必须使"
"用 `as` 定义绑定名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:409
msgid "// use {self};\n"
msgstr "// use {self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:410
msgid "// use self;\n"
msgstr "// use self;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:411
msgid "// use self::{self};\n"
msgstr "// use self::{self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:414
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.super-alias\\] When using `super` to import a "
"parent module, you must use `as` to define the binding name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.super-alias\\] 使用 `super` 导入父模块时，必须使"
"用 `as` 定义绑定名称。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:428
msgid "// use super;\n"
msgstr "// use super;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:429
msgid "// use super::{self};\n"
msgstr "// use super::{self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:430
msgid "// use self::super;\n"
msgstr "// use self::super;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:431
msgid "// use super::super;\n"
msgstr "// use super::super;\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:432
msgid "// use super::super::{self};\n"
msgstr "// use super::super::{self};\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:437
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.extern-prelude\\] `::` as the [extern prelude](../"
"names/preludes.md#extern-prelude) cannot be imported."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.extern-prelude\\] 作为 [extern prelude](../names/"
"preludes.md#extern-prelude) 的 `::` 不能被导入。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:442
msgid "//~ Error\n"
msgstr "//~ Error\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:445
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] In the 2015 edition, the prefix `::` refers to the crate "
"root, so `use ::{self as root};` is allowed because it is same as `use "
"crate::{self as root};`. Starting with the 2018 edition the `::` prefix "
"refers to the extern prelude, which cannot be directly imported."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2015 edition 中，前缀 `::` 指 crate 根，因此允许 "
"`use ::{self as root};`，因为它与 `use crate::{self as root};` 相同。从 2018 "
"edition 开始，`::` 前缀指 extern prelude，而它不能被直接导入。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:449
msgid "//~ Ok\n"
msgstr "//~ Ok\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:452
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.duplicate-name\\] As with any item definition, "
"`use` imports cannot create duplicate bindings of the same name in the same "
"namespace in a module or block."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.duplicate-name\\] 与任何项定义一样，`use` 导入不能"
"在模块或块中的同一命名空间内创建同名的重复绑定。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:455
msgid ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.variant\\] `use` paths cannot refer to enum "
"variants through a [type alias](type-aliases.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.use.restrictions.variant\\] `use` 路径不能通过[类型别名](type-"
"aliases.md)引用枚举变体。"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:465 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1200
#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1201
msgid "//~ OK\n"
msgstr "//~ OK\n"

#: src/items/use-declarations.md:466 src/patterns.md:322 src/patterns.md:323
#: src/patterns.md:324 src/patterns.md:335
msgid "//~ ERROR\n"
msgstr "//~ ERROR\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:1
msgid "r\\[items.fn\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:4
msgid "r\\[items.fn.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.syntax\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:35 src/expressions/closure-expr.md:17
msgid "The `async` qualifier is not allowed in the 2015 edition."
msgstr "2015 edition 中不允许使用 `async` 限定符。"

#: src/items/functions.md:37
msgid ""
"The `safe` function qualifier is only allowed semantically within `extern` "
"blocks."
msgstr "`safe` 函数限定符在语义上只允许用于 `extern` 块内。"

#: src/items/functions.md:39
msgid ""
"_Relevant to editions earlier than Rust 2024_: Within `extern` blocks, the "
"`safe` or `unsafe` function qualifier is only allowed when the `extern` is "
"qualified as `unsafe`."
msgstr ""
"*与 Rust 2024 之前的 edition 相关*：在 `extern` 块内，只有当 `extern` 限定为 "
"`unsafe` 时，才允许使用 `safe` 或 `unsafe` 函数限定符。"

#: src/items/functions.md:41
msgid ""
"Function parameters with only a type are only allowed in an associated "
"function of a [trait item](traits.md) in the 2015 edition."
msgstr ""
"仅含类型的函数参数只允许出现在 2015 edition 中 [trait 项](traits.md)的关联函"
"数里。"

#: src/items/functions.md:43
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.intro\\] A _function_ consists of a [block](../expressions/"
"block-expr.md) (that's the _body_ of the function), along with a name, a set "
"of parameters, and an output type. Other than a name, all these are optional."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.intro\\] 一个 *函数* 由一个[块](../expressions/block-expr.md)"
"（即函数的 *主体*）以及名称、一组参数和输出类型组成。除名称外，所有这些部分都"
"是可选的。"

#: src/items/functions.md:46
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.namespace\\] Functions are declared with the keyword `fn` which "
"defines the given name in the [value namespace](../names/namespaces.md) of "
"the module or block where it is located."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.namespace\\] 函数使用关键字 `fn` 声明，该关键字会在函数所在模块"
"或块的[值命名空间](../names/namespaces.md)中定义给定名称。"

#: src/items/functions.md:49
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.signature\\] Functions may declare a set of _input_ "
"[_variables_](../variables.md) as parameters, through which the caller "
"passes arguments into the function, and the _output_ [_type_](../"
"types.md#type-expressions) of the value the function will return to its "
"caller on completion."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.signature\\] 函数可以声明一组作为参数的 *输入* [*变量*](../"
"variables.md)，调用者通过这些参数向函数传入实参；函数还可以声明完成时将返回给"
"调用者的值的 *输出* [*类型*](../types.md#type-expressions)。"

#: src/items/functions.md:52
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.implicit-return\\] If the output type is not explicitly stated, "
"it is the [unit type](../types/tuple.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.implicit-return\\] 如果未显式声明输出类型，则它是[单元类型](../"
"types/tuple.md)。"

#: src/items/functions.md:55
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.fn-item-type\\] When referred to, a _function_ yields a first-"
"class _value_ of the corresponding [zero-sized](glossary.zst) [_function "
"item type_](../types/function-item.md), which when called evaluates to a "
"direct call to the function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.fn-item-type\\] 当被引用时，一个 *函数* 会产生对应[零大小]"
"(glossary.zst)的[*函数项类型*](../types/function-item.md)的一等 *值*；调用该"
"值时，会求值为对该函数的直接调用。"

#: src/items/functions.md:58
msgid "For example, this is a simple function:"
msgstr "例如，这是一个简单函数："

#: src/items/functions.md:66
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.safety-qualifiers\\] The `safe` function is semantically only "
"allowed when used in an [`extern` block](external-blocks.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.safety-qualifiers\\] `safe` 函数在语义上只允许用于 [`extern` 块]"
"(external-blocks.md)中。"

#: src/items/functions.md:69
msgid "r\\[items.fn.params\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.params\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:70
msgid "Function parameters"
msgstr "函数参数"

#: src/items/functions.md:72
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.params.intro\\] Function parameters are irrefutable [patterns]"
"(../patterns.md), so any pattern that is valid in an else-less `let` binding "
"is also valid as a parameter:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.params.intro\\] 函数参数是不可反驳的[模式](../patterns.md)，因此"
"任何在不带 `else` 的 `let` 绑定中有效的模式，也都可以作为参数："

#: src/items/functions.md:79
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.params.self-pat\\] If the first parameter is a \\[SelfParam\\], "
"this indicates that the function is a [method](associated-items.md#methods)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.params.self-pat\\] 如果第一个参数是 \\[SelfParam\\]，则表示该函"
"数是一个[方法](associated-items.md#methods)。"

#: src/items/functions.md:82
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.params.self-restriction\\] Functions with a self parameter may "
"only appear as an [associated function](associated-items.md#associated-"
"functions-and-methods) in a [trait](traits.md) or [implementation]"
"(implementations.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.params.self-restriction\\] 带有 self 参数的函数只能作为 [trait]"
"(traits.md) 或[实现](implementations.md)中的[关联函数](associated-"
"items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)出现。"

#: src/items/functions.md:85
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.params.varargs\\] A parameter with the `...` token indicates a "
"[variadic function](external-blocks.md#variadic-functions), and may only be "
"used as the last parameter of an [external block](external-blocks.md) "
"function. The variadic parameter may have an optional identifier, such as "
"`args: ...`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.params.varargs\\] 带有 `...` token 的参数表示一个[变参函数]"
"(external-blocks.md#variadic-functions)，并且只能用作[外部块](external-"
"blocks.md)函数的最后一个参数。变参参数可以带有可选的标识符，例如 "
"`args: ...`。"

#: src/items/functions.md:88
msgid "r\\[items.fn.body\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.body\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:89
msgid "Function body"
msgstr "函数体"

#: src/items/functions.md:91
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.body.intro\\] The body block of a function is conceptually "
"wrapped in another block that first binds the argument patterns and then "
"`return`s the value of the function's body. This means that the tail "
"expression of the block, if evaluated, ends up being returned to the caller. "
"As usual, an explicit return expression within the body of the function will "
"short-cut that implicit return, if reached."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.body.intro\\] 从概念上说，函数的主体块会被包裹在另一个块中，该块"
"先绑定实参模式，然后 `return` 函数体的值。这意味着，如果块的尾表达式被求值，"
"最终会将其返回给调用者。和通常一样，如果执行到函数体中的显式 return 表达式，"
"它会提前结束这个隐式返回。"

#: src/items/functions.md:94
msgid "For example, the function above behaves as if it was written as:"
msgstr "例如，上面的函数行为就像写成如下形式："

#: src/items/functions.md:98
msgid "// argument_0 is the actual first argument passed from the caller\n"
msgstr "// argument_0 是调用者传入的实际第一个实参\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:105
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.body.bodyless\\] Functions without a body block are terminated "
"with a semicolon. This form may only appear in a [trait](traits.md) or "
"[external block](external-blocks.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.body.bodyless\\] 没有主体块的函数以分号结束。这种形式只能出现在 "
"[trait](traits.md) 或[外部块](external-blocks.md)中。"

#: src/items/functions.md:108
msgid "r\\[items.fn.generics\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.generics\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:109
msgid "Generic functions"
msgstr "泛型函数"

#: src/items/functions.md:111
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.intro\\] A _generic function_ allows one or more "
"_parameterized types_ to appear in its signature. Each type parameter must "
"be explicitly declared in an angle-bracket-enclosed and comma-separated "
"list, following the function name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.intro\\] *泛型函数* 允许一个或多个 *参数化类型* 出现在"
"其签名中。每个类型参数都必须在函数名之后、由尖括号包围且以逗号分隔的列表中显"
"式声明。"

#: src/items/functions.md:115
msgid "// foo is generic over A and B\n"
msgstr "// foo 在 A 和 B 上是泛型的\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:121
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.param-names\\] Inside the function signature and body, "
"the name of the type parameter can be used as a type name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.param-names\\] 在函数签名和函数体内，类型参数的名称可以"
"作为类型名称使用。"

#: src/items/functions.md:124
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.param-bounds\\] [Trait](traits.md) bounds can be "
"specified for type parameters to allow methods from that trait to be called "
"on values of that type. This is specified using the `where` syntax:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.param-bounds\\] 可以为类型参数指定 [trait](traits.md) "
"约束，以允许在该类型的值上调用来自该 trait 的方法。这使用 `where` 语法指定："

#: src/items/functions.md:133
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.mono\\] When a generic function is referenced, its "
"type is instantiated based on the context of the reference. For example, "
"calling the `foo` function here:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.mono\\] 当泛型函数被引用时，会根据该引用的上下文实例化"
"其类型。例如，在这里调用 `foo` 函数："

#: src/items/functions.md:140
msgid "// details elided\n"
msgstr "// 细节已省略\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:146
msgid "will instantiate type parameter `T` with `i32`."
msgstr "会用 `i32` 实例化类型参数 `T`。"

#: src/items/functions.md:148
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.explicit-arguments\\] The type parameters can also be "
"explicitly supplied in a trailing [path](../paths.md) component after the "
"function name. This might be necessary if there is not sufficient context to "
"determine the type parameters. For example, `mem::size_of::<u32>() == 4`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.generics.explicit-arguments\\] 类型参数也可以在函数名之后的尾随"
"[路径](../paths.md)组件中显式提供。如果没有足够的上下文来确定类型参数，这可能"
"是必要的。例如，`mem::size_of::<u32>() == 4`。"

#: src/items/functions.md:151
msgid "r\\[items.fn.extern\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.extern\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:152
msgid "Extern function qualifier"
msgstr "Extern 函数限定符"

#: src/items/functions.md:154
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.intro\\] The `extern` function qualifier allows "
"providing function _definitions_ that can be called with a particular ABI:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.intro\\] `extern` 函数限定符允许提供可用特定 ABI 调用的函"
"数 *定义*："

#: src/items/functions.md:159 src/items/functions.md:167
msgid "\"ABI\""
msgstr "\"ABI\""

#: src/items/functions.md:162
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.def\\] These are often used in combination with "
"[external block](external-blocks.md) items which provide function "
"_declarations_ that can be used to call functions without providing their "
"_definition_:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.def\\] 这些函数定义常与[外部块](external-blocks.md)项结合"
"使用；外部块项提供函数 *声明*，可在不提供其 *定义* 的情况下调用函数："

#: src/items/functions.md:168 src/items/functions.md:169
msgid "/* no body */"
msgstr "/* no body */"

#: src/items/functions.md:175
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.default-abi\\] When `\"extern\" Abi?*` is omitted from "
"`FunctionQualifiers` in function items, the ABI `\"Rust\"` is assigned. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.default-abi\\] 当函数项的 `FunctionQualifiers` 中省略 "
"`\"extern\" Abi?*` 时，会分配 ABI `\"Rust\"`。例如："

#: src/items/functions.md:182 src/items/functions.md:208
#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:256
msgid "is equivalent to:"
msgstr "等价于："

#: src/items/functions.md:185 src/expressions/call-expr.md:32
msgid "\"Rust\""
msgstr "\"Rust\""

#: src/items/functions.md:188
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.foreign-call\\] Functions can be called by foreign code, "
"and using an ABI that differs from Rust allows, for example, to provide "
"functions that can be called from other programming languages like C:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.foreign-call\\] 函数可以由外部代码调用；使用不同于 Rust "
"的 ABI，例如可以提供能从 C 等其他编程语言调用的函数："

#: src/items/functions.md:192
msgid "// Declares a function with the \"C\" ABI\n"
msgstr "// 声明一个带有 \"C\" ABI 的函数\n"

