msgstr "展开式"

#: src/items/functions.md:232
msgid "unwind"
msgstr "展开"

#: src/items/functions.md:233 src/items/functions.md:235
msgid "non-unwinding"
msgstr "非展开式"

#: src/items/functions.md:233
msgid "abort (see notes below)"
msgstr "中止（见下方注释）"

#: src/items/functions.md:233 src/items/functions.md:235
msgid "[undefined behavior](../behavior-considered-undefined.md)"
msgstr "[未定义行为](../behavior-considered-undefined.md)"

#: src/items/functions.md:234 src/items/functions.md:235
msgid "`panic=abort`"
msgstr "`panic=abort`"

#: src/items/functions.md:234 src/items/functions.md:235
msgid "`panic` aborts without unwinding"
msgstr "`panic` 不展开而中止"

#: src/items/functions.md:234
msgid "abort"
msgstr "中止"

#: src/items/functions.md:237
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.abort\\] With `panic=unwind`, when a `panic` is turned "
"into an abort by a non-unwinding ABI boundary, either no destructors (`Drop` "
"calls) will run, or all destructors up until the ABI boundary will run. It "
"is unspecified which of those two behaviors will happen."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.extern.abort\\] 使用 `panic=unwind` 时，当 `panic` 被非展开式 "
"ABI 边界转变为中止时，要么不会运行任何析构器（`Drop` 调用），要么会运行直到 "
"ABI 边界为止的所有析构器。会发生这两种行为中的哪一种是未指定的。"

#: src/items/functions.md:240
msgid ""
"For other considerations and limitations regarding unwinding across FFI "
"boundaries, see the [relevant section in the Panic documentation](../"
"panic.md#unwinding-across-ffi-boundaries)."
msgstr ""
"有关跨 FFI 边界展开的其他考虑事项和限制，请参阅 [Panic 文档中的相关小节](../"
"panic.md#unwinding-across-ffi-boundaries)。"

#: src/items/functions.md:248
msgid "r\\[items.fn.const\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.const\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:249 src/const_eval.md:264
msgid "Const functions"
msgstr "const 函数"

#: src/items/functions.md:251
msgid ""
"See [const functions](../const_eval.md#const-functions) for the definition "
"of const functions."
msgstr "const 函数的定义见 [const 函数](../const_eval.md#const-functions)。"

#: src/items/functions.md:253
msgid "r\\[items.fn.async\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.async\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:254
msgid "Async functions"
msgstr "异步函数"

#: src/items/functions.md:256
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.async.intro\\] Functions may be qualified as async, and this "
"can also be combined with the `unsafe` qualifier:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.async.intro\\] 函数可以限定为 async，并且这也可以与 `unsafe` 限"
"定符组合使用："

#: src/items/functions.md:264
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.async.future\\] Async functions do no work when called: "
"instead, they capture their arguments into a future. When polled, that "
"future will execute the function's body."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.async.future\\] 调用异步函数时并不会执行工作：相反，它们会把实参"
"捕获到一个 future 中。当该 future 被轮询时，它会执行函数体。"

#: src/items/functions.md:267
msgid ""
"r\\[items.fn.async.desugar-brief\\] An async function is roughly equivalent "
"to a function that returns [`impl Future`](../types/impl-trait.md) and with "
"an [`async move` block](../expressions/block-expr.md#async-blocks) as its "
"body:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.fn.async.desugar-brief\\] 异步函数大致等价于一个返回 [`impl "
"Future`](../types/impl-trait.md)、并以 [`async move` 块](../expressions/"
"block-expr.md#async-blocks)作为其主体的函数："

#: src/items/functions.md:271
msgid "// Source\n"
msgstr "// 源代码\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:277
