msgstr "大致等价于："

#: src/items/functions.md:280
msgid "// Desugared\n"
msgstr "// 脱糖后\n"

#: src/items/functions.md:287
msgid "r\\[items.fn.async.desugar\\] The actual desugaring is more complex:"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.async.desugar\\] 实际的脱糖更复杂："

#: src/items/functions.md:290
msgid "r\\[items.fn.async.lifetime-capture\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.async.lifetime-capture\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:291
msgid ""
"The return type in the desugaring is assumed to capture all lifetime "
"parameters from the `async fn` declaration. This can be seen in the "
"desugared example above, which explicitly outlives, and hence captures, `'a`."
msgstr ""
"脱糖后的返回类型会被假定捕获 `async fn` 声明中的所有生命周期参数。这可以在上"
"面的脱糖示例中看到：它显式地比 `'a` 活得更久，因而捕获了 `'a`。"

#: src/items/functions.md:293
msgid "r\\[items.fn.async.param-capture\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.fn.async.param-capture\\]"

#: src/items/functions.md:294
msgid ""
"The [`async move` block](../expressions/block-expr.md#async-blocks) in the "
"body captures all function parameters, including those that are unused or "
"bound to a `_` pattern. This ensures that function parameters are dropped in "
"the same order as they would be if the function were not async, except that "
"the drop occurs when the returned future has been fully awaited."
msgstr ""
"主体中的 [`async move` 块](../expressions/block-expr.md#async-blocks)会捕获所"
"有函数参数，包括未使用的参数或绑定到 `_` 模式的参数。这确保函数参数按与该函数"
"不是 async 时相同的顺序被丢弃，只是丢弃发生在返回的 future 被完全 await 之"
"后。"

#: src/items/functions.md:296
msgid ""
"For more information on the effect of async, see [`async` blocks](../"
"expressions/block-expr.md#async-blocks)."
msgstr ""
"有关 async 效果的更多信息，请参阅 [`async` 块](../expressions/block-"
"expr.md#async-blocks)。"

