#: src/items/enumerations.md:80
msgid ""
"r\\[items.enum.constructor-names\\] Variant constructors are similar to "
"[struct](structs.md) definitions, and can be referenced by a path from the "
"enumeration name, including in [use declarations](use-declarations.md)."
