"[call expression](../expressions/call-expr.md) or a [struct expression](../"
"expressions/struct-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.enum.tuple-expr\\] 类元组变体可以使用[调用表达式](../expressions/"
"call-expr.md)或[结构体表达式](../expressions/struct-expr.md)实例化。"

