msgstr "通过 `mem::discriminant`"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:221
msgid "r\\[items.enum.discriminant.access-opaque\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.enum.discriminant.access-opaque\\]"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:223
msgid ""
"\\[`std::mem::discriminant`\\] returns an opaque reference to the "
"discriminant of an enum value which can be compared. This cannot be used to "
"get the value of the discriminant."
msgstr ""
"\\[`std::mem::discriminant`\\] 返回一个对 enum 值判别值的不透明引用，可用于比"
"较。它不能用于取得判别值的值。"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:225
msgid "r\\[items.enum.discriminant.coercion\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.enum.discriminant.coercion\\]"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:226
msgid "Casting"
msgstr "转换"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:228
msgid ""
"r\\[items.enum.discriminant.coercion.intro\\] If an enumeration is [unit-"
"only](#unit-only-enum) (with no tuple and struct variants), then its "
"discriminant can be directly accessed with a [numeric cast](../expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#semantics); e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.enum.discriminant.coercion.intro\\] 如果枚举是[仅单元](#unit-only-"
"enum)的（没有元组变体和结构体变体），则可以通过[数值转换](../expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#semantics)直接访问其判别值；例如："

#: src/items/enumerations.md:243
msgid ""
"r\\[items.enum.discriminant.coercion.fieldless\\] [Field-less enums](#field-"
"less-enum) can be cast if they do not have explicit discriminants, or where "
"only unit variants are explicit."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.enum.discriminant.coercion.fieldless\\] [无字段枚举](#field-less-"
"enum)在没有显式判别值，或仅单元变体具有显式判别值时，可以进行转换。"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:273
msgid "Pointer casting"
msgstr "指针转换"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:275
msgid "r\\[items.enum.discriminant.access-memory\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.enum.discriminant.access-memory\\]"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:277
msgid ""
"If the enumeration specifies a [primitive representation](../type-"
"layout.md#primitive-representations), then the discriminant may be reliably "
"accessed via unsafe pointer casting:"
msgstr ""
"如果枚举指定了[原始表示](../type-layout.md#primitive-representations)，则可以"
"通过 unsafe 指针转换可靠地访问判别值："

#: src/items/enumerations.md:302
msgid "r\\[items.enum.empty\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.enum.empty\\]"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:303
msgid "Zero-variant enums"
msgstr "零变体枚举"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:305
msgid ""
"r\\[items.enum.empty.intro\\] Enums with zero variants are known as _zero-"
"variant enums_. As they have no valid values, they cannot be instantiated."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.enum.empty.intro\\] 具有零个变体的枚举称为*零变体枚举*。由于它们没"
"有有效值，因此不能被实例化。"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:312
msgid ""
"r\\[items.enum.empty.uninhabited\\] Zero-variant enums are equivalent to the "
"[never type](../types/never.md), but they cannot be coerced into other types."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.enum.empty.uninhabited\\] 零变体枚举等价于 [never 类型](../types/"
"never.md)，但它们不能被强制转换为其他类型。"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:318
msgid "// mismatched type error\n"
msgstr "// 类型不匹配错误\n"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:321
msgid "r\\[items.enum.variant-visibility\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.enum.variant-visibility\\]"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:322
msgid "Variant visibility"
msgstr "变体可见性"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:324
msgid ""
"Enum variants syntactically allow a \\[Visibility\\] annotation, but this is "
"rejected when the enum is validated. This allows items to be parsed with a "
"unified syntax across different contexts where they are used."
msgstr ""
"枚举变体在语法上允许 \\[Visibility\\] 标注，但这会在验证 enum 时被拒绝。这使"
"得项在其使用的不同上下文中可以用统一语法解析。"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:338 src/items/traits.md:349
msgid "// Empty `vis` is allowed.\n"
msgstr "// 允许空的 `vis`。\n"

#: src/items/enumerations.md:341
