msgstr "// 一个失败的编译时断言\n"

#: src/items/static-items.md:1
msgid "r\\[items.static\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.static\\]"

#: src/items/static-items.md:4
msgid "r\\[items.static.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.static.syntax\\]"

#: src/items/static-items.md:10
msgid ""
"The `safe` and `unsafe` function qualifiers are only allowed semantically "
"within `extern` blocks."
msgstr "`safe` 和 `unsafe` 函数限定符在语义上只允许出现在 `extern` 块内。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:12
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.intro\\] A _static item_ is similar to a [constant]"
"(constant-items.md), except that it represents an allocation in the program "
"that is initialized with the initializer expression. All references and raw "
"pointers to the static refer to the same allocation."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.intro\\] *静态项*类似于[常量](constant-items.md)，但它表示程"
"序中的一块分配，该分配由初始化式初始化。指向该静态项的所有引用和裸指针都指向"
"同一块分配。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:15
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.lifetime\\] Static items have the `static` lifetime, which "
"outlives all other lifetimes in a Rust program. Static items do not call "
"[`drop`](../destructors.md) at the end of the program."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.lifetime\\] 静态项具有 `static` 生命周期，它覆盖 Rust 程序中"
"的所有其他生命周期。静态项不会在程序结束时调用 [`drop`](../destructors.md)。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:18
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.storage-disjointness\\] If the `static` has a size of at "
"least 1 byte, this allocation is disjoint from all other such `static` "
"allocations as well as heap allocations and stack-allocated variables. "
"However, the storage of immutable `static` items can overlap with "
"allocations that do not themselves have a unique address, such as [promoteds]"
"(../destructors.md#constant-promotion) and [`const` items](constant-"
"items.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.storage-disjointness\\] 如果该 `static` 的大小至少为 1 字"
"节，则这块分配与所有其他此类 `static` 分配、堆分配以及栈分配变量互不重叠。然"
"而，不可变 `static` 项的存储可以与自身没有唯一地址的分配重叠，例如[提升值]"
"(../destructors.md#constant-promotion)和 [`const` 项](constant-items.md)。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:21
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.namespace\\] The static declaration defines a static value "
"in the [value namespace](../names/namespaces.md) of the module or block "
"where it is located."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.namespace\\] 静态声明会在其所在模块或块的[值命名空间](../"
"names/namespaces.md)中定义静态值。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:24
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.init\\] The static initializer is a [constant expression]"
"(../const_eval.md#constant-expressions) evaluated at compile time. Static "
"initializers may refer to and read from other statics. When reading from "
"mutable statics, they read the initial value of that static."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.init\\] 静态初始化式是一个在编译时求值的[常量表达式](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions)。静态初始化式可以引用并读取其他静态项。从"
"可变静态项读取时，它们读取的是该静态项的初始值。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:27
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.read-only\\] Non-`mut` static items that contain a type "
"that is not [interior mutable](../interior-mutability.md) may be placed in "
"read-only memory."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.read-only\\] 其类型不是[内部可变](../interior-mutability.md)"
"的非 `mut` 静态项可以放在只读内存中。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:30
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.safety\\] All access to a static is safe, but there are a "
"number of restrictions on statics:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.safety\\] 对静态项的所有访问都是安全的，但静态项有若干限制："

#: src/items/static-items.md:33
msgid "r\\[items.static.sync\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.static.sync\\]"

#: src/items/static-items.md:34
msgid ""
"The type must have the [`Sync`](std::marker::Sync) trait bound to allow "
"thread-safe access."
msgstr ""
"该类型必须满足 [`Sync`](std::marker::Sync) trait 约束，以允许线程安全访问。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:36
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.init.omission\\] The initializer expression must be omitted "
"in an [external block](external-blocks.md), and must be provided for free "
"static items."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.init.omission\\] 在[外部块](external-blocks.md)中必须省略初"
"始化式；对于自由静态项，必须提供初始化式。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:39
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.safety-qualifiers\\] The `safe` and `unsafe` qualifiers are "
"semantically only allowed when used in an [external block](external-"
"blocks.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.safety-qualifiers\\] `safe` 和 `unsafe` 限定符在语义上只允许"
"用于[外部块](external-blocks.md)中。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:42
msgid "r\\[items.static.generics\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.static.generics\\]"

#: src/items/static-items.md:43
msgid "Statics & generics"
msgstr "静态项与泛型"

#: src/items/static-items.md:45
msgid ""
"A static item defined in a generic scope (for example in a blanket or "
"default implementation) will result in exactly one static item being "
"defined, as if the static definition was pulled out of the current scope "
"into the module. There will _not_ be one item per monomorphization."
msgstr ""
"在泛型作用域中（例如 blanket 实现或默认实现中）定义的静态项只会导致定义一个静"
"态项，就好像该静态定义被从当前作用域提到模块中一样。它<em>不会</em>为每个单态"
"化各生成一个项。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:47
msgid "This code:"
msgstr "这段代码："

#: src/items/static-items.md:55
msgid "\"default_impl: counter was {}\""
msgstr "\"default_impl: counter was {}\""

#: src/items/static-items.md:67
msgid "\"blanket_impl: counter was {}\""
msgstr "\"blanket_impl: counter was {}\""

#: src/items/static-items.md:79
msgid "prints"
msgstr "打印"

#: src/items/static-items.md:88
msgid "r\\[items.static.mut\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.static.mut\\]"

#: src/items/static-items.md:89
msgid "Mutable statics"
msgstr "可变静态项"

#: src/items/static-items.md:91
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.mut.intro\\] If a static item is declared with the `mut` "
"keyword, then it is allowed to be modified by the program. One of Rust's "
"goals is to make concurrency bugs hard to run into, and this is obviously a "
"very large source of race conditions or other bugs."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.mut.intro\\] 如果静态项使用 `mut` 关键字声明，那么程序就可以"
"修改它。Rust 的目标之一是让并发 bug 难以出现，而这显然是竞态条件或其他 bug 的"
"一个巨大来源。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:94
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.mut.safety\\] For this reason, an `unsafe` block is "
"required when either reading or writing a mutable static variable. Care "
"should be taken to ensure that modifications to a mutable static are safe "
"with respect to other threads running in the same process."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.mut.safety\\] 因此，读取或写入可变静态变量时都需要 `unsafe` "
"块。应当谨慎确保对可变静态项的修改相对于同一进程中运行的其他线程是安全的。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:97
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.mut.extern\\] Mutable statics are still very useful, "
"however. They can be used with C libraries and can also be bound from C "
"libraries in an `extern` block."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.mut.extern\\] 不过，可变静态项仍然非常有用。它们可以与 C 库"
"一起使用，也可以在 `extern` 块中从 C 库绑定。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:104
msgid ""
"// This violates the idea of no shared state, and this doesn't internally\n"
"// protect against races, so this function is `unsafe`\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这违反了无共享状态的理念，并且其内部没有\n"
"// 防止竞争，因此此函数是 `unsafe`\n"

#: src/items/static-items.md:114
msgid ""
"// As an alternative to `bump_levels_unsafe`, this function is safe, "
"assuming\n"
"// that we have an atomic_add function which returns the old value. This\n"
"// function is safe only if no other code accesses the static in a non-"
"atomic\n"
"// fashion. If such accesses are possible (such as in "
"`bump_levels_unsafe`),\n"
"// then this would need to be `unsafe` to indicate to the caller that they\n"
"// must still guard against concurrent access.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 作为 `bump_levels_unsafe` 的替代方案，如果我们有一个会返回旧值的\n"
"// atomic_add 函数，则此函数是安全的。只有在没有其他代码以\n"
"// 非原子方式访问该 static 时，此函数才是安全的。如果此类访问是可能的\n"
"// （例如在 `bump_levels_unsafe` 中），那么它就需要是 `unsafe`，\n"
"// 以向调用者表明他们仍然必须防范\n"
"// 并发访问。\n"

#: src/items/static-items.md:128
msgid ""
"r\\[items.static.mut.sync\\] Mutable statics have the same restrictions as "
"normal statics, except that the type does not have to implement the `Sync` "
"trait."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.static.mut.sync\\] 可变静态项具有与普通静态项相同的限制，除了其类型"
"不必实现 `Sync` trait。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:131
msgid "r\\[items.static.alternate\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.static.alternate\\]"

#: src/items/static-items.md:132
msgid "Using statics or consts"
msgstr "使用静态项还是常量项"

#: src/items/static-items.md:134
msgid ""
"It can be confusing whether or not you should use a constant item or a "
"static item. Constants should, in general, be preferred over statics unless "
"one of the following are true:"
msgstr ""
"你可能会困惑应当使用常量项还是静态项。一般来说，除非以下情况之一为真，否则应"
"优先使用常量项而不是静态项："

#: src/items/static-items.md:136
msgid "Large amounts of data are being stored."
msgstr "正在存储大量数据。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:137
msgid "The single-address property of statics is required."
msgstr "需要静态项的单一地址属性。"

#: src/items/static-items.md:138
msgid "Interior mutability is required."
msgstr "需要内部可变性。"

#: src/items/traits.md:1
msgid "r\\[items.traits\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:4
msgid "r\\[items.traits.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.syntax\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:14
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.intro\\] A _trait_ describes an abstract interface that "
"types can implement. This interface consists of [associated items]"
"(associated-items.md), which come in three varieties:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.intro\\] _trait_ 描述类型可以实现的抽象接口。此接口由[关联"
"项](associated-items.md)组成，关联项分为三类："

#: src/items/traits.md:17
msgid "[functions](associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)"
msgstr "[函数](associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)"

#: src/items/traits.md:18
msgid "[types](associated-items.md#associated-types)"
msgstr "[类型](associated-items.md#associated-types)"

#: src/items/traits.md:19
msgid "[constants](associated-items.md#associated-constants)"
msgstr "[常量](associated-items.md#associated-constants)"

#: src/items/traits.md:21
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.namespace\\] The trait declaration defines a trait in the "
"[type namespace](../names/namespaces.md) of the module or block where it is "
"located."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.namespace\\] trait 声明会在其所在模块或块的[类型命名空间]"
"(../names/namespaces.md)中定义一个 trait。"

#: src/items/traits.md:24
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.associated-item-namespaces\\] Associated items are defined "
"as members of the trait within their respective namespaces. Associated types "
"are defined in the type namespace. Associated constants and associated "
"functions are defined in the value namespace."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.associated-item-namespaces\\] 关联项在各自的命名空间中定义"
"为 trait 的成员。关联类型在类型命名空间中定义。关联常量和关联函数在值命名空间"
"中定义。"

#: src/items/traits.md:27
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.self-param\\] All traits define an implicit type parameter "
"`Self` that refers to \"the type that is implementing this interface\". "
"Traits may also contain additional type parameters. These type parameters, "
"including `Self`, may be constrained by other traits and so forth [as usual]"
"(generics.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.self-param\\] 所有 trait 都定义一个隐式类型参数 `Self`，它指"
"代“正在实现此接口的类型”。trait 也可以包含额外的类型参数。这些类型参数（包括 "
"`Self`）可以[像通常那样](generics.md)受其他 trait 等约束。"

#: src/items/traits.md:30
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.impls\\] Traits are implemented for specific types through "
"separate [implementations](implementations.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.impls\\] trait 通过单独的[实现](implementations.md)为特定类"
"型实现。"

#: src/items/traits.md:33
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.associated-item-decls\\] Trait functions may omit the "
"function body by replacing it with a semicolon. This indicates that the "
"implementation must define the function. If the trait function defines a "
"body, this definition acts as a default for any implementation which does "
"not override it. Similarly, associated constants may omit the equal sign and "
"expression to indicate implementations must define the constant value. "
"Associated types must never define the type, the type may only be specified "
"in an implementation."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.associated-item-decls\\] trait 函数可以通过用分号替代函数体"
"来省略函数体。这表示实现必须定义该函数。如果 trait 函数定义了函数体，则该定义"
"会作为任何未覆盖它的实现的默认定义。类似地，关联常量可以省略等号和表达式，以"
"表示实现必须定义该常量值。关联类型绝不能定义类型；类型只能在实现中指定。"

#: src/items/traits.md:37
msgid "// Examples of associated trait items with and without definitions.\n"
msgstr "// 带定义和不带定义的关联 trait 项示例。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:47
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.const-fn\\] Trait functions are not allowed to be [`const`]"
"(functions.md#const-functions)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.const-fn\\] trait 函数不得是 [`const`](functions.md#const-"
"functions)。"

#: src/items/traits.md:50
msgid "r\\[items.traits.bounds\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.bounds\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:51
msgid "Trait bounds"
msgstr "trait 约束"

#: src/items/traits.md:53
msgid ""
"Generic items may use traits as [bounds](../trait-bounds.md) on their type "
"parameters."
msgstr "泛型项可以将 trait 用作其类型参数上的[约束](../trait-bounds.md)。"

#: src/items/traits.md:55
msgid "r\\[items.traits.generic\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.generic\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:56
msgid "Generic traits"
msgstr "泛型 trait"

#: src/items/traits.md:58
msgid ""
"Type parameters can be specified for a trait to make it generic. These "
"appear after the trait name, using the same syntax used in [generic "
"functions](functions.md#generic-functions)."
msgstr ""
"可以为 trait 指定类型参数，使其成为泛型。它们出现在 trait 名称之后，使用与[泛"
"型函数](functions.md#generic-functions)相同的语法。"

#: src/items/traits.md:68
msgid "<a id=\"object-safety\"></a> r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible\\]"
msgstr "<a id=\"object-safety\"></a> r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:70
msgid "Dyn compatibility"
msgstr "dyn 兼容性"

#: src/items/traits.md:72
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.intro\\] A dyn-compatible trait can be the "
"base trait of a [trait object](../types/trait-object.md). A trait is _dyn "
"compatible_ if it has the following qualities:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.intro\\] dyn 兼容 trait 可以作为 [trait 对象]"
"(../types/trait-object.md)的基础 trait。如果 trait 具有以下性质，则它是 *dyn "
"兼容* 的："

#: src/items/traits.md:75
msgid "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.supertraits\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.supertraits\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:76
msgid "All [supertraits](#supertraits) must also be dyn compatible."
msgstr "所有 [supertrait](#supertraits) 也必须是 dyn 兼容的。"

#: src/items/traits.md:78
msgid "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.sized\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.sized\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:79
msgid ""
"`Sized` must not be a [supertrait](#supertraits). In other words, it must "
"not require `Self: Sized`."
msgstr ""
"`Sized` 不得是 [supertrait](#supertraits)。换言之，它不得要求 `Self: Sized`。"

#: src/items/traits.md:81
msgid "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.associated-consts\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.associated-consts\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:82
msgid "It must not have any associated constants."
msgstr "它不得有任何关联常量。"

#: src/items/traits.md:84
msgid "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.associated-types\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.associated-types\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:85
msgid "It must not have any associated types with generics."
msgstr "它不得有任何带泛型的关联类型。"

#: src/items/traits.md:87
msgid "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.associated-functions\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.associated-functions\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:88
msgid ""
"All associated functions must either be dispatchable from a trait object or "
"be explicitly non-dispatchable:"
msgstr "所有关联函数必须要么可从 trait 对象分派，要么显式不可分派："

#: src/items/traits.md:89
msgid "Dispatchable functions must:"
msgstr "可分派函数必须："

#: src/items/traits.md:90
msgid ""
"Not have any type parameters (although lifetime parameters are allowed)."
msgstr "没有任何类型参数（但允许生命周期参数）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:91
msgid ""
"Be a [method](associated-items.md#methods) that does not use `Self` except "
"in the type of the receiver."
msgstr ""
"是一个[方法](associated-items.md#methods)，并且除了在接收者类型中之外不使用 "
"`Self`。"

#: src/items/traits.md:92
msgid "Have a receiver with one of the following types:"
msgstr "具有以下类型之一的接收者："

#: src/items/traits.md:93
msgid "`&Self` (i.e. `&self`)"
msgstr "`&Self`（即 `&self`）"

#: src/items/traits.md:94
msgid "`&mut Self` (i.e `&mut self`)"
msgstr "`&mut Self`（即 `&mut self`）"

#: src/items/traits.md:95
msgid "[`Box<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt)"
msgstr "[`Box<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt)"

#: src/items/traits.md:96
msgid "[`Rc<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#rct)"
msgstr "[`Rc<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#rct)"

#: src/items/traits.md:97
msgid "[`Arc<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#arct)"
msgstr "[`Arc<Self>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#arct)"

#: src/items/traits.md:98
msgid ""
"[`Pin<P>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#pinp) where `P` is one of the "
"types above"
msgstr ""
"[`Pin<P>`](../special-types-and-traits.md#pinp)，其中 `P` 是上述类型之一"

#: src/items/traits.md:99
msgid "Not have an opaque return type; that is,"
msgstr "没有不透明返回类型；也就是说，"

#: src/items/traits.md:100
msgid "Not be an `async fn` (which has a hidden `Future` type)."
msgstr "不是 `async fn`（它有隐藏的 `Future` 类型）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:101
msgid ""
"Not have a return position `impl Trait` type (`fn example(&self) -> impl "
"Trait`)."
msgstr "没有返回位置 `impl Trait` 类型（`fn example(&self) -> impl Trait`）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:102
msgid ""
"Not have a `where Self: Sized` bound (receiver type of `Self` (i.e. `self`) "
"implies this)."
msgstr ""
"没有 `where Self: Sized` 约束（类型为 `Self` 的接收者（即 `self`）会隐含此约"
"束）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:103
msgid "Explicitly non-dispatchable functions require:"
msgstr "显式不可分派函数要求："

#: src/items/traits.md:104
msgid ""
"Have a `where Self: Sized` bound (receiver type of `Self` (i.e. `self`) "
"implies this)."
msgstr ""
"具有 `where Self: Sized` 约束（类型为 `Self` 的接收者（即 `self`）会隐含此约"
"束）。"

#: src/items/traits.md:106
msgid "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.async-traits\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.dyn-compatible.async-traits\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:107
msgid ""
"The \\[`AsyncFn`\\], \\[`AsyncFnMut`\\], and \\[`AsyncFnOnce`\\] traits are "
"not dyn-compatible."
msgstr ""
"\\[`AsyncFn`\\]、\\[`AsyncFnMut`\\] 和 \\[`AsyncFnOnce`\\] trait 不是 dyn 兼"
"容的。"

#: src/items/traits.md:109
msgid "\\[!NOTE\\] This concept was formerly known as _object safety_."
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 此概念以前称为 _object safety_。"

#: src/items/traits.md:115
msgid "// Examples of dyn compatible methods.\n"
msgstr "// dyn 兼容方法示例。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:133
msgid ""
"// This trait is dyn compatible, but these methods cannot be dispatched on a "
"trait object.\n"
msgstr "// 此 trait 是 dyn 兼容的，但这些方法不能在 trait 对象上分派。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:135
msgid "// Non-methods cannot be dispatched.\n"
msgstr "// 非方法不能分派。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:137
msgid "// Self type isn't known until runtime.\n"
msgstr "// Self 类型直到运行时才可知。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:139
msgid "// `other` may be a different concrete type of the receiver.\n"
msgstr "// `other` 可能是与接收者不同的具体类型。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:141
msgid "// Generics are not compatible with vtables.\n"
msgstr "// 泛型与 vtable 不兼容。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:150
msgid "// ERROR: cannot call with Self return\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能以 Self 作为返回类型调用\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:151
msgid "// ERROR: cannot call with Self parameter\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能以 Self 作为参数调用\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:152
msgid "// ERROR: cannot call with generic type\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能以泛型类型调用\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:156
msgid "// Examples of dyn-incompatible traits.\n"
msgstr "// dyn 不兼容 trait 示例。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:159
msgid "// ERROR: cannot have associated const\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能有关联 const\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:161
msgid "// ERROR: associated function without Sized\n"
msgstr "// 错误：没有 Sized 的关联函数\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:162
msgid "// ERROR: Self in return type\n"
msgstr "// 错误：返回类型中有 Self\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:163
msgid "// ERROR: has generic type parameters\n"
msgstr "// 错误：具有泛型类型参数\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:164
msgid "// ERROR: nested receiver cannot be dispatched on\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能在嵌套接收者上分派\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:175
msgid "// `Self: Sized` traits are dyn-incompatible.\n"
msgstr "// `Self: Sized` trait 是 dyn 不兼容的。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:184
msgid "// Dyn-incompatible if `Self` is a type argument.\n"
msgstr "// 如果 `Self` 是类型实参，则 dyn 不兼容。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:191
msgid "// ERROR: cannot use `Self` type parameter\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不能使用 `Self` 类型参数\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:194
msgid "r\\[items.traits.supertraits\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.supertraits\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:195
msgid "Supertraits"
msgstr "Supertrait"

#: src/items/traits.md:197
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.supertraits.intro\\] **Supertraits** are traits that are "
"required to be implemented for a type to implement a specific trait. "
"Furthermore, anywhere a [generic](generics.md) or [trait object](../types/"
"trait-object.md) is bounded by a trait, it has access to the associated "
"items of its supertraits."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.supertraits.intro\\] **Supertrait** 是某个类型若要实现特定 "
"trait 就必须实现的 trait。此外，任何受某个 trait 约束的[泛型](generics.md)或 "
"[trait 对象](../types/trait-object.md)，都可以访问该 trait 的 supertrait 的关"
"联项。"

#: src/items/traits.md:200
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.supertraits.decl\\] Supertraits are declared by trait "
"bounds on the `Self` type of a trait and transitively the supertraits of the "
"traits declared in those trait bounds. It is an error for a trait to be its "
"own supertrait."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.supertraits.decl\\] Supertrait 通过 trait 的 `Self` 类型上"
"的 trait 约束声明，并且还传递地包括这些 trait 约束中所声明 trait 的 "
"supertrait。trait 不能成为它自己的 supertrait，否则是错误。"

#: src/items/traits.md:203
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.supertraits.subtrait\\] The trait with a supertrait is "
"called a **subtrait** of its supertrait."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.supertraits.subtrait\\] 带有 supertrait 的 trait 称为其 "
"supertrait 的 **subtrait**。"

#: src/items/traits.md:206
msgid ""
"The following is an example of declaring `Shape` to be a supertrait of "
"`Circle`."
msgstr "下面的示例将 `Shape` 声明为 `Circle` 的 supertrait。"

#: src/items/traits.md:213
msgid ""
"And the following is the same example, except using [where clauses]"
"(generics.md#where-clauses)."
msgstr "下面是相同示例，不过使用 [where 子句](generics.md#where-clauses)。"

#: src/items/traits.md:220
msgid ""
"This next example gives `radius` a default implementation using the `area` "
"function from `Shape`."
msgstr "下一个示例使用来自 `Shape` 的 `area` 函数为 `radius` 提供默认实现。"

#: src/items/traits.md:226
msgid ""
"// A = pi * r^2\n"
"        // so algebraically,\n"
"        // r = sqrt(A / pi)\n"
msgstr ""
"// A = pi * r^2\n"
"        // 因此按代数变换，\n"
"        // r = sqrt(A / pi)\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:234
msgid "This next example calls a supertrait method on a generic parameter."
msgstr "下一个示例在泛型参数上调用 supertrait 方法。"

#: src/items/traits.md:240
msgid ""
"// Here we call the area method from the supertrait `Shape` of `Circle`.\n"
msgstr "// 这里调用 `Circle` 的 supertrait `Shape` 中的 area 方法。\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:241
msgid "\"Area: {}\""
msgstr "\"Area: {}\""

#: src/items/traits.md:242
msgid "\"Radius: {}\""
msgstr "\"Radius: {}\""

#: src/items/traits.md:246
msgid ""
"Similarly, here is an example of calling supertrait methods on trait objects."
msgstr "类似地，这里是一个在 trait 对象上调用 supertrait 方法的示例。"

#: src/items/traits.md:259
msgid "r\\[items.traits.safety\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.safety\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:260
msgid "Unsafe traits"
msgstr "Unsafe trait"

#: src/items/traits.md:262
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.safety.intro\\] Traits items that begin with the `unsafe` "
"keyword indicate that _implementing_ the trait may be [unsafe](../"
"unsafety.md). It is safe to use a correctly implemented unsafe trait. The "
"[trait implementation](implementations.md#trait-implementations) must also "
"begin with the `unsafe` keyword."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.safety.intro\\] 以 `unsafe` 关键字开头的 trait 项表示*实现*"
"该 trait 可能是[不安全](../unsafety.md)的。使用正确实现的 unsafe trait 是安全"
"的。[trait 实现](implementations.md#trait-implementations)也必须以 `unsafe` "
"关键字开头。"

#: src/items/traits.md:265
msgid ""
"[`Sync`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sync) and [`Send`](../special-types-"
"and-traits.md#send) are examples of unsafe traits."
msgstr ""
"[`Sync`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sync) 和 [`Send`](../special-types-"
"and-traits.md#send) 是 unsafe trait 的示例。"

#: src/items/traits.md:267
msgid "r\\[items.traits.params\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.params\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:268
msgid "Parameter patterns"
msgstr "参数模式"

#: src/items/traits.md:270
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.params.patterns-no-body\\] Parameters in associated "
"functions without a body only allow \\[IDENTIFIER\\] or `_` [wild card](../"
"patterns.md#wildcard-pattern) patterns, as well as the form allowed by \\"
"[SelfParam\\]. `mut` \\[IDENTIFIER\\] is currently allowed, but it is "
"deprecated and will become a hard error in the future."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.params.patterns-no-body\\] 没有函数体的关联函数中的参数只允"
"许 \\[IDENTIFIER\\] 或 `_` [通配符](../patterns.md#wildcard-pattern)模式，以"
"及 \\[SelfParam\\] 所允许的形式。当前允许 `mut` \\[IDENTIFIER\\]，但它已弃"
"用，并将在未来成为硬错误。"

#: src/items/traits.md:283
msgid "// ERROR: patterns aren't allowed in functions without bodies\n"
msgstr "// 错误：无函数体的函数中不允许使用模式\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:287
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.params.patterns-with-body\\] Parameters in associated "
"functions with a body only allow irrefutable patterns."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.params.patterns-with-body\\] 带有函数体的关联函数中的参数只"
"允许不可反驳模式。"

#: src/items/traits.md:292
msgid "// OK: is irrefutable\n"
msgstr "// OK：不可反驳\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:298 src/items/traits.md:299
msgid "// ERROR: pattern is refutable\n"
msgstr "// 错误：模式可反驳\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:303
msgid "r\\[items.traits.params.pattern-required.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.params.pattern-required.edition2018\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:304
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] Prior to the 2018 edition, the pattern for an associated "
"function parameter is optional:"
msgstr "\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2018 edition 之前，关联函数参数的模式是可选的："

#: src/items/traits.md:308 src/items/traits.md:327 src/paths.md:218
msgid "// 2015 Edition\n"
msgstr "// 2015 版\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:310
msgid "// OK: parameter identifiers are not required\n"
msgstr "// OK：不要求参数标识符\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:314
msgid "Beginning in the 2018 edition, patterns are no longer optional."
msgstr "从 2018 edition 开始，模式不再是可选的。"

#: src/items/traits.md:316
msgid "r\\[items.traits.params.restriction-patterns.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.params.restriction-patterns.edition2018\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:317
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] Prior to the 2018 edition, parameters in associated "
"functions with a body are limited to the following kinds of patterns:"
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2018 edition 之前，带有函数体的关联函数中的参数仅限于"
"以下种类的模式："

#: src/items/traits.md:320
msgid "\\[IDENTIFIER\\]"
msgstr "\\[IDENTIFIER\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:321
msgid "`mut` \\[IDENTIFIER\\]"
msgstr "`mut` \\[IDENTIFIER\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:322
msgid "[`_`](../patterns.md#wildcard-pattern)"
msgstr "[`_`](../patterns.md#wildcard-pattern)"

#: src/items/traits.md:323
msgid "`&` \\[IDENTIFIER\\]"
msgstr "`&` \\[IDENTIFIER\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:324
msgid "`&&` \\[IDENTIFIER\\]"
msgstr "`&&` \\[IDENTIFIER\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:329
msgid "// ERROR: pattern not allowed\n"
msgstr "// 错误：不允许使用模式\n"

#: src/items/traits.md:333
msgid ""
"Beginning in 2018, all irrefutable patterns are allowed as described in \\"
"[items.traits.params.patterns-with-body\\]."
msgstr ""
"从 2018 开始，允许 \\[items.traits.params.patterns-with-body\\] 中所述的所有"
"不可反驳模式。"

#: src/items/traits.md:335
msgid "r\\[items.traits.associated-visibility\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.traits.associated-visibility\\]"

#: src/items/traits.md:336
msgid "Item visibility"
msgstr "项可见性"

#: src/items/traits.md:338
msgid ""
"r\\[items.traits.associated-visibility.intro\\] Trait items syntactically "
"allow a \\[Visibility\\] annotation, but this is rejected when the trait is "
"validated. This allows items to be parsed with a unified syntax across "
"different contexts where they are used. As an example, an empty `vis` macro "
"fragment specifier can be used for trait items, where the macro rule may be "
"used in other situations where visibility is allowed."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.traits.associated-visibility.intro\\] trait 项在语法上允许使用 \\"
"[Visibility\\] 注解，但在验证 trait 时会拒绝这种注解。这允许在不同使用上下文"
"中用统一语法解析项。例如，可以对 trait 项使用空的 `vis` 宏片段说明符，而该宏"
"规则还可以用于其他允许可见性的场景。"

#: src/items/traits.md:356
msgid "// Visibility is allowed here.\n"
msgstr "// 这里允许可见性。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:1
msgid "r\\[items.impl\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl\\]"

#: src/items/implementations.md:4
msgid "r\\[items.impl.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.syntax\\]"

#: src/items/implementations.md:23
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.intro\\] An _implementation_ is an item that associates items "
"with an _implementing type_. Implementations are defined with the keyword "
"`impl` and contain functions that belong to an instance of the type that is "
"being implemented or to the type statically."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.intro\\] *实现*是将项与*实现类型*关联起来的项。实现使用关键字 "
"`impl` 定义，并包含属于被实现类型的某个实例或静态属于该类型的函数。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:26
msgid "r\\[items.impl.kinds\\] There are two types of implementations:"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.kinds\\] 实现分为两类："

#: src/items/implementations.md:29
msgid "inherent implementations"
msgstr "固有实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:30
msgid "[trait](traits.md) implementations"
msgstr "[trait](traits.md) 实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:32
msgid "r\\[items.impl.inherent\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.inherent\\]"

#: src/items/implementations.md:33
msgid "Inherent implementations"
msgstr "固有实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:35
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.intro\\] An inherent implementation is defined as "
"the sequence of the `impl` keyword, generic type declarations, a path to a "
"nominal type, a where clause, and a bracketed set of associable items."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.intro\\] 固有实现被定义为依次由 `impl` 关键字、泛型类"
"型声明、到名义类型的路径、where 子句以及一组用花括号括起的可关联项组成。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:38
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.implementing-type\\] The nominal type is called the "
"_implementing type_ and the associable items are the _associated items_ to "
"the implementing type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.implementing-type\\] 该名义类型称为*实现类型*，可关联"
"项是该实现类型的*关联项*。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:41
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.associated-items\\] Inherent implementations "
"associate the contained items to the implementing type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.associated-items\\] 固有实现将所包含的项关联到实现类"
"型。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:44
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.associated-items.allowed-items\\] Inherent "
"implementations can contain [associated functions](associated-"
"items.md#associated-functions-and-methods) (including [methods](associated-"
"items.md#methods)) and [associated constants](associated-items.md#associated-"
"constants)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.associated-items.allowed-items\\] 固有实现可以包含[关"
"联函数](associated-items.md#associated-functions-and-methods)（包括[方法]"
"(associated-items.md#methods)）和[关联常量](associated-items.md#associated-"
"constants)。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:47
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.type-alias\\] They cannot contain associated type "
"aliases."
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.inherent.type-alias\\] 它们不能包含关联类型别名。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:50
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.associated-item-path\\] The [path](../paths.md) to "
"an associated item is any path to the implementing type, followed by the "
"associated item's identifier as the final path component."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.associated-item-path\\] 到关联项的[路径](../paths.md)"
"是到实现类型的任意路径，后跟作为最终路径组件的关联项标识符。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:53
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.coherence\\] A type can also have multiple inherent "
"implementations. An implementing type must be defined within the same crate "
"as the original type definition."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.inherent.coherence\\] 一个类型也可以有多个固有实现。实现类型必"
"须与原始类型定义在同一 crate 内定义。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:76
msgid "// Actual path to the implementing type and impl in the same module.\n"
msgstr "// 到同一模块中实现类型和 impl 的实际路径。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:79
msgid ""
"// Impl blocks in different modules are still accessed through a path to the "
"type.\n"
msgstr "// 不同模块中的 impl 块仍然通过到该类型的路径访问。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:82
msgid "// Re-exported paths to the implementing type also work.\n"
msgstr "// 到实现类型的重导出路径也可用。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:85
msgid ""
"// Does not work, because use in `values` is not pub.\n"
"    // values::Color::red();\n"
msgstr ""
"// 无法工作，因为 `values` 中的 use 不是 pub。\n"
"    // values::Color::red();\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:90
msgid "r\\[items.impl.trait\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.trait\\]"

#: src/items/implementations.md:91
msgid "Trait implementations"
msgstr "trait 实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:93
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.intro\\] A _trait implementation_ is defined like an "
"inherent implementation except that the optional generic type declarations "
"are followed by a [trait](traits.md), followed by the keyword `for`, "
"followed by a path to a nominal type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.intro\\] *trait 实现*的定义方式类似于固有实现，不同之处"
"在于可选的泛型类型声明后面跟着一个 [trait](traits.md)，再跟关键字 `for`，再跟"
"到名义类型的路径。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:98
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.implemented-trait\\] The trait is known as the "
"_implemented trait_. The implementing type implements the implemented trait."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.implemented-trait\\] 该 trait 称为*被实现 trait*。实现类"
"型实现该被实现 trait。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:101
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.def-requirement\\] A trait implementation must define "
"all non-default associated items declared by the implemented trait, may "
"redefine default associated items defined by the implemented trait, and "
"cannot define any other items."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.def-requirement\\] trait 实现必须定义由被实现 trait 声明"
"的所有非默认关联项，可以重新定义由被实现 trait 定义的默认关联项，并且不能定义"
"任何其他项。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:104
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.associated-item-path\\] The path to the associated "
"items is `<` followed by a path to the implementing type followed by `as` "
"followed by a path to the trait followed by `>` as a path component followed "
"by the associated item's path component."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.associated-item-path\\] 到关联项的路径是 `<`，后跟到实现"
"类型的路径，再跟 `as`，再跟到 trait 的路径，再跟作为路径组件的 `>`，最后跟关"
"联项的路径组件。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:107
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.safety\\] [Unsafe traits](traits.md#unsafe-traits) "
"require the trait implementation to begin with the `unsafe` keyword."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.safety\\] [unsafe trait](traits.md#r-"
"items.traits.safety) 要求 trait 实现以 `unsafe` 关键字开头。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:142
msgid "r\\[items.impl.trait.coherence\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.trait.coherence\\]"

#: src/items/implementations.md:143
msgid "Trait implementation coherence"
msgstr "trait 实现一致性"

#: src/items/implementations.md:145
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.coherence.intro\\] A trait implementation is considered "
"incoherent if either the orphan rules check fails or there are overlapping "
"implementation instances."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.coherence.intro\\] 如果孤儿规则检查失败，或者存在重叠的"
"实现实例，则认为 trait 实现是不一致的。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:148
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.coherence.overlapping\\] Two trait implementations "
"overlap when there is a non-empty intersection of the traits the "
"implementation is for, the implementations can be instantiated with the same "
"type. <!-- This is probably wrong? Source: No two implementations can be "
"instantiable with the same set of types for the input type parameters. -->"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.coherence.overlapping\\] 当两个 trait 实现所针对的 "
"trait 存在非空交集，并且这些实现可以用同一类型实例化时，这两个 trait 实现重"
"叠。 <!-- 这可能是错的？来源：对于输入类型参数的同一组类型，不能实例化两个实"
"现。 -->"

#: src/items/implementations.md:151
msgid "r\\[items.impl.trait.orphan-rule\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.trait.orphan-rule\\]"

#: src/items/implementations.md:152
msgid "Orphan rules"
msgstr "孤儿规则"

#: src/items/implementations.md:154
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.orphan-rule.intro\\] The _orphan rule_ states that a "
"trait implementation is only allowed if either the trait or at least one of "
"the types in the implementation is defined in the current crate. It prevents "
"conflicting trait implementations across different crates and is key to "
"ensuring coherence."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.orphan-rule.intro\\] *孤儿规则*规定，只有当 trait 或实现"
"中的至少一个类型在当前 crate 中定义时，才允许 trait 实现。它可以防止不同 "
"crate 之间发生冲突的 trait 实现，是确保一致性的关键。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:157
msgid ""
"An orphan implementation is one that implements a foreign trait for a "
"foreign type. If these were freely allowed, two crates could implement the "
"same trait for the same type in incompatible ways, creating a situation "
"where adding or updating a dependency could break compilation due to "
"conflicting implementations."
msgstr ""
"孤儿实现是指为外部类型实现外部 trait 的实现。如果自由允许这些实现，两个 "
"crate 就可以用不兼容的方式为同一类型实现同一 trait，从而造成这样一种情况：添"
"加或更新依赖可能因实现冲突而破坏编译。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:159
msgid ""
"The orphan rule enables library authors to add new implementations to their "
"traits without fear that they'll break downstream code. Without these "
"restrictions, a library couldn't add an implementation like `impl<T: "
"Display> MyTrait for T` without potentially conflicting with downstream "
"implementations."
msgstr ""
"孤儿规则使库作者能够向自己的 trait 添加新实现，而不必担心破坏下游代码。没有这"
"些限制，库就无法添加像 `impl<T: Display> MyTrait for T` 这样的实现，因为它可"
"能与下游实现冲突。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:161
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.orphan-rule.def\\] Given `impl<P1..=Pn> Trait<T1..=Tn> "
"for T0`, an `impl` is valid only if at least one of the following is true:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.orphan-rule.def\\] 给定 `impl<P1..=Pn> Trait<T1..=Tn> "
"for T0`，只有至少满足以下条件之一时，`impl` 才有效："

#: src/items/implementations.md:164
msgid "`Trait` is a [local trait](../glossary.md#local-trait)"
msgstr "`Trait` 是[本地 trait](../glossary.md#local-trait)"

#: src/items/implementations.md:165
msgid "All of"
msgstr "全部满足"

#: src/items/implementations.md:166
msgid ""
"At least one of the types `T0..=Tn` must be a [local type](../"
"glossary.md#local-type). Let `Ti` be the first such type."
msgstr ""
"类型 `T0..=Tn` 中必须至少有一个是[本地类型](../glossary.md#local-type)。令 "
"`Ti` 为第一个这样的类型。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:167
msgid ""
"No [uncovered type](../glossary.md#uncovered-type) parameters `P1..=Pn` may "
"appear in `T0..Ti` (excluding `Ti`)"
msgstr ""
"不得有[未覆盖类型](../glossary.md#uncovered-type)参数 `P1..=Pn` 出现在 "
"`T0..Ti` 中（不包括 `Ti`）"

#: src/items/implementations.md:169
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.uncovered-param\\] Only the appearance of _uncovered_ "
"type parameters is restricted."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.uncovered-param\\] 只限制 *未覆盖* 类型参数的出现。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:172
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.fundamental\\] Note that for the purposes of coherence, "
"[fundamental types](../glossary.md#fundamental-type-constructors) are "
"special. The `T` in `Box<T>` is not considered covered, and `Box<LocalType>` "
"is considered local."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.trait.fundamental\\] 注意，出于一致性的目的，[基本类型](../"
"glossary.md#fundamental-type-constructors)是特殊的。`Box<T>` 中的 `T` 不被视"
"为已覆盖，而 `Box<LocalType>` 被视为本地的。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:175
msgid "r\\[items.impl.generics\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.generics\\]"

#: src/items/implementations.md:176
msgid "Generic implementations"
msgstr "泛型实现"

#: src/items/implementations.md:178
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.generics.intro\\] An implementation can take [generic "
"parameters](generics.md), which can be used in the rest of the "
"implementation. Implementation parameters are written directly after the "
"`impl` keyword."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.generics.intro\\] 实现可以接受[泛型参数](generics.md)，这些参"
"数可以在实现的其余部分中使用。实现参数直接写在 `impl` 关键字之后。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:187
msgid "/* Treat the integer as a sequence of bits */"
msgstr "/* 将整数视为位序列 */"

#: src/items/implementations.md:191
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.generics.use\\] Generic parameters _constrain_ an "
"implementation if the parameter appears at least once in one of:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.generics.use\\] 如果参数至少在以下任一位置出现一次，则泛型参"
"数 *约束* 一个实现："

#: src/items/implementations.md:194
msgid "The implemented trait, if it has one"
msgstr "被实现的 trait（如果有）"

#: src/items/implementations.md:195
msgid "The implementing type"
msgstr "实现类型"

#: src/items/implementations.md:196
msgid ""
"As an [associated type](associated-items.md#associated-types) in the [bounds]"
"(../trait-bounds.md) of a type that contains another parameter that "
"constrains the implementation"
msgstr ""
"作为某个类型的[约束](../trait-bounds.md)中的[关联类型](associated-"
"items.md#associated-types)，且该类型包含另一个约束该实现的参数"

#: src/items/implementations.md:198
msgid ""
"r\\[items.impl.generics.constrain\\] Type and const parameters must always "
"constrain the implementation. Lifetimes must constrain the implementation if "
"the lifetime is used in an associated type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.impl.generics.constrain\\] 类型参数和 const 参数必须始终约束该实"
"现。如果生命周期用于关联类型中，则生命周期必须约束该实现。"

#: src/items/implementations.md:201
msgid "Examples of constraining situations:"
msgstr "约束情况示例："

#: src/items/implementations.md:209
msgid "// T constrains by being an argument to GenericTrait.\n"
msgstr "// T 通过作为 GenericTrait 的实参来形成约束。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:212
msgid "// T constrains by being an argument to GenericStruct\n"
msgstr "// T 通过作为 GenericStruct 的实参来形成约束\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:215
msgid "// Likewise, N constrains by being an argument to ConstGenericStruct\n"
msgstr "// 同样，N 通过作为 ConstGenericStruct 的实参来形成约束\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:218
msgid ""
"// T constrains by being in an associated type in a bound for type `U` which "
"is\n"
"// itself a generic parameter constraining the trait.\n"
msgstr ""
"// T 通过位于类型 `U` 的约束中的关联类型内来形成约束，而 `U`\n"
"// 本身是约束该 trait 的泛型参数。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:222
msgid ""
"// Like previous, except the type is `(U, isize)`. `U` appears inside the "
"type\n"
"// that includes `T`, and is not the type itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 与前例类似，但该类型是 `(U, isize)`。`U` 出现在包含 `T` 的类型内部，\n"
"// 而不是该类型本身。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:228
msgid "Examples of non-constraining situations:"
msgstr "非约束情况示例："

#: src/items/implementations.md:231
msgid ""
"// The rest of these are errors, since they have type or const parameters "
"that\n"
"// do not constrain.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 其余这些都是错误，因为它们有未形成约束的类型参数或\n"
"// const 参数。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:233
msgid "// T does not constrain since it does not appear at all.\n"
msgstr "// T 不形成约束，因为它完全没有出现。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:236
msgid "// N does not constrain for the same reason.\n"
msgstr "// N 因同样原因不形成约束。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:239
msgid "// Usage of T inside the implementation does not constrain the impl.\n"
msgstr "// 在实现内部使用 T 不会约束该 impl。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:244
msgid ""
"// T is used as an associated type in the bounds for U, but U does not "
"constrain.\n"
msgstr "// T 被用作 U 的约束中的关联类型，但 U 不形成约束。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:247
msgid ""
"// T is used in the bounds, but not as an associated type, so it does not "
"constrain.\n"
msgstr "// T 用在约束中，但不是作为关联类型使用，因此它不形成约束。\n"

#: src/items/implementations.md:252
msgid "Example of an allowed unconstraining lifetime parameter:"
msgstr "允许的不形成约束的生命周期参数示例："

#: src/items/implementations.md:259
msgid "Example of a disallowed unconstraining lifetime parameter:"
msgstr "不允许的不形成约束的生命周期参数示例："

#: src/items/implementations.md:269
msgid "r\\[items.impl.attributes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.impl.attributes\\]"

#: src/items/implementations.md:270
msgid "Attributes on implementations"
msgstr "实现上的属性"

#: src/items/implementations.md:272
msgid ""
"Implementations may contain outer [attributes](../attributes.md) before the "
"`impl` keyword and inner [attributes](../attributes.md) inside the brackets "
"that contain the associated items. Inner attributes must come before any "
"associated items. The attributes that have meaning here are [`cfg`](../"
"conditional-compilation.md), [`deprecated`](../attributes/diagnostics.md#the-"
"deprecated-attribute), [`doc`](../../rustdoc/the-doc-attribute.html), and "
"[the lint check attributes](../attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-"
"attributes)."
msgstr ""
"实现可以在 `impl` 关键字之前包含外部[属性](../attributes.md)，并在包含关联项"
"的花括号内部包含内部[属性](../attributes.md)。内部属性必须位于任何关联项之"
"前。在此处有意义的属性是 [`cfg`](../conditional-compilation.md)、"
"[`deprecated`](../attributes/diagnostics.md#the-deprecated-attribute)、"
"[`doc`](../../rustdoc/the-doc-attribute.html) 和 [lint 检查属性](../"
"attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes)。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:1
msgid "r\\[items.extern\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:4
msgid "r\\[items.extern.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.syntax\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:20
msgid ""
"Starting with the 2024 Edition, the `unsafe` keyword is required "
"semantically."
msgstr "从 2024 Edition 开始，语义上要求使用 `unsafe` 关键字。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:22
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.intro\\] External blocks provide _declarations_ of items "
"that are not _defined_ in the current crate and are the basis of Rust's "
"foreign function interface. These are akin to unchecked imports."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.intro\\] 外部块提供当前 crate 中未 *定义* 的项的 *声明*，并"
"且是 Rust 外部函数接口（FFI）的基础。它们类似于未经检查的导入。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:25
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.allowed-kinds\\] Two kinds of item _declarations_ are "
"allowed in external blocks: [functions](functions.md) and [statics](static-"
"items.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.allowed-kinds\\] 外部块中允许两种项 *声明*：[函数]"
"(functions.md)和[静态项](static-items.md)。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:28
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.safety\\] Calling unsafe functions or accessing unsafe "
"statics that are declared in external blocks is only allowed in an [`unsafe` "
"context](../unsafe-keyword.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.safety\\] 调用外部块中声明的 unsafe 函数，或访问其中声明的 "
"unsafe 静态项，只允许在 [`unsafe` 上下文](../unsafe-keyword.md)中进行。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:31
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.namespace\\] The external block defines its functions and "
"statics in the [value namespace](../names/namespaces.md) of the module or "
"block where it is located."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.namespace\\] 外部块会在其所在模块或块的[值命名空间](../"
"names/namespaces.md)中定义它的函数和静态项。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:34
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.unsafe-required\\] The `unsafe` keyword is semantically "
"required to appear before the `extern` keyword on external blocks."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.unsafe-required\\] 对于外部块，语义上要求 `unsafe` 关键字出"
"现在 `extern` 关键字之前。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:37
msgid "r\\[items.extern.edition2024\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.edition2024\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:38
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2024\\] Prior to the 2024 edition, the `unsafe` keyword is "
"optional. The `safe` and `unsafe` item qualifiers are only allowed if the "
"external block itself is marked as `unsafe`."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2024\\] 在 2024 edition 之前，`unsafe` 关键字是可选的。只有当外部"
"块本身被标记为 `unsafe` 时，才允许使用 `safe` 和 `unsafe` 项限定符。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:41
msgid "r\\[items.extern.fn\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.fn\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:44
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.body\\] Functions within external blocks are declared in "
"the same way as other Rust functions, with the exception that they must not "
"have a body and are instead terminated by a semicolon."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.body\\] 外部块中的函数以与其他 Rust 函数相同的方式声明，"
"区别在于它们不得有函数体，而是以分号结束。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:47
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.param-patterns\\] Patterns are not allowed in "
"parameters, only \\[IDENTIFIER\\] or `_` may be used."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.param-patterns\\] 参数中不允许使用模式，只可以使用 \\"
"[IDENTIFIER\\] 或 `_`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:50
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.qualifiers\\] The `safe` and `unsafe` function "
"qualifiers are allowed, but other function qualifiers (e.g. `const`, "
"`async`, `extern`) are not."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.qualifiers\\] 允许使用 `safe` 和 `unsafe` 函数限定符，但"
"不允许使用其他函数限定符（例如 `const`、`async`、`extern`）。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:53
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.foreign-abi\\] Functions within external blocks may be "
"called by Rust code, just like functions defined in Rust. The Rust compiler "
"automatically translates between the Rust ABI and the foreign ABI."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.foreign-abi\\] 外部块中的函数可以由 Rust 代码调用，就像"
"在 Rust 中定义的函数一样。Rust 编译器会自动在 Rust ABI 与外部 ABI 之间转换。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:56
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.safety\\] A function declared in an extern block is "
"implicitly `unsafe` unless the `safe` function qualifier is present."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.safety\\] 在 extern 块中声明的函数默认隐式为 `unsafe`，除"
"非存在 `safe` 函数限定符。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:59
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.fn-ptr\\] When coerced to a function pointer, a function "
"declared in an extern block has type `for<'l1, ..., 'lm> extern \"abi\" "
"fn(A1, ..., An) -> R`, where `'l1`, ... `'lm` are its lifetime parameters, "
"`A1`, ..., `An` are the declared types of its parameters, and `R` is the "
"declared return type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.fn.fn-ptr\\] 当被强制转换为函数指针时，在 extern 块中声明的"
"函数具有类型 `for<'l1, ..., 'lm> extern \"abi\" fn(A1, ..., An) -> R`，其中 "
"`'l1`、...、`'lm` 是它的生命周期参数，`A1`、...、`An` 是其参数的声明类型，"
"`R` 是声明的返回类型。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:62
msgid "r\\[items.extern.static\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.static\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:63
msgid "Statics"
msgstr "静态项"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:65
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.static.intro\\] Statics within external blocks are declared "
"in the same way as [statics](static-items.md) outside of external blocks, "
"except that they do not have an expression initializing their value."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.static.intro\\] 外部块中的静态项以与外部块之外的[静态项]"
"(static-items.md)相同的方式声明，但它们没有用于初始化其值的表达式。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:68
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.static.safety\\] Unless a static item declared in an extern "
"block is qualified as `safe`, it is `unsafe` to access that item, whether or "
"not it's mutable, because there is nothing guaranteeing that the bit pattern "
"at the static's memory is valid for the type it is declared with, since some "
"arbitrary (e.g. C) code is in charge of initializing the static."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.static.safety\\] 除非在 extern 块中声明的静态项被限定为 "
"`safe`，否则访问该项就是 `unsafe`，无论它是否可变；因为没有任何东西能保证该静"
"态项内存中的位模式对其声明类型是有效的，这是因为某些任意代码（例如 C 代码）负"
"责初始化该静态项。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:71
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.static.mut\\] Extern statics can be either immutable or "
"mutable just like [statics](static-items.md) outside of external blocks."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.static.mut\\] extern 静态项可以是不可变的，也可以是可变的，"
"就像外部块之外的[静态项](static-items.md)一样。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:74
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.static.read-only\\] An immutable static _must_ be "
"initialized before any Rust code is executed. It is not enough for the "
"static to be initialized before Rust code reads from it. Once Rust code "
"runs, mutating an immutable static (from inside or outside Rust) is UB, "
"except if the mutation happens to bytes inside of an `UnsafeCell`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.static.read-only\\] 不可变静态项 *必须* 在任何 Rust 代码执行"
"之前初始化。仅在 Rust 代码从该静态项读取之前完成初始化是不够的。一旦 Rust 代"
"码运行，修改不可变静态项（无论从 Rust 内部还是外部修改）都是 UB，除非修改发生"
"在 `UnsafeCell` 内部的字节上。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:77
msgid "r\\[items.extern.abi\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.abi\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:80
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.abi.intro\\] The `extern` keyword can be followed by an "
"optional [ABI](glossary.abi) string. The ABI specifies the calling "
"convention of the functions in the block. The calling convention defines a "
"low-level interface for functions, such as how arguments are placed in "
"registers or on the stack, how return values are passed, and who is "
"responsible for cleaning up the stack."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.abi.intro\\] `extern` 关键字后可以跟一个可选的 [ABI]"
"(glossary.abi) 字符串。ABI 指定块中函数的调用约定。调用约定为函数定义低层接"
"口，例如参数如何放入寄存器或栈中、返回值如何传递，以及由谁负责清理栈。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:85
msgid "// Interface to the Windows API.\n"
msgstr "// Windows API 接口。\n"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:86
msgid "\"system\""
msgstr "\"system\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:89
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.abi.default\\] If the ABI string is not specified, it "
"defaults to `\"C\"`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.abi.default\\] 如果未指定 ABI 字符串，则默认为 `\"C\"`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:92
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The `extern` syntax without an explicit ABI is being phased out, "
"so it's better to always write the ABI explicitly."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 不带显式 ABI 的 `extern` 语法正在逐步淘汰，因此最好始终显式写出 "
"ABI。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:95
msgid ""
"For more details, see [Rust issue #134986](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/134986)."
msgstr ""
"更多细节见 [Rust issue #134986](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/"
"134986)。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:97
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.abi.standard\\] The following ABI strings are supported on "
"all platforms:"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.abi.standard\\] 以下 ABI 字符串在所有平台上都受支持："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:100
msgid "r\\[items.extern.abi.rust\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.abi.rust\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:101
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"Rust\"` --- The native calling convention for Rust "
"functions and closures. This is the default when a function is declared "
"without using [`extern fn`](items.fn.extern). The Rust ABI offers no "
"stability guarantees."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"Rust\"` --- Rust 函数和闭包的原生调用约定。当函数声明未使用 "
"[`extern fn`](items.fn.extern) 时，这是默认值。Rust ABI 不提供稳定性保证。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:103
msgid "r\\[items.extern.abi.c\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.abi.c\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:104
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"C\"` --- The \"C\" ABI matches the default ABI chosen by "
"the dominant C compiler for the target."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"C\"` --- \"C\" ABI 与目标平台上主流 C 编译器所选择的默认 "
"ABI 匹配。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:106
msgid "r\\[items.extern.abi.system\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.abi.system\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:107
msgid ""
"`unsafe extern \"system\"` --- This is equivalent to `extern \"C\"` except "
"on Windows x86_32 where it is equivalent to `\"stdcall\"` for non-variadic "
"functions, and equivalent to `\"C\"` for variadic functions."
msgstr ""
"`unsafe extern \"system\"` --- 这等价于 `extern \"C\"`，但在 Windows x86_32 "
"上例外：对于非变参函数，它等价于 `\"stdcall\"`；对于变参函数，它等价于 "
"`\"C\"`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:109
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] As the correct underlying ABI on Windows is target-specific, "
"it's best to use `extern \"system\"` when attempting to link Windows API "
"functions that don't use an explicitly defined ABI."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 由于 Windows 上正确的底层 ABI 与目标相关，在尝试链接未使用显式定"
"义 ABI 的 Windows API 函数时，最好使用 `extern \"system\"`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:112
msgid "r\\[items.extern.abi.unwind\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.abi.unwind\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:113
msgid ""
"`extern \"C-unwind\"` and `extern \"system-unwind\"` --- Identical to "
"`\"C\"` and `\"system\"`, respectively, but with [different behavior]"
"(functions.md#unwinding) when the callee unwinds (by panicking or throwing a "
"C++ style exception)."
msgstr ""
"`extern \"C-unwind\"` 和 `extern \"system-unwind\"` --- 分别与 `\"C\"` 和 "
"`\"system\"` 相同，但当被调用方进行 unwind（通过 panic 或抛出 C++ 风格异常）"
"时具有[不同的行为](functions.md#unwinding)。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:115
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.abi.platform\\] There are also some platform-specific ABI "
"strings:"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.abi.platform\\] 还有一些平台特定的 ABI 字符串："

