#: src/items/external-blocks.md:213
msgid "Variadic functions"
msgstr "变参函数"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:215
msgid ""
"Functions within external blocks may be variadic by specifying `...` as the "
"last argument. The variadic parameter may optionally be specified with an "
"identifier."
msgstr ""
"外部块中的函数可以通过将 `...` 指定为最后一个参数来成为变参函数。变参参数可以"
"选择性地用标识符指定。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:222
msgid ""
"// SAFETY: This function guarantees it will not access\n"
"    // variadic arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"// SAFETY: 此函数保证不会访问\n"
"    // 变长参数。\n"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:228
msgid ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] The `safe` qualifier should not be used on a function in an "
"`extern` block unless that function guarantees that it will not access the "
"variadic arguments at all. Passing an unexpected number of arguments or "
"arguments of unexpected type to a variadic function may lead to \\[undefined "
"behavior\\]\\[undefined\\]."
msgstr ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] 除非 `extern` 块中的函数保证它完全不会访问变参实参，否则不应在"
"该函数上使用 `safe` 限定符。向变参函数传递意外数量的实参或意外类型的实参可能"
"导致\\[未定义行为\\]\\[undefined\\]。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:231
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.variadic.conventions\\] Variadic parameters can only be "
"specified within `extern` blocks with the following ABI strings or their "
"corresponding \\[`-unwind` variants\\]\\[items.fn.extern.unwind\\]:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.variadic.conventions\\] 变参参数只能在带有以下 ABI 字符串或"
"其对应 \\[`-unwind` 变体\\]\\[items.fn.extern.unwind\\] 的 `extern` 块中指"
"定："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:234
msgid "`\"aapcs\"`"
msgstr "`\"aapcs\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:235
msgid "`\"C\"`"
msgstr "`\"C\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:236
msgid "`\"cdecl\"`"
msgstr "`\"cdecl\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:237
msgid "`\"efiapi\"`"
msgstr "`\"efiapi\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:238
msgid "`\"system\"`"
msgstr "`\"system\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:239
msgid "`\"sysv64\"`"
msgstr "`\"sysv64\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:240
msgid "`\"win64\"`"
msgstr "`\"win64\"`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:242
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:243
msgid "Attributes on extern blocks"
msgstr "extern 块上的属性"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:245
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.intro\\] The following [attributes](../"
"attributes.md) control the behavior of external blocks."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.intro\\] 以下[属性](../attributes.md)控制 extern "
"块的行为。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:248
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:249
msgid "The `link` attribute"
msgstr "`link` 属性"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:251
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.intro\\] The _`link` attribute_ specifies "
"the name of a native library that the compiler should link with for the "
"items within an `extern` block."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.intro\\] *`link` 属性*指定编译器应为 "
"`extern` 块中的项链接的原生库名称。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:254
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.syntax\\] It uses the \\"
"[MetaListNameValueStr\\] syntax to specify its inputs. The `name` key is the "
"name of the native library to link. The `kind` key is an optional value "
"which specifies the kind of library with the following possible values:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.syntax\\] 它使用 \\[MetaListNameValueStr\\] "
"语法来指定其输入。`name` 键是要链接的原生库名称。`kind` 键是一个可选值，用于"
"指定库的种类，可能的值如下："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:257
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.dylib\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.dylib\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:258
msgid ""
"`dylib` --- Indicates a dynamic library. This is the default if `kind` is "
"not specified."
msgstr "`dylib` --- 表示动态库。如果未指定 `kind`，这是默认值。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:260
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.static\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.static\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:261
msgid "`static` --- Indicates a static library."
msgstr "`static` --- 表示静态库。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:263
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.framework\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.framework\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:264
msgid ""
"`framework` --- Indicates a macOS framework. This is only valid for macOS "
"targets."
msgstr "`framework` --- 表示 macOS framework。这仅对 macOS 目标有效。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:266
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.raw-dylib\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.raw-dylib\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:267
msgid ""
"`raw-dylib` --- Indicates a dynamic library where the compiler will generate "
"an import library to link against (see [`dylib` versus `raw-dylib`](#dylib-"
"versus-raw-dylib) below for details). This is only valid for Windows targets."
msgstr ""
"`raw-dylib` --- 表示一种动态库，编译器会为其生成要链接的导入库（详情见下文的 "
"[`dylib` versus `raw-dylib`](#dylib-versus-raw-dylib)）。这仅对 Windows 目标"
"有效。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:269
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.name-requirement\\] The `name` key must be "
"included if `kind` is specified."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.name-requirement\\] 如果指定了 `kind`，则必"
"须包含 `name` 键。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:272
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers\\] The optional `modifiers` "
"argument is a way to specify linking modifiers for the library to link."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers\\] 可选的 `modifiers` 参数用于为要"
"链接的库指定链接修饰符。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:275
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.syntax\\] Modifiers are specified "
"as a comma-delimited string with each modifier prefixed with either a `+` or "
"`-` to indicate that the modifier is enabled or disabled, respectively."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.syntax\\] 修饰符被指定为以逗号分隔"
"的字符串，每个修饰符前带有 `+` 或 `-` 前缀，分别表示启用或禁用该修饰符。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:278
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.multiple\\] Specifying multiple "
"`modifiers` arguments in a single `link` attribute, or multiple identical "
"modifiers in the same `modifiers` argument is not currently supported. "
"Example: `#[link(name = \"mylib\", kind = \"static\", modifiers = \"+whole-"
"archive\")]`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.multiple\\] 目前不支持在单个 "
"`link` 属性中指定多个 `modifiers` 参数，也不支持在同一个 `modifiers` 参数中指"
"定多个相同的修饰符。例如：`#[link(name = \"mylib\", kind = \"static\", "
"modifiers = \"+whole-archive\")]`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:281
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.wasm_import_module\\] The "
"`wasm_import_module` key may be used to specify the [WebAssembly module]"
"(https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/syntax/modules.html) name for the "
"items within an `extern` block when importing symbols from the host "
"environment. The default module name is `env` if `wasm_import_module` is not "
"specified."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.wasm_import_module\\] 从宿主环境导入符号时，"
"可以使用 `wasm_import_module` 键为 `extern` 块中的项指定 [WebAssembly module]"
"(https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/syntax/modules.html) 名称。如果未指"
"定 `wasm_import_module`，默认模块名为 `env`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:286
msgid "\"crypto\""
msgstr "\"crypto\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:288 src/items/external-blocks.md:293
#: src/items/external-blocks.md:298 src/attributes/testing.md:87
#: src/attributes/testing.md:105
msgid "// …\n"
msgstr "// …\n"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:291
msgid "\"CoreFoundation\""
msgstr "\"CoreFoundation\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:291
msgid "\"framework\""
msgstr "\"framework\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:302
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.empty-block\\] It is valid to add the "
"`link` attribute on an empty extern block. You can use this to satisfy the "
"linking requirements of extern blocks elsewhere in your code (including "
"upstream crates) instead of adding the attribute to each extern block."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.empty-block\\] 可以在空 extern 块上添加 "
"`link` 属性。你可以用这种方式满足代码中其他位置（包括上游 crate）extern 块的"
"链接要求，而不必为每个 extern 块添加该属性。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:305
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:306
msgid "Linking modifiers: `bundle`"
msgstr "链接修饰符：`bundle`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:308
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.allowed-kinds\\] This "
"modifier is only compatible with the `static` linking kind. Using any other "
"kind will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.allowed-kinds\\] 此修饰符只"
"与 `static` 链接种类兼容。使用任何其他种类都会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:311
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.behavior\\] When building "
"a rlib or staticlib `+bundle` means that the native static library will be "
"packed into the rlib or staticlib archive, and then retrieved from there "
"during linking of the final binary."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.behavior\\] 构建 rlib 或 "
"staticlib 时，`+bundle` 表示原生静态库会被打包进 rlib 或 staticlib 归档中，然"
"后在链接最终二进制文件时从中取出。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:314
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.behavior-negative\\] When "
"building a rlib `-bundle` means that the native static library is registered "
"as a dependency of that rlib \"by name\", and object files from it are "
"included only during linking of the final binary, the file search by that "
"name is also performed during final linking. When building a staticlib `-"
"bundle` means that the native static library is simply not included into the "
"archive and some higher level build system will need to add it later during "
"linking of the final binary."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.behavior-negative\\] 构建 "
"rlib 时，`-bundle` 表示原生静态库会“按名称”注册为该 rlib 的依赖，并且其中的目"
"标文件只会在链接最终二进制文件时包含进来，对该名称的文件搜索也会在最终链接期"
"间执行。构建 staticlib 时，`-bundle` 表示原生静态库不会被包含进归档中，某个更"
"高层的构建系统之后需要在链接最终二进制文件时添加它。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:317
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.no-effect\\] This modifier "
"has no effect when building other targets like executables or dynamic "
"libraries."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.no-effect\\] 构建可执行文件"
"或动态库等其他目标时，此修饰符没有效果。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:320
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.default\\] The default for "
"this modifier is `+bundle`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.bundle.default\\] 此修饰符的默认值"
"是 `+bundle`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:323
msgid ""
"More implementation details about this modifier can be found in [`bundle` "
"documentation for rustc](../../rustc/command-line-arguments.html#linking-"
"modifiers-bundle)."
msgstr ""
"关于此修饰符的更多实现细节，可在 [rustc 的 `bundle` 文档](../../rustc/"
"command-line-arguments.html#linking-modifiers-bundle)中找到。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:325
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.whole-archive\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.whole-archive\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:326
msgid "Linking modifiers: `whole-archive`"
msgstr "链接修饰符：`whole-archive`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:328
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.whole-archive.allowed-kinds\\] "
"This modifier is only compatible with the `static` linking kind. Using any "
"other kind will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.whole-archive.allowed-kinds\\] 此"
"修饰符只与 `static` 链接种类兼容。使用任何其他种类都会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:331
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.whole-archive.behavior\\] `+whole-"
"archive` means that the static library is linked as a whole archive without "
"throwing any object files away."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.whole-archive.behavior\\] `+whole-"
"archive` 表示将静态库作为完整归档进行链接，而不会丢弃任何目标文件。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:334
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.whole-archive.default\\] The "
"default for this modifier is `-whole-archive`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.whole-archive.default\\] 此修饰符"
"的默认值是 `-whole-archive`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:337
msgid ""
"More implementation details about this modifier can be found in [`whole-"
"archive` documentation for rustc](../../rustc/command-line-"
"arguments.html#linking-modifiers-whole-archive)."
msgstr ""
"关于此修饰符的更多实现细节，可在 [rustc 的 `whole-archive` 文档](../../rustc/"
"command-line-arguments.html#linking-modifiers-whole-archive)中找到。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:339
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:340
msgid "Linking modifiers: `verbatim`"
msgstr "链接修饰符：`verbatim`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:342
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim.allowed-kinds\\] This "
"modifier is compatible with all linking kinds."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim.allowed-kinds\\] 此修饰符"
"与所有链接种类兼容。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:345
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim.behavior\\] `+verbatim` "
"means that rustc itself won't add any target-specified library prefixes or "
"suffixes (like `lib` or `.a`) to the library name, and will try its best to "
"ask for the same thing from the linker."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim.behavior\\] `+verbatim` "
"表示 rustc 本身不会向库名称添加任何目标指定的库前缀或后缀（如 `lib` 或 "
"`.a`），并且会尽力要求链接器做同样的事情。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:348
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim.behavior-negative\\] `-"
"verbatim` means that rustc will either add a target-specific prefix and "
"suffix to the library name before passing it to linker, or won't prevent "
"linker from implicitly adding it."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim.behavior-negative\\] `-"
"verbatim` 表示 rustc 会在将库名称传递给链接器之前添加目标特定的前缀和后缀，或"
"者不会阻止链接器隐式添加它们。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:351
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim.default\\] The default "
"for this modifier is `-verbatim`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.modifiers.verbatim.default\\] 此修饰符的默认"
"值是 `-verbatim`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:354
msgid ""
"More implementation details about this modifier can be found in [`verbatim` "
"documentation for rustc](../../rustc/command-line-arguments.html#linking-"
"modifiers-verbatim)."
msgstr ""
"关于此修饰符的更多实现细节，可在 [rustc 的 `verbatim` 文档](../../rustc/"
"command-line-arguments.html#linking-modifiers-verbatim)中找到。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:356
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.kind-raw-dylib\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.kind-raw-dylib\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:357
msgid "`dylib` versus `raw-dylib`"
msgstr "`dylib` 与 `raw-dylib`"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:359
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.kind-raw-dylib.intro\\] On Windows, linking "
"against a dynamic library requires that an import library is provided to the "
"linker: this is a special static library that declares all of the symbols "
"exported by the dynamic library in such a way that the linker knows that "
"they have to be dynamically loaded at runtime."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.kind-raw-dylib.intro\\] 在 Windows 上，链接"
"动态库要求向链接器提供导入库：这是一种特殊的静态库，它以某种方式声明动态库导"
"出的所有符号，使链接器知道这些符号必须在运行时动态加载。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:362
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.kind-raw-dylib.import\\] Specifying `kind = "
"\"dylib\"` instructs the Rust compiler to link an import library based on "
"the `name` key. The linker will then use its normal library resolution logic "
"to find that import library. Alternatively, specifying `kind = \"raw-"
"dylib\"` instructs the compiler to generate an import library during "
"compilation and provide that to the linker instead."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.kind-raw-dylib.import\\] 指定 `kind = "
"\"dylib\"` 会指示 Rust 编译器基于 `name` 键链接一个导入库。随后链接器会使用其"
"正常的库解析逻辑来查找该导入库。或者，指定 `kind = \"raw-dylib\"` 会指示编译"
"器在编译期间生成一个导入库，并改为将其提供给链接器。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:365
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.kind-raw-dylib.platform-specific\\] `raw-"
"dylib` is only supported on Windows. Using it when targeting other platforms "
"will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.kind-raw-dylib.platform-specific\\] `raw-"
"dylib` 仅在 Windows 上受支持。以其他平台为目标时使用它会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:368
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:369
msgid "The `import_name_type` key"
msgstr "`import_name_type` 键"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:371
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.intro\\] On x86 Windows, "
"names of functions are \"decorated\" (i.e., have a specific prefix and/or "
"suffix added) to indicate their calling convention. For example, a `stdcall` "
"calling convention function with the name `fn1` that has no arguments would "
"be decorated as `_fn1@0`. However, the [PE Format](https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/debug/pe-format#import-name-type) does "
"also permit names to have no prefix or be undecorated. Additionally, the "
"MSVC and GNU toolchains use different decorations for the same calling "
"conventions which means, by default, some Win32 functions cannot be called "
"using the `raw-dylib` link kind via the GNU toolchain."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.intro\\] 在 x86 Windows "
"上，函数名称会被“修饰”（即添加特定前缀和/或后缀）以表示其调用约定。例如，名"
"为 `fn1` 且没有参数的 `stdcall` 调用约定函数会被修饰为 `_fn1@0`。不过，[PE "
"Format](https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/debug/pe-format#import-"
"name-type) 也允许名称没有前缀或不被修饰。此外，MSVC 和 GNU 工具链对相同调用约"
"定使用不同的修饰方式，这意味着默认情况下，某些 Win32 函数无法通过 GNU 工具链"
"使用 `raw-dylib` 链接种类来调用。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:374
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.values\\] To allow for "
"these differences, when using the `raw-dylib` link kind you may also specify "
"the `import_name_type` key with one of the following values to change how "
"functions are named in the generated import library:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.values\\] 为了适应这些差"
"异，使用 `raw-dylib` 链接种类时，还可以为 `import_name_type` 键指定以下值之"
"一，以改变生成的导入库中函数的命名方式："

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:377
msgid ""
"`decorated`: The function name will be fully-decorated using the MSVC "
"toolchain format."
msgstr "`decorated`：函数名称将使用 MSVC 工具链格式进行完整修饰。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:378
msgid ""
"`noprefix`: The function name will be decorated using the MSVC toolchain "
"format, but skipping the leading `?`, `@`, or optionally `_`."
msgstr ""
"`noprefix`：函数名称将使用 MSVC 工具链格式进行修饰，但跳过开头的 `?`、`@` 或"
"可选的 `_`。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:379
msgid "`undecorated`: The function name will not be decorated."
msgstr "`undecorated`：函数名称不会被修饰。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:381
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.default\\] If the "
"`import_name_type` key is not specified, then the function name will be "
"fully-decorated using the target toolchain's format."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.default\\] 如果未指定 "
"`import_name_type` 键，则函数名称将使用目标工具链的格式进行完整修饰。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:384
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.variables\\] Variables are "
"never decorated and so the `import_name_type` key has no effect on how they "
"are named in the generated import library."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.variables\\] 变量从不会被修"
"饰，因此 `import_name_type` 键不会影响它们在生成的导入库中的命名方式。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:387
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.platform-specific\\] The "
"`import_name_type` key is only supported on x86 Windows. Using it when "
"targeting other platforms will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link.import_name_type.platform-specific\\] "
"`import_name_type` 键仅在 x86 Windows 上受支持。以其他平台为目标时使用它会导"
"致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:391
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:392
msgid "The `link_name` attribute"
msgstr "`link_name` 属性"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:394
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.intro\\] The _`link_name` [attribute]"
"(../attributes.md)_ may be applied to declarations inside an `extern` block "
"to specify the symbol to import for the given function or static."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.intro\\] *`link_name` [属性](../"
"attributes.md)*可以应用于 `extern` 块内的声明，以指定要为给定函数或静态项导入"
"的符号。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:400
msgid "\"actual_symbol_name\""
msgstr "\"actual_symbol_name\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:405
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.syntax\\] The `link_name` attribute "
"uses the \\[MetaNameValueStr\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.syntax\\] `link_name` 属性使用 \\"
"[MetaNameValueStr\\] 语法。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:408
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.invalid-names\\] The symbol name must "
"not be the empty string or contain any `U+0000` (NUL) bytes."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.invalid-names\\] 符号名称不得为空字符"
"串，也不得包含任何 `U+0000`（NUL）字节。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:411
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.allowed-positions\\] The `link_name` "
"attribute may only be applied to a function or static item in an `extern` "
"block."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.allowed-positions\\] `link_name` 属性只"
"能应用于 `extern` 块中的函数或静态项。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:417
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.duplicates\\] Only the first use of "
"`link_name` on an item has effect."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.duplicates\\] 在一个项上，只有首次使用"
"的 `link_name` 会生效。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:420 src/attributes/testing.md:176
#: src/abi.md:109 src/abi.md:136
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `rustc` lints against any use following the first with a future-"
"compatibility warning. This may become an error in the future."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `rustc` 会对第一次之后的任何使用发出未来兼容性警告。将来这可能会"
"变成错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:423
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.link_ordinal\\] The `link_name` "
"attribute may not be used with the [`link_ordinal`]"
"(items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal) attribute."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_name.link_ordinal\\] `link_name` 属性不得与 "
"[`link_ordinal`](items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal) 属性一起使用。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:426
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:427
msgid "The `link_ordinal` attribute"
msgstr "`link_ordinal` 属性"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:429
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal.intro\\] The _`link_ordinal` "
"attribute_ can be applied on declarations inside an `extern` block to "
"indicate the numeric ordinal to use when generating the import library to "
"link against. An ordinal is a unique number per symbol exported by a dynamic "
"library on Windows and can be used when the library is being loaded to find "
"that symbol rather than having to look it up by name."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal.intro\\] *`link_ordinal` 属性*可以应"
"用于 `extern` 块内的声明，以表示生成要链接的导入库时使用的数字序号。在 "
"Windows 上，序号是动态库导出的每个符号对应的唯一数字；加载该库时，可以使用它"
"来查找该符号，而不必按名称查找。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:432
msgid ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] `link_ordinal` should only be used in cases where the ordinal "
"of the symbol is known to be stable: if the ordinal of a symbol is not "
"explicitly set when its containing binary is built then one will be "
"automatically assigned to it, and that assigned ordinal may change between "
"builds of the binary."
msgstr ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] `link_ordinal` 只应在已知符号序号稳定的情况下使用：如果构建包"
"含该符号的二进制文件时没有显式设置该符号的序号，则会自动为它分配一个序号，而"
"该分配的序号可能会在该二进制文件的不同构建之间变化。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:437
msgid "\"exporter\""
msgstr "\"exporter\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:437
msgid "\"raw-dylib\""
msgstr "\"raw-dylib\""

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:444
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal.allowed-kinds\\] This attribute is "
"only used with the `raw-dylib` linking kind. Using any other kind will "
"result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal.allowed-kinds\\] 此属性只与 `raw-"
"dylib` 链接种类一起使用。使用任何其他种类都会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:447
msgid ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal.exclusive\\] Using this attribute "
"with the `link_name` attribute will result in a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.extern.attributes.link_ordinal.exclusive\\] 将此属性与 `link_name` "
"属性一起使用会导致编译器错误。"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:450
msgid "r\\[items.extern.attributes.fn-parameters\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.extern.attributes.fn-parameters\\]"

#: src/items/external-blocks.md:453
msgid ""
"Attributes on extern function parameters follow the same rules and "
"restrictions as [regular function parameters](functions.md#attributes-on-"
"function-parameters)."
msgstr ""
"extern 函数参数上的属性遵循与[常规函数参数](functions.md#attributes-on-"
"function-parameters)相同的规则和限制。"

#: src/items/generics.md:1
msgid "r\\[items.generics\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.generics\\]"

#: src/items/generics.md:4
msgid "r\\[items.generics.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.generics.syntax\\]"

#: src/items/generics.md:19
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.syntax.intro\\] [Functions](functions.md), [type aliases]"
"(type-aliases.md), [structs](structs.md), [enumerations](enumerations.md), "
"[unions](unions.md), [traits](traits.md), and [implementations]"
"(implementations.md) may be _parameterized_ by types, constants, and "
"lifetimes. These parameters are listed in angle <span "
"class=\"parenthetical\">brackets (`<...>`)</span>, usually immediately after "
"the name of the item and before its definition. For implementations, which "
"don't have a name, they come directly after `impl`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.syntax.intro\\] [函数](functions.md)、[类型别名](type-"
"aliases.md)、[结构体](structs.md)、[枚举](enumerations.md)、[联合体]"
"(unions.md)、[trait](traits.md) 和[实现](implementations.md)可以按类型、常量"
"和生命周期进行*参数化*。这些参数列在尖括号 <span class=\"parenthetical\">"
"（`<...>`）</span> 中，通常紧跟在项的名称之后、定义之前。对于没有名称的实现，"
"它们直接位于 `impl` 之后。"

#: src/items/generics.md:22
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.syntax.decl-order\\] The order of generic parameters is "
"restricted to lifetime parameters and then type and const parameters "
"intermixed."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.syntax.decl-order\\] 泛型参数的顺序受限为先是生命周期参"
"数，然后是类型参数和 const 参数交错排列。"

#: src/items/generics.md:25
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.syntax.duplicate-params\\] The same parameter name may "
"not be declared more than once in a \\[GenericParams\\] list."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.syntax.duplicate-params\\] 同一参数名不得在 \\"
"[GenericParams\\] 列表中声明多次。"

#: src/items/generics.md:28
msgid "Some examples of items with type, const, and lifetime parameters:"
msgstr "下面是带有类型、const 和生命周期参数的项的一些示例："

#: src/items/generics.md:38
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.syntax.scope\\] Generic parameters are in scope within "
"the item definition where they are declared. They are not in scope for items "
"declared within the body of a function as described in [item declarations]"
"(../statements.md#item-declarations). See [generic parameter scopes](../"
"names/scopes.md#generic-parameter-scopes) for more details."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.syntax.scope\\] 泛型参数在其声明所在的项定义内处于作用域"
"中。对于函数体内声明的项，它们不在作用域内，如[项声明](../statements.md#r-"
"statement.item)中所述。更多细节见[泛型参数作用域](../names/scopes.md#r-"
"names.scopes.generic-parameters)。"

#: src/items/generics.md:41
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.builtin-generic-types\\] [References](../types/"
"pointer.md#shared-references-), [raw pointers](../types/pointer.md#raw-"
"pointers-const-and-mut), [arrays](../types/array.md), [slices](../types/"
"slice.md), [tuples](../types/tuple.md), and [function pointers](../types/"
"function-pointer.md) have lifetime or type parameters as well, but are not "
"referred to with path syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.builtin-generic-types\\] [引用](../types/pointer.md#r-"
"type.pointer.reference.shared)、[裸指针](../types/pointer.md#r-"
"type.pointer.raw)、[数组](../types/array.md)、[切片](../types/slice.md)、[元"
"组](../types/tuple.md)和[函数指针](../types/function-pointer.md)也有生命周期"
"或类型参数，但不会使用路径语法引用它们。"

#: src/items/generics.md:44
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.invalid-lifetimes\\] `'_` and `'static` are not valid "
"lifetime parameter names."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.invalid-lifetimes\\] `'_` 和 `'static` 不是有效的生命周期"
"参数名。"

#: src/items/generics.md:47
msgid "r\\[items.generics.const\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.generics.const\\]"

#: src/items/generics.md:48
msgid "Const generics"
msgstr "const 泛型"

#: src/items/generics.md:50
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.intro\\] _Const generic parameters_ allow items to "
"be generic over constant values."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.intro\\] *const 泛型参数*允许项针对常量值泛型化。"

#: src/items/generics.md:53
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.namespace\\] The const identifier introduces a name "
"in the [value namespace](../names/namespaces.md) for the constant parameter, "
"and all instances of the item must be instantiated with a value of the given "
"type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.namespace\\] const 标识符会在[值命名空间](../names/"
"namespaces.md)中为常量参数引入一个名称，并且该项的所有实例都必须以给定类型的"
"值实例化。"

#: src/items/generics.md:56
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.allowed-types\\] The only allowed types of const "
"parameters are `u8`, `u16`, `u32`, `u64`, `u128`, `usize`, `i8`, `i16`, "
"`i32`, `i64`, `i128`, `isize`, `char` and `bool`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.allowed-types\\] const 参数唯一允许的类型是 `u8`、"
"`u16`、`u32`、`u64`、`u128`、`usize`、`i8`、`i16`、`i32`、`i64`、`i128`、"
"`isize`、`char` 和 `bool`。"

#: src/items/generics.md:59
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.use\\] Const parameters can be used anywhere a "
"[const item](constant-items.md) can be used, with the exception that when "
"used in a [type](../types.md) or [array repeat expression](../expressions/"
"array-expr.md), it must be standalone (as described below). That is, they "
"are allowed in the following places:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.use\\] const 参数可以用在 [const 项](constant-"
"items.md)可用的任何位置，但在[类型](../types.md)或[数组重复表达式](../"
"expressions/array-expr.md)中使用时例外，它必须独立出现（如下所述）。也就是"
"说，它们允许出现在以下位置："

#: src/items/generics.md:62
msgid ""
"As an applied const to any type which forms a part of the signature of the "
"item in question."
msgstr "作为应用到某个类型上的 const 实参，而该类型构成所讨论项签名的一部分。"

#: src/items/generics.md:63
msgid ""
"As part of a const expression used to define an [associated const]"
"(associated-items.md#associated-constants), or as a parameter to an "
"[associated type](associated-items.md#associated-types)."
msgstr ""
"作为用于定义[关联 const](associated-items.md#associated-constants) 的 const "
"表达式的一部分，或作为[关联类型](associated-items.md#associated-types)的参"
"数。"

#: src/items/generics.md:64
msgid ""
"As a value in any runtime expression in the body of any functions in the "
"item."
msgstr "作为项中任意函数体内任意运行时表达式中的值。"

#: src/items/generics.md:65
msgid ""
"As a parameter to any type used in the body of any functions in the item."
msgstr "作为项中任意函数体内所用任意类型的参数。"

#: src/items/generics.md:66
msgid "As a part of the type of any fields in the item."
msgstr "作为项中任意字段类型的一部分。"

#: src/items/generics.md:69
msgid "// Examples where const generic parameters can be used.\n"
msgstr "// 可以使用 const 泛型参数的示例。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:70
msgid "// Used in the signature of the item itself.\n"
msgstr "// 用于项自身的签名中。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:73
msgid "// Used as a type within a function body.\n"
msgstr "// 在函数体内用作类型。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:78
msgid "// Used as a field of a struct.\n"
msgstr "// 用作结构体字段。\n"

#: src/items/generics.md:83
