#: src/items/generics.md:148 src/paths.md:117
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] In a generic argument list, an [inferred const]"
"(items.generics.const.inferred) is parsed as an \\[inferred type\\]\\"
"[InferredType\\] but then semantically treated as a separate kind of [const "
"generic argument](items.generics.const.argument)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 在泛型实参列表中，[推断 const](items.generics.const.inferred) 会"
