#: src/items/generics.md:151
msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.inferred\\] Where a const argument is expected, an "
"`_` (optionally surrounded by any number of matching parentheses), called "
"the _inferred const_ (\\[path rules\\]\\[paths.expr.complex-const-params\\], "
"\\[array expression rules\\]\\[expr.array.length-restriction\\]), can be "
"used instead. This asks the compiler to infer the const argument if possible "
"based on surrounding information."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.inferred\\] 在预期 const 实参的位置，可以改用 `_`"
"（可选地由任意数量匹配的括号包围），称为*推断 const*（\\[路径规则\\]\\"
