#: src/items/generics.md:163
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] An [inferred const](items.generics.const.inferred) is not "
"semantically an \\[expression\\]\\[Expression\\] and so is not accepted "
"within braces."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] [推断 const](items.generics.const.inferred) 在语义上不是\\[表达式"
