msgid ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.inferred.constraint\\] The inferred const cannot be "
"used in item signatures."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.generics.const.inferred.constraint\\] 推断 const 不能用于项签名。"

#: src/items/generics.md:176
