#: src/items/associated-items.md:351
msgid "r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause\\]"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:352
msgid "Required where clauses on generic associated types"
msgstr "泛型关联类型上必需的 where 子句"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:354
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.intro\\] Generic associated "
"type declarations on traits currently may require a list of where clauses, "
"dependent on functions in the trait and how the GAT is used. These rules may "
"be loosened in the future; updates can be found [on the generic associated "
"types initiative repository](https://rust-lang.github.io/generic-associated-"
"types-initiative/explainer/required_bounds.html)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.intro\\] trait 上的泛型关联类"
"型声明目前可能需要一个 where 子句列表，这取决于 trait 中的函数以及 GAT 的使用"
"方式。这些规则未来可能会放宽；更新可见于[泛型关联类型倡议仓库](https://rust-"
"lang.github.io/generic-associated-types-initiative/explainer/"
"required_bounds.html)。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:357
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.valid-fn\\] In a few words, "
"these where clauses are required in order to maximize the allowed "
"definitions of the associated type in impls. To do this, any clauses that "
"_can be proven to hold_ on functions (using the parameters of the function "
"or trait) where a GAT appears as an input or output must also be written on "
"the GAT itself."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.valid-fn\\] 简言之，需要这些 "
"where 子句，是为了最大化 impl 中允许的关联类型定义。为此，在 GAT 作为输入或输"
"出出现的函数上，任何（使用函数或 trait 的参数）*可以证明成立* 的子句，也必须"
"写在 GAT 本身上。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:367
msgid ""
"In the above, on the `next` function, we can prove that `Self: 'a`, because "
"of the implied bounds from `&'a mut self`; therefore, we must write the "
"equivalent bound on the GAT itself: `where Self: 'x`."
msgstr ""
"在上面的例子中，对于 `next` 函数，由于 `&'a mut self` 所产生的隐含约束，我们"
"可以证明 `Self: 'a`；因此，必须在 GAT 本身上写出等价约束：`where Self: 'x`。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:369
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.intersection\\] When there "
"are multiple functions in a trait that use the GAT, then the _intersection_ "
"of the bounds from the different functions are used, rather than the union."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.intersection\\] 当 trait 中有"
"多个函数使用该 GAT 时，会使用来自不同函数的约束的 *交集*，而不是并集。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:380
msgid ""
"In this example, no bounds are required on the `type Checker<'a>;`. While we "
"know that `T: 'a` on `create_checker`, we do not know that on `do_check`. "
"However, if `do_check` was commented out, then the `where T: 'x` bound would "
"be required on `Checker`."
msgstr ""
"在这个示例中，`type Checker<'a>;` 上不需要任何约束。虽然我们知道在 "
"`create_checker` 上有 `T: 'a`，但在 `do_check` 上并不知道这一点。不过，如果"
"将 `do_check` 注释掉，那么 `Checker` 上就需要 `where T: 'x` 约束。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:382
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.forward\\] The bounds on "
"associated types also propagate required where clauses."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.forward\\] 关联类型上的约束也"
"会传播必需的 where 子句。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:393
msgid ""
"Here, `where Self: 'a` is required on `Item` because of `iter`. However, "
"`Item` is used in the bounds of `Iterator`, the `where Self: 'a` clause is "
"also required there."
msgstr ""
"这里，由于 `iter`，`Item` 上需要 `where Self: 'a`。不过，`Item` 被用于 "
"`Iterator` 的约束中，因此那里也需要 `where Self: 'a` 子句。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:395
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.static\\] Finally, any "
"explicit uses of `'static` on GATs in the trait do not count towards the "
"required bounds."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.type.generic-where-clause.static\\] 最后，trait 中对 "
"GAT 的任何显式 `'static` 使用都不计入必需约束。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:405
msgid "r\\[items.associated.const\\]"
msgstr "r\\[items.associated.const\\]"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:406
msgid "Associated constants"
msgstr "关联常量"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:408
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.intro\\] _Associated constants_ are [constants]"
"(constant-items.md) associated with a type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.intro\\] *关联常量* 是与某个类型关联的[常量]"
"(constant-items.md)。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:411
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.decl\\] An _associated constant declaration_ "
"declares a signature for associated constant definitions. It is written as "
"`const`, then an identifier, then `:`, then a type, finished by a `;`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.decl\\] *关联常量声明* 为关联常量定义声明签名。它"
"写作 `const`，后接标识符，再接 `:`，再接一个类型，并以 `;` 结束。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:414
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.name\\] The identifier is the name of the "
"constant used in the path. The type is the type that the definition has to "
"implement."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.name\\] 该标识符是路径中使用的常量名称。该类型是定"
"义必须实现的类型。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:417
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.def\\] An _associated constant definition_ "
"defines a constant associated with a type. It is written the same as a "
"[constant item](constant-items.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.def\\] *关联常量定义* 定义一个与某个类型关联的常"
"量。它的写法与[常量项](constant-items.md)相同。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:420
msgid ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.eval\\] Associated constant definitions undergo "
"[constant evaluation](../const_eval.md) only when referenced. Further, "
"definitions that include [generic parameters](generics.md) are evaluated "
"after monomorphization."
msgstr ""
"r\\[items.associated.const.eval\\] 关联常量定义只有在被引用时才会进行[常量求"
"值](../const_eval.md)。此外，包含[泛型参数](generics.md)的定义会在单态化之后"
"求值。"

#: src/items/associated-items.md:428 src/items/associated-items.md:433
msgid "// Definition not immediately evaluated\n"
msgstr "// 定义不会立即求值\n"

