#: src/attributes.md:19
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.intro\\] An _attribute_ is a general, free-form metadatum "
"that is interpreted according to name, convention, language, and compiler "
"version. Attributes are modeled on Attributes in [ECMA-335](https://www.ecma-"
"international.org/publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-335/), with the "
"syntax coming from [ECMA-334](https://www.ecma-international.org/"
"publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-334/) (C#)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.intro\\] *属性*是一种通用的、自由形式的元数据，会根据名称、约"
"定、语言和编译器版本来解释。属性借鉴了 [ECMA-335](https://www.ecma-"
"international.org/publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-335/) 中的 "
"Attributes，其语法来自 [ECMA-334](https://www.ecma-international.org/"
"publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-334/) (C#)。"

#: src/attributes.md:22
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.inner\\] _Inner attributes_, written with a bang (`!`) after "
"the hash (`#`), apply to the form that the attribute is declared within."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.inner\\] *内部属性*写作在井号 (`#`) 之后带一个感叹号 (`!`)，应"
"用于声明该属性所在的形式。"

#: src/attributes.md:27
msgid "// General metadata applied to the enclosing module or crate.\n"
msgstr "// 应用于外围模块或 crate 的通用元数据。\n"

#: src/attributes.md:30
msgid "// Inner attribute applies to the entire function.\n"
msgstr "// 内部属性应用于整个函数。\n"

#: src/attributes.md:40
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.outer\\] _Outer attributes_, written without the bang after "
"the hash, apply to the form that follows the attribute."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.outer\\] *外部属性*写作时不在井号之后带感叹号，应用于该属性后"
"面的形式。"

#: src/attributes.md:45
msgid "// A function marked as a unit test\n"
msgstr "// 标记为单元测试的函数\n"

#: src/attributes.md:51
msgid "// A conditionally-compiled module\n"
msgstr "// 按条件编译的模块\n"

#: src/attributes.md:57
msgid "// A lint attribute used to suppress a warning/error\n"
msgstr "// 用于抑制警告/错误的 lint 属性\n"

#: src/attributes.md:62
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.input\\] The attribute consists of a path to the attribute, "
"followed by an optional delimited token tree whose interpretation is defined "
"by the attribute. Attributes other than macro attributes also allow the "
"input to be an equals sign (`=`) followed by an expression. See the [meta "
"item syntax](#meta-item-attribute-syntax) below for more details."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.input\\] 属性由指向该属性的路径组成，后面可以跟一个可选的带定"
"界符的 token 树，其解释由该属性定义。除宏属性以外的属性还允许输入为等号 "
"(`=`) 后跟一个表达式。更多细节见下方的[元项语法](#r-attributes.meta)。"

#: src/attributes.md:65
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.safety\\] An attribute may be unsafe to apply. To avoid "
"undefined behavior when using these attributes, certain obligations that "
"cannot be checked by the compiler must be met. To assert these have been, "
"the attribute is wrapped in `unsafe(..)`, e.g. `#[unsafe(no_mangle)]`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.safety\\] 属性在应用时可能是不安全的。为避免在使用这些属性时产"
"生未定义行为，必须满足某些编译器无法检查的义务。为断言这些义务已经满足，需要"
"将属性包裹在 `unsafe(..)` 中，例如 `#[unsafe(no_mangle)]`。"

#: src/attributes.md:68
msgid "The following attributes are unsafe:"
msgstr "以下属性是不安全的："

