msgstr "`cold` 属性"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:90
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.cold.intro\\] The _`cold` [attribute](../"
"attributes.md)_ suggests that the attributed function is unlikely to be "
"called which may help the compiler produce better code."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.cold.intro\\] *`cold` [属性](../attributes.md)* 建议带"
"属性函数不太可能被调用，这可以帮助编译器生成更好的代码。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:99
