#: src/attributes/codegen.md:159
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.unsafe\\] The `naked` attribute must be marked "
"with \\[`unsafe`\\]\\[attributes.safety\\] because the body must respect the "
"function's calling convention, uphold its signature, and either return or "
"diverge (i.e., not fall through past the end of the assembly code)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.unsafe\\] `naked` 属性必须标记为 \\[`unsafe`\\]"
"\\[attributes.safety\\]，因为函数体必须遵守函数的调用约定、满足其签名，并且要"
"么返回，要么发散（即不会直通执行到汇编代码末尾之后）。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:162
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.body\\] The [function body](items.fn.body) must "
"consist of exactly one [`naked_asm!`](asm) macro invocation."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.body\\] [函数体](items.fn.body)必须正好由一个 "
"[`naked_asm!`](asm) 宏调用组成。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:165
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.prologue-epilogue\\] The compiler emits no "
"prologue or epilogue for a naked function: the assembly code in the "
"[`naked_asm!`](asm) invocation constitutes its entire body."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.prologue-epilogue\\] 编译器不会为 naked "
"function 发出序言或尾声：[`naked_asm!`](asm) 调用中的汇编代码构成其整个函数"
"体。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:168
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.call-stack\\] On entry the assembly code may "
"assume that the call stack and register state are valid per the function's "
"signature and calling convention."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.call-stack\\] 进入时，汇编代码可以假定调用栈和寄"
"存器状态按照该函数的签名和调用约定是有效的。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:171
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.no-duplication\\] The compiler may not "
"duplicate the assembly code except when monomorphizing a polymorphic "
"function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.no-duplication\\] 除非在单态化多态函数时，否则编"
"译器不得复制该汇编代码。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:174
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This guarantee matters for naked functions that define symbols."
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 这一保证对于定义符号的 naked function 很重要。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:177
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.unused-variables\\] The [`unused_variables` "
"lint](../../rustc/lints/listing/warn-by-default.html#unused-variables) is "
"suppressed in naked functions."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.unused-variables\\] naked function 中会抑制 "
"[`unused_variables` lint](../../rustc/lints/listing/warn-by-"
"default.html#unused-variables)。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:180
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.inline\\] The [`inline` attribute]"
"(attributes.codegen.inline) cannot be applied to a naked function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.inline\\] [`inline` 属性]"
"(attributes.codegen.inline)不能应用于 naked function。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:183
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.track_caller\\] The [`track_caller` attribute]"
"(attributes.codegen.track_caller) cannot be applied to a naked function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.track_caller\\] [`track_caller` 属性]"
"(attributes.codegen.track_caller)不能应用于 naked function。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:186
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.testing\\] The [testing attributes]"
"(attributes.testing) cannot be applied to a naked function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.testing\\] [测试属性](attributes.testing)不能应"
"用于 naked function。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:189
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.target_feature\\] The [`target_feature` "
"attribute](attributes.codegen.target_feature) cannot be applied to a naked "
"function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.target_feature\\] [`target_feature` 属性]"
"(attributes.codegen.target_feature)不能应用于 naked function。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:194
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.abi\\] A naked function cannot use the "
"[\"Rust\" ABI](items.extern.abi.rust)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.naked.abi\\] naked function 不能使用 [\"Rust\" ABI]"
"(items.extern.abi.rust)。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:198
msgid "r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins\\]"
msgstr "r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins\\]"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:199
msgid "The `no_builtins` attribute"
msgstr "`no_builtins` 属性"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:201
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins.intro\\] The _`no_builtins` [attribute]"
"(../attributes.md)_ disables optimization of certain code patterns related "
"to calls to library functions that are assumed to exist."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins.intro\\] *`no_builtins` [属性](../"
"attributes.md)* 会禁用某些代码模式的优化，这些代码模式与调用被假定存在的库函"
"数有关。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:211
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins.syntax\\] The `no_builtins` attribute "
"uses the \\[MetaWord\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins.syntax\\] `no_builtins` 属性使用 \\"
"[MetaWord\\] 语法。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:214
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins.allowed-positions\\] The `no_builtins` "
"attribute can only be applied to the crate root."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins.allowed-positions\\] `no_builtins` 属性只"
"能应用于 crate 根。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:217
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins.duplicates\\] Only the first use of the "
"`no_builtins` attribute has effect."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.no_builtins.duplicates\\] 只有第一次使用 "
"`no_builtins` 属性会产生效果。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:223
msgid "r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature\\]"
msgstr "r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature\\]"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:224
msgid "The `target_feature` attribute"
msgstr "`target_feature` 属性"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:226
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.intro\\] The _`target_feature` "
"[attribute](../attributes.md)_ may be applied to a function to enable code "
"generation of that function for specific platform architecture features. It "
"uses the \\[MetaListNameValueStr\\] syntax with a single key of `enable` "
"whose value is a string of comma-separated feature names to enable."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.intro\\] *`target_feature` [属性](../"
"attributes.md)* 可以应用于函数，以便为特定平台架构特性启用该函数的代码生成。"
"它使用 \\[MetaListNameValueStr\\] 语法，带有单个 `enable` 键，其值是一个由逗"
"号分隔的、要启用的特性名称字符串。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:233 src/attributes/codegen.md:234
msgid "\"avx2\""
msgstr "\"avx2\""

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:238
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.arch\\] Each [target architecture](../"
"conditional-compilation.md#target_arch) has a set of features that may be "
"enabled. It is an error to specify a feature for a target architecture that "
"the crate is not being compiled for."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.arch\\] 每个[目标架构](../conditional-"
"compilation.md#target_arch)都有一组可以启用的特性。为 crate 并未针对其编译的"
"目标架构指定特性是错误。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:243
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.closures\\] Closures defined within a "
"`target_feature`\\-annotated function inherit the attribute from the "
"enclosing function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.closures\\] 在带有 `target_feature`\\-"
"注解的函数内定义的闭包，会从外围函数继承该属性。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:247
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.target-ub\\] It is [undefined behavior]"
"(../behavior-considered-undefined.md) to call a function that is compiled "
"with a feature that is not supported on the current platform the code is "
"running on, _except_ if the platform explicitly documents this to be safe."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.target-ub\\] 调用一个使用当前代码运行平"
"台不支持的特性编译的函数是[未定义行为](../behavior-considered-"
"undefined.md)， *除非* 该平台明确将这种情况记录为安全。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:252
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.safety-restrictions\\] The following "
"restrictions apply unless otherwise specified by the platform rules below:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.safety-restrictions\\] 除非下文平台规则"
"另有规定，否则适用以下限制："

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:255
msgid ""
"Safe `#[target_feature]` functions (and closures that inherit the attribute) "
"can only be safely called within a caller that enables all the "
"`target_feature`s that the callee enables. This restriction does not apply "
"in an `unsafe` context."
msgstr ""
"安全的 `#[target_feature]` 函数（以及继承该属性的闭包）只能在启用了被调用方所"
"启用的全部 `target_feature` 的调用方中安全调用。此限制不适用于 `unsafe` 上下"
"文。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:257
msgid ""
"Safe `#[target_feature]` functions (and closures that inherit the attribute) "
"can only be coerced to _safe_ function pointers in contexts that enable all "
"the `target_feature`s that the coercee enables. This restriction does not "
"apply to `unsafe` function pointers."
msgstr ""
"安全的 `#[target_feature]` 函数（以及继承该属性的闭包）只能在启用了被强制转换"
"对象所启用的全部 `target_feature` 的上下文中，被强制转换为*安全*函数指针。此"
"限制不适用于 `unsafe` 函数指针。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:260
msgid ""
"Implicitly enabled features are included in this rule. For example an `sse2` "
"function can call ones marked with `sse`."
msgstr ""
"隐式启用的特性也包含在此规则内。例如，`sse2` 函数可以调用标记为 `sse` 的函"
"数。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:263 src/attributes/codegen.md:283
msgid "\"sse2\""
msgstr "\"sse2\""

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:264 src/attributes/codegen.md:276
msgid "\"sse\""
msgstr "\"sse\""

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:268
msgid ""
"// Calling `foo_sse` here is unsafe, as we must ensure that SSE is\n"
"    // available first, even if `sse` is enabled by default on the target\n"
"    // platform or manually enabled as compiler flags.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 在这里调用 `foo_sse` 是 unsafe 的，因为我们必须先确保\n"
"    // SSE 可用，即使 `sse` 在目标平台上默认启用，\n"
"    // 或者作为编译器标志手动启用。\n"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:278
msgid "// Calling `foo_sse` here is safe.\n"
msgstr "// 在这里调用 `foo_sse` 是安全的。\n"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:285
msgid "// Calling `foo_sse` here is safe because `sse2` implies `sse`.\n"
msgstr "// 在这里调用 `foo_sse` 是安全的，因为 `sse2` 蕴含 `sse`。\n"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:291
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.fn-traits\\] A function with a "
"`#[target_feature]` attribute _never_ implements the `Fn` family of traits, "
"although closures inheriting features from the enclosing function do."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.fn-traits\\] 带有 `#[target_feature]` "
"属性的函数 *永远不会* 实现 `Fn` trait 家族，但从外围函数继承特性的闭包会实"
"现。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:294
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.allowed-positions\\] The "
"`#[target_feature]` attribute is not allowed on the following places:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.allowed-positions\\] "
"`#[target_feature]` 属性不允许用于以下位置："

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:297
msgid "\\[the `main` function\\]\\[crate.main\\]"
msgstr "\\[`main` 函数\\]\\[crate.main\\]"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:298
msgid "a \\[`panic_handler` function\\]\\[panic.panic_handler\\]"
msgstr "一个 \\[`panic_handler` 函数\\]\\[panic.panic_handler\\]"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:299
msgid "safe trait methods"
msgstr "安全 trait 方法"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:300
msgid "safe default functions in traits"
msgstr "trait 中的安全默认函数"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:302
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.inline\\] Functions marked with "
"`target_feature` are not inlined into a context that does not support the "
"given features. The `#[inline(always)]` attribute may not be used with a "
"`target_feature` attribute."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.inline\\] 标记有 `target_feature` 的函"
"数不会被内联到不支持给定特性的上下文中。`#[inline(always)]` 属性不得与 "
"`target_feature` 属性一起使用。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:307
msgid "r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.availability\\]"
msgstr "r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.availability\\]"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:308
msgid "Available features"
msgstr "可用特性"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:310
msgid "The following is a list of the available feature names."
msgstr "以下是可用特性名称列表。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:312
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.cfg-only\\] Target feature names "
"marked as \"(cfg only)\" in this list may only be used with the \\"
"[`target_feature`\\]\\[cfg.target_feature\\] conditional compilation option, "
"not with the `target_feature` attribute."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.cfg-only\\] 此列表中标记为 \"(cfg only)"
"\" 的目标特性名称只能与 \\[`target_feature`\\]\\[cfg.target_feature\\] 条件编"
"译选项一起使用，不能与 `target_feature` 属性一起使用。"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:315
msgid "r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.x86\\]"
msgstr "r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.x86\\]"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:316
msgid "`x86` or `x86_64`"
msgstr "`x86` 或 `x86_64`"

#: src/attributes/codegen.md:318
msgid ""
"Executing code with unsupported features is undefined behavior on this "
"platform. Hence on this platform use of `#[target_feature]` functions "
"follows the \\[above restrictions\\]\\"
"[attributes.codegen.target_feature.safety-restrictions\\]."
msgstr ""
"在此平台上，执行带有不受支持特性的代码是未定义行为。因此，在此平台上使用 "
"`#[target_feature]` 函数遵循\\[上述限制\\]\\"
"[attributes.codegen.target_feature.safety-restrictions\\]。"

