#: src/attributes/codegen.md:724
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.remark-cfg\\] See the "
"[`target_feature` conditional compilation option](../conditional-"
"compilation.md#target_feature) for selectively enabling or disabling "
"compilation of code based on compile-time settings. Note that this option is "
"not affected by the `target_feature` attribute, and is only driven by the "
"features enabled for the entire crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.codegen.target_feature.remark-cfg\\] 有关基于编译时设置选择性"
"启用或禁用代码编译，请参见[`target_feature` 条件编译选项](../conditional-"
"compilation.md#target_feature)。请注意，该选项不受 `target_feature` 属性影"
