msgstr "`collapse_debuginfo` 属性"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:176
msgid ""
"r\\[attributes.debugger.collapse_debuginfo.intro\\] The "
"_`collapse_debuginfo` [attribute](../attributes.md)_ controls whether code "
"locations from a macro definition are collapsed into a single location "
"associated with the macro's call site when generating debuginfo for code "
"calling this macro."
msgstr ""
"r\\[attributes.debugger.collapse_debuginfo.intro\\] *`collapse_debuginfo` [属"
"性](../attributes.md)*控制在为调用此宏的代码生成 debuginfo 时，来自宏定义的代"
"码位置是否折叠为与宏调用点关联的单一位置。"

#: src/attributes/debugger.md:184
