msgid "r\\[statement.attribute\\]"
msgstr "r\\[statement.attribute\\]"

#: src/statements.md:140
msgid "Attributes on statements"
msgstr "语句上的属性"

#: src/statements.md:142
msgid ""
"Statements accept [outer attributes](attributes.md). The attributes that "
"have meaning on a statement are [`cfg`](conditional-compilation.md), and "
"[the lint check attributes](attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes)."
msgstr ""
"语句接受[外部属性](attributes.md)。在语句上有意义的属性是 [`cfg`]"
"(conditional-compilation.md) 和 [lint 检查属性](attributes/"
"diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes)。"

#: src/expressions.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr\\]"

#: src/expressions.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions.md:48
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.intro\\] An expression may have two roles: it always produces a "
"_value_, and it may have _effects_ (otherwise known as \"side effects\")."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.intro\\] 表达式可以有两种作用：它总会产生一个 *值*，并且可以具有 *效"
"果*（也称为“副作用”）。"

#: src/expressions.md:51
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.evaluation\\] An expression _evaluates to_ a value, and has effects "
"during _evaluation_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.evaluation\\] 表达式会 *求值为* 一个值，并在 *求值* 期间产生效果。"

#: src/expressions.md:54
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.operands\\] Many expressions contain sub-expressions, called the "
"_operands_ of the expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.operands\\] 许多表达式包含子表达式，这些子表达式称为该表达式的 *操作"
"数*。"

#: src/expressions.md:57
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.behavior\\] The meaning of each kind of expression dictates several "
"things:"
msgstr "r\\[expr.behavior\\] 每种表达式的含义决定了若干事项："

#: src/expressions.md:60
msgid "Whether or not to evaluate the operands when evaluating the expression"
msgstr "在求值表达式时是否求值其操作数"

#: src/expressions.md:61
msgid "The order in which to evaluate the operands"
msgstr "求值操作数的顺序"

#: src/expressions.md:62
msgid ""
"How to combine the operands' values to obtain the value of the expression"
msgstr "如何组合操作数的值以获得表达式的值"

#: src/expressions.md:64
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.structure\\] In this way, the structure of expressions dictates the "
"structure of execution. Blocks are just another kind of expression, so "
"blocks, statements, expressions, and blocks again can recursively nest "
"inside each other to an arbitrary depth."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.structure\\] 以这种方式，表达式的结构决定了执行的结构。块只是另一种"
"表达式，因此块、语句、表达式以及再次出现的块可以递归地相互嵌套到任意深度。"

#: src/expressions.md:67
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] We give names to the operands of expressions so that we may "
"discuss them, but these names are not stable and may be changed."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 我们为表达式的操作数赋予名称，以便讨论它们，但这些名称并不稳定，"
"可能会改变。"

#: src/expressions.md:70
msgid "r\\[expr.precedence\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.precedence\\]"

#: src/expressions.md:71
msgid "Expression precedence"
msgstr "表达式优先级"

#: src/expressions.md:73
msgid ""
"The precedence of Rust operators and expressions is ordered as follows, "
"going from strong to weak. Binary Operators at the same precedence level are "
"grouped in the order given by their associativity."
msgstr ""
"Rust 运算符和表达式的优先级按如下顺序排列，从强到弱。同一优先级层级的二元运算"
"符按其结合性给出的顺序分组。"

#: src/expressions.md:75
msgid "Operator/Expression"
msgstr "运算符/表达式"

#: src/expressions.md:75
msgid "Associativity"
msgstr "结合性"

