#: src/expressions.md:196
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.move.intro\\] When a place expression is evaluated in a value "
"expression context, or is bound by value in a pattern, it denotes the value "
"held _in_ that memory location."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.move.intro\\] 当位置表达式在值表达式上下文中求值，或在模式中按值绑定"
"时，它表示该内存位置 *中* 保存的值。"

#: src/expressions.md:199
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.move.copy\\] If the type of that value implements [`Copy`](special-"
"types-and-traits.md#copy), then the value will be copied."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.move.copy\\] 如果该值的类型实现了 [`Copy`](special-types-and-"
"traits.md#copy)，则该值会被复制。"

#: src/expressions.md:202
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.move.requires-sized\\] In the remaining situations, if that type is "
"[`Sized`](special-types-and-traits.md#sized), then it may be possible to "
"move the value."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.move.requires-sized\\] 在其余情况下，如果该类型是 [`Sized`](special-"
"types-and-traits.md#sized)，则可能可以移动该值。"

#: src/expressions.md:205
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.move.movable-place\\] Only the following place expressions may be "
"moved out of:"
msgstr "r\\[expr.move.movable-place\\] 只有以下位置表达式可以被移出："

#: src/expressions.md:208
msgid "[Variables](variables.md) which are not currently borrowed."
msgstr "当前未被借用的[变量](variables.md)。"

#: src/expressions.md:209 src/expressions.md:230
msgid "[Temporary values](#temporaries)."
msgstr "[临时值](#temporaries)。"

#: src/expressions.md:210
msgid ""
"[Fields](expressions/field-expr.md) of a place expression which can be moved "
"out of and don't implement [`Drop`](special-types-and-traits.md#drop)."
msgstr ""
"可以被移出且未实现 [`Drop`](special-types-and-traits.md#drop) 的位置表达式的"
"[字段](expressions/field-expr.md)。"

#: src/expressions.md:211
msgid ""
"The result of [dereferencing](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-"
"operator) an expression with type [`Box<T>`](special-types-and-"
"traits.md#boxt) and that can also be moved out of."
msgstr ""
"对类型为 [`Box<T>`](special-types-and-traits.md#boxt) 且本身也可以被移出的表"
"达式进行[解引用](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator)所得的"
"结果。"

#: src/expressions.md:213
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.move.deinitialization\\] After moving out of a place expression "
"that evaluates to a local variable, the location is deinitialized and cannot "
"be read from again until it is reinitialized."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.move.deinitialization\\] 从求值为局部变量的位置表达式中移出后，该位"
"置会被反初始化，并且在重新初始化之前不能再次读取。"

#: src/expressions.md:216
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.move.place-invalid\\] In all other cases, trying to use a place "
"expression in a value expression context is an error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.move.place-invalid\\] 在所有其他情况下，尝试在值表达式上下文中使用位"
"置表达式都是错误。"

#: src/expressions.md:219
msgid "r\\[expr.mut\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.mut\\]"

#: src/expressions.md:220
msgid "Mutability"
msgstr "可变性"

#: src/expressions.md:222
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.mut.intro\\] For a place expression to be [assigned](expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#assignment-expressions) to, mutably [borrowed](expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#borrow-operators), [implicitly mutably borrowed](#implicit-"
"borrows), or bound to a pattern containing `ref mut`, it must be _mutable_. "
"We call these _mutable place expressions_. In contrast, other place "
"expressions are called _immutable place expressions_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.mut.intro\\] 若要对一个位置表达式进行[赋值](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#assignment-expressions)、进行可变[借用](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#borrow-operators)、进行[隐式可变借用](#implicit-borrows)，或将其绑定"
"到包含 `ref mut` 的模式，它必须是 *可变的*。我们称这些表达式为 *可变位置表达"
"式*。相对地，其他位置表达式称为 *不可变位置表达式*。"

#: src/expressions.md:225
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.mut.valid-places\\] The following expressions can be mutable place "
"expression contexts:"
msgstr "r\\[expr.mut.valid-places\\] 以下表达式可以是可变位置表达式上下文："

#: src/expressions.md:228
msgid "Mutable [variables](variables.md) which are not currently borrowed."
msgstr "当前未被借用的可变[变量](variables.md)。"

#: src/expressions.md:229
msgid "[Mutable `static` items](items/static-items.md#mutable-statics)."
msgstr "[可变 `static` 条目](items/static-items.md#mutable-statics)。"

#: src/expressions.md:231
msgid ""
"[Fields](expressions/field-expr.md): this evaluates the subexpression in a "
"mutable place expression context."
msgstr ""
"[字段](expressions/field-expr.md)：这会在可变位置表达式上下文中求值子表达式。"

#: src/expressions.md:232
msgid ""
"[Dereferences](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator) of a "
"`*mut T` pointer."
msgstr ""
"对 `*mut T` 指针的[解引用](expressions/operator-expr.md#the-dereference-"
"operator)。"

#: src/expressions.md:233
msgid ""
"Dereference of a variable, or field of a variable, with type `&mut T`. Note: "
"This is an exception to the requirement of the next rule."
msgstr ""
"对类型为 `&mut T` 的变量或变量字段的解引用。注意：这是下一条规则要求的例外。"

#: src/expressions.md:234
msgid ""
"Dereferences of a type that implements `DerefMut`: this then requires that "
"the value being dereferenced is evaluated in a mutable place expression "
"context."
msgstr ""
"对实现了 `DerefMut` 的类型进行解引用：这随后要求被解引用的值在可变位置表达式"
"上下文中求值。"

#: src/expressions.md:235
msgid ""
"[Array indexing](expressions/array-expr.md#array-and-slice-indexing-"
"expressions) of a type that implements `IndexMut`: this then evaluates the "
"value being indexed, but not the index, in mutable place expression context."
msgstr ""
"对实现了 `IndexMut` 的类型进行[数组索引](expressions/array-expr.md#array-and-"
"slice-indexing-expressions)：这随后会在可变位置表达式上下文中求值被索引的值，"
"但不会在该上下文中求值索引。"

#: src/expressions.md:237
msgid "r\\[expr.temporary\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.temporary\\]"

#: src/expressions.md:238
msgid "Temporaries"
msgstr "临时值"

#: src/expressions.md:240
msgid ""
"When using a value expression in most place expression contexts, a temporary "
"unnamed memory location is created and initialized to that value. The "
"expression evaluates to that location instead, except if [promoted]"
"(destructors.md#constant-promotion) to a `static`. The [drop scope]"
"(destructors.md#drop-scopes) of the temporary is usually the end of the "
"enclosing statement."
msgstr ""
"在大多数位置表达式上下文中使用值表达式时，会创建一个临时的未命名内存位置，并"
"用该值初始化它。该表达式随后会求值为这个位置，除非它被[提升]"
"(destructors.md#constant-promotion)为 `static`。该临时值的[drop 作用域]"
"(destructors.md#drop-scopes)通常是外围语句的末尾。"

#: src/expressions.md:242
msgid "r\\[expr.super-macros\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.super-macros\\]"

#: src/expressions.md:243
msgid "Super macros"
msgstr "super 宏"

#: src/expressions.md:245
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.super-macros.intro\\] Certain built-in macros may create "
"[temporaries](expr.temporary) whose [scopes](destructors.scope.temporary) "
"may be [extended](destructors.scope.lifetime-extension). These temporaries "
"are _super temporaries_ and these macros are _super macros_. [Invocations]"
"(macro.invocation) of these macros are _super macro call expressions_. "
"Arguments to these macros may be _super operands_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.super-macros.intro\\] 某些内置宏可以创建[临时值](expr.temporary)，其"
"[作用域](destructors.scope.temporary)可以被[延长](destructors.scope.lifetime-"
"extension)。这些临时值是 *super 临时值*，这些宏是 *super 宏*。这些宏的[调用]"
"(macro.invocation)是 *super 宏调用表达式*。这些宏的实参可以是 *super 操作数"
"*。"

#: src/expressions.md:248
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] When a super macro call expression is an [extending expression]"
"(destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs), its super operands are "
"[extending expressions](destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs) and the "
"[scopes](destructors.scope.temporary) of the super temporaries are [extended]"
"(destructors.scope.lifetime-extension). See \\[destructors.scope.lifetime-"
"extension.exprs\\]."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 当 super 宏调用表达式是[延长表达式](destructors.scope.lifetime-"
"extension.exprs)时，它的 super 操作数是[延长表达式]"
"(destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs)，并且 super 临时值的[作用域]"
"(destructors.scope.temporary)会被[延长](destructors.scope.lifetime-"
"extension)。见 \\[destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs\\]。"

#: src/expressions.md:251
msgid "r\\[expr.super-macros.format_args\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.super-macros.format_args\\]"

#: src/expressions.md:252
msgid "`format_args!`"
msgstr "`format_args!`"

#: src/expressions.md:254
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.super-macros.format_args.super-operands\\] Except for the format "
"string argument, all arguments passed to [`format_args!`](core::format_args) "
"are _super operands_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.super-macros.format_args.super-operands\\] 除格式字符串实参外，传给 "
"[`format_args!`](core::format_args) 的所有实参都是 *super 操作数*。"

