"r\\[expr.implicit-borrow-intro\\] Certain expressions will treat an "
"expression as a place expression by implicitly borrowing it. For example, it "
"is possible to compare two unsized [slices](types/slice.md) for equality "
"directly, because the `==` operator implicitly borrows its operands:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.implicit-borrow-intro\\] 某些表达式会通过隐式借用一个表达式而将其视"
"为位置表达式。例如，可以直接比较两个未定大小的[切片](types/slice.md)是否相"
"等，因为 `==` 运算符会隐式借用其操作数："

