"r\\[expr.literal.string-representation\\] In the descriptions below, the "
"_string representation_ of a token is the sequence of characters from the "
"input which matched the token's production in a _Lexer_ grammar snippet."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string-representation\\] 在下面的描述中，token 的*字符串表示"
"*是输入中与该 token 在 _Lexer_ 语法片段中的产生式相匹配的字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:39
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This string representation never includes a character `U+000D` "
"(CR) immediately followed by `U+000A` (LF): this pair would have been "
"previously transformed into a single `U+000A` (LF)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 这种字符串表示绝不会包含后面紧跟 `U+000A` (LF) 的 `U+000D` (CR) "
"字符：这一对字符此前已经被转换为单个 `U+000A` (LF)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:42
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.escape\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.escape\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:45
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.escape.intro\\] The descriptions of textual literal "
"expressions below make use of several forms of _escape_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.escape.intro\\] 下面对文本字面量表达式的描述使用了若干形式的"
"*转义*。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:48
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.escape.sequence\\] Each form of escape is characterised by:"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.escape.sequence\\] 每种转义形式都由以下内容刻画："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:50
msgid ""
"an _escape sequence_: a sequence of characters, which always begins with "
"`U+005C` (`\\`)"
msgstr "一个*转义序列*：一串字符，它总是以 `U+005C` (`\\`) 开头"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:51
msgid ""
"an _escaped value_: either a single character or an empty sequence of "
"characters"
msgstr "一个*转义后的值*：单个字符或一个空字符序列"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:53
msgid "In the definitions of escapes below:"
msgstr "在下面的转义定义中："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:54
msgid "An _octal digit_ is any of the characters in the range \\[`0`\\-`7`\\]."
msgstr "*八进制数字*是范围 \\[`0`\\-`7`\\] 内的任意字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:55
msgid ""
"A _hexadecimal digit_ is any of the characters in the ranges \\[`0`\\-"
"`9`\\], \\[`a`\\-`f`\\], or \\[`A`\\-`F`\\]."
msgstr ""
"*十六进制数字*是范围 \\[`0`\\-`9`\\]、\\[`a`\\-`f`\\] 或 \\[`A`\\-`F`\\] 内的"
"任意字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:57
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.escape.simple\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.escape.simple\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:58
msgid "Simple escapes"
msgstr "简单转义"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:60
msgid ""
"Each sequence of characters occurring in the first column of the following "
"table is an escape sequence."
msgstr "下表第一列中出现的每个字符序列都是一个转义序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:62
msgid ""
"In each case, the escaped value is the character given in the corresponding "
"entry in the second column."
msgstr "在每种情况下，转义后的值都是第二列对应条目给出的字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:64
msgid "Escape sequence"
msgstr "转义序列"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:64
msgid "Escaped value"
msgstr "转义后的值"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:66
msgid "U+0000 (NUL)"
msgstr "U+0000 (NUL)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:67
msgid "U+0009 (HT)"
msgstr "U+0009 (HT)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:68
msgid "U+000A (LF)"
msgstr "U+000A (LF)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:69
msgid "U+000D (CR)"
msgstr "U+000D (CR)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:70
msgid "U+0022 (QUOTATION MARK)"
msgstr "U+0022 (QUOTATION MARK)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:71
msgid "U+0027 (APOSTROPHE)"
msgstr "U+0027 (APOSTROPHE)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:72
msgid "U+005C (REVERSE SOLIDUS)"
msgstr "U+005C (REVERSE SOLIDUS)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:74
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.escape.hex-octet\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.escape.hex-octet\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:75
msgid "8-bit escapes"
msgstr "8 位转义"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:77
msgid ""
"The escape sequence consists of `\\x` followed by two hexadecimal digits."
msgstr "该转义序列由 `\\x` 后跟两个十六进制数字组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:79 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:89
msgid ""
"The escaped value is the character whose [Unicode scalar value](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) is the result of "
"interpreting the final two characters in the escape sequence as a "
"hexadecimal integer, as if by \\[`u8::from_str_radix`\\] with radix 16."
msgstr ""
"转义后的值是这样一个字符：它的 [Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/"
"glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)是将该转义序列中最后两个字符解释为十六进制整数"
"的结果，如同以基数 16 调用 \\[`u8::from_str_radix`\\] 一样。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:81
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The escaped value therefore has a [Unicode scalar value](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) in the range of [`u8`](../"
"types/numeric.md)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 因此，转义后的值具有位于 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md) 范围内的 "
"[Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:84
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.escape.hex-ascii\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.escape.hex-ascii\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:85
msgid "7-bit escapes"
msgstr "7 位转义"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:87
msgid ""
"The escape sequence consists of `\\x` followed by an octal digit then a "
"hexadecimal digit."
msgstr "该转义序列由 `\\x` 后跟一个八进制数字，再后跟一个十六进制数字组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:91
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.escape.unicode\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.escape.unicode\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:94
msgid ""
"The escape sequence consists of `\\u{`, followed by a sequence of characters "
"each of which is a hexadecimal digit or `_`, followed by `}`."
msgstr ""
"该转义序列由 `\\u{` 后跟一串字符，再后跟 `}` 组成；这串字符中的每个字符都是十"
"六进制数字或 `_`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:96
msgid ""
"The escaped value is the character whose [Unicode scalar value](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) is the result of "
"interpreting the hexadecimal digits contained in the escape sequence as a "
"hexadecimal integer, as if by \\[`u32::from_str_radix`\\] with radix 16."
msgstr ""
"转义后的值是这样一个字符：它的 [Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/"
"glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)是将该转义序列中包含的十六进制数字解释为十六进"
"制整数的结果，如同以基数 16 调用 \\[`u32::from_str_radix`\\] 一样。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:98
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The permitted forms of a \\[CHAR_LITERAL\\] or \\"
"[STRING_LITERAL\\] token ensure that there is such a character."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] \\[CHAR_LITERAL\\] 或 \\[STRING_LITERAL\\] token 的允许形式保证存"
"在这样的字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:101
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.continuation\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.continuation\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:102
msgid "String continuation escapes"
msgstr "字符串续行转义"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:104
msgid ""
"The escape sequence consists of `\\` followed immediately by `U+000A` (LF), "
"and all following whitespace characters before the next non-whitespace "
"character. For this purpose, the whitespace characters are `U+0009` (HT), "
"`U+000A` (LF), `U+000D` (CR), and `U+0020` (SPACE)."
msgstr ""
"该转义序列由 `\\` 后面立即跟随的 `U+000A` (LF)，以及在下一个非空白字符之前所"
"有随后出现的空白字符组成。就此而言，空白字符是 `U+0009` (HT)、`U+000A` (LF)、"
"`U+000D` (CR) 和 `U+0020` (SPACE)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:106
msgid "The escaped value is an empty sequence of characters."
msgstr "转义后的值是一个空字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:108
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The effect of this form of escape is that a string continuation "
"skips following whitespace, including additional newlines. Thus `a`, `b` and "
"`c` are equal:"
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 这种转义形式的效果是，字符串续行会跳过随后的空白，包括额外的换"
"行。因此，`a`、`b` 和 `c` 相等："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:112
msgid "\"foobar\""
msgstr "\"foobar\""

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:113 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:115
msgid "\"foo\\\n"
msgstr "\"foo\\\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:123
msgid ""
"Skipping additional newlines (as in example c) is potentially confusing and "
"unexpected. This behavior may be adjusted in the future. Until a decision is "
"made, it is recommended to avoid relying on skipping multiple newlines with "
"line continuations. See [this issue](https://github.com/rust-lang/reference/"
"pull/1042) for more information."
msgstr ""
"跳过额外的换行（如示例 c 中所示）可能令人困惑且出乎意料。这个行为将来可能会调"
"整。在作出决定之前，建议避免依赖通过续行跳过多个换行。更多信息见[此议题]"
"(https://github.com/rust-lang/reference/pull/1042)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:125
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.char\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.char\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:126
msgid "Character literal expressions"
msgstr "字符字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:128
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.intro\\] A character literal expression consists of a "
"single \\[CHAR_LITERAL\\] token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.intro\\] 字符字面量表达式由单个 \\[CHAR_LITERAL\\] "
"token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:131
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.type\\] The expression's type is the primitive [`char`]"
"(../types/char.md) type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.type\\] 该表达式的类型是基本类型 [`char`](../types/"
"char.md)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:134
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.char.no-suffix\\] The token must not have a suffix."
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.char.no-suffix\\] 该 token 不得带有后缀。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:137
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.literal-content\\] The token's _literal content_ is "
"the sequence of characters following the first `U+0027` (`'`) and preceding "
"the last `U+0027` (`'`) in the string representation of the token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.literal-content\\] 该 token 的*字面量内容*是其字符串表"
"示中第一个 `U+0027` (`'`) 之后、最后一个 `U+0027` (`'`) 之前的字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:140
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.represented\\] The literal expression's _represented "
"character_ is derived from the literal content as follows:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.represented\\] 字面量表达式*所表示的字符*按如下方式从字"
"面量内容派生："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:143
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.char.escape\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.char.escape\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:144 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:232
msgid ""
"If the literal content is one of the following forms of escape sequence, the "
"represented character is the escape sequence's escaped value:"
msgstr ""
"如果字面量内容是以下形式之一的转义序列，则所表示的字符是该转义序列的转义后的"
"值："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:145 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:187
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:233 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:274
msgid "[Simple escapes](#simple-escapes)"
msgstr "[简单转义](#simple-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:146 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:188
msgid "[7-bit escapes](#7-bit-escapes)"
msgstr "[7 位转义](#7-bit-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:147 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:189
msgid "[Unicode escapes](#unicode-escapes)"
msgstr "[Unicode 转义](#unicode-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:149
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.char.single\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.char.single\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:150 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:237
msgid ""
"Otherwise the represented character is the single character that makes up "
"the literal content."
msgstr "否则，所表示的字符就是组成该字面量内容的单个字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:152
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.result\\] The expression's value is the [`char`](../"
"types/char.md) corresponding to the represented character's [Unicode scalar "
"value](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.char.result\\] 该表达式的值是与所表示字符的 [Unicode 标量值]"
"(http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)相对应的 [`char`](../"
"types/char.md)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:155
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The permitted forms of a \\[CHAR_LITERAL\\] token ensure that "
"these rules always produce a single character."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] \\[CHAR_LITERAL\\] token 的允许形式保证这些规则总是产生单个字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:158
msgid "Examples of character literal expressions:"
msgstr "字符字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:161
msgid "'R'"
msgstr "'R'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:161
msgid ""
"// R\n"
"'\\''"
msgstr ""
"// R\n"
"'\\''"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:162
msgid ""
"// '\n"
"'\\x52'"
msgstr ""
"// '\n"
"'\\x52'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:163
msgid ""
"// R\n"
"'\\u{00E6}'"
msgstr ""
"// R\n"
"'\\u{00E6}'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:167
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.string\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.string\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:168
msgid "String literal expressions"
msgstr "字符串字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:170
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.intro\\] A string literal expression consists of a "
"single \\[STRING_LITERAL\\] or \\[RAW_STRING_LITERAL\\] token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.intro\\] 字符串字面量表达式由单个 \\"
"[STRING_LITERAL\\] 或 \\[RAW_STRING_LITERAL\\] token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:173
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.type\\] The expression's type is a shared reference "
"(with `static` lifetime) to the primitive [`str`](../types/str.md) type. "
"That is, the type is `&'static str`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.type\\] 该表达式的类型是指向基本类型 [`str`](../"
"types/str.md) 的共享引用（具有 `static` 生命周期）。也就是说，该类型是 "
"`&'static str`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:176
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.string.no-suffix\\] The token must not have a suffix."
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.string.no-suffix\\] 该 token 不得带有后缀。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:179
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.literal-content\\] The token's _literal content_ is "
"the sequence of characters following the first `U+0022` (`\"`) and preceding "
"the last `U+0022` (`\"`) in the string representation of the token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.literal-content\\] 该 token 的*字面量内容*是其字符串"
"表示中第一个 `U+0022` (`\"`) 之后、最后一个 `U+0022` (`\"`) 之前的字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:182
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.represented\\] The literal expression's _represented "
"string_ is a sequence of characters derived from the literal content as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.represented\\] 字面量表达式*所表示的字符串*是按如下方"
"式从字面量内容派生出的字符序列："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:185
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.string.escape\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.string.escape\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:186
msgid ""
"If the token is a \\[STRING_LITERAL\\], each escape sequence of any of the "
"following forms occurring in the literal content is replaced by the escape "
"sequence's escaped value."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 \\[STRING_LITERAL\\]，则字面量内容中出现的以下任一形式的每个"
"转义序列都会被替换为该转义序列的转义后的值。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:190 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:276
msgid "[String continuation escapes](#string-continuation-escapes)"
msgstr "[字符串续行转义](#string-continuation-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:192
msgid ""
"These replacements take place in left-to-right order. For example, the token "
"`\"\\\\x41\"` is converted to the characters `\\` `x` `4` `1`."
msgstr ""
"这些替换按从左到右的顺序进行。例如，token `\"\\\\x41\"` 会被转换为字符 `\\` "
"`x` `4` `1`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:194
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.string.raw\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.string.raw\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:195
msgid ""
"If the token is a \\[RAW_STRING_LITERAL\\], the represented string is "
"identical to the literal content."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 \\[RAW_STRING_LITERAL\\]，则所表示的字符串与字面量内容相同。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:197
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.result\\] The expression's value is a reference to a "
"statically allocated [`str`](../types/str.md) containing the UTF-8 encoding "
"of the represented string."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.string.result\\] 该表达式的值是对一个静态分配的 [`str`](../"
"types/str.md) 的引用，该 [`str`](../types/str.md) 包含所表示字符串的 UTF-8 编"
"码。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:200
msgid "Examples of string literal expressions:"
msgstr "字符串字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:213
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.byte-char\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.byte-char\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:214
msgid "Byte literal expressions"
msgstr "字节字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:216
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.intro\\] A byte literal expression consists of a "
"single \\[BYTE_LITERAL\\] token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.intro\\] 字节字面量表达式由单个 \\"
"[BYTE_LITERAL\\] token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:219
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.literal\\] The expression's type is the primitive "
"[`u8`](../types/numeric.md) type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.literal\\] 该表达式的类型是基本类型 [`u8`](../"
"types/numeric.md)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:222
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.no-suffix\\] The token must not have a suffix."
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.no-suffix\\] 该 token 不得带有后缀。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:225
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.literal-content\\] The token's _literal content_ "
"is the sequence of characters following the first `U+0027` (`'`) and "
"preceding the last `U+0027` (`'`) in the string representation of the token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.literal-content\\] 该 token 的*字面量内容*是其字符"
"串表示中第一个 `U+0027` (`'`) 之后、最后一个 `U+0027` (`'`) 之前的字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:228
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.represented\\] The literal expression's "
"_represented character_ is derived from the literal content as follows:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.represented\\] 字面量表达式*所表示的字符*按如下方"
"式从字面量内容派生："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:231
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.escape\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.escape\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:234 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:275
msgid "[8-bit escapes](#8-bit-escapes)"
msgstr "[8 位转义](#8-bit-escapes)"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:236
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.single\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.single\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:239
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.result\\] The expression's value is the "
"represented character's [Unicode scalar value](http://www.unicode.org/"
"glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-char.result\\] 该表达式的值是所表示字符的 [Unicode 标量"
"值](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:242
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The permitted forms of a \\[BYTE_LITERAL\\] token ensure that "
"these rules always produce a single character, whose Unicode scalar value is "
"in the range of [`u8`](../types/numeric.md)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] \\[BYTE_LITERAL\\] token 的允许形式保证这些规则总是产生单个字符，"
"且其 Unicode 标量值位于 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md) 的范围内。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:245
msgid "Examples of byte literal expressions:"
msgstr "字节字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:248
msgid "b'R'"
msgstr "b'R'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:248
msgid ""
"// 82\n"
"b'\\''"
msgstr ""
"// 82\n"
"b'\\''"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:249
msgid ""
"// 39\n"
"b'\\x52'"
msgstr ""
"// 39\n"
"b'\\x52'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:250
msgid ""
"// 82\n"
"b'\\xA0'"
msgstr ""
"// 82\n"
"b'\\xA0'"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:251
msgid "// 160\n"
msgstr "// 160\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:254
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.byte-string\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.byte-string\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:255
msgid "Byte string literal expressions"
msgstr "字节字符串字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:257
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.intro\\] A byte string literal expression "
"consists of a single \\[BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\] or \\"
"[RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\] token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.intro\\] 字节字符串字面量表达式由单个 \\"
"[BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\] 或 \\[RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\] token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:260
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.type\\] The expression's type is a shared "
"reference (with `static` lifetime) to an array whose element type is [`u8`]"
"(../types/numeric.md). That is, the type is `&'static [u8; N]`, where `N` is "
"the number of bytes in the represented string described below."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.type\\] 该表达式的类型是指向某个数组的共享引用"
"（具有 `static` 生命周期），该数组的元素类型为 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md)。"
"也就是说，该类型是 `&'static [u8; N]`，其中 `N` 是下面描述的所表示字符串中的"
"字节数。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:263
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.no-suffix\\] The token must not have a suffix."
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.no-suffix\\] 该 token 不得带有后缀。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:266
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.literal-content\\] The token's _literal "
"content_ is the sequence of characters following the first `U+0022` (`\"`) "
"and preceding the last `U+0022` (`\"`) in the string representation of the "
"token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.literal-content\\] 该 token 的*字面量内容*是其字"
"符串表示中第一个 `U+0022` (`\"`) 之后、最后一个 `U+0022` (`\"`) 之前的字符序"
"列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:269
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.represented\\] The literal expression's "
"_represented string_ is a sequence of characters derived from the literal "
"content as follows:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.represented\\] 字面量表达式*所表示的字符串*是按"
"如下方式从字面量内容派生出的字符序列："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:272
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.escape\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.escape\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:273
msgid ""
"If the token is a \\[BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\], each escape sequence of any of "
"the following forms occurring in the literal content is replaced by the "
"escape sequence's escaped value."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 \\[BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\]，则字面量内容中出现的以下任一形式的"
"每个转义序列都会被替换为该转义序列的转义后的值。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:278
msgid ""
"These replacements take place in left-to-right order. For example, the token "
"`b\"\\\\x41\"` is converted to the characters `\\` `x` `4` `1`."
msgstr ""
"这些替换按从左到右的顺序进行。例如，token `b\"\\\\x41\"` 会被转换为字符 `\\` "
"`x` `4` `1`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:280
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.raw\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.raw\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:281
msgid ""
"If the token is a \\[RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\], the represented string is "
"identical to the literal content."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 \\[RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\]，则所表示的字符串与字面量内容相"
"同。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:283
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.result\\] The expression's value is a reference "
"to a statically allocated array containing the [Unicode scalar values]"
"(http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) of the characters in "
"the represented string, in the same order."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.byte-string.result\\] 该表达式的值是对一个静态分配数组的引"
"用，该数组按相同顺序包含所表示字符串中各字符的 [Unicode 标量值](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:286
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The permitted forms of \\[BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\] and \\"
"[RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\] tokens ensure that these rules always produce "
"array element values in the range of [`u8`](../types/numeric.md)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] \\[BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\] 和 \\[RAW_BYTE_STRING_LITERAL\\] token "
"的允许形式保证这些规则总是产生位于 [`u8`](../types/numeric.md) 范围内的数组元"
"素值。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:289
msgid "Examples of byte string literal expressions:"
msgstr "字节字符串字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:302
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.c-string\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.c-string\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:303
msgid "C string literal expressions"
msgstr "C 字符串字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:305
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.intro\\] A C string literal expression consists of "
"a single \\[C_STRING_LITERAL\\] or \\[RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL\\] token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.intro\\] C 字符串字面量表达式由单个 \\"
"[C_STRING_LITERAL\\] 或 \\[RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL\\] token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:308
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.type\\] The expression's type is a shared "
"reference (with `static` lifetime) to the standard library [CStr]"
"(core::ffi::CStr) type. That is, the type is `&'static core::ffi::CStr`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.type\\] 该表达式的类型是指向标准库 [CStr]"
"(core::ffi::CStr) 类型的共享引用（具有 `static` 生命周期）。也就是说，该类型"
"是 `&'static core::ffi::CStr`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:311
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.no-suffix\\] The token must not have a suffix."
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.c-string.no-suffix\\] 该 token 不得带有后缀。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:314
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.literal-content\\] The token's _literal content_ "
"is the sequence of characters following the first `\"` and preceding the "
"last `\"` in the string representation of the token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.literal-content\\] 该 token 的*字面量内容*是其字符"
"串表示中第一个 `\"` 之后、最后一个 `\"` 之前的字符序列。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:317
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.represented\\] The literal expression's "
"_represented bytes_ are a sequence of bytes derived from the literal content "
"as follows:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.represented\\] 字面量表达式*所表示的字节*是按如下方"
"式从字面量内容派生出的字节序列："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:320
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.c-string.escape\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.c-string.escape\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:321
msgid ""
"If the token is a \\[C_STRING_LITERAL\\], the literal content is treated as "
"a sequence of items, each of which is either a single Unicode character "
"other than `\\` or an [escape](#escapes). The sequence of items is converted "
"to a sequence of bytes as follows:"
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 \\[C_STRING_LITERAL\\]，则字面量内容会被视为一串项，其中每一"
"项要么是除 `\\` 以外的单个 Unicode 字符，要么是一个[转义](#escapes)。这串项按"
"如下方式转换为字节序列："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:322
msgid "Each single Unicode character contributes its UTF-8 representation."
msgstr "每个单独的 Unicode 字符贡献其 UTF-8 表示。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:323
msgid ""
"Each [simple escape](#simple-escapes) contributes the [Unicode scalar value]"
"(http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value) of its escaped value."
msgstr ""
"每个[简单转义](#simple-escapes)贡献其转义后的值的 [Unicode 标量值](http://"
"www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:324
msgid ""
"Each [8-bit escape](#8-bit-escapes) contributes a single byte containing the "
"[Unicode scalar value](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/"
"#unicode_scalar_value) of its escaped value."
msgstr ""
"每个 [8 位转义](#8-bit-escapes)贡献一个字节，该字节包含其转义后的值的 "
"[Unicode 标量值](http://www.unicode.org/glossary/#unicode_scalar_value)。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:325
msgid ""
"Each [unicode escape](#unicode-escapes) contributes the UTF-8 representation "
"of its escaped value."
msgstr "每个 [unicode 转义](#unicode-escapes)贡献其转义后的值的 UTF-8 表示。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:326
msgid ""
"Each [string continuation escape](#string-continuation-escapes) contributes "
"no bytes."
msgstr "每个[字符串续行转义](#string-continuation-escapes)不贡献任何字节。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:328
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.c-string.raw\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.c-string.raw\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:329
msgid ""
"If the token is a \\[RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL\\], the represented bytes are the "
"UTF-8 encoding of the literal content."
msgstr ""
"如果该 token 是 \\[RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL\\]，则所表示的字节是字面量内容的 "
"UTF-8 编码。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:331
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The permitted forms of \\[C_STRING_LITERAL\\] and \\"
"[RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL\\] tokens ensure that the represented bytes never "
"include a null byte."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] \\[C_STRING_LITERAL\\] 和 \\[RAW_C_STRING_LITERAL\\] token 的允许"
"形式保证所表示的字节绝不会包含空字节。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:334
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.result\\] The expression's value is a reference to "
"a statically allocated [CStr](core::ffi::CStr) whose array of bytes contains "
"the represented bytes followed by a null byte."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.c-string.result\\] 该表达式的值是对一个静态分配的 [CStr]"
"(core::ffi::CStr) 的引用，其字节数组包含所表示的字节，并在其后跟有一个空字"
"节。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:337
msgid "Examples of C string literal expressions:"
msgstr "C 字符串字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:353
msgid "\"\\xE6\""
msgstr "\"\\xE6\""

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:353
msgid "// [230]\n"
msgstr "// [230]\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:354
msgid "// [195, 166]\n"
msgstr "// [195, 166]\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:357
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:358
msgid "Integer literal expressions"
msgstr "整数字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:360
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.int.intro\\] An integer literal expression consists of a "
"single \\[INTEGER_LITERAL\\] token."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.int.intro\\] 整数字面量表达式由单个 \\[INTEGER_LITERAL\\] "
"token 组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:363
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.int.suffix\\] If the token has a [suffix](../"
"tokens.md#suffixes), the suffix must be the name of one of the [primitive "
"integer types](../types/numeric.md): `u8`, `i8`, `u16`, `i16`, `u32`, `i32`, "
"`u64`, `i64`, `u128`, `i128`, `usize`, or `isize`, and the expression has "
"that type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.int.suffix\\] 如果该 token 带有[后缀](../"
"tokens.md#suffixes)，则后缀必须是某个[基本整数类型](../types/numeric.md)的名"
"称：`u8`、`i8`、`u16`、`i16`、`u32`、`i32`、`u64`、`i64`、`u128`、`i128`、"
"`usize` 或 `isize`，且该表达式具有该类型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:366
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.int.infer\\] If the token has no suffix, the expression's "
"type is determined by type inference:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.int.infer\\] 如果该 token 没有后缀，则表达式的类型由类型推断"
"决定："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:369
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.inference-unique-type\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.inference-unique-type\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:370
msgid ""
"If an integer type can be _uniquely_ determined from the surrounding program "
"context, the expression has that type."
msgstr "如果可以从周围程序上下文*唯一*确定一个整数类型，则该表达式具有该类型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:372
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.inference-default\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.inference-default\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:373
msgid ""
"If the program context under-constrains the type, it defaults to the signed "
"32-bit integer `i32`."
msgstr "如果程序上下文对该类型的约束不足，则默认使用有符号 32 位整数 `i32`。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:375
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.inference-error\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.inference-error\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:376 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:452
msgid ""
"If the program context over-constrains the type, it is considered a static "
"type error."
msgstr "如果程序上下文对该类型约束过度，则视为静态类型错误。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:378
msgid "Examples of integer literal expressions:"
msgstr "整数字面量表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:381 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:382
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:387 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:390
#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:393
msgid "// type i32\n"
msgstr "// type i32\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:383 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:384
msgid "// type u32\n"
msgstr "// type u32\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:385
msgid "// type u64\n"
msgstr "// type u64\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:388
msgid "// type u8\n"
msgstr "// type u8\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:391
msgid "// type i16\n"
msgstr "// type i16\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:394
msgid "// type i64\n"
msgstr "// type i64\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:396
msgid "// type usize\n"
msgstr "// type usize\n"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:399
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.int.representation\\] The value of the expression is "
"determined from the string representation of the token as follows:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.int.representation\\] 该表达式的值按如下方式从该 token 的字"
"符串表示确定："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:402
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.radix\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.radix\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:403
msgid ""
"An integer radix is chosen by inspecting the first two characters of the "
"string, as follows:"
msgstr "通过检查该字符串的前两个字符来选择整数基数，如下所示："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:405
msgid "`0b` indicates radix 2"
msgstr "`0b` 表示基数 2"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:406
msgid "`0o` indicates radix 8"
msgstr "`0o` 表示基数 8"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:407
msgid "`0x` indicates radix 16"
msgstr "`0x` 表示基数 16"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:408
msgid "otherwise the radix is 10."
msgstr "否则基数为 10。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:410
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.radix-prefix-stripped\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.radix-prefix-stripped\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:411
msgid ""
"If the radix is not 10, the first two characters are removed from the string."
msgstr "如果基数不是 10，则从该字符串中移除前两个字符。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:413
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.type-suffix-stripped\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.type-suffix-stripped\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:414 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:469
msgid "Any suffix is removed from the string."
msgstr "从该字符串中移除任何后缀。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:416
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.separators-stripped\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.separators-stripped\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:417 src/expressions/literal-expr.md:472
msgid "Any underscores are removed from the string."
msgstr "从该字符串中移除任何下划线。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:419
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.u128-value\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.u128-value\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:420
msgid ""
"The string is converted to a `u128` value as if by \\"
"[`u128::from_str_radix`\\] with the chosen radix. If the value does not fit "
"in `u128`, it is a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"该字符串会按所选择的基数转换为一个 `u128` 值，如同调用 \\"
"[`u128::from_str_radix`\\] 一样。如果该值无法放入 `u128`，则为编译器错误。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:422
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.int.cast\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.int.cast\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:423
msgid ""
"The `u128` value is converted to the expression's type via a [numeric cast]"
"(operator-expr.md#numeric-cast)."
msgstr ""
"该 `u128` 值通过[数值转换](operator-expr.md#numeric-cast)转换为表达式的类型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:425
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The final cast will truncate the value of the literal if it does "
"not fit in the expression's type. `rustc` includes a [lint check](../"
"attributes/diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes) named "
"`overflowing_literals`, defaulting to `deny`, which rejects expressions "
"where this occurs."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 如果字面量的值无法放入表达式的类型，最终转换会截断该值。`rustc` "
"包含一个名为 `overflowing_literals` 的 [lint 检查](../attributes/"
"diagnostics.md#lint-check-attributes)，其默认级别为 `deny`，会拒绝发生这种情"
"况的表达式。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:428
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `-1i8`, for example, is an application of the [negation operator]"
"(operator-expr.md#negation-operators) to the literal expression `1i8`, not a "
"single integer literal expression. See [Overflow](operator-expr.md#overflow) "
"for notes on representing the most negative value for a signed type."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 例如，`-1i8` 是将[取负运算符](operator-expr.md#negation-"
"operators)应用于字面量表达式 `1i8`，而不是单个整数字面量表达式。关于如何表示"
"有符号类型的最小负值，见[溢出](operator-expr.md#overflow)中的说明。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:431
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.float\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.float\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:432
msgid "Floating-point literal expressions"
msgstr "浮点字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:434
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.float.intro\\] A floating-point literal expression has one "
"of two forms:"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.float.intro\\] 浮点字面量表达式具有以下两种形式之一："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:436
msgid "a single \\[FLOAT_LITERAL\\] token"
msgstr "单个 \\[FLOAT_LITERAL\\] token"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:437
msgid ""
"a single \\[INTEGER_LITERAL\\] token which has a suffix and no radix "
"indicator"
msgstr "单个 \\[INTEGER_LITERAL\\] token，它带有后缀且没有进制指示符"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:439
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.float.suffix\\] If the token has a [suffix](../"
"tokens.md#suffixes), the suffix must be the name of one of the [primitive "
"floating-point types](../types/numeric.md#floating-point-types): `f32` or "
"`f64`, and the expression has that type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.float.suffix\\] 如果该 token 带有[后缀](../"
"tokens.md#suffixes)，则后缀必须是某个[基本浮点数类型](../types/"
"numeric.md#floating-point-types)的名称：`f32` 或 `f64`，且该表达式具有该类"
"型。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:442
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.float.infer\\] If the token has no suffix, the expression's "
"type is determined by type inference:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.float.infer\\] 如果该 token 没有后缀，则表达式的类型由类型推"
"断决定："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:445
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.float.inference-unique-type\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.float.inference-unique-type\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:446
msgid ""
