"r\\[expr.literal.float.result\\] The value of the expression is determined "
"from the string representation of the token as follows:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.float.result\\] 该表达式的值按如下方式从该 token 的字符串表"
"示确定："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:468
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.float.type-suffix-stripped\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.float.type-suffix-stripped\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:471
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.float.separators-stripped\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.float.separators-stripped\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:474
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.float.value\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.float.value\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:475
msgid ""
"The string is converted to the expression's type as if by [`f32::from_str`]"
"(../../core/primitive.f32.md#method.from_str) or [`f64::from_str`](../../"
"core/primitive.f64.md#method.from_str)."
msgstr ""
"该字符串会转换为表达式的类型，如同调用 [`f32::from_str`](../../core/"
"primitive.f32.md#method.from_str) 或 [`f64::from_str`](../../core/"
"primitive.f64.md#method.from_str) 一样。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:477
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `-1.0`, for example, is an application of the [negation operator]"
"(operator-expr.md#negation-operators) to the literal expression `1.0`, not a "
"single floating-point literal expression."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 例如，`-1.0` 是将[取负运算符](operator-expr.md#negation-"
"operators)应用于字面量表达式 `1.0`，而不是单个浮点字面量表达式。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:480
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `inf` and `NaN` are not literal tokens. The \\"
"[`f32::INFINITY`\\], \\[`f64::INFINITY`\\], \\[`f32::NAN`\\], and \\"
"[`f64::NAN`\\] constants can be used instead of literal expressions. In "
"`rustc`, a literal large enough to be evaluated as infinite will trigger the "
"`overflowing_literals` lint check."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `inf` 和 `NaN` 不是字面量 token。可以使用 \\[`f32::INFINITY`\\]、"
"\\[`f64::INFINITY`\\]、\\[`f32::NAN`\\] 和 \\[`f64::NAN`\\] 常量来代替字面量"
"表达式。在 `rustc` 中，大到足以被求值为无穷大的字面量会触发 "
"`overflowing_literals` lint 检查。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:483
msgid "r\\[expr.literal.bool\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.literal.bool\\]"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:484
msgid "Boolean literal expressions"
msgstr "布尔字面量表达式"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:486
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.bool.intro\\] A boolean literal expression consists of one "
"of the keywords `true` or `false`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.bool.intro\\] 布尔字面量表达式由关键字 `true` 或 `false` 之"
"一组成。"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:489
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.literal.bool.result\\] The expression's type is the primitive "
"[boolean type](../types/boolean.md), and its value is:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.literal.bool.result\\] 该表达式的类型是基本[布尔类型](../types/"
"boolean.md)，其值为："

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:491
msgid "true if the keyword is `true`"
msgstr "如果关键字是 `true`，则为 true"

#: src/expressions/literal-expr.md:492
msgid "false if the keyword is `false`"
msgstr "如果关键字是 `false`，则为 false"

#: src/expressions/path-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.path\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.path\\]"

#: src/expressions/path-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.path.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.path.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/path-expr.md:11
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.path.intro\\] A [path](../paths.md) used as an expression context "
"denotes either a local variable or an item."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.path.intro\\] 在表达式上下文中使用的[路径](../paths.md)表示局部变量"
"或项。"

#: src/expressions/path-expr.md:14
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.path.place\\] Path expressions that resolve to local or static "
"variables are [place expressions](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-"
"value-expressions); other paths are [value expressions](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.path.place\\] 解析为局部变量或静态变量的路径表达式是[位置表达式](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)；其他路径是[值表达式]"
"(../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)。"

#: src/expressions/path-expr.md:17
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.path.safety\\] Using a [`static mut`](../items/static-"
"items.md#mutable-statics) variable requires an [`unsafe` block](block-"
"expr.md#unsafe-blocks)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.path.safety\\] 使用 [`static mut`](../items/static-items.md#mutable-"
"statics) 变量需要 [`unsafe` 块](block-expr.md#unsafe-blocks)。"

#: src/expressions/path-expr.md:34
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.path.const\\] Evaluation of associated constants is handled the "
"same way as [`const` blocks](block-expr.md#const-blocks)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.path.const\\] 关联常量的求值以与 [`const` 块](block-expr.md#const-"
"blocks)相同的方式处理。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.block\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.block.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:23
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.intro\\] A _block expression_, or _block_, is a control flow "
"expression and anonymous namespace scope for items and variable declarations."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.intro\\] *块表达式*（或*块*）是一种控制流表达式，也是项和变量"
"声明的匿名命名空间作用域。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:26
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.sequential-evaluation\\] As a control flow expression, a "
"block sequentially executes its component non-item declaration statements "
"and then its final optional expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.sequential-evaluation\\] 作为控制流表达式，块会顺序执行其组成"
"的非项声明语句，然后执行其可选的最终表达式。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:29
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.namespace\\] As an anonymous namespace scope, item "
"declarations are only in scope inside the block itself and variables "
"declared by `let` statements are in scope from the next statement until the "
"end of the block. See the [scopes](../names/scopes.md) chapter for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.namespace\\] 作为匿名命名空间作用域，项声明只在块本身内部处于"
"作用域内，而 `let` 语句声明的变量从下一条语句开始直到块结束都处于作用域内。更"
"多细节请参见[作用域](../names/scopes.md)章节。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:32
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.inner-attributes\\] The syntax for a block is `{`, then any "
"[inner attributes](../attributes.md), then any number of [statements](../"
"statements.md), then an optional expression, called the final operand, and "
"finally a `}`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.inner-attributes\\] 块的语法是 `{`，随后是任意[内部属性](../"
"attributes.md)，随后是任意数量的[语句](../statements.md)，随后是一个称为最终"
"操作数的可选表达式，最后是 `}`。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:35
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.statements\\] Statements are usually required to be followed "
"by a semicolon, with two exceptions:"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.statements\\] 语句通常必须后跟分号，但有两个例外："

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:38
msgid "Item declaration statements do not need to be followed by a semicolon."
msgstr "项声明语句不需要后跟分号。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:39
msgid ""
"Expression statements usually require a following semicolon except if its "
"outer expression is a flow control expression."
msgstr "表达式语句通常需要后跟分号，但如果它的外层表达式是控制流表达式则例外。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:41
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.null-statement\\] Furthermore, extra semicolons between "
"statements are allowed, but these semicolons do not affect semantics."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.null-statement\\] 此外，语句之间允许出现额外的分号，但这些分号"
"不影响语义。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:44
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.evaluation\\] When evaluating a block expression, each "
"statement, except for item declaration statements, is executed sequentially."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.evaluation\\] 求值块表达式时，除项声明语句外，每条语句都会按顺"
"序执行。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:47
msgid "r\\[expr.block.result\\] Then the final operand is executed, if given."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.result\\] 然后，如果给出了最终操作数，则执行该最终操作数。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:50
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.value-trailing-expr\\] When a block contains a [final operand]"
"(expr.block.inner-attributes), the block has the type and value of that "
"final operand."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.value-trailing-expr\\] 当块包含[最终操作数](expr.block.inner-"
"attributes)时，该块具有该最终操作数的类型和值。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:54
msgid "// `0u8` is the final operand.\n"
msgstr "// `0u8` 是最终操作数。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:60
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.value-no-trailing-expr\\] When a block does not contain a "
"[final operand](expr.block.inner-attributes) and the block does not diverge, "
"the block has [unit type](type.tuple.unit) and [unit value](type.tuple.unit)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.value-no-trailing-expr\\] 当块不包含[最终操作数]"
"(expr.block.inner-attributes)且该块不发散时，该块具有[单元类型]"
"(type.tuple.unit)和[单元值](type.tuple.unit)。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:64
msgid "// Has no final operand.\n"
msgstr "// 没有最终操作数。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:70
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.value-diverges-no-trailing-expr\\] When a block does not "
"contain a [final operand](expr.block.inner-attributes) and the block "
"[diverges](expr.block.diverging), the block has the [never type](type.never) "
"and has no final value (because its type is [uninhabited]"
"(glossary.uninhabited))."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.value-diverges-no-trailing-expr\\] 当块不包含[最终操作数]"
"(expr.block.inner-attributes)且该块[发散](expr.block.diverging)时，该块具有"
"[never 类型](type.never)，并且没有最终值（因为其类型是[无值]"
"(glossary.uninhabited)的）。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:74
msgid ""
"// Diverges and has no final operand.\n"
"//          ^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"// The body of a function is a block expression.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 发散且没有最终操作数。\n"
"//          ^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"// 函数体是一个块表达式。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:79
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Observe that a block having no final operand is distinct from "
"having an explicit final operand with unit type.  E.g., even though this "
"block diverges, the type of the block is [unit](type.tuple.unit) rather than "
"[never](type.never)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 注意，没有最终操作数的块不同于具有单元类型的显式最终操作数的块。"
"例如，即使此块发散，该块的类型也是[单元](type.tuple.unit)，而不是 [never]"
"(type.never)。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:83 src/expressions/block-expr.md:145
msgid "// ERROR: Mismatched types.\n"
msgstr "// 错误：类型不匹配。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:84
msgid "//          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ This block has unit type.\n"
msgstr "//          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ 这个块具有单元类型。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:87
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] As a control flow expression, if a block expression is the outer "
"expression of an expression statement, the expected type is `()` unless it "
"is followed immediately by a semicolon."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 作为控制流表达式，如果块表达式是表达式语句的外层表达式，则预期类"
"型是 `()`，除非它后面紧跟分号。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:90
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.diverging\\] A block is considered to be \\[diverging\\]\\"
"[divergence\\] if all reachable control flow paths contain a diverging "
"expression, unless that expression is a [place expression](expr.place-"
"value.place-memory-location) that is not read from."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.diverging\\] 如果所有可达控制流路径都包含一个发散表达式，则块"
"被认为是\\[发散的\\]\\[divergence\\]，除非该表达式是一个未被读取的[位置表达"
"式](expr.place-value.place-memory-location)。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:96
msgid ""
"// There are no conditional statements, so this entire function body is "
"diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 没有条件语句，因此整个函数体是发散的。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:101
msgid ""
"// All paths are diverging, so this entire function body is diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 所有路径都是发散的，因此整个函数体是发散的。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:110
msgid ""
"// Some paths are not diverging, so this entire block is not diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 某些路径不是发散的，因此整个块不是发散的。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:117
msgid ""
"// Note: This makes use of the unstable never type which is only available "
"on\n"
"// Rust's nightly channel. This is done for illustration purposes. It is\n"
"// possible to encounter this scenario in stable Rust, but requires a more\n"
"// convoluted example.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 注意：这里使用了不稳定的 never 类型，它仅在\n"
"// Rust 的 nightly 通道上可用。这样做是为了说明用途。在稳定版 Rust 中\n"
"// 也可能遇到这种场景，但需要一个更\n"
"// 复杂的示例。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:130
msgid "// A read of a place expression produces a diverging block.\n"
msgstr "// 读取位置表达式会产生一个发散块。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:143
msgid "// Assignment to `_` means the place is not read.\n"
msgstr "// 赋值给 `_` 意味着不会读取该位置。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:148
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.value\\] Blocks are always [value expressions](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions) and evaluate the "
"last operand in value expression context."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.value\\] 块始终是[值表达式](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions)，并在值表达式上下文中求值最后一个操作数。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:151
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This can be used to force moving a value if really needed. For "
"example, the following example fails on the call to `consume_self` because "
"the struct was moved out of `s` in the block expression."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 如果确实需要，这可以用来强制移动一个值。例如，下面的示例在调用 "
"`consume_self` 时失败，因为结构体已在块表达式中从 `s` 移出。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:165
msgid "// Move the value out of `s` in the block expression.\n"
msgstr "// 在块表达式中将值从 `s` 中移出。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:168
msgid "// Fails to execute because `s` is moved out of.\n"
msgstr "// 无法执行，因为值已从 `s` 中移出。\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:173
msgid "r\\[expr.block.async\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.async\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:174
msgid "`async` blocks"
msgstr "`async` 块"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:176
msgid "r\\[expr.block.async.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.async.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:181
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.intro\\] An _async block_ is a variant of a block "
"expression which evaluates to a future."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.intro\\] *async 块*是块表达式的一种变体，它求值为一个 "
"future。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:184
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.future-result\\] The final expression of the block, if "
"present, determines the result value of the future."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.future-result\\] 块的最终表达式（如果存在）决定该 "
"future 的结果值。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:187
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.anonymous-type\\] Executing an async block is similar "
"to executing a closure expression: its immediate effect is to produce and "
"return an anonymous type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.anonymous-type\\] 执行 async 块类似于执行闭包表达式：它"
"的即时效果是产生并返回一个匿名类型。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:190
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.future\\] Whereas closures return a type that "
"implements one or more of the \\[`std::ops::Fn`\\] traits, however, the type "
"returned for an async block implements the \\[`std::future::Future`\\] trait."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.future\\] 不过，闭包返回的类型会实现一个或多个 \\"
"[`std::ops::Fn`\\] trait，而 async 块返回的类型实现 \\"
"[`std::future::Future`\\] trait。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:193
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.layout-unspecified\\] The actual data format for this "
"type is unspecified."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.layout-unspecified\\] 此类型的实际数据格式是未指定的。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:196
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The future type that rustc generates is roughly equivalent to an "
"enum with one variant per `await` point, where each variant stores the data "
"needed to resume from its corresponding point."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] rustc 生成的 future 类型大致等价于一个 enum，其中每个 `await` 点"
"对应一个变体，每个变体都存储从相应点恢复所需的数据。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:199
msgid "r\\[expr.block.async.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.async.edition2018\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:200
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] Async blocks are only available beginning with Rust 2018."
msgstr "\\[!EDITION-2018\\] async 块仅从 Rust 2018 开始可用。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:203
msgid "r\\[expr.block.async.capture\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.async.capture\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:204 src/types/closure.md:59
msgid "Capture modes"
msgstr "捕获模式"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:206
msgid ""
"Async blocks capture variables from their environment using the same "
"[capture modes](../types/closure.md#capture-modes) as closures. Like "
"closures, when written `async { .. }` the capture mode for each variable "
"will be inferred from the content of the block. `async move { .. }` blocks "
"however will move all referenced variables into the resulting future."
msgstr ""
"`async` 块使用与闭包相同的[捕获模式](../types/closure.md#capture-modes)从其环"
"境中捕获变量。与闭包一样，写作 `async { .. }` 时，每个变量的捕获模式将从块的"
"内容推断。不过，`async move { .. }` 块会把所有被引用的变量移动到生成的 "
"future 中。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:208
msgid "r\\[expr.block.async.context\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.async.context\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:209
msgid "Async context"
msgstr "async 上下文"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:211
msgid ""
"Because async blocks construct a future, they define an **async context** "
"which can in turn contain [`await` expressions](await-expr.md). Async "
"contexts are established by async blocks as well as the bodies of async "
"functions, whose semantics are defined in terms of async blocks."
msgstr ""
"由于 `async` 块构造一个 future，它们定义了一个 **async 上下文**，该上下文又可"
"以包含 [`await` 表达式](await-expr.md)。async 上下文由 `async` 块以及 "
"`async` 函数的主体建立；`async` 函数主体的语义是以 `async` 块来定义的。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:213
msgid "r\\[expr.block.async.function\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.async.function\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:214
msgid "Control-flow operators"
msgstr "控制流运算符"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:216
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.function.intro\\] Async blocks act like a function "
"boundary, much like closures."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.function.intro\\] async 块的行为类似于函数边界，很像闭"
"包。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:219
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.function.return-try\\] Therefore, the `?` operator and "
"`return` expressions both affect the output of the future, not the enclosing "
"function or other context. That is, `return <expr>` from within an async "
"block will return the result of `<expr>` as the output of the future. "
"Similarly, if `<expr>?` propagates an error, that error is propagated as the "
"result of the future."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.function.return-try\\] 因此，`?` 运算符和 `return` 表达"
"式都会影响 future 的输出，而不是外围函数或其他上下文。也就是说，在 async 块内"
"部的 `return <expr>` 会把 `<expr>` 的结果作为 future 的输出返回。类似地，如"
"果 `<expr>?` 传播错误，该错误会作为 future 的结果被传播。"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:222
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.function.control-flow\\] Finally, the `break` and "
"`continue` keywords cannot be used to branch out from an async block. "
"Therefore the following is illegal:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.block.async.function.control-flow\\] 最后，`break` 和 `continue` 关"
"键字不能用于从 async 块中跳出。因此，以下写法是非法的："

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:228
msgid "// error[E0267]: `break` inside of an `async` block\n"
msgstr "// error[E0267]: `async` 块内的 `break`\n"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:233
msgid "r\\[expr.block.const\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.block.const\\]"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:234
msgid "`const` blocks"
msgstr "`const` 块"

#: src/expressions/block-expr.md:236
