#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:166
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.deref.result\\] When applied to a [pointer](../types/pointer.md) or "
"[`Box`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt), it denotes the pointed-to "
"location."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.deref.result\\] 当应用于[指针](../types/pointer.md)或 [`Box`](../"
"special-types-and-traits.md#boxt) 时，它表示被指向的位置。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:169
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.deref.mut\\] If the expression is of type `&mut T`, `*mut T`, or "
"`Box<T>`, and is either a local variable, a (nested) field of a local "
"variable or is a mutable [place expression](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions), then the resulting memory location can "
"be assigned to."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.deref.mut\\] 如果表达式的类型为 `&mut T`、`*mut T` 或 `Box<T>`，并且"
"它是局部变量、局部变量的（嵌套）字段，或者是可变[位置表达式](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)，则所得内存位置可以被"
"赋值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:172
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.deref.box\\] When applied to a [`Box`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#boxt), the resultant place may be [moved from](expr.move.movable-"
"place)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.deref.box\\] 当应用于 [`Box`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt) "
"时，所得位置可以[从中移出](expr.move.movable-place)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:175
msgid "r\\[expr.deref.safety\\] Dereferencing a raw pointer requires `unsafe`."
msgstr "r\\[expr.deref.safety\\] 解引用裸指针需要 `unsafe`。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:178
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.deref.traits\\] On non-pointer types `*x` is equivalent to "
"`*std::ops::Deref::deref(&x)` in an [immutable place expression context](../"
"expressions.md#mutability) and `*std::ops::DerefMut::deref_mut(&mut x)` in a "
"mutable place expression context, except that when `*x` undergoes [temporary "
"lifetime extension](destructors.scope.lifetime-extension), the dereferenced "
"expression `x` also has its [temporary scope](destructors.scope.temporary) "
"extended."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.deref.traits\\] 对于非指针类型，`*x` 在[不可变位置表达式上下文](../"
"expressions.md#mutability)中等价于 `*std::ops::Deref::deref(&x)`，在可变位置"
"表达式上下文中等价于 `*std::ops::DerefMut::deref_mut(&mut x)`；但当 `*x` 经历"
"[临时生命周期延长](destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)时，被解引用的表达式 "
"`x` 的[临时作用域](destructors.scope.temporary)也会被延长。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:193
msgid ""
"// The temporary holding the result of `String::new()` is extended\n"
"// to live to the end of the block, so `x` may be used in subsequent\n"
"// statements.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 持有 `String::new()` 结果的临时值的生命周期被延长\n"
"// 到块的末尾，因此 `x` 可以在后续\n"
"// 语句中使用。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:201
msgid ""
"// The temporary holding the result of `String::new()` is dropped at\n"
"// the end of the statement, so it's an error to use `y` after.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 持有 `String::new()` 结果的临时值会在该语句\n"
"// 末尾被丢弃，因此之后使用 `y` 是错误的。\n"

