"address may be truncated; using `usize` avoids this."
msgstr ""
"从裸指针转换为整数会产生所引用内存的机器地址。如果整数类型小于指针类型，该地"
"址可能被截断；使用 `usize` 可以避免这种情况。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:692
msgid "r\\[expr.as.int-as-pointer\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.as.int-as-pointer\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:693
msgid "Address to pointer cast"
msgstr "地址到指针转换"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:695
msgid ""
"Casting from an integer to a raw pointer interprets the integer as a memory "
"address and produces a pointer referencing that memory."
msgstr ""
"从整数转换为裸指针会将该整数解释为内存地址，并产生一个引用该内存的指针。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:697
msgid ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] This interacts with the Rust memory model, which is still "
"under development. A pointer obtained from this cast may suffer additional "
"restrictions even if it is bitwise equal to a valid pointer. Dereferencing "
"such a pointer may be [undefined behavior](../behavior-considered-"
"undefined.md) if aliasing rules are not followed."
msgstr ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] 这会与仍在开发中的 Rust 内存模型相互作用。通过这种转换获得的指"
"针即使与有效指针按位相等，也可能受到额外限制。如果没有遵守别名规则，解引用这"
"样的指针可能是[未定义行为](../behavior-considered-undefined.md)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:702
msgid "A trivial example of sound address arithmetic:"
msgstr "健全地址算术的一个简单示例："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:708
msgid "// 4 == size_of::<i32>()\n"
msgstr "// 4 == size_of::<i32>()\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:716
msgid "r\\[expr.as.pointer\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.as.pointer\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:717
msgid "Pointer-to-pointer cast"
msgstr "指针到指针转换"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:719
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.as.pointer.behavior\\] `*const T` / `*mut T` can be cast to `*const "
"U` / `*mut U` with the following behavior:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.as.pointer.behavior\\] `*const T` / `*mut T` 可以转换为 `*const "
"U` / `*mut U`，行为如下："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:722
msgid "r\\[expr.as.pointer.sized\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.as.pointer.sized\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:723
msgid "If `T` and `U` are both sized, the pointer is returned unchanged."
msgstr "如果 `T` 和 `U` 都是确定大小类型，则原样返回指针。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:730
msgid "// The pointer address remains the same.\n"
msgstr "// 指针地址保持不变。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:734
msgid "r\\[expr.as.pointer.discard-metadata\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.as.pointer.discard-metadata\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:735
msgid ""
"If `T` is unsized and `U` is sized, the cast discards all metadata that "
"completes the wide pointer `T` and produces a thin pointer `U` consisting of "
"the data part of the unsized pointer."
msgstr ""
"如果 `T` 是未确定大小类型而 `U` 是确定大小类型，则该转换会丢弃补全指向 `T` 的"
"宽指针所需的所有元数据，并产生一个指向 `U` 的瘦指针，其内容由该未确定大小指针"
"的数据部分组成。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:741
msgid "// Cast from wide pointer (*const [i32]) to thin pointer (*const i32)\n"
msgstr "// 从宽指针 (*const [i32]) 转换为瘦指针 (*const i32)\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:742
msgid "// discarding the length metadata.\n"
msgstr "// 丢弃长度元数据。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:747
msgid "r\\[expr.as.pointer.unsized.unchanged\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.as.pointer.unsized.unchanged\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:748
msgid ""
"If `T` and `U` are both unsized, the pointer is also returned unchanged. In "
"particular, the metadata is preserved exactly. The cast can only be "
"performed if the metadata is compatible according to the below rules:"
msgstr ""
"如果 `T` 和 `U` 都是未确定大小类型，也会原样返回指针。特别是，元数据会被精确"
"保留。只有当元数据按以下规则兼容时，才能执行该转换："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:750
msgid "r\\[expr.as.pointer.unsized.slice\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.as.pointer.unsized.slice\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:751
msgid ""
"When `T` and `U` are unsized with slice metadata, they are always "
"compatible. The metadata of a slice is the number of elements, so casting "
"`*[u16] -> *[u8]` is legal but will result in reducing the number of bytes "
"by half."
msgstr ""
"当 `T` 和 `U` 都是带有切片元数据的未确定大小类型时，它们总是兼容。切片的元数"
"据是元素数量，因此转换 `*[u16] -> *[u8]` 是合法的，但会导致字节数减半。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:761
msgid "r\\[expr.as.pointer.unsized.trait\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.as.pointer.unsized.trait\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:762
msgid ""
"When `T` and `U` are unsized with trait object metadata, the metadata is "
"compatible only when all of the following holds:"
msgstr ""
"当 `T` 和 `U` 都是带有 trait 对象元数据的未确定大小类型时，只有满足以下所有条"
"件，元数据才兼容："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:763
msgid "The principal trait must be the same."
msgstr "principal trait（主体 trait）必须相同。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:774
msgid "// You can't cast to a different principal trait.\n"
msgstr "// 不能转换为不同的主 trait。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:779
msgid "Auto traits may be removed."
msgstr "可以移除 auto trait。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:790
msgid "// Removing an auto trait.\n"
msgstr "// 移除 auto trait。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:795
msgid ""
"Auto traits may be added only if they are a super trait of the principal "
"trait."
msgstr ""
"只有当 auto trait 是 principal trait（主体 trait）的 super trait 时，才可以添"
"加该 auto trait。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:806
msgid "// Adding an auto trait.\n"
msgstr "// 添加 auto trait。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:818
msgid ""
"// Same as above, except trait Foo does not have Send as a super trait.\n"
msgstr "// 与上面相同，但 trait Foo 没有将 Send 作为 super trait。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:823
msgid "Trailing lifetimes may only be shortened."
msgstr "尾随生命周期只能缩短。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:832
msgid "// Shortening the lifetime is allowed.\n"
msgstr "// 允许缩短生命周期。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:843
msgid "// It is not allowed to cast to a longer lifetime.\n"
msgstr "// 不允许转换为更长的生命周期。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:848
msgid "Generics (including lifetimes) and associated types must match exactly."
msgstr "泛型（包括生命周期）和关联类型必须精确匹配。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:858
msgid "// You can't cast to a different generic parameter.\n"
msgstr "// 不能转换为不同的泛型参数。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:876
msgid "// Forces equality\n"
msgstr "// 强制要求相等\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:884
msgid "r\\[expr.as.pointer.unsized.compound\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.as.pointer.unsized.compound\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:885
msgid ""
"When `T` or `U` is a struct or tuple type whose last field is unsized, it "
"has the same metadata and compatibility rules as its last field."
msgstr ""
"当 `T` 或 `U` 是最后一个字段为未确定大小类型的结构体或元组类型时，它与其最后"
"一个字段具有相同的元数据和兼容性规则。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:894
msgid "// The metadata (length 3) is preserved when casting to a struct\n"
msgstr "// 元数据（长度 3）在转换为 struct 时会被保留\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:895
msgid "// where the last field is the unsized type `[u8]`.\n"
msgstr "// 其中最后一个字段是未定长类型 `[u8]`。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:898
msgid "// And preserved when casting back.\n"
msgstr "// 并且在转换回来时也会被保留。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:903
msgid "r\\[expr.assign\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.assign\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:904
msgid "Assignment expressions"
msgstr "赋值表达式"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:906
msgid "r\\[expr.assign.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.assign.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:911
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.intro\\] An _assignment expression_ moves a value into a "
"specified place."
msgstr "r\\[expr.assign.intro\\] *赋值表达式*会将一个值移动到指定位置。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:914
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.assignee\\] An assignment expression consists of a [mutable]"
"(../expressions.md#mutability) [assignee expression](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions), the _assignee operand_, followed by an "
"equals sign (`=`) and a [value expression](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions), the _assigned value operand_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.assignee\\] 赋值表达式由[可变](../expressions.md#mutability) "
"[赋值目标表达式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)"
"（即*赋值目标操作数*）后接等号（`=`）和[值表达式](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions)（即*被赋的值操作数*）组成。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:917
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.behavior-basic\\] In its most basic form, an assignee "
"expression is a [place expression](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-"
"value-expressions), and we discuss this case first."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.behavior-basic\\] 在最基本的形式中，赋值目标表达式是[位置表达"
"式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)，我们先讨论这"
"种情况。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:920
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.behavior-destructuring\\] The more general case of "
"destructuring assignment is discussed below, but this case always decomposes "
"into sequential assignments to place expressions, which may be considered "
"the more fundamental case."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.behavior-destructuring\\] 更一般的解构赋值情况会在下文讨论，"
"但这种情况总是分解为对位置表达式的顺序赋值，而这可以被视为更基础的情况。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:923
msgid "r\\[expr.assign.basic\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.assign.basic\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:924
msgid "Basic assignments"
msgstr "基本赋值"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:926
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.evaluation-order\\] Evaluating assignment expressions begins "
"by evaluating its operands. The assigned value operand is evaluated first, "
"followed by the assignee expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.evaluation-order\\] 赋值表达式的求值从求值其操作数开始。先求"
"值被赋的值操作数，然后求值赋值目标表达式。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:929
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructuring-order\\] For destructuring assignment, "
"subexpressions of the assignee expression are evaluated left-to-right."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructuring-order\\] 对于解构赋值，赋值目标表达式的子表达式"
"按从左到右的顺序求值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:932
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This is different than other expressions in that the right "
"operand is evaluated before the left one."
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 这与其他表达式不同，因为右操作数会先于左操作数求值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:935
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.drop-target\\] It then has the effect of first [dropping](../"
"destructors.md) the value at the assigned place, unless the place is an "
"uninitialized local variable or an uninitialized field of a local variable."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.drop-target\\] 然后，它的效果是先[丢弃](../destructors.md)被"
"赋值位置处的值，除非该位置是未初始化的局部变量或局部变量的未初始化字段。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:938
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.behavior\\] Next it either [copies or moves](../"
"expressions.md#moved-and-copied-types) the assigned value to the assigned "
"place."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.behavior\\] 接着，它会将被赋的值[复制或移动](../"
"expressions.md#moved-and-copied-types)到被赋值位置。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:941
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.result\\] An assignment expression always produces [the unit "
"value](../types/tuple.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.result\\] 赋值表达式始终产生[单元值](../types/tuple.md)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:944 src/patterns.md:347
#: src/macro-ambiguity.md:29
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:952
msgid "r\\[expr.assign.destructure\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.assign.destructure\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:953
msgid "Destructuring assignments"
msgstr "解构赋值"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:955
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.intro\\] Destructuring assignment is a "
"counterpart to destructuring pattern matches for variable declaration, "
"permitting assignment to complex values, such as tuples or structs. For "
"instance, we may swap two mutable variables:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.intro\\] 解构赋值对应于变量声明中的解构模式匹配，"
"允许对复杂值（如元组或结构体）赋值。例如，我们可以交换两个可变变量："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:959
msgid "// Swap `a` and `b` using destructuring assignment.\n"
msgstr "// 使用解构赋值交换 `a` 和 `b`。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:964
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.assignee\\] In contrast to destructuring "
"declarations using `let`, patterns may not appear on the left-hand side of "
"an assignment due to syntactic ambiguities. Instead, a group of expressions "
"that correspond to patterns are designated to be [assignee expressions](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions), and permitted on "
"the left-hand side of an assignment. Assignee expressions are then desugared "
"to pattern matches followed by sequential assignment."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.assignee\\] 与使用 `let` 的解构声明不同，由于语法"
"歧义，模式不能出现在赋值左侧。相反，与模式对应的一组表达式会被指定为[赋值目标"
"表达式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)，并允许出"
"现在赋值左侧。随后，赋值目标表达式会脱糖为模式匹配，接着进行顺序赋值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:967
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.irrefutable\\] The desugared patterns must be "
"irrefutable: in particular, this means that only slice patterns whose length "
"is known at compile-time, and the trivial slice `[..]`, are permitted for "
"destructuring assignment."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.irrefutable\\] 脱糖后的模式必须是不可反驳的：具体"
"来说，这意味着只有长度在编译时已知的切片模式，以及平凡切片 `[..]`，才允许用于"
"解构赋值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:970
msgid ""
"The desugaring method is straightforward, and is illustrated best by example."
msgstr "脱糖方法很直接，用示例最容易说明。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:980
msgid "// desugars to:\n"
msgstr "// 脱糖为：\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1002
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.repeat-ident\\] Identifiers are not forbidden "
"from being used multiple times in a single assignee expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.repeat-ident\\] 标识符并不禁止在单个赋值目标表达"
"式中多次使用。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1005
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.discard-value\\] [Underscore expressions](./"
"underscore-expr.md) and empty [range expressions](./range-expr.md) may be "
"used to ignore certain values, without binding them."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.discard-value\\] [下划线表达式](./underscore-"
"expr.md)和空[范围表达式](./range-expr.md)可用于忽略某些值，而不绑定它们。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1008
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.default-binding\\] Note that default binding "
"modes do not apply for the desugared expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.assign.destructure.default-binding\\] 注意，默认绑定模式不适用于脱糖"
"后的表达式。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1011
msgid "r\\[expr.assign.destructure.tmp-scopes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.assign.destructure.tmp-scopes\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1012
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The desugaring restricts the [temporary scope]"
"(destructors.scope.temporary) of the assigned value operand (the RHS) of a "
"destructuring assignment."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 脱糖会限制解构赋值的被赋的值操作数（RHS）的[临时作用域]"
"(destructors.scope.temporary)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1015
msgid ""
"In a basic assignment, the [temporary](expr.temporary) is dropped at the end "
"of the enclosing temporary scope. Below, that's the statement. Therefore, "
"the assignment and use is allowed."
msgstr ""
"在基本赋值中，[临时值](expr.temporary)会在外围临时作用域的末尾被丢弃。在下面"
"的例子中，也就是语句末尾。因此，赋值和使用是允许的。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1024
msgid ""
"Conversely, in a destructuring assignment, the temporary is dropped at the "
"end of the `let` statement in the desugaring. As that happens before we try "
"to assign to `x`, below, it fails."
msgstr ""
"相反，在解构赋值中，临时值会在脱糖中 `let` 语句的末尾被丢弃。由于这发生在下面"
"我们尝试赋值给 `x` 之前，因此会失败。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1033 src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1059
#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1075
msgid "This desugars to:"
msgstr "这会脱糖为："

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1041
msgid "//                     ^\n"
msgstr "//                     ^\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1042
msgid "//      The temporary is dropped here.\n"
msgstr "//      临时值在这里被丢弃。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1047
msgid "r\\[expr.assign.destructure.tmp-ext\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.assign.destructure.tmp-ext\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1048
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Due to the desugaring, the assigned value operand (the RHS) of a "
"destructuring assignment is an [extending expression]"
"(destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs) within a newly-introduced block."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 由于脱糖，解构赋值的被赋的值操作数（RHS）是在新引入块内的[延长表"
"达式](destructors.scope.lifetime-extension.exprs)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1051
msgid ""
"Below, because the [temporary scope](destructors.scope.temporary) is "
"extended to the end of this introduced block, the assignment is allowed."
msgstr ""
"下面，因为[临时作用域](destructors.scope.temporary)被延长到这个引入块的末尾，"
"所以赋值是允许的。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1067
msgid ""
"However, if we try to use `x`, even within the same statement, we'll get an "
"error because the [temporary](expr.temporary) is dropped at the end of this "
"introduced block."
msgstr ""
"然而，如果我们尝试使用 `x`，即使是在同一条语句内，也会得到错误，因为[临时值]"
"(expr.temporary)会在这个引入块的末尾被丢弃。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1089
msgid "r\\[expr.compound-assign\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.compound-assign\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1090
msgid "Compound assignment expressions"
msgstr "复合赋值表达式"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1092
msgid "r\\[expr.compound-assign.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.compound-assign.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1107
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.intro\\] _Compound assignment expressions_ combine "
"arithmetic and logical binary operators with assignment expressions."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.intro\\] *复合赋值表达式*将算术和逻辑二元运算符与赋"
"值表达式结合起来。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1118
msgid ""
"The syntax of compound assignment is a [mutable](../"
"expressions.md#mutability) [place expression](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions), the _assigned operand_, then one of the "
"operators followed by an `=` as a single token (no whitespace), and then a "
"[value expression](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions), the _modifying operand_."
msgstr ""
"复合赋值的语法是一个[可变](../expressions.md#mutability) [位置表达式](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)（即*被赋值操作数*），"
"然后是某个运算符后接 `=` 作为单个 token（没有空白），再后接一个[值表达式](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)（即*修改操作数*）。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1120
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.place\\] Unlike other place operands, the assigned "
"place operand must be a place expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.place\\] 与其他位置操作数不同，被赋值位置操作数必须"
"是位置表达式。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1123
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.no-value\\] Attempting to use a value expression is "
"a compiler error rather than promoting it to a temporary."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.no-value\\] 尝试使用值表达式会产生编译器错误，而不是"
"将其提升为临时值。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1126
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.operand-order\\] Evaluation of compound assignment "
"expressions depends on the types of the operands."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.operand-order\\] 复合赋值表达式的求值取决于操作数的"
"类型。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1129
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.primitives\\] If the types of both operands are "
"known, prior to monomorphization, to be primitive, the right hand side is "
"evaluated first, the left hand side is evaluated next, and the place given "
"by the evaluation of the left hand side is mutated by applying the operator "
"to the values of both sides."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.primitives\\] 如果在单态化之前即可知道两个操作数的类"
"型都是基本类型，则先求值右侧，再求值左侧，并通过将运算符应用于两侧的值来修改"
"由左侧求值得到的位置。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1140
msgid ""
"// The RHS is evaluated first as both operands are of primitive\n"
"    // type.\n"
msgstr ""
"// RHS 会先求值，因为两个操作数都是基本\n"
"    // 类型。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1148
msgid ""
"// The LHS is evaluated first as `Wrapping<_>` is not a primitive\n"
"    // type.\n"
msgstr ""
"// LHS 会先求值，因为 `Wrapping<_>` 不是基本\n"
"    // 类型。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1156
msgid ""
"// The LHS is evaluated first as one of the operands is a generic\n"
"    // parameter, even though that generic parameter can be unified\n"
"    // with a primitive type due to the where clause bound.\n"
msgstr ""
"// LHS 会先求值，因为其中一个操作数是泛型\n"
"    // 参数，即使该泛型参数由于 where 子句约束\n"
"    // 可以与基本类型合一。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1166
msgid ""
"// We supply a primitive type as the generic argument, but this\n"
"    // does not affect the evaluation order in `f3` when\n"
"    // monomorphized.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 我们提供一个基本类型作为泛型实参，但这\n"
"    // 不会影响 `f3` 单态化时的求值\n"
"    // 顺序。\n"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1173
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This is unusual. Elsewhere left to right evaluation is the norm."
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 这并不常见。在其他地方，从左到右求值是常规做法。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1176
msgid ""
"See the [eval order test](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/1.58.0/src/"
"test/ui/expr/compound-assignment/eval-order.rs) for more examples."
msgstr ""
"更多示例见 [eval order test](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/1.58.0/"
"src/test/ui/expr/compound-assignment/eval-order.rs)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1178
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.trait\\] Otherwise, this expression is syntactic "
"sugar for using the corresponding trait for the operator (see \\[expr.arith-"
"logic.behavior\\]) and calling its method with the left hand side as the "
"[receiver](expr.method.intro) and the right hand side as the next argument."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.trait\\] 否则，此表达式是使用该运算符对应 trait（见 "
"\\[expr.arith-logic.behavior\\]）的语法糖，并以左侧作为[接收者]"
"(expr.method.intro)、右侧作为下一个参数来调用其方法。"

