#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1226
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.result\\] As with normal assignment expressions, "
"compound assignment expressions always produce [the unit value](../types/"
"tuple.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.compound-assign.result\\] 与普通赋值表达式一样，复合赋值表达式始终产"
"生[单元值](../types/tuple.md)。"

#: src/expressions/operator-expr.md:1229
msgid ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] Avoid writing code that depends on the evaluation order of "
"operands in compound assignments as it can be unusual and surprising."
msgstr ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] 避免编写依赖复合赋值中操作数求值顺序的代码，因为该顺序可能不常"
"见且令人意外。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.paren\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.paren\\]"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.paren.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.paren.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:9
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.paren.intro\\] A _parenthesized expression_ wraps a single "
"expression, evaluating to that expression. The syntax for a parenthesized "
"expression is a `(`, then an expression, called the _enclosed operand_, and "
"then a `)`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.paren.intro\\] *带括号表达式*包装单个表达式，并求值为该表达式。带括"
"号表达式的语法是一个 `(`，随后是一个称为*被包围操作数*的表达式，最后是一个 "
"`)`。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:12
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.paren.evaluation\\] Parenthesized expressions evaluate to the value "
"of the enclosed operand."
msgstr "r\\[expr.paren.evaluation\\] 带括号表达式求值为被包围操作数的值。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:15
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.paren.place-or-value\\] A parenthesized expression is a [place "
"expression](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions) if "
"the enclosed operand is a place expression, and is a value expression if the "
"enclosed operand is a value expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.paren.place-or-value\\] 如果被包围操作数是位置表达式，则带括号表达式"
"是[位置表达式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)；如"
"果被包围操作数是值表达式，则带括号表达式是值表达式。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:18
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.paren.override-precedence\\] Parentheses can be used to explicitly "
"modify the precedence order of subexpressions within an expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.paren.override-precedence\\] 括号可用于显式修改表达式内子表达式的优"
"先级顺序。"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:21
msgid "An example of a parenthesized expression:"
msgstr "带括号表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:24
msgid "// not parenthesized\n"
msgstr "// 未加括号\n"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:25
msgid "// parenthesized\n"
msgstr "// 带括号\n"

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:30
msgid ""
"An example of a necessary use of parentheses is when calling a function "
"pointer that is a member of a struct:"
msgstr "必须使用括号的一个示例是调用作为结构体成员的函数指针："

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:38 src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:43
msgid "\"The method f\""
msgstr "\"The method f\""

#: src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:41 src/expressions/grouped-expr.md:44
msgid "\"The field f\""
msgstr "\"The field f\""

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.array\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.array\\]"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:2
msgid "Array and array index expressions"
msgstr "数组和数组索引表达式"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:4
msgid "Array expressions"
msgstr "数组表达式"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:6
msgid "r\\[expr.array.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.array.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:15
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.constructor\\] _Array expressions_ construct [arrays](../"
"types/array.md). Array expressions come in two forms."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.constructor\\] *数组表达式*构造[数组](../types/array.md)。数组"
"表达式有两种形式。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:18
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.array\\] The first form lists out every value in the array."
msgstr "r\\[expr.array.array\\] 第一种形式列出数组中的每个值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:21
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.array-syntax\\] The syntax for this form is a comma-separated "
"list of expressions of uniform type enclosed in square brackets."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.array-syntax\\] 这种形式的语法是用方括号括起、以逗号分隔的同一"
"类型表达式列表。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:24
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.array-behavior\\] This produces an array containing each of "
"these values in the order they are written."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.array-behavior\\] 这会生成一个数组，其中按写出的顺序包含这些"
"值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:27
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat\\] The syntax for the second form is two expressions "
"separated by a semicolon (`;`) enclosed in square brackets."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat\\] 第二种形式的语法是用方括号括起的两个表达式，二者以分"
"号（`;`）分隔。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:30
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-operand\\] The expression before the `;` is called the "
"_repeat operand_."
msgstr "r\\[expr.array.repeat-operand\\] `;` 前面的表达式称为*重复操作数*。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:33
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.length-operand\\] The expression after the `;` is called the "
"_length operand_."
msgstr "r\\[expr.array.length-operand\\] `;` 后面的表达式称为*长度操作数*。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:36
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.length-restriction\\] The length operand must either be an "
"[inferred const](items.generics.const.inferred) or be a [constant expression]"
"(../const_eval.md#constant-expressions) of type `usize` (e.g. a [literal](../"
"tokens.md#literals) or a [constant item](../items/constant-items.md))."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.length-restriction\\] 长度操作数必须是[推断 const]"
"(items.generics.const.inferred)，或者是类型为 `usize` 的[常量表达式](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions)（例如[字面量](../tokens.md#literals)或[常"
"量项](../items/constant-items.md)）。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:42
msgid "// Constant item.\n"
msgstr "// 常量项。\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:47
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] In an array expression, an [inferred const]"
"(items.generics.const.inferred) is parsed as an \\[expression\\]\\"
"[Expression\\] but then semantically treated as a separate kind of [const "
"generic argument](items.generics.const.argument)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 在数组表达式中，[推断 const](items.generics.const.inferred) 会被"
"解析为\\[表达式\\]\\[Expression\\]，但随后在语义上会被视为另一类[const 泛型实"
"参](items.generics.const.argument)。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:50
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-behavior\\] An array expression of this form creates "
"an array with the length of the value of the length operand with each "
"element being a copy of the repeat operand. That is, `[a; b]` creates an "
"array containing `b` copies of the value of `a`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-behavior\\] 这种形式的数组表达式会创建一个数组，其长度"
"为长度操作数的值，并且每个元素都是重复操作数的副本。也就是说，`[a; b]` 会创建"
"一个包含 `b` 个 `a` 的值的副本的数组。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:53
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-copy\\] If the length operand has a value greater than "
"1 then this requires the repeat operand to have a type that implements "
"[`Copy`](../special-types-and-traits.md#copy), to be a [const block "
"expression](expr.block.const), or to be a [path](path-expr.md) to a constant "
"item."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-copy\\] 如果长度操作数的值大于 1，那么这要求重复操作数"
"的类型实现 [`Copy`](../special-types-and-traits.md#copy)，或者重复操作数是 "
"[const 块表达式](expr.block.const)，或者是指向常量项的[路径](path-expr.md)。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:56
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-const-item\\] When the repeat operand is a const block "
"or a path to a constant item, it is evaluated the number of times specified "
"in the length operand."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-const-item\\] 当重复操作数是 const 块或指向常量项的路径"
"时，会按长度操作数指定的次数对它求值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:59
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-evaluation-zero\\] If that value is `0`, then the "
"const block or constant item is not evaluated at all."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-evaluation-zero\\] 如果该值为 `0`，则根本不会对 const "
"块或常量项求值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:62
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-non-const\\] For expressions that are neither a const "
"block nor a path to a constant item, it is evaluated exactly once, and then "
"the result is copied the length operand's value times."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.repeat-non-const\\] 对于既不是 const 块也不是指向常量项路径的"
"表达式，会对它恰好求值一次，然后将结果复制长度操作数的值所指定的次数。"

