#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:75
msgid "r\\[expr.array.index\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.array.index\\]"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:76
msgid "Array and slice indexing expressions"
msgstr "数组和切片索引表达式"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:78
msgid "r\\[expr.array.index.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.array.index.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:83
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.array\\] [Array](../types/array.md) and [slice](../"
"types/slice.md)\\-typed values can be indexed by writing a square-bracket-"
"enclosed expression of type `usize` (the index) after them. When the array "
"is mutable, the resulting [memory location](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions) can be assigned to."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.array\\] [数组](../types/array.md)和[切片](../types/"
"slice.md)类型的值可以通过在其后写一个用方括号括起、类型为 `usize` 的表达式"
"（索引）来进行索引。当数组可变时，可以对产生的[内存位置](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions)赋值。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:86
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.trait\\] For other types an index expression `a[b]` is "
"equivalent to `*std::ops::Index::index(&a, b)`, or "
"`*std::ops::IndexMut::index_mut(&mut a, b)` in a mutable place expression "
"context, except that when the index expression undergoes [temporary lifetime "
"extension](destructors.scope.lifetime-extension), the indexed expression `a` "
"also has its [temporary scope](destructors.scope.temporary) extended. Just "
"as with methods, Rust will also insert dereference operations on `a` "
"repeatedly to find an implementation."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.trait\\] 对于其他类型，索引表达式 `a[b]` 等价于 "
"`*std::ops::Index::index(&a, b)`，在可变位置表达式上下文中则等价于 "
"`*std::ops::IndexMut::index_mut(&mut a, b)`；但例外的是，当索引表达式经历[临"
"时生命周期延长](destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)时，被索引的表达式 `a` "
"的[临时作用域](destructors.scope.temporary)也会被延长。与方法一样，Rust 也会"
"反复在 `a` 上插入解引用操作以查找实现。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:90
msgid ""
"// The temporary holding the result of `vec![()]` is extended to\n"
"// live to the end of the block, so `x` may be used in subsequent\n"
"// statements.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 保存 `vec![()]` 结果的临时值会被延长到\n"
"// 存活至块的末尾，因此 `x` 可以在后续\n"
"// 语句中使用。\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:98
msgid ""
"// The temporary holding the result of `vec![()]` is dropped at the\n"
"// end of the statement, so it's an error to use `y` after.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 保存 `vec![()]` 结果的临时值会在\n"
"// 语句末尾被丢弃，因此之后使用 `y` 是错误的。\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:104
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.zero-index\\] Indices are zero-based for arrays and "
"slices."
msgstr "r\\[expr.array.index.zero-index\\] 数组和切片的索引从零开始。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:107
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.const\\] Array access is a [constant expression](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions), so bounds can be checked at compile-"
"time with a constant index value. Otherwise a check will be performed at run-"
"time that will put the thread in a [_panicked state_](../panic.md) if it "
"fails."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.const\\] 数组访问是[常量表达式](../"
"const_eval.md#constant-expressions)，因此在索引值为常量时，可以在编译时检查边"
"界。否则会在运行时执行检查；如果检查失败，会使线程进入 [*panic 状态*](../"
"panic.md)。"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:111
msgid "// lint is deny by default.\n"
msgstr "// lint 默认是 deny。\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:114
msgid "// Evaluates to 3\n"
msgstr "// 求值为 3\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:117
msgid "// multidimensional array indexing\n"
msgstr "// 多维数组索引\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:119 src/expressions/array-expr.md:125
msgid "// warning: index out of bounds\n"
msgstr "// warning: index out of bounds\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:122
msgid "// panics\n"
msgstr "// 会 panic\n"

#: src/expressions/array-expr.md:128
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.trait-impl\\] The array index expression can be "
"implemented for types other than arrays and slices by implementing the "
"[Index](std::ops::Index) and [IndexMut](std::ops::IndexMut) traits."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.array.index.trait-impl\\] 通过实现 [Index](std::ops::Index) 和 "
"[IndexMut](std::ops::IndexMut) trait，可以为数组和切片以外的类型实现数组索引"
"表达式。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.tuple\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.tuple\\]"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:2
msgid "Tuple and tuple indexing expressions"
msgstr "元组和元组索引表达式"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:4
msgid "Tuple expressions"
msgstr "元组表达式"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:6
msgid "r\\[expr.tuple.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.tuple.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:13
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.result\\] A _tuple expression_ constructs [tuple values](../"
"types/tuple.md)."
msgstr "r\\[expr.tuple.result\\] *元组表达式*构造[元组值](../types/tuple.md)。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:16
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.intro\\] The syntax for tuple expressions is a parenthesized, "
"comma separated list of expressions, called the _tuple initializer operands_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.intro\\] 元组表达式的语法是用括号括起、以逗号分隔的表达式列"
"表，称为*元组初始化器操作数*。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:19
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.unary-tuple-restriction\\] 1-ary tuple expressions require a "
"comma after their tuple initializer operand to be disambiguated with a "
"[parenthetical expression](grouped-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.unary-tuple-restriction\\] 一元元组表达式要求在其元组初始化器"
"操作数后有一个逗号，以便与[带括号表达式](grouped-expr.md)消除歧义。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:22
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.value\\] Tuple expressions are a [value expression](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions) that evaluate into a "
"newly constructed value of a tuple type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.value\\] 元组表达式是[值表达式](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions)，会求值为一个新构造的元组类型的值。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:25
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.type\\] The number of tuple initializer operands is the arity "
"of the constructed tuple."
msgstr "r\\[expr.tuple.type\\] 元组初始化器操作数的数量就是所构造元组的元数。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:28
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.unit\\] Tuple expressions without any tuple initializer "
"operands produce the unit tuple."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.unit\\] 没有任何元组初始化器操作数的元组表达式会生成单元元组。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:31
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.fields\\] For other tuple expressions, the first written "
"tuple initializer operand initializes the field `0` and subsequent operands "
"initializes the next highest field. For example, in the tuple expression "
"`('a', 'b', 'c')`, `'a'` initializes the value of the field `0`, `'b'` field "
"`1`, and `'c'` field `2`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple.fields\\] 对于其他元组表达式，第一个写出的元组初始化器操作数初"
"始化字段 `0`，后续操作数依次初始化下一个编号更高的字段。例如，在元组表达式 "
"`('a', 'b', 'c')` 中，`'a'` 初始化字段 `0` 的值，`'b'` 初始化字段 `1`，`'c'` "
"初始化字段 `2`。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:34
msgid "Examples of tuple expressions and their types:"
msgstr "元组表达式及其类型的示例："

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:36 src/syntax-index.md:165 src/glossary.md:60
msgid "Expression"
msgstr "表达式"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:38 src/types/tuple.md:30
msgid "`()` (unit)"
msgstr "`()`（单元）"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:39
msgid "`(0.0, 4.5)`"
msgstr "`(0.0, 4.5)`"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:39 src/types/tuple.md:32
msgid "`(f64, f64)`"
msgstr "`(f64, f64)`"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:40
msgid "`(\"x\".to_string(), )`"
msgstr "`(\"x\".to_string(), )`"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:40
msgid "`(String, )`"
msgstr "`(String, )`"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:41
msgid "`(\"a\", 4usize, true)`"
msgstr "`(\"a\", 4usize, true)`"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:41
msgid "`(&'static str, usize, bool)`"
msgstr "`(&'static str, usize, bool)`"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:43
msgid "r\\[expr.tuple-index\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.tuple-index\\]"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:44
msgid "Tuple indexing expressions"
msgstr "元组索引表达式"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:46
msgid "r\\[expr.tuple-index.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.tuple-index.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:51
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.intro\\] A _tuple indexing expression_ accesses fields "
"of [tuples](../types/tuple.md) and [tuple structs](../types/struct.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.intro\\] *元组索引表达式*访问[元组](../types/tuple.md)和"
"[元组结构体](../types/struct.md)的字段。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:54
msgid ""
"The syntax for a tuple index expression is an expression, called the _tuple "
"operand_, then a `.`, then finally a tuple index."
msgstr ""
"元组索引表达式的语法是一个称为*元组操作数*的表达式，后跟一个 `.`，最后跟一个"
"元组索引。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:56
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.index-syntax\\] The syntax for the _tuple index_ is a "
"[decimal literal](../tokens.md#integer-literals) with no leading zeros, "
"underscores, or suffix. For example `0` and `2` are valid tuple indices but "
"not `01`, `0_`, nor `0i32`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.index-syntax\\] *元组索引*的语法是不带前导零、下划线或后"
"缀的[十进制字面量](../tokens.md#integer-literals)。例如，`0` 和 `2` 是有效的"
"元组索引，而 `01`、`0_` 和 `0i32` 不是。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:59
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.required-type\\] The type of the tuple operand must be "
"a [tuple type](../types/tuple.md) or a [tuple struct](../types/struct.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.required-type\\] 元组操作数的类型必须是[元组类型](../"
"types/tuple.md)或[元组结构体](../types/struct.md)。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:62
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.index-name-operand\\] The tuple index must be a name of "
"a field of the type of the tuple operand."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.index-name-operand\\] 元组索引必须是元组操作数类型的某个"
"字段名。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:65
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.result\\] Evaluation of tuple index expressions has no "
"side effects beyond evaluation of its tuple operand. As a [place expression]"
"(../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions), it evaluates to "
"the location of the field of the tuple operand with the same name as the "
"tuple index."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.tuple-index.result\\] 元组索引表达式的求值除了求值其元组操作数外，没"
"有其他副作用。作为[位置表达式](../expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions)，它求值为元组操作数中与元组索引同名字段的位置。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:68
msgid "Examples of tuple indexing expressions:"
msgstr "元组索引表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:71
msgid "// Indexing a tuple\n"
msgstr "// 索引元组\n"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:72
msgid "\"a string\""
msgstr "\"a string\""

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:74
msgid "// Indexing a tuple struct\n"
msgstr "// 索引元组结构体\n"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:82
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Unlike field access expressions, tuple index expressions can be "
"the function operand of a [call expression](./call-expr.md) as it cannot be "
"confused with a method call since method names cannot be numbers."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 与字段访问表达式不同，元组索引表达式可以作为[调用表达式](./call-"
"expr.md)的函数操作数，因为方法名不能是数字，所以它不会与方法调用混淆。"

#: src/expressions/tuple-expr.md:85
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Although arrays and slices also have elements, you must use an "
"[array or slice indexing expression](array-expr.md#array-and-slice-indexing-"
"expressions) or a [slice pattern](../patterns.md#slice-patterns) to access "
"their elements."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 虽然数组和切片也有元素，但必须使用[数组或切片索引表达式](array-"
"expr.md#array-and-slice-indexing-expressions)或[切片模式](../"
"patterns.md#slice-patterns)来访问它们的元素。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.struct\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.struct\\]"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.struct.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.struct.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:22
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.intro\\] A _struct expression_ creates a struct, enum, or "
"union value. It consists of a path to a [struct](../items/structs.md), [enum "
"variant](../items/enumerations.md), or [union](../items/unions.md) item "
"followed by the values for the fields of the item."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.intro\\] *结构体表达式*创建 struct、enum 或 union 值。它由指"
"向 [struct](../items/structs.md)、[枚举变体](../items/enumerations.md)或 "
"[union](../items/unions.md) 项的路径，后跟该项各字段的值组成。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:25
msgid "The following are examples of struct expressions:"
msgstr "以下是结构体表达式的示例："

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:34
msgid "\"Joe\""
msgstr "\"Joe\""

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:38
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Tuple structs and tuple enum variants are typically instantiated "
"using a \\[call expression\\]\\[expr.call\\] referring to the \\[constructor "
"in the value namespace\\]\\[items.struct.tuple\\]. These are distinct from a "
"struct expression using curly braces referring to the constructor in the "
"type namespace."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 元组结构体和元组枚举变体通常使用\\[调用表达式\\]\\[expr.call\\]实"
"例化，该调用表达式引用\\[值命名空间中的构造器\\]\\[items.struct.tuple\\]。这"
"不同于使用花括号、引用类型命名空间中的构造器的结构体表达式。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:43 src/expressions/struct-expr.md:123
msgid "// Typical way of creating a tuple struct.\n"
msgstr "// 创建元组结构体的典型方式。\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:44
msgid "// `c` is a function that takes 3 arguments.\n"
msgstr "// `c` 是一个接受 3 个实参的函数。\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:45
msgid "// Creates a `Position` value.\n"
msgstr "// 创建一个 `Position` 值。\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:53
msgid "The last segment of the call path cannot refer to a type alias:"
msgstr "调用路径的最后一段不能指向类型别名："

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:62
msgid ""
"// <Unit as Tr>::T(); // causes an error -- `::T` is a type, not a value\n"
msgstr ""
"// <Unit as Tr>::T(); // causes an error -- `::T` is a type, not a value\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:68
msgid ""
"Unit structs and unit enum variants are typically instantiated using a \\"
"[path expression\\]\\[expr.path\\] referring to the \\[constant in the value "
"namespace\\]\\[items.struct.unit\\]."
msgstr ""
"单元结构体和单元枚举变体通常使用\\[路径表达式\\]\\[expr.path\\]实例化，该路径"
"表达式引用\\[值命名空间中的常量\\]\\[items.struct.unit\\]。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:72
msgid "// Gamma unit value, referring to the const in the value namespace.\n"
msgstr "// Gamma 单元值，指向值命名空间中的 const。\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:74
msgid "// Exact same value as `a`, but constructed using a struct expression\n"
msgstr "// 与 `a` 完全相同的值，但使用结构体表达式构造\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:75
msgid "// referring to the type namespace.\n"
msgstr "// 指向类型命名空间。\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:83
msgid "r\\[expr.struct.field\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.struct.field\\]"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:84
msgid "Field struct expression"
msgstr "字段结构体表达式"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:86
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.field.intro\\] A struct expression with fields enclosed in "
"curly braces allows you to specify the value for each individual field in "
"any order. The field name is separated from its value with a colon."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.field.intro\\] 字段用花括号括起的结构体表达式允许以任意顺序为"
"每个单独字段指定值。字段名与其值之间用冒号分隔。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:89
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.field.union-constraint\\] A value of a [union](../items/"
"unions.md) type can only be created using this syntax, and it must specify "
"exactly one field."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.field.union-constraint\\] [union](../items/unions.md) 类型的"
"值只能使用这种语法创建，并且必须恰好指定一个字段。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:92
msgid "r\\[expr.struct.update\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.struct.update\\]"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:93
msgid "Functional update syntax"
msgstr "函数式更新语法"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:95
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.update.intro\\] A struct expression that constructs a value "
"of a struct type can terminate with the syntax `..` followed by an "
"expression to denote a functional update."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.update.intro\\] 构造结构体类型值的结构体表达式可以用语法 "
"`..` 后跟一个表达式结尾，以表示函数式更新。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:98
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.update.base-same-type\\] The expression following `..` (the "
"base) must have the same struct type as the new struct type being formed."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.update.base-same-type\\] `..` 后面的表达式（基底）必须与正在"
"形成的新结构体类型具有相同的结构体类型。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:101
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.update.fields\\] The entire expression uses the given values "
"for the fields that were specified and moves or copies the remaining fields "
"from the base expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.update.fields\\] 整个表达式对已指定的字段使用给定值，并从基底"
"表达式移动或复制其余字段。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:104
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.update.visibility-constraint\\] As with all struct "
"expressions, all of the fields of the struct must be [visible](../visibility-"
"and-privacy.md), even those not explicitly named."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.update.visibility-constraint\\] 与所有结构体表达式一样，结构"
"体的所有字段都必须是[可见的](../visibility-and-privacy.md)，即使是那些没有显"
"式命名的字段。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:111
msgid "// OK, only base.x is accessed\n"
msgstr "// OK，仅访问 base.x\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:115
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.brace-restricted-positions\\] Struct expressions can't be "
"used directly in a [loop](loop-expr.md) or [if](if-expr.md#if-expressions) "
"expression's head, or in the [scrutinee](../glossary.md#scrutinee) of an [if "
"let](if-expr.md#if-let-patterns) or [match](match-expr.md) expression. "
"However, struct expressions can be used in these situations if they are "
"within another expression, for example inside [parentheses](grouped-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.brace-restricted-positions\\] 结构体表达式不能直接用于 [loop]"
"(loop-expr.md) 或 [if](if-expr.md#if-expressions) 表达式的头部，也不能直接用"
"于 [if let](if-expr.md#if-let-patterns) 或 [match](match-expr.md) 表达式的[被"
"匹配表达式](../glossary.md#scrutinee)中。不过，如果结构体表达式位于另一个表达"
"式内部，例如位于[带括号表达式](grouped-expr.md)内部，则可以在这些情形中使用。"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:118
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.struct.tuple-field\\] The field names can be decimal integer values "
"to specify indices for constructing tuple structs. This can be used with "
"base structs to fill out the remaining indices not specified:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.struct.tuple-field\\] 字段名可以是十进制整数值，以指定构造元组结构体"
"时使用的索引。这可以与基底结构体一起使用，以填充未指定的其余索引："

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:124
msgid "// Specifying fields by index.\n"
msgstr "// 按索引指定字段。\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:125
msgid "// Fill out all other fields using a base struct.\n"
msgstr "// 使用基结构体填充所有其他字段。\n"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:128
msgid "r\\[expr.struct.field.named\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.struct.field.named\\]"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:129
msgid "Struct field init shorthand"
msgstr "结构体字段初始化简写"

#: src/expressions/struct-expr.md:131
msgid ""
"When initializing a data structure (struct, enum, union) with named (but not "
"numbered) fields, it is allowed to write `fieldname` as a shorthand for "
"`fieldname: fieldname`. This allows a compact syntax with less duplication. "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"在初始化带有命名（而非编号）字段的数据结构（struct、enum、union）时，允许写 "
"`fieldname` 作为 `fieldname: fieldname` 的简写。这样可以使用更紧凑、重复更少"
"的语法。例如："

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.call\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.call\\]"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.call.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.call.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:11
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.call.intro\\] A _call expression_ calls a function. The syntax of a "
"call expression is an expression, called the _function operand_, followed by "
"a parenthesized comma-separated list of expression, called the _argument "
"operands_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.call.intro\\] *调用表达式*调用函数。调用表达式的语法是一个称为*函数"
"操作数*的表达式，后跟一个用括号括起、以逗号分隔的表达式列表，该列表称为*实参"
"操作数*。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:14
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.call.convergence\\] If the function eventually returns, then the "
"expression completes."
msgstr "r\\[expr.call.convergence\\] 如果函数最终返回，则该表达式完成。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:17
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.call.trait\\] For [non-function types](../types/function-item.md), "
"the expression `f(...)` uses the method on one of the following traits based "
"on the function operand:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.call.trait\\] 对于[非函数类型](../types/function-item.md)，表达式 "
"`f(...)` 会根据函数操作数，使用以下 trait 之一上的方法："

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:20
msgid "\\[`Fn`\\] or \\[`AsyncFn`\\] --- shared reference."
msgstr "\\[`Fn`\\] 或 \\[`AsyncFn`\\] --- 共享引用。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:21
msgid "\\[`FnMut`\\] or \\[`AsyncFnMut`\\] --- mutable reference."
msgstr "\\[`FnMut`\\] 或 \\[`AsyncFnMut`\\] --- 可变引用。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:22
msgid "\\[`FnOnce`\\] or \\[`AsyncFnOnce`\\] --- value."
msgstr "\\[`FnOnce`\\] 或 \\[`AsyncFnOnce`\\] --- 值。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:24
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.call.autoref-deref\\] An automatic borrow will be taken if needed. "
"The function operand will also be [automatically dereferenced](field-"
"expr.md#automatic-dereferencing) as required."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.call.autoref-deref\\] 如果需要，将进行自动借用。函数操作数也会按需被"
"[自动解引用](field-expr.md#automatic-dereferencing)。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:27
msgid "Some examples of call expressions:"
msgstr "调用表达式的一些示例："

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:35
msgid "r\\[expr.call.desugar\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.call.desugar\\]"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:36
msgid "Disambiguating function calls"
msgstr "消除函数调用歧义"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:38
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.call.desugar.fully-qualified\\] All function calls are sugar for a "
"more explicit [fully-qualified syntax](../paths.md#qualified-paths)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.call.desugar.fully-qualified\\] 所有函数调用都是更显式的[完全限定语"
"法](../paths.md#qualified-paths)的语法糖。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:41
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.call.desugar.ambiguity\\] Function calls may need to be fully "
"qualified, depending on the ambiguity of a call in light of in-scope items."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.call.desugar.ambiguity\\] 根据作用域内项所造成的调用歧义，函数调用可"
"能需要完全限定。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:44
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] In the past, the terms \"Unambiguous Function Call Syntax\", "
"\"Universal Function Call Syntax\", or \"UFCS\", have been used in "
"documentation, issues, RFCs, and other community writings. However, these "
"terms lack descriptive power and potentially confuse the issue at hand. We "
"mention them here for searchability's sake."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 过去，文档、议题、RFC 和其他社区文字中曾使用过 \"Unambiguous "
"Function Call Syntax\"、\"Universal Function Call Syntax\" 或 \"UFCS\" 这些术"
"语。然而，这些术语描述力不足，并且可能混淆当前问题。我们在这里提及它们是为了"
"便于搜索。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:47
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.call.desugar.limits\\] Several situations often occur which result "
"in ambiguities about the receiver or referent of method or associated "
"function calls. These situations may include:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.call.desugar.limits\\] 有几种经常出现的情形会导致方法调用或关联函数"
"调用的接收者或所指对象产生歧义。这些情形可以包括："

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:50
msgid ""
"Multiple in-scope traits define methods with the same name for the same types"
msgstr "多个作用域内的 trait 为相同类型定义了同名方法"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:51
msgid ""
"Auto-`deref` is undesirable; for example, distinguishing between methods on "
"a smart pointer itself and the pointer's referent"
msgstr ""
"不希望发生自动 `deref`；例如，要区分智能指针本身上的方法和该指针所指对象上的"
"方法"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:52
msgid ""
"Methods which take no arguments, like [`default()`]"
"(std::default::Default::default), and return properties of a type, like "
"[`size_of()`](std::mem::size_of)"
msgstr ""
"不接受实参并返回某个类型属性的方法，例如 [`default()`]"
"(std::default::Default::default) 和 [`size_of()`](std::mem::size_of)"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:54
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.call.desugar.explicit-path\\] To resolve the ambiguity, the "
"programmer may refer to their desired method or function using more specific "
"paths, types, or traits."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.call.desugar.explicit-path\\] 为解决歧义，程序员可以使用更具体的路"
"径、类型或 trait 来指称所需的方法或函数。"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:57
msgid "For example,"
msgstr "例如，"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:85
msgid ""
"// we can do this because we only have one item called `print` for `Foo`s\n"
msgstr "// 我们可以这样做，因为对于 `Foo`，只有一个名为 `print` 的项\n"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:87
msgid "// more explicit, and, in the case of `Foo`, not necessary\n"
msgstr "// 更显式，而且对于 `Foo` 来说不是必需的\n"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:89
msgid "// if you're not into the whole brevity thing\n"
msgstr "// 如果你不喜欢过于简短的写法\n"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:92
msgid ""
"// b.print(); // Error: multiple 'print' found\n"
"    // Bar::print(&b); // Still an error: multiple `print` found\n"
msgstr ""
"// b.print(); // Error: multiple 'print' found\n"
"    // Bar::print(&b); // Still an error: multiple `print` found\n"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:95
msgid "// necessary because of in-scope items defining `print`\n"
msgstr "// 由于作用域内有定义 `print` 的项，因此必要\n"

#: src/expressions/call-expr.md:100
