#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.method\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.method\\]"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:2
msgid "Method-call expressions"
msgstr "方法调用表达式"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.method.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.method.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:9
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.intro\\] A _method call_ consists of an expression (the "
"_receiver_) followed by a single dot, an expression path segment, and a "
"parenthesized expression-list."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.intro\\] *方法调用*由一个表达式（*接收者*）后跟单个点号、一个"
"表达式路径段以及带括号的表达式列表组成。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:12
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.target\\] Method calls are resolved to associated [methods]"
"(../items/associated-items.md#methods) on specific traits, either statically "
"dispatching to a method if the exact `self`\\-type of the left-hand-side is "
"known, or dynamically dispatching if the left-hand-side expression is an "
"indirect [trait object](../types/trait-object.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.target\\] 方法调用会被解析为特定 trait 上的关联[方法](../"
"items/associated-items.md#methods)：如果左侧的确切 `self`\\-类型已知，则静态"
"分派到某个方法；如果左侧表达式是间接的 [trait 对象](../types/trait-"
"object.md)，则动态分派。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:16
msgid "\"3.14\""
msgstr "\"3.14\""

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:21
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.autoref-deref\\] When looking up a method call, the receiver "
"may be automatically dereferenced or borrowed in order to call a method. "
"This requires a more complex lookup process than for other functions, since "
"there may be a number of possible methods to call. The following procedure "
"is used:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.autoref-deref\\] 查找方法调用时，可以对接收者自动解引用或借"
"用，以便调用方法。由于可能有多个可调用的方法，这需要比其他函数更复杂的查找过"
"程。使用以下过程："

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:24
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.candidate-receivers\\] The first step is to build a list of "
"candidate receiver types. Obtain these by repeatedly [dereferencing]"
"(operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator) the receiver expression's type, "
"adding each type encountered to the list, then finally attempting an array "
"[unsized coercion](../type-coercions.md#unsized-coercions) at the end, and "
"adding the result type if that is successful."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.candidate-receivers\\] 第一步是构建候选接收者类型列表。通过反"
"复对接收者表达式的类型进行[解引用](operator-expr.md#the-dereference-operator)"
"来获得这些类型，将遇到的每个类型添加到列表中，然后最后尝试一次数组的 "
"[unsized 强制转换](../type-coercions.md#unsized-coercions)，如果成功，则添加"
"结果类型。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:27
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.candidate-receivers-refs\\] Then, for each candidate `T`, "
"add `&T` and `&mut T` to the list immediately after `T`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.candidate-receivers-refs\\] 然后，对于每个候选类型 `T`，在列"
"表中紧接 `T` 之后添加 `&T` 和 `&mut T`。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:30
msgid ""
"For instance, if the receiver has type `Box<[i32;2]>`, then the candidate "
"types will be `Box<[i32;2]>`, `&Box<[i32;2]>`, `&mut Box<[i32;2]>`, `[i32; "
"2]` (by dereferencing), `&[i32; 2]`, `&mut [i32; 2]`, `[i32]` (by unsized "
"coercion), `&[i32]`, and finally `&mut [i32]`."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果接收者的类型是 `Box<[i32;2]>`，则候选类型将是 `Box<[i32;2]>`、"
"`&Box<[i32;2]>`、`&mut Box<[i32;2]>`、`[i32; 2]`（通过解引用）、`&[i32; 2]`、"
"`&mut [i32; 2]`、`[i32]`（通过 unsized 强制转换）、`&[i32]`，最后是 `&mut "
"[i32]`。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:32
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.candidate-search\\] Then, for each candidate type `T`, "
"search for a [visible](../visibility-and-privacy.md) method with a receiver "
"of that type in the following places:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.candidate-search\\] 然后，对于每个候选类型 `T`，在以下位置搜"
"索具有该类型接收者的[可见](../visibility-and-privacy.md)方法："

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:35
msgid "`T`'s inherent methods (methods implemented directly on `T`)."
msgstr "`T` 的固有方法（直接在 `T` 上实现的方法）。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:36
msgid ""
"Any of the methods provided by a [visible](../visibility-and-privacy.md) "
"trait implemented by `T`. If `T` is a type parameter, methods provided by "
"trait bounds on `T` are looked up first. Then all remaining methods in scope "
"are looked up."
msgstr ""
"由 `T` 所实现的任何[可见](../visibility-and-privacy.md) trait 提供的方法。如"
"果 `T` 是类型参数，则先查找 `T` 上 trait 约束提供的方法。然后查找作用域中的所"
"有其余方法。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:38
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The lookup is done for each type in order, which can "
"occasionally lead to surprising results. The below code will print \"In "
"trait impl!\", because `&self` methods are looked up first, the trait method "
"is found before the struct's `&mut self` method is found."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 查找会按顺序对每个类型进行，这有时可能导致意外的结果。下面的代码"
"将打印 \"In trait impl!\"，因为会先查找 `&self` 方法，所以会在找到结构体的 "
"`&mut self` 方法之前找到 trait 方法。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:50
msgid "\"In struct impl!\""
msgstr "\"In struct impl!\""

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:56
msgid "\"In trait impl!\""
msgstr "\"In trait impl!\""

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:66
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.ambiguous-target\\] If this results in multiple possible "
"candidates, then it is an error, and the receiver must be [converted](call-"
"expr.md#disambiguating-function-calls) to an appropriate receiver type to "
"make the method call."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.ambiguous-target\\] 如果这导致多个可能的候选项，则为错误，并"
"且必须将接收者[转换](call-expr.md#disambiguating-function-calls)为合适的接收"
"者类型，才能进行方法调用。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:69
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.receiver-constraints\\] This process does not take into "
"account the mutability or lifetime of the receiver, or whether a method is "
"`unsafe`. Once a method is looked up, if it can't be called for one (or "
"more) of those reasons, the result is a compiler error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.receiver-constraints\\] 此过程不会考虑接收者的可变性或生命周"
"期，也不会考虑方法是否为 `unsafe`。一旦查找到某个方法，如果由于其中一个（或多"
"个）原因而无法调用它，则结果是编译器错误。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:72
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.method.ambiguous-search\\] If a step is reached where there is more "
"than one possible method, such as where generic methods or traits are "
"considered the same, then it is a compiler error. These cases require a "
"[disambiguating function call syntax](call-expr.md#disambiguating-function-"
"calls) for method and function invocation."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.method.ambiguous-search\\] 如果到达某个步骤时存在多个可能的方法，例"
"如泛型方法或 trait 被认为相同的情况，则为编译器错误。这些情况要求对方法和函数"
"调用使用[消歧函数调用语法](call-expr.md#disambiguating-function-calls)。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:75
msgid "r\\[expr.method.edition2021\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.method.edition2021\\]"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:76
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2021\\] Before the 2021 edition, during the search for visible "
"methods, if the candidate receiver type is an [array type](../types/"
"array.md), methods provided by the standard library [`IntoIterator`]"
"(std::iter::IntoIterator) trait are ignored."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2021\\] 在 2021 edition 之前，在搜索可见方法期间，如果候选接收者"
"类型是[数组类型](../types/array.md)，则会忽略标准库 [`IntoIterator`]"
"(std::iter::IntoIterator) trait 提供的方法。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:79
msgid ""
"The edition used for this purpose is determined by the token representing "
"the method name."
msgstr "为此目的使用的 edition 由表示方法名的词法单元决定。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:81
msgid "This special case may be removed in the future."
msgstr "这个特殊情况将来可能会被移除。"

#: src/expressions/method-call-expr.md:83
msgid ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] For [trait objects](../types/trait-object.md), if there is an "
"inherent method of the same name as a trait method, it will give a compiler "
"error when trying to call the method in a method call expression. Instead, "
"you can call the method using [disambiguating function call syntax](call-"
"expr.md#disambiguating-function-calls), in which case it calls the trait "
"method, not the inherent method. There is no way to call the inherent "
"method. Just don't define inherent methods on trait objects with the same "
"name as a trait method and you'll be fine."
msgstr ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] 对于 [trait 对象](../types/trait-object.md)，如果存在与 trait "
"方法同名的固有方法，那么尝试在方法调用表达式中调用该方法时会产生编译器错误。"
"相反，可以使用[消歧函数调用语法](call-expr.md#disambiguating-function-calls)"
"调用该方法；在这种情况下，调用的是 trait 方法，而不是固有方法。没有办法调用该"
"固有方法。不要在 trait 对象上定义与 trait 方法同名的固有方法即可。"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.field\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.field\\]"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.field.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.field.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:9
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.field.intro\\] A _field expression_ is a [place expression](../"
"expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions) that evaluates to "
"the location of a field of a [struct](../items/structs.md) or [union](../"
"items/unions.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.field.intro\\] *字段表达式*是[位置表达式](../expressions.md#place-"
"expressions-and-value-expressions)，其求值结果为[结构体](../items/structs.md)"
"或[联合体](../items/unions.md)的字段位置。"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:12
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.field.mut\\] When the operand is [mutable](../"
"expressions.md#mutability), the field expression is also mutable."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.field.mut\\] 当操作数是[可变的](../expressions.md#mutability)时，字"
"段表达式也是可变的。"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:15
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.field.form\\] The syntax for a field expression is an expression, "
"called the _container operand_, then a `.`, and finally an [identifier](../"
"identifiers.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.field.form\\] 字段表达式的语法是一个称为*容器操作数*的表达式，随后是"
"一个 `.`，最后是一个[标识符](../identifiers.md)。"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:18
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.field.not-method-call\\] Field expressions cannot be followed by a "
"parenthetical comma-separated list of expressions, as that is instead parsed "
"as a [method call expression](method-call-expr.md). That is, they cannot be "
"the function operand of a [call expression](call-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.field.not-method-call\\] 字段表达式后面不能跟随一个用括号括起、以逗"
"号分隔的表达式列表，因为那会改为解析为[方法调用表达式](method-call-expr.md)。"
"也就是说，它们不能作为[调用表达式](call-expr.md)的函数操作数。"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:21
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Wrap the field expression in a [parenthesized expression]"
"(grouped-expr.md) to use it in a call expression."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 若要在调用表达式中使用字段表达式，请将字段表达式包在[带括号表达"
"式](grouped-expr.md)中。"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:28
msgid "// Invalid: Parsed as calling the method \"callable\"\n"
msgstr "// 无效：被解析为调用方法 \"callable\"\n"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:29
msgid "// holds_callable.callable();\n"
msgstr "// holds_callable.callable();\n"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:31
msgid "// Valid\n"
msgstr "// 有效\n"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:35 src/expressions/range-expr.md:39
#: src/patterns.md:151 src/patterns.md:376 src/patterns.md:424
#: src/patterns.md:566 src/types/array.md:15 src/types/slice.md:19
#: src/type-coercions.md:241 src/lifetime-elision.md:32 src/glossary.md:192
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:42
msgid "// Call expression containing a field expression\n"
msgstr "// 包含字段表达式的调用表达式\n"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:45
msgid "r\\[expr.field.autoref-deref\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.field.autoref-deref\\]"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:46
msgid "Automatic dereferencing"
msgstr "自动解引用"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:48
msgid ""
"If the type of the container operand implements [`Deref`](../special-types-"
"and-traits.md#deref-and-derefmut) or [`DerefMut`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#deref-and-derefmut) depending on whether the operand is [mutable]"
"(../expressions.md#mutability), it is _automatically dereferenced_ as many "
"times as necessary to make the field access possible. This process is also "
"called _autoderef_ for short."
msgstr ""
"如果容器操作数的类型根据该操作数是否[可变](../expressions.md#mutability)而实"
"现了 [`Deref`](../special-types-and-traits.md#deref-and-derefmut) 或 "
"[`DerefMut`](../special-types-and-traits.md#deref-and-derefmut)，则它会被*自"
"动解引用*所需的次数，以使字段访问成为可能。这个过程也简称为 _autoderef_。"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:50
msgid "r\\[expr.field.borrow\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.field.borrow\\]"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:51
msgid "Borrowing"
msgstr "借用"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:53
msgid ""
"The fields of a struct or a reference to a struct are treated as separate "
"entities when borrowing. If the struct does not implement [`Drop`](../"
"special-types-and-traits.md#drop) and is stored in a local variable, this "
"also applies to moving out of each of its fields. This also does not apply "
"if automatic dereferencing is done through user-defined types other than "
"[`Box`](../special-types-and-traits.md#boxt)."
msgstr ""
"借用时，struct 的字段或指向 struct 的引用的字段会被视为独立实体。如果该 "
"struct 未实现 [`Drop`](../special-types-and-traits.md#drop) 且存储在局部变量"
"中，这也适用于从其各个字段中移出。若自动解引用是通过 [`Box`](../special-"
"types-and-traits.md#boxt) 以外的用户定义类型完成的，则这也不适用。"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:59
msgid "\"f1\""
msgstr "\"f1\""

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:60
msgid "\"f2\""
msgstr "\"f2\""

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:61
msgid "\"f3\""
msgstr "\"f3\""

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:63
msgid "// x.f1 borrowed mutably\n"
msgstr "// x.f1 被可变借用\n"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:64
msgid "// x.f2 borrowed immutably\n"
msgstr "// x.f2 被不可变借用\n"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:65
msgid "// Can borrow again\n"
msgstr "// 可以再次借用\n"

#: src/expressions/field-expr.md:66
msgid "// Move out of x.f3\n"
msgstr "// 从 x.f3 中移出\n"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.closure\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.closure\\]"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.closure.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.closure.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:19
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.intro\\] A _closure expression_, also known as a lambda "
"expression or a lambda, defines a [closure type](../types/closure.md) and "
"evaluates to a value of that type. The syntax for a closure expression is an "
"optional `async` keyword, an optional `move` keyword, then a pipe-symbol-"
"delimited (`|`) comma-separated list of [patterns](../patterns.md), called "
"the _closure parameters_ each optionally followed by a `:` and a type, then "
"an optional `->` and type, called the _return type_, and then an expression, "
"called the _closure body operand_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.intro\\] *闭包表达式*，也称为 lambda 表达式或 lambda，定义一"
"个[闭包类型](../types/closure.md)，并求值为该类型的值。闭包表达式的语法为：一"
"个可选的 `async` 关键字、一个可选的 `move` 关键字，然后是一个由管道符号（`|"
"`）括定的、以逗号分隔的[模式](../patterns.md)列表，称为*闭包形参*，每个形参都"
"可后接一个 `:` 和一个类型；然后是一个可选的 `->` 和类型，称为*返回类型*；最后"
"是一个表达式，称为*闭包体操作数*。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:22
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.param-type\\] The optional type after each pattern is a "
"type annotation for the pattern."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.param-type\\] 每个模式之后的可选类型是该模式的类型标注。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:25
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.explicit-type-body\\] If there is a return type, the "
"closure body must be a [block](block-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.explicit-type-body\\] 如果存在返回类型，则闭包体必须是一个"
"[块](block-expr.md)。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:28
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.parameter-restriction\\] A closure expression denotes a "
"function that maps a list of parameters onto the expression that follows the "
"parameters. Just like a [`let` binding](../statements.md#let-statements), "
"the closure parameters are irrefutable [patterns](../patterns.md), whose "
"type annotation is optional and will be inferred from context if not given."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.parameter-restriction\\] 闭包表达式表示一个函数，它将形参列"
"表映射到形参之后的表达式。与 [`let` 绑定](../statements.md#let-statements)一"
"样，闭包形参是不可反驳的[模式](../patterns.md)，其类型标注是可选的；如果未给"
"出，则会从上下文推断。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:31
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.unique-type\\] Each closure expression has a unique, "
"anonymous type."
msgstr "r\\[expr.closure.unique-type\\] 每个闭包表达式都有一个唯一的匿名类型。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:34
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.captures\\] Significantly, closure expressions _capture "
"their environment_, which regular [function definitions](../items/"
"functions.md) do not."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.captures\\] 重要的是，闭包表达式会*捕获其环境*，而普通的[函"
"数定义](../items/functions.md)不会。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:37
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.capture-inference\\] Without the `move` keyword, the "
"closure expression [infers how it captures each variable from its "
"environment](../types/closure.md#capture-modes), preferring to capture by "
"shared reference, effectively borrowing all outer variables mentioned inside "
"the closure's body."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.capture-inference\\] 没有 `move` 关键字时，闭包表达式会[推断"
"如何从其环境中捕获每个变量](../types/closure.md#capture-modes)，并优先以共享"
"引用进行捕获，实际上会借用闭包体中提到的所有外部变量。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:40
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.capture-mut-ref\\] If needed the compiler will infer that "
"instead mutable references should be taken, or that the values should be "
"moved or copied (depending on their type) from the environment."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.capture-mut-ref\\] 如果需要，编译器会转而推断应取得可变引"
"用，或者应从环境中移动或复制这些值（取决于它们的类型）。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:43
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.capture-move\\] A closure can be forced to capture its "
"environment by copying or moving values by prefixing it with the `move` "
"keyword. This is often used to ensure that the closure's lifetime is "
"`'static`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.capture-move\\] 可以通过在闭包前加上 `move` 关键字，强制闭包"
"通过复制或移动值来捕获其环境。这常用于确保闭包的生命周期为 `'static`。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:46
msgid "r\\[expr.closure.trait-impl\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.closure.trait-impl\\]"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:47
msgid "Closure trait implementations"
msgstr "闭包 trait 实现"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:49
msgid ""
"Which traits the closure type implements depends on how variables are "
"captured, the types of the captured variables, and the presence of `async`. "
"See the [call traits and coercions](../types/closure.md#call-traits-and-"
"coercions) chapter for how and when a closure implements `Fn`, `FnMut`, and "
"`FnOnce`. The closure type implements [`Send`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#send) and [`Sync`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sync) if the "
"type of every captured variable also implements the trait."
msgstr ""
"闭包类型实现哪些 trait，取决于变量如何被捕获、被捕获变量的类型，以及是否存在 "
"`async`。关于闭包如何以及何时实现 `Fn`、`FnMut` 和 `FnOnce`，请参见[调用 "
"trait 与强转](../types/closure.md#call-traits-and-coercions)一章。如果每个被"
"捕获变量的类型也实现了相应 trait，则闭包类型会实现 [`Send`](../special-types-"
"and-traits.md#send) 和 [`Sync`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sync)。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:51
msgid "r\\[expr.closure.async\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.closure.async\\]"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:52
msgid "Async closures"
msgstr "async 闭包"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:54
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.async.intro\\] Closures marked with the `async` keyword "
"indicate that they are asynchronous in an analogous way to an \\[async "
"function\\]\\[items.fn.async\\]."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.async.intro\\] 用 `async` 关键字标记的闭包表示它们以类似于 "
"\\[async 函数\\]\\[items.fn.async\\] 的方式是异步的。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:57
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.async.future\\] Calling the async closure does not perform "
"any work, but instead evaluates to a value that implements \\[`Future`\\] "
"that corresponds to the computation of the body of the closure."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.async.future\\] 调用 async 闭包不会执行任何工作，而是求值为"
"一个实现 \\[`Future`\\] 的值，该值对应于闭包体的计算。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:69
msgid "\"done with {i}.\""
msgstr "\"done with {i}.\""

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:74
msgid "r\\[expr.closure.async.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.closure.async.edition2018\\]"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:75
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] Async closures are only available beginning with Rust "
"2018."
msgstr "\\[!EDITION-2018\\] async 闭包仅从 Rust 2018 开始可用。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:80
msgid ""
"In this example, we define a function `ten_times` that takes a higher-order "
"function argument, and we then call it with a closure expression as an "
"argument, followed by a closure expression that moves values from its "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"在此示例中，我们定义了一个函数 `ten_times`，它接受一个高阶函数实参；随后我们"
"先用一个闭包表达式作为实参来调用它，再用一个从其环境中移动值的闭包表达式来调"
"用它。"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:89 src/expressions/closure-expr.md:91
msgid "\"hello, {}\""
msgstr "\"hello, {}\""

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:89
msgid "// With type annotations\n"
msgstr "// 带有类型标注\n"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:93
msgid "\"konnichiwa\""
msgstr "\"konnichiwa\""

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:94
msgid "\"{}, {}\""
msgstr "\"{}, {}\""

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:97
msgid "Attributes on closure parameters"
msgstr "闭包形参上的属性"

#: src/expressions/closure-expr.md:99
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.closure.param-attributes\\] Attributes on closure parameters follow "
"the same rules and restrictions as [regular function parameters](../items/"
"functions.md#attributes-on-function-parameters)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.closure.param-attributes\\] 闭包形参上的属性遵循与[常规函数形参](../"
"items/functions.md#attributes-on-function-parameters)相同的规则和限制。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:1
msgid "r\\[expr.loop\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:2
msgid "Loops and other breakable expressions"
msgstr "循环和其他可 `break` 的表达式"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:4
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:15
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.intro\\] Rust supports four loop expressions:"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.intro\\] Rust 支持四种循环表达式："

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:18
msgid "A [`loop` expression](#infinite-loops) denotes an infinite loop."
msgstr "[`loop` 表达式](#infinite-loops)表示无限循环。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:19
msgid ""
"A [`while` expression](#predicate-loops) loops until a predicate is false."
msgstr "[`while` 表达式](#predicate-loops)会循环，直到谓词为 false。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:20
msgid ""
"A [`for` expression](#iterator-loops) extracts values from an iterator, "
"looping until the iterator is empty."
msgstr ""
"[`for` 表达式](#iterator-loops)从迭代器提取值，并循环直到该迭代器为空。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:21
msgid ""
"A \\[labeled block expression\\]\\[expr.loop.block-labels\\] runs a loop "
"exactly once, but allows exiting the loop early with `break`."
msgstr ""
"\\[带标签的块表达式\\]\\[expr.loop.block-labels\\]会运行一个恰好执行一次的循"
"环，但允许使用 `break` 提前退出该循环。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:23
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break-label\\] All four types of loop support [`break` "
"expressions](#break-expressions), and [labels](#loop-labels)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break-label\\] 所有四种循环都支持 [`break` 表达式](#break-"
"expressions)和[标签](#loop-labels)。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:26
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue-label\\] All except labeled block expressions support "
"[`continue` expressions](#continue-expressions)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue-label\\] 除带标签的块表达式外，其他所有类型都支持 "
"[`continue` 表达式](#continue-expressions)。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:29
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.explicit-result\\] Only `loop` and labeled block expressions "
"support [evaluation to non-trivial values](#break-and-loop-values)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.explicit-result\\] 只有 `loop` 和带标签的块表达式支持[求值为非"
"平凡值](#break-and-loop-values)。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:32
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.infinite\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.infinite\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:33
msgid "Infinite loops"
msgstr "无限循环"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:35
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.infinite.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.infinite.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:40
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.infinite.intro\\] A `loop` expression repeats execution of its "
"body continuously: `loop { println!(\"I live.\"); }`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.infinite.intro\\] `loop` 表达式会持续重复执行其主体：`loop "
"{ println!(\"I live.\"); }`。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:43
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.infinite.diverging\\] A `loop` expression without an "
"associated `break` expression is [diverging](divergence) and has type [`!`]"
"(type.never)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.infinite.diverging\\] 没有关联 `break` 表达式的 `loop` 表达式是"
"[发散的](divergence)，并具有 [`!`](type.never) 类型。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:46
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.infinite.break\\] A `loop` expression containing associated "
"[`break` expression(s)](#break-expressions) may terminate, and must have "
"type compatible with the value of the `break` expression(s)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.infinite.break\\] 包含一个或多个关联 [`break` 表达式](#break-"
"expressions)的 `loop` 表达式可能会终止，并且类型必须与这些 `break` 表达式的值"
"兼容。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:49
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.while\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.while\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:50
msgid "Predicate loops"
msgstr "谓词循环"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:52
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.while.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.while.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:57
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.intro\\] A `while` loop expression allows repeating the "
"evaluation of a block while a set of conditions remain true."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.intro\\] `while` 循环表达式允许在一组条件保持为 true 时重"
"复求值一个块。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:60
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.condition\\] Condition operands must be either an \\"
"[Expression\\] with a [boolean type](../types/boolean.md) or a conditional "
"`let` match. If all of the condition operands evaluate to `true` and all of "
"the `let` patterns successfully match their [scrutinee](../"
"glossary.md#scrutinee)s, then the loop body block executes."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.condition\\] 条件操作数必须是具有[布尔类型](../types/"
"boolean.md)的 \\[Expression\\]，或者是条件式 `let` 匹配。如果所有条件操作数都"
"求值为 `true`，并且所有 `let` 模式都成功匹配其[被匹配值](../"
"glossary.md#scrutinee)，则执行循环体块。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:63
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.repeat\\] After the loop body successfully executes, the "
"condition operands are re-evaluated to determine if the body should be "
"executed again."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.repeat\\] 循环体成功执行之后，会重新求值条件操作数，以确"
"定是否应再次执行主体。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:66
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.exit\\] If any condition operand evaluates to `false` or "
"any `let` pattern does not match its scrutinee, the body is not executed and "
"execution continues after the `while` expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.exit\\] 如果任何条件操作数求值为 `false`，或者任何 `let` "
"模式没有匹配其被匹配值，则不执行主体，并在 `while` 表达式之后继续执行。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:69
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.while.eval\\] A `while` expression evaluates to `()`."
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.while.eval\\] `while` 表达式求值为 `()`。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:72
msgid "An example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:83
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.while.let\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.while.let\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:84
msgid "`while let` patterns"
msgstr "`while let` 模式"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:86
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.let.intro\\] `let` patterns in a `while` condition allow "
"binding new variables into scope when the pattern matches successfully. The "
"following examples illustrate bindings using `let` patterns:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.let.intro\\] `while` 条件中的 `let` 模式允许在模式成功匹"
"配时将新变量绑定进作用域。以下示例展示使用 `let` 模式的绑定："

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:93
msgid "\"y = {}\""
msgstr "\"y = {}\""

