msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.let.desugar\\] A `while let` loop is equivalent to a "
"`loop` expression containing a [`match` expression](match-expr.md) as "
"follows."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.let.desugar\\] `while let` 循环等价于如下包含 [`match` 表"
"达式](match-expr.md)的 `loop` 表达式。"

