msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.let.or-pattern\\] Multiple patterns may be specified "
"with the `|` operator. This has the same semantics as with `|` in `match` "
"expressions:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.while.let.or-pattern\\] 可以用 `|` 运算符指定多个模式。这与 "
"`match` 表达式中的 `|` 具有相同语义："

