#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:157
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.for\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.for\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:158
msgid "Iterator loops"
msgstr "迭代器循环"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:160
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.for.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.for.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:167
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.for.intro\\] A `for` expression is a syntactic construct for "
"looping over elements provided by an implementation of "
"`std::iter::IntoIterator`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.for.intro\\] `for` 表达式是一种语法构造，用于遍历由 "
"`std::iter::IntoIterator` 的实现提供的元素。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:170
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.for.condition\\] If the iterator yields a value, that value is "
"matched against the irrefutable pattern, the body of the loop is executed, "
"and then control returns to the head of the `for` loop. If the iterator is "
"empty, the `for` expression completes."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.for.condition\\] 如果迭代器产出一个值，则该值会与不可反驳模式匹"
"配，循环体会被执行，然后控制流返回到 `for` 循环的首部。如果迭代器为空，则 "
"`for` 表达式完成。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:173
msgid "An example of a `for` loop over the contents of an array:"
msgstr "对数组内容进行 `for` 循环的示例："

