#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:268
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break.intro\\] When `break` is encountered, execution of the "
"associated loop body is immediately terminated, for example:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break.intro\\] 遇到 `break` 时，会立即终止关联循环体的执行，例"
"如："

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:282
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break.diverging\\] A `break` expression is [diverging]"
"(divergence) and has a type of [`!`](type.never)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break.diverging\\] `break` 表达式是[发散的](divergence)，并具"
"有 [`!`](type.never) 类型。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:285
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break.label\\] A `break` expression is normally associated "
"with the innermost `loop`, `for` or `while` loop enclosing the `break` "
"expression, but a [label](#loop-labels) can be used to specify which "
"enclosing loop is affected. Example:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break.label\\] `break` 表达式通常与包含该 `break` 表达式的最内"
"层 `loop`、`for` 或 `while` 循环关联，但可以使用[标签](#loop-labels)指定受影"
"响的外围循环。示例："

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:296
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break.value\\] A `break` expression is only permitted in the "
"body of a loop, and has one of the forms `break`, `break 'label` or ([see "
"below](#break-and-loop-values)) `break EXPR` or `break 'label EXPR`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break.value\\] `break` 表达式只允许出现在循环体内，并具有 "
"`break`、`break 'label` 或（[见下文](#break-and-loop-values)）`break EXPR` "
"或 `break 'label EXPR` 这些形式之一。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:299
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break-value.implicit-value\\] In a \\[`loop` with break "
"expressions\\]\\[expr.loop.break-value\\] or a [labeled block expression]"
"(expr.loop.block-labels), a `break` without an expression is equivalent to "
"`break ()`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break-value.implicit-value\\] 在\\[带有 `break` 表达式的 "
"`loop`\\]\\[expr.loop.break-value\\]或[带标签的块表达式](expr.loop.block-"
"labels)中，不带表达式的 `break` 等价于 `break ()`。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:302
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.block-labels\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.block-labels\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:305
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:310
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.intro\\] Labeled block expressions are exactly "
"like block expressions, except that they allow using `break` expressions "
"within the block."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.intro\\] 带标签的块表达式与块表达式完全相同，只是"
"它们允许在块内使用 `break` 表达式。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:313
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.break\\] Unlike loops, `break` expressions within "
"a labeled block expression _must_ have a label (i.e. the label is not "
"optional)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.break\\] 不同于循环，带标签的块表达式内部的 "
"`break` 表达式 *必须* 带有标签（即标签不是可选的）。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:316
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.label-required\\] Similarly, labeled block "
"expressions _must_ begin with a label."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.label-required\\] 类似地，带标签的块表达式 *必须* 以"
"标签开头。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:338
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.type\\] The type of a labeled block expression is "
"the [least upper bound](coerce.least-upper-bound) of all of the break "
"operands and the final operand. If the final operand is omitted, the type of "
"the final operand defaults to the [unit type](type.tuple.unit), unless the "
"block \\[diverges\\]\\[expr.block.diverging\\], in which case it is the "
"[never type](type.never)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.block-labels.type\\] 带标签的块表达式的类型是所有 `break` 操作"
"数和最终操作数的[最小上界](coerce.least-upper-bound)。如果省略最终操作数，则"
"最终操作数的类型默认为[单元类型](type.tuple.unit)，除非该块\\[发散\\]\\"
"[expr.block.diverging\\]，此时为[never 类型](type.never)。"

