#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:355
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.continue\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.continue\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:356
msgid "`continue` expressions"
msgstr "`continue` 表达式"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:358
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.continue.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.continue.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:363
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.intro\\] When `continue` is encountered, the current "
"iteration of the associated loop body is immediately terminated, returning "
"control to the loop _head_."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.intro\\] 遇到 `continue` 时，会立即终止关联循环体的当"
"前迭代，并把控制流返回到循环*首部*。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:366
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.diverging\\] A `continue` expression is [diverging]"
"(divergence) and has a type of [`!`](type.never)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.diverging\\] `continue` 表达式是[发散的](divergence)，"
"并具有 [`!`](type.never) 类型。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:369
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.while\\] In the case of a `while` loop, the head is "
"the conditional operands controlling the loop."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.while\\] 对于 `while` 循环，首部是控制该循环的条件操作"
"数。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:372
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.for\\] In the case of a `for` loop, the head is the "
"call-expression controlling the loop."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.for\\] 对于 `for` 循环，首部是控制该循环的调用表达式。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:375
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.label\\] Like `break`, `continue` is normally "
"associated with the innermost enclosing loop, but `continue 'label` may be "
"used to specify the loop affected."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.label\\] 与 `break` 类似，`continue` 通常与最内层外围"
"循环关联，但可以使用 `continue 'label` 指定受影响的循环。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:378
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.in-loop-only\\] A `continue` expression is only "
"permitted in the body of a loop."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.continue.in-loop-only\\] `continue` 表达式只允许出现在循环体"
"内。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:381
msgid "r\\[expr.loop.break-value\\]"
msgstr "r\\[expr.loop.break-value\\]"

