msgid "// first number in Fibonacci sequence over 10:\n"
msgstr "// Fibonacci 序列中大于 10 的第一个数：\n"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:401
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break-value.type\\] The type of a `loop` with associated "
"`break` expressions is the [least upper bound](coerce.least-upper-bound) of "
"all of the break operands."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break-value.type\\] 带有关联 `break` 表达式的 `loop` 的类型是所"
"有 `break` 操作数的[最小上界](coerce.least-upper-bound)。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:418
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break-value.diverging\\] A `loop` with associated `break` "
"expressions does not [diverge](divergence) if any of the break operands do "
"not diverge. If all of the `break` operands diverge, then the `loop` "
"expression also diverges."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.loop.break-value.diverging\\] 如果任何 `break` 操作数不发散，则带有"
"关联 `break` 表达式的 `loop` 不会[发散](divergence)。如果所有 `break` 操作数"
"都发散，那么该 `loop` 表达式也会发散。"

#: src/expressions/loop-expr.md:424
msgid "// This loop is diverging because all `break` operands are diverging.\n"
msgstr "// 此循环是发散的，因为所有 `break` 操作数都是发散的。\n"

