msgid "\"Bigger\""
msgstr "\"Bigger\""

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:68
msgid "\"Smaller\""
msgstr "\"Smaller\""

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:73
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.if.diverging\\] An `if` expression [diverges](divergence) if either "
"the condition expression diverges or if all arms diverge."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.if.diverging\\] 如果条件表达式发散，或者所有分支都发散，则 `if` 表达"
"式[发散](divergence)。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:78
msgid "// Diverges because the condition expression diverges\n"
msgstr "// 发散，因为条件表达式发散\n"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:84
msgid ""
"// The semicolon above is important: The type of the `if` expression is\n"
"    // `()`, despite being diverging. When the final body expression is\n"
"    // elided, the type of the body is inferred to ! because the function "
"body\n"
"    // diverges. Without the semicolon, the `if` would be the tail "
"expression\n"
"    // with type `()`, which would fail to match the return type `!`.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 上面的分号很重要：`if` 表达式的类型是\n"
"    // `()`，尽管它会发散。当最终的函数体表达式\n"
"    // 被省略时，函数体的类型会被推断为 !，因为函数体\n"
"    // 发散。没有分号时，`if` 将成为尾表达式，\n"
"    // 其类型为 `()`，这将无法匹配返回类型 `!`。\n"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:92
msgid "// Diverges because all arms diverge\n"
msgstr "// 发散，因为所有分支都发散\n"

