msgstr "`if let` 模式"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:104
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.if.let.intro\\] `let` patterns in an `if` condition allow binding "
"new variables into scope when the pattern matches successfully."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.if.let.intro\\] `if` 条件中的 `let` 模式允许在模式成功匹配时将新变量"
"绑定到作用域中。"

#: src/expressions/if-expr.md:107
