msgstr "r\\[expr.placeholder.syntax\\]"

#: src/expressions/underscore-expr.md:9
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.placeholder.intro\\] Underscore expressions, denoted with the "
"symbol `_`, are used to signify a placeholder in a destructuring assignment."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.placeholder.intro\\] 下划线表达式以符号 `_` 表示，用于在解构赋值中表"
"示占位符。"

#: src/expressions/underscore-expr.md:12
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.placeholder.lhs-assignment-only\\] They may only appear in the left-"
"hand side of an assignment."
msgstr "r\\[expr.placeholder.lhs-assignment-only\\] 它们只能出现在赋值的左侧。"

#: src/expressions/underscore-expr.md:15
msgid ""
"r\\[expr.placeholder.pattern\\] Note that this is distinct from the "
"[wildcard pattern](../patterns.md#wildcard-pattern)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[expr.placeholder.pattern\\] 注意，这不同于[通配符模式](../"
"patterns.md#wildcard-pattern)。"

#: src/expressions/underscore-expr.md:18
