"edition and beyond."
msgstr ""
"\\[ObsoleteRangePattern\\] 语法在 2021 edition 及以后版本中在语义上无效。"

#: src/patterns.md:30
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.intro\\] Patterns are used to match values against structures "
"and to, optionally, bind variables to values inside these structures. They "
"are also used in variable declarations and parameters for functions and "
"closures."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.intro\\] 模式用于将值与结构相匹配，并可选地把变量绑定到这些结构"
"内部的值。它们也用于变量声明以及函数和闭包的参数。"

#: src/patterns.md:33
msgid "The pattern in the following example does four things:"
msgstr "以下示例中的模式做了四件事："

#: src/patterns.md:35
msgid "Tests if `person` has the `car` field filled with something."
msgstr "测试 `person` 的 `car` 字段是否填有某个值。"

#: src/patterns.md:36
msgid ""
"Tests if the person's `age` field is between 13 and 19, and binds its value "
"to the `person_age` variable."
msgstr ""
"测试这个人的 `age` 字段是否在 13 到 19 之间，并将其值绑定到 `person_age` 变"
"量。"

#: src/patterns.md:37
msgid "Binds a reference to the `name` field to the variable `person_name`."
msgstr "将指向 `name` 字段的引用绑定到变量 `person_name`。"

#: src/patterns.md:38
msgid ""
"Ignores the rest of the fields of `person`. The remaining fields can have "
"any value and are not bound to any variables."
msgstr ""
"忽略 `person` 的其余字段。剩余字段可以具有任意值，且不会绑定到任何变量。"

