msgstr "\"matches everything else\""

#: src/patterns.md:465
msgid "r\\[patterns.range\\]"
msgstr "r\\[patterns.range\\]"

#: src/patterns.md:466
msgid "Range patterns"
msgstr "范围模式"

#: src/patterns.md:468
msgid "r\\[patterns.range.syntax\\]"
msgstr "r\\[patterns.range.syntax\\]"

#: src/patterns.md:500
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.intro\\] _Range patterns_ match scalar values within the "
"range defined by their bounds. They comprise a _sigil_ (`..` or `..=`) and a "
"bound on one or both sides."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.intro\\] *范围模式*匹配由其边界定义的范围内的标量值。它们"
"由一个 _sigil_（符号标记，`..` 或 `..=`）以及一侧或两侧的边界组成。"

#: src/patterns.md:503
msgid ""
"A bound on the left of the sigil is called a _lower bound_. A bound on the "
"right is called an _upper bound_."
msgstr "该 sigil 左侧的边界称为*下界*。右侧的边界称为*上界*。"

#: src/patterns.md:505
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.exclusive\\] The _exclusive range pattern_ matches all "
"values from the lower bound up to, but not including the upper bound. It is "
"written as its lower bound, followed by `..`, followed by the upper bound."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.exclusive\\] *排除上界的范围模式*匹配从下界开始直到上界、"
"但不包括上界的所有值。它写作下界，后接 `..`，再后接上界。"

#: src/patterns.md:508
msgid ""
"For example, a pattern `'m'..'p'` will match only `'m'`, `'n'` and `'o'`, "
"specifically **not** including `'p'`."
msgstr ""
"例如，模式 `'m'..'p'` 只会匹配 `'m'`、`'n'` 和 `'o'`，明确**不**包括 `'p'`。"

#: src/patterns.md:510
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.inclusive\\] The _inclusive range pattern_ matches all "
"values from the lower bound up to and including the upper bound. It is "
"written as its lower bound, followed by `..=`, followed by the upper bound."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.inclusive\\] *包含上界的范围模式*匹配从下界开始直到并包括"
"上界的所有值。它写作下界，后接 `..=`，再后接上界。"

#: src/patterns.md:513
msgid ""
"For example, a pattern `'m'..='p'` will match only the values `'m'`, `'n'`, "
"`'o'`, and `'p'`."
msgstr "例如，模式 `'m'..='p'` 只会匹配值 `'m'`、`'n'`、`'o'` 和 `'p'`。"

#: src/patterns.md:515
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.from\\] The _from range pattern_ matches all values "
"greater than or equal to the lower bound. It is written as its lower bound "
"followed by `..`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.from\\] *起始范围模式*匹配所有大于或等于下界的值。它写作下"
"界后接 `..`。"

#: src/patterns.md:518
msgid ""
"For example, `1..` will match any integer greater than or equal to 1, such "
"as 1, 9, or 9001, or 9007199254740991 (if it is of an appropriate size), but "
"not 0, and not negative numbers for signed integers."
msgstr ""
"例如，`1..` 会匹配任何大于或等于 1 的整数，例如 1、9、9001，或者 "
"9007199254740991（如果它的大小合适），但不匹配 0；对于有符号整数，也不匹配负"
"数。"

#: src/patterns.md:520
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.to-exclusive\\] The _to exclusive range pattern_ matches "
"all values less than the upper bound. It is written as `..` followed by the "
"upper bound."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.to-exclusive\\] *排除终止范围模式*匹配所有小于上界的值。它"
"写作 `..` 后接上界。"

#: src/patterns.md:523
msgid ""
"For example, `..10` will match any integer less than 10, such as 9, 1, 0, "
"and for signed integer types, all negative values."
msgstr ""
"例如，`..10` 会匹配任何小于 10 的整数，例如 9、1、0；对于有符号整数类型，还会"
"匹配所有负值。"

#: src/patterns.md:525
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.to-inclusive\\] The _to inclusive range pattern_ matches "
"all values less than or equal to the upper bound. It is written as `..=` "
"followed by the upper bound."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.to-inclusive\\] *包含终止范围模式*匹配所有小于或等于上界的"
"值。它写作 `..=` 后接上界。"

#: src/patterns.md:528
msgid ""
"For example, `..=10` will match any integer less than or equal to 10, such "
"as 10, 1, 0, and for signed integer types, all negative values."
msgstr ""
"例如，`..=10` 会匹配任何小于或等于 10 的整数，例如 10、1、0；对于有符号整数类"
"型，还会匹配所有负值。"

#: src/patterns.md:530
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.constraint-nonempty\\] A range pattern must be nonempty; "
"it must span at least one value in the set of possible values for its type. "
"In other words:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.constraint-nonempty\\] 范围模式必须非空；它必须覆盖其类型"
"的可能值集合中的至少一个值。换言之："

#: src/patterns.md:533
msgid ""
"In `a..=b`, a ≤ b must be the case. For example, it is an error to have a "
"range pattern `10..=0`, but `10..=10` is allowed."
msgstr ""
"在 `a..=b` 中，必须满足 a ≤ b。例如，范围模式 `10..=0` 是错误，但允许 "
"`10..=10`。"

#: src/patterns.md:534
msgid ""
"In `a..b`, a \\< b must be the case. For example, it is an error to have a "
"range pattern `10..0` or `10..10`."
msgstr ""
"在 `a..b` 中，必须满足 a \\< b。例如，范围模式 `10..0` 或 `10..10` 是错误。"

#: src/patterns.md:535
msgid ""
"In `..b`, b must not be the smallest value of its type. For example, it is "
"an error to have a range pattern `..-128i8` or `..f64::NEG_INFINITY`."
msgstr ""
"在 `..b` 中，b 不得是其类型的最小值。例如，范围模式 `..-128i8` 或 "
"`..f64::NEG_INFINITY` 是错误。"

#: src/patterns.md:537
msgid "r\\[patterns.range.bound\\] A bound is written as one of:"
msgstr "r\\[patterns.range.bound\\] 边界写作以下形式之一："

#: src/patterns.md:540
msgid "A character, byte, integer, or float literal."
msgstr "字符、字节、整数或浮点数字面量。"

#: src/patterns.md:541
msgid "A `-` followed by an integer or float literal."
msgstr "一个 `-` 后接整数或浮点数字面量。"

#: src/patterns.md:542
msgid "A [path](expressions/path-expr.md)."
msgstr "一个[路径](expressions/path-expr.md)。"

#: src/patterns.md:544 src/inline-assembly.md:647 src/inline-assembly.md:958
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1066 src/inline-assembly.md:1559
msgid "\\[!NOTE\\]"
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\]"

#: src/patterns.md:546
msgid ""
"We syntactically accept more than this for a _\\[RangePatternBound\\]_. We "
"later reject the other things semantically."
msgstr ""
"对于 _\\[RangePatternBound\\]_，我们在语法上接受的内容多于这些。其他内容随后"
"会在语义上被拒绝。"

#: src/patterns.md:548
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.constraint-bound-path\\] If a bound is written as a path, "
"after macro resolution, the path must resolve to a constant item of the type "
"`char`, an integer type, or a float type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.constraint-bound-path\\] 如果边界写作路径，则在宏解析之"
"后，该路径必须解析为类型为 `char`、整数类型或浮点数类型的常量项。"

#: src/patterns.md:551
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.type\\] The range pattern matches the type of its upper "
"and lower bounds, which must be the same type."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.type\\] 范围模式匹配其上界和下界的类型，二者必须是同一类"
"型。"

#: src/patterns.md:554
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.path-value\\] If a bound is a [path](expressions/path-"
"expr.md), the bound matches the type and has the value of the [constant]"
"(items/constant-items.md) the path resolves to."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.path-value\\] 如果边界是[路径](expressions/path-expr.md)，"
"则该边界匹配该路径所解析到的[常量](items/constant-items.md)的类型，并具有该常"
"量的值。"

#: src/patterns.md:557
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.literal-value\\] If a bound is a literal, the bound "
"matches the type and has the value of the corresponding [literal expression]"
"(expressions/literal-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.literal-value\\] 如果边界是字面量，则该边界匹配对应[字面量"
"表达式](expressions/literal-expr.md)的类型，并具有该字面量表达式的值。"

#: src/patterns.md:560
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.negation\\] If a bound is a literal preceded by a `-`, "
"the bound matches the same type as the corresponding [literal expression]"
"(expressions/literal-expr.md) and has the value of [negating](expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#negation-operators) the value of the corresponding literal "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.negation\\] 如果边界是前面带有 `-` 的字面量，则该边界匹配"
"对应[字面量表达式](expressions/literal-expr.md)的相同类型，并具有对该字面量表"
"达式的值进行[取负](expressions/operator-expr.md#negation-operators)后的值。"

#: src/patterns.md:563
msgid ""
"r\\[patterns.range.float-restriction\\] For float range patterns, the "
"constant may not be a `NaN`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[patterns.range.float-restriction\\] 对于浮点数范围模式，该常量不可以是 "
"`NaN`。"

