"expressions) and [while expressions](../expressions/loop-expr.md#predicate-"
"loops)"
msgstr ""
"[if 表达式](../expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions) 和 [while 表达式](../"
"expressions/loop-expr.md#predicate-loops) 中的条件操作数"

