"operators) 中的操作数"

#: src/types/boolean.md:32
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The boolean type acts similarly to but is not an [enumerated "
"type](enum.md). In practice, this mostly means that constructors are not "
"associated to the type (e.g. `bool::true`)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 布尔类型的行为类似于 [枚举类型](enum.md)，但它不是枚举类型。实际"
"上，这主要意味着构造器并不关联到该类型（例如 `bool::true`）。"

#: src/types/boolean.md:35
msgid ""
"r\\[type.bool.traits\\] Like all primitives, the boolean type [implements]"
"(../items/implementations.md) the [traits](../items/traits.md) [`Clone`](../"
"special-types-and-traits.md#clone), [`Copy`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#copy), [`Sized`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sized), [`Send`]"
"(../special-types-and-traits.md#send), and [`Sync`](../special-types-and-"
"traits.md#sync)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[type.bool.traits\\] 与所有原始类型一样，布尔类型 [实现](../items/"
"implementations.md) 了 [trait](../items/traits.md) [`Clone`](../special-"
"types-and-traits.md#clone)、[`Copy`](../special-types-and-traits.md#copy)、"
"[`Sized`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sized)、[`Send`](../special-types-"
"and-traits.md#send) 和 [`Sync`](../special-types-and-traits.md#sync)。"

