msgstr "// 然而，整个函数并不被视为发散。\n"

#: src/divergence.md:56
msgid "// ERROR: The type of the body is `()` but expected type `!`.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR：主体的类型是 `()`，但期望类型是 `!`。\n"

