#: src/destructors.md:1
msgid "r[destructors](destructors.md)"
msgstr "r[destructors](destructors.md)"

#: src/destructors.md:4
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.intro\\] When an [initialized](glossary.md#initialized) "
"[variable](variables.md) or [temporary](expressions.md#temporaries) goes out "
"of [scope](#drop-scopes), its _destructor_ is run or it is _dropped_. "
"[Assignment](expressions/operator-expr.md#assignment-expressions) also runs "
"the destructor of its left-hand operand, if it's initialized. If a variable "
"has been partially initialized, only its initialized fields are dropped."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.intro\\] 当一个[已初始化](glossary.md#initialized)的[变量]"
"(variables.md)或[临时值](expressions.md#temporaries)离开[作用域](#drop-"
"scopes)时，会运行它的*析构器*，或者说它会被*丢弃*。[赋值](expressions/"
"operator-expr.md#assignment-expressions)也会在其左操作数已初始化时运行该左操"
"作数的析构器。如果变量只被部分初始化，则只会丢弃其已初始化的字段。"

#: src/destructors.md:7
msgid "r\\[destructors.operation\\] The destructor of a type `T` consists of:"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.operation\\] 类型 `T` 的析构器由以下部分组成："

#: src/destructors.md:10
msgid ""
"If `T: Drop`, calling [`<T as core::ops::Drop>::drop`](core::ops::Drop::drop)"
msgstr ""
"如果 `T: Drop`，调用 [`<T as core::ops::Drop>::drop`](core::ops::Drop::drop)"

#: src/destructors.md:11
msgid "Recursively running the destructor of all of its fields."
msgstr "递归运行其所有字段的析构器。"

#: src/destructors.md:12
msgid ""
"The fields of a [struct](types/struct.md) are dropped in declaration order."
msgstr "[结构体](types/struct.md)的字段按声明顺序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:13
msgid ""
"The fields of the active [enum variant](types/enum.md) are dropped in "
"declaration order."
msgstr "活动的[枚举变体](types/enum.md)的字段按声明顺序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:14
msgid "The fields of a [tuple](types/tuple.md) are dropped in order."
msgstr "[元组](types/tuple.md)的字段按顺序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:15
msgid ""
"The elements of an [array](types/array.md) or owned [slice](types/slice.md) "
"are dropped from the first element to the last."
msgstr ""
"[数组](types/array.md)或拥有所有权的 [slice](types/slice.md) 的元素从第一个到"
"最后一个依次丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:16
msgid ""
"The variables that a [closure](types/closure.md) captures by move are "
"dropped in an unspecified order."
msgstr "[闭包](types/closure.md)通过 move 捕获的变量以未指定的顺序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:17
msgid ""
"[Trait objects](types/trait-object.md) run the destructor of the underlying "
"type."
msgstr "[Trait 对象](types/trait-object.md)会运行底层类型的析构器。"

#: src/destructors.md:18
msgid "Other types don't result in any further drops."
msgstr "其他类型不会导致任何进一步的丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:20
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.drop_in_place\\] If a destructor must be run manually, such "
"as when implementing your own smart pointer, \\"
"[`core::ptr::drop_in_place`\\] can be used."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.drop_in_place\\] 如果必须手动运行析构器，例如在实现自己的智能"
"指针时，可以使用 \\[`core::ptr::drop_in_place`\\]。"

#: src/destructors.md:23 src/destructors.md:288
msgid "Some examples:"
msgstr "一些示例："

#: src/destructors.md:34
msgid "\"drops when overwritten\""
msgstr "\"被覆盖时丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:35
msgid "\"drops when scope ends\""
msgstr "\"作用域结束时丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:37
msgid "\"Tuple first\""
msgstr "\"元组第一个\""

#: src/destructors.md:37
msgid "\"Tuple second\""
msgstr "\"元组第二个\""

#: src/destructors.md:39
msgid "// No destructor run on assignment.\n"
msgstr "// 赋值时不运行析构器。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:41
msgid "\"Drops when moved\""
msgstr "\"移动时丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:41
msgid "// Drops now, but is then uninitialized.\n"
msgstr "// 现在丢弃，但随后处于未初始化状态。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:44
msgid "// Uninitialized does not drop.\n"
msgstr "// 未初始化值不会丢弃。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:47
msgid "// After a partial move, only the remaining fields are dropped.\n"
msgstr "// 部分移动后，只丢弃剩余字段。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:49
msgid "\"first\""
msgstr "\"第一个\""

#: src/destructors.md:49
msgid "\"forgotten\""
msgstr "\"已忘记\""

#: src/destructors.md:49
msgid "// Perform a partial move, leaving only `partial_move.0` initialized.\n"
msgstr "// 执行一次部分移动，只留下 `partial_move.0` 已初始化。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:51
msgid "// When partial_move's scope ends, only the first field is dropped.\n"
msgstr "// 当 partial_move 的作用域结束时，只丢弃第一个字段。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:55
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:56
msgid "Drop scopes"
msgstr "drop 作用域"

#: src/destructors.md:58
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.intro\\] Each variable or temporary is associated to a "
"_drop scope_. When control flow leaves a drop scope all variables associated "
"to that scope are dropped in reverse order of declaration (for variables) or "
"creation (for temporaries)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.intro\\] 每个变量或临时值都关联到一个 *drop 作用域*。当"
"控制流离开某个 drop 作用域时，所有关联到该作用域的变量都会按声明（对变量而"
"言）或创建（对临时值而言）的逆序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:61
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.desugaring\\] Drop scopes can be determined by "
"replacing [`for`](expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops), [`if`]"
"(expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions), and [`while`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops) expressions with equivalent expressions using "
"[`match`](expressions/match-expr.md), [`loop`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#infinite-loops) and `break`."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.desugaring\\] drop 作用域可以通过将 [`for`]"
"(expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops)、[`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-"
"expressions) 和 [`while`](expressions/loop-expr.md#predicate-loops) 表达式替"
"换为使用 [`match`](expressions/match-expr.md)、[`loop`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#infinite-loops) 和 `break` 的等价表达式来确定。"

#: src/destructors.md:64
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.operators\\] Overloaded operators are not "
"distinguished from built-in operators and [binding modes]"
"(patterns.md#binding-modes) are not considered."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.operators\\] 重载运算符不与内建运算符区分，也不考虑[绑"
"定模式](patterns.md#binding-modes)。"

#: src/destructors.md:67
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.list\\] Given a function, or closure, there are drop "
"scopes for:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.list\\] 给定一个函数或闭包时，以下项都有 drop 作用域："

#: src/destructors.md:70
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.function\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.function\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:71
msgid "The entire function"
msgstr "整个函数"

#: src/destructors.md:73
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.statement\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.statement\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:74
msgid "Each [statement](statements.md)"
msgstr "每个[语句](statements.md)"

#: src/destructors.md:76
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.expression\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.expression\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:77
msgid "Each [expression](expressions.md)"
msgstr "每个[表达式](expressions.md)"

#: src/destructors.md:79
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.block\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.block\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:80
msgid "Each block, including the function body"
msgstr "每个块，包括函数体"

#: src/destructors.md:81
msgid ""
"In the case of a [block expression](expressions/block-expr.md), the scope "
"for the block and the expression are the same scope."
msgstr ""
"对于[块表达式](expressions/block-expr.md)，块的作用域和表达式的作用域是同一个"
"作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:83
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.match-arm\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.match-arm\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:84
msgid "Each arm of a `match` expression"
msgstr "`match` 表达式的每个分支"

#: src/destructors.md:86
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.nesting\\] Drop scopes are nested within one another "
"as follows. When multiple scopes are left at once, such as when returning "
"from a function, variables are dropped from the inside outwards."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.nesting\\] drop 作用域按如下方式相互嵌套。当一次离开多"
"个作用域时，例如从函数返回时，变量会从内向外丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:89
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.function\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.function\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:90
msgid "The entire function scope is the outer most scope."
msgstr "整个函数作用域是最外层作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:92
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.function-body\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.function-body\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:93
msgid ""
"The function body block is contained within the scope of the entire function."
msgstr "函数体块包含在整个函数的作用域内。"

#: src/destructors.md:95
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.expr-statement\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.expr-statement\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:96
msgid ""
"The parent of the expression in an expression statement is the scope of the "
"statement."
msgstr "表达式语句中的表达式的父作用域是该语句的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:98
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.let-initializer\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.let-initializer\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:99
msgid ""
"The parent of the initializer of a [`let` statement](statements.md#let-"
"statements) is the `let` statement's scope."
msgstr ""
"[`let` 语句](statements.md#let-statements)初始化器的父作用域是该 `let` 语句的"
"作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:101
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.statement\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.statement\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:102
msgid ""
"The parent of a statement scope is the scope of the block that contains the "
"statement."
msgstr "语句作用域的父作用域是包含该语句的块的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:104
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.match-guard\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.match-guard\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:105
msgid ""
"The parent of the expression for a `match` guard is the scope of the arm "
"that the guard is for."
msgstr "`match` 守卫表达式的父作用域是该守卫所属分支的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:107
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.match-arm\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.match-arm\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:108
msgid ""
"The parent of the expression after the `=>` in a `match` expression is the "
"scope of the arm that it's in."
msgstr "`match` 表达式中 `=>` 之后的表达式的父作用域是其所在分支的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:110
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.match\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.match\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:111
msgid ""
"The parent of the arm scope is the scope of the `match` expression that it "
"belongs to."
msgstr "分支作用域的父作用域是其所属 `match` 表达式的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:113
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.other\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.nesting.other\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:114
msgid ""
"The parent of all other scopes is the scope of the immediately enclosing "
"expression."
msgstr "所有其他作用域的父作用域都是直接包围它的表达式的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:116
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.params\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.params\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:117
msgid "Scopes of function parameters"
msgstr "函数参数的作用域"

#: src/destructors.md:119
msgid ""
"All function parameters are in the scope of the entire function body, so are "
"dropped last when evaluating the function. Each actual function parameter is "
"dropped after any bindings introduced in that parameter's pattern."
msgstr ""
"所有函数参数都在整个函数体的作用域内，因此在函数求值时最后丢弃。每个实际函数"
"参数会在该参数的模式引入的任何绑定之后丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:125 src/destructors.md:151 src/destructors.md:169
#: src/destructors.md:211 src/destructors.md:227 src/destructors.md:295
#: src/destructors.md:358
msgid "\"drop({})\""
msgstr "\"drop({})\""

#: src/destructors.md:127
msgid ""
"// Drops `y`, then the second parameter, then `x`, then the first parameter\n"
msgstr "// 依次丢弃 `y`、第二个参数、`x`、第一个参数\n"

#: src/destructors.md:133
msgid "// drop order is 3 2 0 1\n"
msgstr "// 丢弃顺序为 3 2 0 1\n"

#: src/destructors.md:136 src/paths.md:35
msgid "\"0\""
msgstr "\"0\""

#: src/destructors.md:137
msgid "\"2\""
msgstr "\"2\""

#: src/destructors.md:137
msgid "\"3\""
msgstr "\"3\""

#: src/destructors.md:141
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.bindings\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.bindings\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:142
msgid "Scopes of local variables"
msgstr "局部变量的作用域"

#: src/destructors.md:144
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.bindings.let\\] Local variables declared in a `let` "
"statement are associated to the scope of the block that contains the `let` "
"statement."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.bindings.let\\] 在 `let` 语句中声明的局部变量关联到包含"
"该 `let` 语句的块的作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:154
msgid "\"Dropped last in outer scope\""
msgstr "\"在外层作用域中最后丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:156 src/destructors.md:179
msgid "\"Dropped in inner scope\""
msgstr "\"在内层作用域中丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:158
msgid "\"Dropped first in outer scope\""
msgstr "\"在外层作用域中最先丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:161
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.bindings.match-arm\\] Local variables declared in a "
"`match` expression or pattern-matching `match` guard are associated to the "
"arm scope of the `match` arm that they are declared in."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.bindings.match-arm\\] 在 `match` 表达式或模式匹配 "
"`match` 守卫中声明的局部变量关联到声明它们的 `match` 分支的分支作用域。"

#: src/destructors.md:172
msgid "\"Dropped last in the first arm's scope\""
msgstr "\"在第一个分支的作用域中最后丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:173
msgid ""
"// When guard evaluation succeeds, control-flow stays in the arm and\n"
"    // values may be moved from the scrutinee into the arm's bindings,\n"
"    // causing them to be dropped in the arm's scope.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当守卫求值成功时，控制流停留在该分支中，\n"
"    // 值可以从被匹配值移动到该分支的绑定中，\n"
"    // 从而使它们在该分支的作用域中被丢弃。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:176
msgid "\"Dropped second in the first arm's scope\""
msgstr "\"在第一个分支的作用域中第二个丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:177
msgid "\"Dropped first in the first arm's scope\""
msgstr "\"在第一个分支的作用域中第一个丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:180
msgid ""
"// Pattern-matching guards' bindings and temporaries are dropped in\n"
"        // reverse order, dropping each guard condition operand's bindings\n"
"        // before its temporaries. Lastly, variables bound by the arm's\n"
"        // pattern are dropped.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 模式匹配守卫的绑定和临时值按逆序丢弃，\n"
"        // 每个守卫条件操作数的绑定会先于其临时值丢弃。\n"
"        // 最后，丢弃由该分支的模式绑定的变量。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:188
msgid "\"Dropped in the enclosing temporary scope\""
msgstr "\"在外围临时作用域中丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:189
msgid ""
"// When guard evaluation fails, control-flow leaves the arm scope,\n"
"    // causing bindings and temporaries from earlier pattern-matching\n"
"    // guard condition operands to be dropped. This occurs before "
"evaluating\n"
"    // the next arm's guard or body.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当守卫求值失败时，控制流离开该分支作用域，\n"
"    // 导致来自较早模式匹配守卫条件操作数的绑定和临时值被丢弃。\n"
"    // 这发生在对下一个分支的守卫或主体求值之前。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:193
msgid "\"Dropped in the first arm's scope\""
msgstr "\"在第一个分支的作用域中丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:195
msgid ""
"// When a guard is executed multiple times due to self-overlapping\n"
"    // or-patterns, control-flow leaves the arm scope when the guard fails\n"
"    // and re-enters the arm scope before executing the guard again.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当守卫因自重叠的 or-patterns（或模式）而执行多次时，\n"
"    // 控制流会在守卫失败时离开分支作用域，\n"
"    // 并在再次执行守卫前重新进入该分支作用域。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:198
msgid "\"Dropped in the second arm's scope twice\""
msgstr "\"在第二个分支的作用域中丢弃两次\""

#: src/destructors.md:204
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.bindings.patterns\\] Variables in patterns are dropped "
"in reverse order of declaration within the pattern."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.bindings.patterns\\] 模式中的变量会按其在模式内声明的逆"
"序丢弃。"

#: src/destructors.md:215
msgid "\"Dropped last\""
msgstr "\"最后丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:216
msgid "\"Dropped first\""
msgstr "\"最先丢弃\""

#: src/destructors.md:220
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.bindings.or-patterns\\] For the purpose of drop order, "
"[or-patterns](patterns.md#or-patterns) declare bindings in the order given "
"by the first subpattern."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.bindings.or-patterns\\] 就丢弃顺序而言，[or-patterns"
"（或模式）](patterns.md#or-patterns)按第一个子模式给出的顺序声明绑定。"

#: src/destructors.md:229
msgid "// Drops `x` before `y`.\n"
msgstr "// 先丢弃 `x`，再丢弃 `y`。\n"

#: src/destructors.md:232
msgid ""
"//   ^^^^^^^^^^   ^^^^^^^^^^^ This is the second subpattern.\n"
"//   |\n"
"//   This is the first subpattern.\n"
"//\n"
"//   In the first subpattern, `x` is declared before `y`. Since it is\n"
"//   the first subpattern, that is the order used even if the second\n"
"//   subpattern, where the bindings are declared in the opposite\n"
"//   order, is matched.\n"
msgstr ""
"//   ^^^^^^^^^^   ^^^^^^^^^^^ 这是第二个子模式。\n"
"//   |\n"
"//   这是第一个子模式。\n"
"//\n"
"//   在第一个子模式中，`x` 先于 `y` 声明。因为它是\n"
"//   第一个子模式，所以即使匹配的是绑定声明顺序相反的\n"
"//   第二个子模式，也会使用这个顺序。\n"

