#: src/destructors.md:258
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.temporary\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.temporary\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:259
msgid "Temporary scopes"
msgstr "临时作用域"

#: src/destructors.md:261
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.temporary.intro\\] The _temporary scope_ of an "
"expression is the scope that is used for the temporary variable that holds "
"the result of that expression when used in a [place context]"
"(expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-expressions), unless it is "
"[promoted](destructors.md#constant-promotion)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.temporary.intro\\] 表达式的 *临时作用域* 是一个作用域："
"当该表达式在[位置上下文](expressions.md#place-expressions-and-value-"
"expressions)中使用时，保存该表达式结果的临时变量会使用这个作用域，除非该表达"
"式被[提升](destructors.md#constant-promotion)。"

#: src/destructors.md:264
msgid ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.temporary.enclosing\\] Apart from lifetime extension, "
"the temporary scope of an expression is the smallest scope that contains the "
"expression and is one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[destructors.scope.temporary.enclosing\\] 除生命周期延长之外，表达式的临时"
"作用域是包含该表达式且属于以下项之一的最小作用域："

#: src/destructors.md:267
msgid "The entire function."
msgstr "整个函数。"

#: src/destructors.md:268
msgid "A statement."
msgstr "一个语句。"

#: src/destructors.md:269
msgid ""
"The body of an [`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions), [`while`]"
"(expressions/loop-expr.md#predicate-loops) or [`loop`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#infinite-loops) expression."
msgstr ""
"[`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions)、[`while`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops) 或 [`loop`](expressions/loop-expr.md#infinite-"
"loops) 表达式的主体。"

#: src/destructors.md:270
msgid "The `else` block of an `if` expression."
msgstr "`if` 表达式的 `else` 块。"

#: src/destructors.md:271
msgid ""
"The non-pattern matching condition expression of an `if` or `while` "
"expression or a non-pattern-matching `match` [guard condition operand]"
"(expressions/match-expr.md#match-guard-chains)."
msgstr ""
"`if` 或 `while` 表达式的非模式匹配条件表达式，或者非模式匹配的 `match` [守卫"
"条件操作数](expressions/match-expr.md#match-guard-chains)。"

#: src/destructors.md:272
msgid ""
"The pattern-matching guard, if present, and body expression for a `match` "
"arm."
msgstr "`match` 分支的模式匹配守卫（如果存在）以及主体表达式。"

#: src/destructors.md:273
msgid ""
"Each operand of a [lazy boolean expression](expressions/operator-"
"expr.md#lazy-boolean-operators)."
msgstr ""
"[惰性布尔表达式](expressions/operator-expr.md#lazy-boolean-operators)的每个操"
"作数。"

#: src/destructors.md:274
msgid ""
"The pattern-matching condition(s) and consequent body of [`if`](expressions/"
"if-expr.md#if-expressions) (\\[destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024\\])."
msgstr ""
"[`if`](expressions/if-expr.md#if-expressions) 的模式匹配条件以及后件主体（\\"
"[destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024\\]）。"

#: src/destructors.md:275
msgid ""
"The pattern-matching condition and loop body of [`while`](expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#predicate-loops)."
msgstr ""
"[`while`](expressions/loop-expr.md#predicate-loops) 的模式匹配条件和循环体。"

#: src/destructors.md:276
msgid ""
"The entirety of the tail expression of a block (\\"
"[destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024\\])."
msgstr "块尾表达式的整体（\\[destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024\\]）。"

#: src/destructors.md:278
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The [scrutinee](glossary.md#scrutinee) of a `match` expression "
"is not a temporary scope, so temporaries in the scrutinee can be dropped "
"after the `match` expression. For example, the temporary for `1` in `match 1 "
"{ ref mut z => z };` lives until the end of the statement."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `match` 表达式的[被匹配值](glossary.md#scrutinee)不是临时作用域，"
"因此被匹配值中的临时值可以在 `match` 表达式之后才丢弃。例如，`match 1 { ref "
"mut z => z };` 中 `1` 的临时值会存活到该语句结束。"

#: src/destructors.md:281
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The desugaring of a [destructuring assignment]"
"(expr.assign.destructure) restricts the temporary scope of its assigned "
"value operand (the RHS). For details, see \\[expr.assign.destructure.tmp-"
"scopes\\]."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] [解构赋值](expr.assign.destructure)的脱糖会限制其被赋值操作数"
"（RHS）的临时作用域。详情见 \\[expr.assign.destructure.tmp-scopes\\]。"

#: src/destructors.md:284
msgid "r\\[destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024\\]"
msgstr "r\\[destructors.scope.temporary.edition2024\\]"

#: src/destructors.md:285
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2024\\] The 2024 edition added two new temporary scope narrowing "
"rules: `if let` temporaries are dropped before the `else` block, and "
"temporaries of tail expressions of blocks are dropped immediately after the "
"tail expression is evaluated."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2024\\] 2024 版次新增了两条临时作用域收窄规则：`if let` 临时值会"
"在 `else` 块之前丢弃，块尾表达式的临时值会在尾表达式求值后立即丢弃。"

