#: src/names/namespaces.md:50
msgid ""
"An example of how overlapping names in different namespaces can be used "
"unambiguously:"
msgstr "以下示例展示了不同命名空间中的重叠名称如何能被无歧义地使用："

#: src/names/namespaces.md:53
msgid ""
"// Foo introduces a type in the type namespace and a constructor in the "
"value\n"
"// namespace.\n"
msgstr ""
"// Foo 在类型命名空间中引入一个类型，并在值命名空间中引入一个构造器。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:56
msgid "// The `Foo` macro is declared in the macro namespace.\n"
msgstr "// `Foo` 宏声明在宏命名空间中。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:61
msgid ""
"// `Foo` in the `f` parameter type refers to `Foo` in the type namespace.\n"
"// `'Foo` introduces a new lifetime in the lifetime namespace.\n"
msgstr ""
"// `f` 参数类型中的 `Foo` 指称类型命名空间中的 `Foo`。\n"
"// `'Foo` 在生命周期命名空间中引入一个新的生命周期。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:65
msgid "// `Foo` refers to the `Foo` constructor in the value namespace.\n"
msgstr "// `Foo` 指称值命名空间中的 `Foo` 构造器。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:67
msgid "// `Foo` refers to the `Foo` macro in the macro namespace.\n"
msgstr "// `Foo` 指称宏命名空间中的 `Foo` 宏。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:69
msgid "// `'Foo` introduces a label in the label namespace.\n"
msgstr "// `'Foo` 在标签命名空间中引入一个标签。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:71
msgid ""
"// `'Foo` refers to the `'Foo` lifetime parameter, and `Foo`\n"
"        // refers to the type namespace.\n"
msgstr ""
"// `'Foo` 指称 `'Foo` 生命周期参数，而 `Foo`\n"
"        // 指称类型命名空间。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:74
msgid "// `'Foo` refers to the label.\n"
msgstr "// `'Foo` 指称该标签。\n"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:80
msgid "r\\[names.namespaces.without\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.namespaces.without\\]"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:81
msgid "Named entities without a namespace"
msgstr "没有命名空间的具名实体"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:83
msgid ""
"The following entities have explicit names, but the names are not a part of "
"any specific namespace."
msgstr "以下实体具有显式名称，但这些名称不属于任何特定命名空间。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:85
msgid "Fields"
msgstr "字段"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:87
msgid ""
"r\\[names.namespaces.without.fields\\] Even though struct, enum, and union "
"fields are named, the named fields do not live in an explicit namespace. "
"They can only be accessed via a [field expression](../expressions/field-"
"expr.md), which only inspects the field names of the specific type being "
"accessed."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.namespaces.without.fields\\] 尽管 struct、enum 和 union 字段都有名"
"称，但这些具名字段并不位于显式命名空间中。它们只能通过[字段表达式](../"
"expressions/field-expr.md)访问，而字段表达式只检查正在被访问的特定类型的字段"
"名称。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:92
msgid ""
"r\\[names.namespaces.without.use\\] A [use declaration](../items/use-"
"declarations.md) has named aliases that it imports into scope, but the `use` "
"item itself does not belong to a specific namespace. Instead, it can "
"introduce aliases into multiple namespaces, depending on the item kind being "
"imported."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.namespaces.without.use\\] [use 声明](../items/use-declarations.md)"
"具有它导入到作用域中的具名别名，但 `use` 项本身不属于特定命名空间。相反，它可"
"以根据所导入的项的种类，将别名引入多个命名空间。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:95
msgid "r\\[names.namespaces.sub-namespaces\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.namespaces.sub-namespaces\\]"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:96
msgid "Sub-namespaces"
msgstr "子命名空间"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:98
msgid ""
"r\\[names.namespaces.sub-namespaces.intro\\] The macro namespace is split "
"into two sub-namespaces: one for [bang-style macros](../macros.md) and one "
"for [attributes](../attributes.md). When an attribute is resolved, any bang-"
"style macros in scope will be ignored. And conversely resolving a bang-style "
"macro will ignore attribute macros in scope. This prevents one style from "
"shadowing another."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.namespaces.sub-namespaces.intro\\] 宏命名空间被划分为两个子命名空"
"间：一个用于[感叹号风格宏](../macros.md)，另一个用于[属性](../"
"attributes.md)。解析属性时，作用域中的任何感叹号风格宏都会被忽略。反过来，解"
"析感叹号风格宏时，也会忽略作用域中的属性宏。这会防止一种风格遮蔽另一种风格。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:101
msgid ""
"For example, the [`cfg` attribute](../conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-"
"attribute) and the [`cfg` macro](../conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-"
"macro) are two different entities with the same name in the macro namespace, "
"but they can still be used in their respective context."
msgstr ""
"例如，[`cfg` 属性](../conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-attribute)和 [`cfg` "
"宏](../conditional-compilation.md#the-cfg-macro)是宏命名空间中两个同名的不同"
"实体，但它们仍然可以在各自对应的上下文中使用。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:104
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] `use` imports still cannot create duplicate bindings of the same "
"name in a module or block, regardless of sub-namespace."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 无论子命名空间如何，`use` 导入仍然不能在模块或块中创建同名的重复"
"绑定。"

#: src/names/namespaces.md:113
msgid "// error[E0252]: the name `mymac` is defined multiple times.\n"
msgstr "// error[E0252]: 名称 `mymac` 被定义了多次。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:1
msgid "r\\[names.scopes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:4
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.intro\\] A _scope_ is the region of source text where a "
"named [entity](../names.md) may be referenced with that name. The following "
"sections provide details on the scoping rules and behavior, which depend on "
"the kind of entity and where it is declared. The process of how names are "
"resolved to entities is described in the [name resolution](name-"
"resolution.md) chapter. More information on \"drop scopes\" used for the "
"purpose of running destructors may be found in the [destructors](../"
"destructors.md) chapter."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.intro\\] *作用域* 是源文本中的一个区域，在该区域内，具名[实"
"体](../names.md)可以通过该名称被引用。以下各节详细说明作用域规则和行为，这些"
"规则和行为取决于实体的种类及其声明位置。名称如何解析为实体的过程在[名称解析]"
"(name-resolution.md)一章中描述。关于用于运行析构器的 \"drop 作用域\" 的更多信"
"息，可以在[析构器](../destructors.md)一章中找到。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:7
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.items\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.items\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:8
msgid "Item scopes"
msgstr "项作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:10
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.module\\] The name of an [item](../items.md) declared "
"directly in a [module](../items/modules.md) has a scope that extends from "
"the start of the module to the end of the module. These items are also "
"members of the module and can be referred to with a [path](../paths.md) "
"leading from their module."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.module\\] 直接在[模块](../items/modules.md)中声明的"
"[项](../items.md)的名称，其作用域从该模块的开头延伸到该模块的末尾。这些项也是"
"该模块的成员，并且可以通过从其模块引出的[路径](../paths.md)来引用。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:13
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.statement\\] The name of an item declared as a "
"[statement](../statements.md) has a scope that extends from the start of the "
"block the item statement is in until the end of the block."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.statement\\] 作为[语句](../statements.md)声明的项的名"
"称，其作用域从该项语句所在块的开头延伸到该块的末尾。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:16
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.duplicate\\] It is an error to introduce an item with "
"a duplicate name of another item in the same [namespace](namespaces.md) "
"within the same module or block. [Asterisk glob imports](../items/use-"
"declarations.md) have special behavior for dealing with duplicate names and "
"shadowing, see the linked chapter for more details."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.duplicate\\] 在同一模块或块内，如果在同一[命名空间]"
"(namespaces.md)中引入一个与另一项名称重复的项，则是错误。[星号 glob 导入](../"
"items/use-declarations.md)在处理重复名称和遮蔽时具有特殊行为，更多细节见链接"
"章节。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:19
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.shadow-prelude\\] Items in a module may shadow items "
"in a [prelude](#prelude-scopes)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.shadow-prelude\\] 模块中的项可以遮蔽 [prelude]"
"(#prelude-scopes) 中的项。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:22
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.nested-modules\\] Item names from outer modules are "
"not in scope within a nested module. A [path](../paths.md) may be used to "
"refer to an item in another module."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.items.nested-modules\\] 外层模块中的项名称在嵌套模块内不在作"
"用域中。可以使用[路径](../paths.md)来引用另一个模块中的项。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:25
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.associated-items\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.associated-items\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:26
msgid "Associated item scopes"
msgstr "关联项作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:28
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.associated-items.scope\\] [Associated items](../items/"
"associated-items.md) are not scoped and can only be referred to by using a "
"[path](../paths.md) leading from the type or trait they are associated with. "
"[Methods](../items/associated-items.md#methods) can also be referred to via "
"[call expressions](../expressions/call-expr.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.associated-items.scope\\] [关联项](../items/associated-"
"items.md)没有作用域，只能通过从其关联的类型或 trait 引出的[路径](../paths.md)"
"来引用。[方法](../items/associated-items.md#methods)也可以通过[调用表达式]"
"(../expressions/call-expr.md)来引用。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:31
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.associated-items.duplicate\\] Similar to items within a "
"module or block,  it is an error to introduce an item within a trait or "
"implementation that is a duplicate of another item in the trait or impl in "
"the same namespace."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.associated-items.duplicate\\] 与模块或块内的项类似，如果在 "
"trait 或实现内引入的项与该 trait 或 impl 中同一命名空间内的另一项重复，则是错"
"误。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:34
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:35
msgid "Pattern binding scopes"
msgstr "模式绑定作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:37
msgid ""
"The scope of a local variable [pattern](../patterns.md) binding depends on "
"where it is used:"
msgstr "局部变量[模式](../patterns.md)绑定的作用域取决于其使用位置："

#: src/names/scopes.md:39
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.let\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.let\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:40
msgid ""
"[`let` statement](../statements.md#let-statements) bindings range from just "
"after the `let` statement until the end of the block where it is declared. "
"r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.parameter\\]"
msgstr ""
"[`let` 语句](../statements.md#let-statements)绑定的范围从该 `let` 语句之后开"
"始，直到其声明所在块的末尾。 r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.parameter\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:42
msgid ""
"[Function parameter](../items/functions.md#function-parameters) bindings are "
"within the body of the function. r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.closure\\]"
msgstr ""
"[函数参数](../items/functions.md#function-parameters)绑定位于函数体内。 r\\"
"[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.closure\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:44
msgid ""
"[Closure parameter](../expressions/closure-expr.md) bindings are within the "
"closure body. r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.loop\\]"
msgstr ""
"[闭包参数](../expressions/closure-expr.md)绑定位于闭包体内。 r\\"
"[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.loop\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:46
msgid ""
"[`for`](../expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops) bindings are within the "
"loop body. r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.let-chains\\]"
msgstr ""
"[`for`](../expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops) 绑定位于循环体内。 r\\"
"[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.let-chains\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:48
msgid ""
"[`if let`](../expressions/if-expr.md#if-let-patterns) and [`while let`](../"
"expressions/loop-expr.md#while-let-patterns) bindings are valid in the "
"following conditions as well as the consequent block. r\\"
"[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.match-arm\\]"
msgstr ""
"[`if let`](../expressions/if-expr.md#if-let-patterns) 和 [`while let`](../"
"expressions/loop-expr.md#while-let-patterns) 绑定在后续条件以及结果块中有"
"效。 r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.match-arm\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:50
msgid ""
"[`match` arms](../expressions/match-expr.md) bindings are within the [match "
"guard](../expressions/match-expr.md#match-guards) and the match arm "
"expression. r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.match-guard-let\\]"
msgstr ""
"[`match` 分支](../expressions/match-expr.md)绑定位于 [match 守卫](../"
"expressions/match-expr.md#match-guards)和 match 分支表达式内。 r\\"
"[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.match-guard-let\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:52
msgid ""
"[`match` guard `let`](expr.match.guard.let) bindings are valid in the "
"following guard conditions and the match arm expression."
msgstr ""
"[`match` 守卫 `let`](expr.match.guard.let) 绑定在后续守卫条件和 match 分支表"
"达式中有效。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:54
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.pattern-bindings.items\\] Local variable scopes do not "
"extend into item declarations."
msgstr ""
