#: src/names/scopes.md:81
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:82
msgid "Generic parameter scopes"
msgstr "泛型参数作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:84
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.param-list\\] Generic parameters are "
"declared in a \\[GenericParams\\] list. The scope of a generic parameter is "
"within the item it is declared on."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.param-list\\] 泛型参数在 \\"
"[GenericParams\\] 列表中声明。泛型参数的作用域位于声明它的项内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:87
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.order-independent\\] All parameters are "
"in scope within the generic parameter list regardless of the order they are "
"declared. The following shows some examples where a parameter may be "
"referenced before it is declared:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.order-independent\\] 无论声明顺序如何，所"
"有参数都在泛型参数列表内的作用域中。以下展示一些参数可以在声明前被引用的示"
"例："

#: src/names/scopes.md:91
msgid "// The 'b bound is referenced before it is declared.\n"
msgstr "// 'b 约束在声明前被引用。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:94
msgid ""
"// The const N is referenced in the trait bound before it is declared.\n"
msgstr "// const N 在声明前于 trait 约束中被引用。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:99
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.bounds\\] Generic parameters are also in "
"scope for type bounds and where clauses, for example:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.bounds\\] 泛型参数也在类型约束和 where 子"
"句的作用域中，例如："

#: src/names/scopes.md:103
msgid ""
"// The <'a, U> for `SomeTrait` refer to the 'a and U parameters of "
"`bounds_scope`.\n"
msgstr "// `SomeTrait` 的 <'a, U> 指代 `bounds_scope` 的 'a 和 U 参数。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:112
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.inner-items\\] It is an error for [items]"
"(../items.md) declared inside a function to refer to a generic parameter "
"from their outer scope."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.inner-items\\] 在函数内部声明的[项](../"
"items.md)引用其外层作用域中的泛型参数是错误。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:117
msgid "// ERROR: can't use generic parameters from outer function\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: 不能使用外层函数的泛型参数\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:121
msgid "Generic parameter shadowing"
msgstr "泛型参数遮蔽"

#: src/names/scopes.md:123
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.shadow\\] It is an error to shadow a "
"generic parameter with the exception that items declared within functions "
"are allowed to shadow generic parameter names from the function."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.generic-parameters.shadow\\] 遮蔽泛型参数是错误，但有一个例"
"外：在函数内声明的项允许遮蔽来自该函数的泛型参数名称。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:128
msgid ""
"// Items within functions are allowed to shadow generic parameter in scope.\n"
msgstr "// 函数内的项允许遮蔽作用域中的泛型参数。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:137
msgid "// ERROR: 'a is already in use\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: 'a 已被使用\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:138 src/names/scopes.md:140
msgid "// ERROR: T is already in use\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: T 已被使用\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:139
msgid "// ERROR: N is already in use\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: N 已被使用\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:144
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:145
msgid "Lifetime scopes"
msgstr "生命周期作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:147
msgid ""
"Lifetime parameters are declared in a \\[GenericParams\\] list and [higher-"
"ranked trait bounds](../trait-bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds)."
msgstr ""
"生命周期参数在 \\[GenericParams\\] 列表和[高阶 trait 约束](../trait-"
"bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds)中声明。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:149
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes.special\\] The `'static` lifetime and "
"[placeholder lifetime](../lifetime-elision.md) `'_` have a special meaning "
"and cannot be declared as a parameter."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes.special\\] `'static` 生命周期和[占位生命周期](../"
"lifetime-elision.md) `'_` 具有特殊含义，不能声明为参数。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:152
msgid "Lifetime generic parameter scopes"
msgstr "生命周期泛型参数作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:154
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes.generic\\] [Constant](../items/constant-items.md) "
"and [static](../items/static-items.md) items and [const contexts](../"
"const_eval.md#const-context) only ever allow `'static` lifetime references, "
"so no other lifetime may be in scope within them. [Associated consts](../"
"items/associated-items.md#associated-constants) do allow referring to "
"lifetimes declared in their trait or implementation."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes.generic\\] [常量](../items/constant-items.md)项、"
"[static](../items/static-items.md)项以及 [const 上下文](../"
"const_eval.md#const-context)始终只允许 `'static` 生命周期引用，因此其中不能有"
"其他生命周期在作用域中。[关联常量](../items/associated-items.md#associated-"
"constants)确实允许引用在其 trait 或实现中声明的生命周期。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:157
msgid "Higher-ranked trait bound scopes"
msgstr "高阶 trait 约束作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:159
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes.higher-ranked\\] The scope of a lifetime "
"parameter declared as a [higher-ranked trait bound](../trait-"
"bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds) depends on the scenario where it is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes.higher-ranked\\] 声明为[高阶 trait 约束](../trait-"
"bounds.md#higher-ranked-trait-bounds)的生命周期参数，其作用域取决于它的使用场"
"景。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:162
msgid ""
"As a \\[TypeBoundWhereClauseItem\\] the declared lifetimes are in scope in "
"the type and the type bounds."
msgstr ""
"作为 \\[TypeBoundWhereClauseItem\\] 时，声明的生命周期在类型和类型约束中处于"
"作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:163
msgid ""
"As a \\[TraitBound\\] the declared lifetimes are in scope within the bound "
"type path."
msgstr "作为 \\[TraitBound\\] 时，声明的生命周期在约束类型路径内处于作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:164
msgid ""
"As a \\[BareFunctionType\\] the declared lifetimes are in scope within the "
"function parameters and return type."
msgstr ""
"作为 \\[BareFunctionType\\] 时，声明的生命周期在函数参数和返回类型内处于作用"
"域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:170
msgid "// 'a is in scope in both the type and the type bounds.\n"
msgstr "// 'a 在类型和类型约束中都处于作用域内。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:175
msgid "// 'a is in scope within the bound.\n"
msgstr "// 'a 在约束内处于作用域内。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:182
msgid "// 'a is in scope in both the parameters and return type.\n"
msgstr "// 'a 在参数和返回类型中都处于作用域内。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:187
msgid "Impl trait restrictions"
msgstr "impl Trait 限制"

#: src/names/scopes.md:189
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes.impl-trait\\] [Impl trait](../types/impl-"
"trait.md) types can only reference lifetimes declared on a function or "
"implementation."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.lifetimes.impl-trait\\] [impl Trait](../types/impl-"
"trait.md) 类型只能引用在函数或实现上声明的生命周期。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:209
msgid ""
"// The `impl Trait2` here is not allowed to refer to 'b but it is allowed "
"to\n"
"// refer to 'a.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这里的 `impl Trait2` 不允许引用 'b，但允许\n"
"// 引用 'a。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:218
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.loop-label\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.loop-label\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:219
msgid "Loop label scopes"
msgstr "循环标签作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:221
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.loop-label.scope\\] [Loop labels](../expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#loop-labels) may be declared by a [loop expression](../expressions/"
"loop-expr.md). The scope of a loop label is from the point it is declared "
"till the end of the loop expression. The scope does not extend into [items]"
"(../items.md), [closures](../expressions/closure-expr.md), [async blocks](../"
"expressions/block-expr.md#async-blocks), [const arguments](../items/"
"generics.md#const-generics), [const contexts](../const_eval.md#const-"
"context), and the iterator expression of the defining [`for` loop](../"
"expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.loop-label.scope\\] [循环标签](../expressions/loop-"
"expr.md#loop-labels)可以由[循环表达式](../expressions/loop-expr.md)声明。循环"
"标签的作用域从其声明点开始，直到循环表达式的末尾。该作用域不会延伸到[项](../"
"items.md)、[闭包](../expressions/closure-expr.md)、[async 块](../expressions/"
"block-expr.md#async-blocks)、[const 实参](../items/generics.md#const-"
"generics)、[const 上下文](../const_eval.md#const-context)，以及定义该标签的 "
"[`for` 循环](../expressions/loop-expr.md#iterator-loops)的迭代表达式中。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:230
msgid ""
"// Using 'a here would be an error.\n"
"        // break 'a;\n"
msgstr ""
"// 在这里使用 'a 会是错误。\n"
"        // break 'a;\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:234
msgid "// The label is in scope for the expression of `while` loops.\n"
msgstr "// 该标签在 `while` 循环的表达式中处于作用域内。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:236 src/names/scopes.md:237
msgid "// Loop does not run.\n"
msgstr "// 循环不会运行。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:238
msgid "// The label is not in scope in the defining `for` loop:\n"
msgstr "// 该标签在定义它的 `for` 循环中不在作用域内：\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:241
msgid ""
"// This will break the outer loop, skipping the inner loop and stopping\n"
"    // the outer loop.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这会跳出外层循环，跳过内层循环并停止\n"
"    // 外层循环。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:244
msgid "// This does not run.\n"
msgstr "// 这里不会运行。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:246
msgid "// This does not run, either.\n"
msgstr "// 这里也不会运行。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:251
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.loop-label.shadow\\] Loop labels may shadow labels of the "
"same name in outer scopes. References to a label refer to the closest "
"definition."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.loop-label.shadow\\] 循环标签可以遮蔽外层作用域中同名的标"
"签。对标签的引用指向最近的定义。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:255
msgid "// Loop label shadowing example.\n"
msgstr "// 循环标签遮蔽示例。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:258
msgid ""
"// This terminates the inner loop, but the outer loop continues to run.\n"
msgstr "// 这会终止内层循环，但外层循环会继续运行。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:264
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.prelude\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.prelude\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:265
msgid "Prelude scopes"
msgstr "Prelude 作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:267
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.prelude.intro\\] [Preludes](preludes.md) bring entities "
"into scope of every module. The entities are not members of the module, but "
"are implicitly queried during [name resolution](name-resolution.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.prelude.intro\\] [Preludes](preludes.md) 将实体带入每个模块"
"的作用域中。这些实体不是模块的成员，但会在[名称解析](name-resolution.md)期间"
"被隐式查询。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:270
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.prelude.shadow\\] The prelude names may be shadowed by "
"declarations in a module."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.prelude.shadow\\] prelude 名称可以被模块中的声明遮蔽。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:273
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.prelude.layers\\] The preludes are layered such that one "
"shadows another if they contain entities of the same name. The order that "
"preludes may shadow other preludes is the following where earlier entries "
"may shadow later ones:"
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.prelude.layers\\] prelude 是分层的，因此如果它们包含同名实"
"体，一个 prelude 会遮蔽另一个 prelude。prelude 可以遮蔽其他 prelude 的顺序如"
"下，其中较早的条目可以遮蔽较后的条目："

#: src/names/scopes.md:276
msgid "[Extern prelude](preludes.md#extern-prelude)"
msgstr "[Extern prelude](preludes.md#extern-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:277
msgid "[Tool prelude](preludes.md#tool-prelude)"
msgstr "[Tool prelude](preludes.md#tool-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:278
msgid "[`macro_use` prelude](preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)"
msgstr "[`macro_use` prelude](preludes.md#macro_use-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:279
msgid "[Standard library prelude](preludes.md#standard-library-prelude)"
msgstr "[标准库 prelude](preludes.md#standard-library-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:280
msgid "[Language prelude](preludes.md#language-prelude)"
msgstr "[语言 prelude](preludes.md#language-prelude)"

#: src/names/scopes.md:282
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.macro_rules\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.macro_rules\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:283
msgid "`macro_rules` scopes"
msgstr "`macro_rules` 作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:285
msgid ""
"The scope of `macro_rules` macros is described in the [Macros By Example](../"
"macros-by-example.md) chapter. The behavior depends on the use of the "
"[`macro_use`](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-attribute) and "
"[`macro_export`](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_export-attribute) "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"`macro_rules` 宏的作用域在 [Macros By Example](../macros-by-example.md) 章节"
"中描述。其行为取决于 [`macro_use`](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-"
"attribute) 和 [`macro_export`](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_export-"
"attribute) 属性的使用。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:287
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.derive\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.derive\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:290
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.derive.scope\\] [Derive macro helper attributes](../"
"procedural-macros.md#derive-macro-helper-attributes) are in scope in the "
"item where their corresponding [`derive` attribute](../attributes/derive.md) "
"is specified. The scope extends from just after the `derive` attribute to "
"the end of the item. <!-- Note: Not strictly true, see https://github.com/"
"rust-lang/rust/issues/79202, but this is the intention. -->"
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.derive.scope\\] [派生宏辅助属性](../procedural-"
"macros.md#derive-macro-helper-attributes)在指定其对应 [`derive` 属性](../"
"attributes/derive.md)的项中处于作用域内。该作用域从 `derive` 属性之后开始，延"
"伸到该项的末尾。<!-- 注：并非严格如此，见 https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/79202，但这是预期行为。 -->"

#: src/names/scopes.md:293
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.derive.shadow\\] Helper attributes shadow other attributes "
"of the same name in scope."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.derive.shadow\\] 辅助属性会遮蔽作用域中同名的其他属性。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:296
msgid "r\\[names.scopes.self\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.scopes.self\\]"

#: src/names/scopes.md:297
msgid "`Self` scope"
msgstr "`Self` 作用域"

#: src/names/scopes.md:299
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.self.intro\\] Although [`Self`](../paths.md#self-1) is a "
"keyword with special meaning, it interacts with name resolution in a way "
"similar to normal names."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.self.intro\\] 虽然 [`Self`](../paths.md#self-1) 是具有特殊含"
"义的关键字，但它以类似普通名称的方式与名称解析交互。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:302
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.self.def-scope\\] The implicit `Self` type in the "
"definition of a [struct](../items/structs.md), [enum](../items/"
"enumerations.mdr), [union](../items/unions.md), [trait](../items/traits.md), "
"or [implementation](../items/implementations.md) is treated similarly to a "
"[generic parameter](#generic-parameter-scopes), and is in scope in the same "
"way as a generic type parameter."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.self.def-scope\\] [结构体](../items/structs.md)、[枚举](../"
"items/enumerations.mdr)、[联合体](../items/unions.md)、[trait](../items/"
"traits.md)或[实现](../items/implementations.md)定义中的隐式 `Self` 类型，会被"
"类似[泛型参数](#generic-parameter-scopes)地处理，并以与泛型类型参数相同的方式"
"处于作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:305
msgid ""
"r\\[names.scopes.self.impl-scope\\] The implicit `Self` constructor in the "
"value [namespace](namespaces.md) of an [implementation](../items/"
"implementations.md) is in scope within the body of the implementation (the "
"implementation's [associated items](../items/associated-items.md))."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.scopes.self.impl-scope\\] [实现](../items/implementations.md)的值"
"[命名空间](namespaces.md)中的隐式 `Self` 构造器，在该实现的主体（该实现的[关"
"联项](../items/associated-items.md)）内处于作用域内。"

#: src/names/scopes.md:309
msgid "// Self type within struct definition.\n"
msgstr "// 结构体定义内的 Self 类型。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:313
msgid "// Self type within generic parameters.\n"
msgstr "// 泛型参数内的 Self 类型。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:316
msgid "// Self value constructor within an implementation.\n"
msgstr "// 实现内的 Self 值构造器。\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:320
msgid "// Self type\n"
msgstr "// Self 类型\n"

#: src/names/scopes.md:321
msgid "// Self value constructor\n"
msgstr "// Self 值构造器\n"

#: src/names/preludes.md:1
msgid "r\\[names.preludes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:4
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.intro\\] A _prelude_ is a collection of names that are "
"automatically brought into scope of every module in a crate."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.intro\\] _prelude_（预导入集）是一组会自动引入到 crate 中"
"每个模块作用域内的名称。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:7
msgid ""
"These prelude names are not part of the module itself: they are implicitly "
"queried during [name resolution](name-resolution.md). For example, even "
"though something like \\[`Box`\\] is in scope in every module, you cannot "
"refer to it as `self::Box` because it is not a member of the current module."
msgstr ""
"这些 prelude 名称并不是模块本身的一部分：它们会在[名称解析](name-"
"resolution.md)期间被隐式查询。例如，尽管像 \\[`Box`\\] 这样的名称在每个模块中"
"都在作用域内，但你不能用 `self::Box` 指代它，因为它不是当前模块的成员。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:9
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.kinds\\] There are several different preludes:"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.kinds\\] 存在几种不同的 prelude："

