msgid "[Standard library prelude](names.preludes.std)"
msgstr "[标准库 prelude](names.preludes.std)"

#: src/names/preludes.md:13
msgid "[Extern prelude](#extern-prelude)"
msgstr "[Extern prelude](#extern-prelude)"

#: src/names/preludes.md:14
msgid "[Language prelude](#language-prelude)"
msgstr "[语言 prelude](#language-prelude)"

#: src/names/preludes.md:15
msgid "[`macro_use` prelude](#macro_use-prelude)"
msgstr "[`macro_use` prelude](#macro_use-prelude)"

#: src/names/preludes.md:16
msgid "[Tool prelude](#tool-prelude)"
msgstr "[工具 prelude](#tool-prelude)"

#: src/names/preludes.md:18
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.std\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.std\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:19
msgid "Standard library prelude"
msgstr "标准库 prelude"

#: src/names/preludes.md:21
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.std.intro\\] Each crate has a standard library prelude, "
"which consists of the names from a single standard library module."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.std.intro\\] 每个 crate 都有一个标准库 prelude，它由单个标"
"准库模块中的名称组成。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:24
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.std.module\\] The module used depends on the crate's "
"edition, and on whether the [`no_std` attribute](#the-no_std-attribute) is "
