msgstr "\\[`core::prelude::rust_2024`\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:34
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] \\[`std::prelude::rust_2015`\\] and \\"
"[`std::prelude::rust_2018`\\] have the same contents as \\"
"[`std::prelude::v1`\\]."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] \\[`std::prelude::rust_2015`\\] 和 \\"
"[`std::prelude::rust_2018`\\] 与 \\[`std::prelude::v1`\\] 具有相同的内容。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:37
msgid ""
"\\[`core::prelude::rust_2015`\\] and \\[`core::prelude::rust_2018`\\] have "
"the same contents as \\[`core::prelude::v1`\\]."
msgstr ""
"\\[`core::prelude::rust_2015`\\] 和 \\[`core::prelude::rust_2018`\\] 与 \\"
"[`core::prelude::v1`\\] 具有相同的内容。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:39
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] When one of \\[`core::panic!`\\] or \\[`std::panic!`\\] is "
"brought into scope due to the [standard library prelude]"
"(names.preludes.std), and a user-written [glob import](items.use.glob) "
"brings the other into scope, `rustc` currently allows use of `panic!`, even "
"though it is ambiguous. The user-written glob import takes precedence to "
"resolve this ambiguity."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 当 \\[`core::panic!`\\] 或 \\[`std::panic!`\\] 中的一个因[标准库 "
"prelude](names.preludes.std)而被引入作用域，而用户编写的 [glob 导入]"
"(items.use.glob)又将另一个引入作用域时，即使这存在歧义，`rustc` 目前也允许使"
"用 `panic!`。用户编写的 glob 导入优先用于解析此歧义。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:42
msgid ""
"For details, see \\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.panic-"
"hack\\]."
msgstr ""
"有关详情，请参见 \\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.panic-"
"hack\\]。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:44
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.extern\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.extern\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:45
msgid "Extern prelude"
msgstr "Extern prelude"

#: src/names/preludes.md:47
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.intro\\] External crates imported with [`extern "
"crate`](../items/extern-crates.md) in the root module or provided to the "
"compiler (as with the `--extern` flag with `rustc`) are added to the _extern "
"prelude_. If imported with an alias such as `extern crate orig_name as "
"new_name`, then the symbol `new_name` is instead added to the prelude."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.intro\\] 在根模块中用 [`extern crate`](../items/"
"extern-crates.md) 导入的外部 crate，或提供给编译器的外部 crate（例如通过 "
"`rustc` 的 `--extern` 标志提供），会被加入 _extern prelude_。如果使用诸如 "
"`extern crate orig_name as new_name` 的别名导入，则改为将符号 `new_name` 加入"
"该 prelude。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:50
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.core\\] The \\[`core`\\] crate is always added to "
"the extern prelude."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.core\\] \\[`core`\\] crate 总是会被加入 extern "
"prelude。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:53
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.std\\] The \\[`std`\\] crate is added as long as "
"the [`no_std` attribute](#the-no_std-attribute) is not specified in the "
"crate root."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.std\\] 只要 crate 根中未指定 [`no_std` 属性](#the-"
"no_std-attribute)，\\[`std`\\] crate 就会被加入。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:56
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.extern.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.extern.edition2018\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:57
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] In the 2015 edition, crates in the extern prelude cannot "
"be referenced via [use declarations](../items/use-declarations.md), so it is "
"generally standard practice to include `extern crate` declarations to bring "
"them into scope."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2015 edition 中，extern prelude 中的 crate 不能通过 "
"[use 声明](../items/use-declarations.md)引用，因此通常的标准做法是包含 "
"`extern crate` 声明，以将它们引入作用域。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:60
msgid ""
"Beginning in the 2018 edition, [use declarations](../items/use-"
"declarations.md) can reference crates in the extern prelude, so it is "
"considered unidiomatic to use `extern crate`."
msgstr ""
"从 2018 edition 开始，[use 声明](../items/use-declarations.md)可以引用 "
"extern prelude 中的 crate，因此使用 `extern crate` 被认为不符合惯用写法。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:62
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Additional crates that ship with `rustc`, such as \\[`alloc`\\], "
"and [`test`](mod@test), are not automatically included with the `--extern` "
"flag when using Cargo. They must be brought into scope with an `extern "
"crate` declaration, even in the 2018 edition."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 随 `rustc` 一同提供的其他 crate，例如 \\[`alloc`\\] 和 [`test`]"
"(mod@test)，在使用 Cargo 时不会通过 `--extern` 标志自动包含进来。即使在 2018 "
"edition 中，也必须用 `extern crate` 声明将它们引入作用域。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:70
msgid ""
"Cargo does bring in `proc_macro` to the extern prelude for proc-macro crates "
"only."
msgstr ""
"Cargo 确实会把 `proc_macro` 引入 extern prelude，但仅限 proc-macro crate。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:77
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:78
msgid "The `no_std` attribute"
msgstr "`no_std` 属性"

#: src/names/preludes.md:80
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.intro\\] The _`no_std` \\[attribute\\]\\"
"[attributes\\]_ causes the \\[`std`\\] crate to not be linked automatically "
"and the [standard library prelude](names.preludes.std) to instead use the "
"`core` prelude."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.intro\\] *`no_std` \\[属性\\]\\"
"[attributes\\]* 会使 \\[`std`\\] crate 不再被自动链接，并使[标准库 prelude]"
"(names.preludes.std)改为使用 `core` prelude。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:89
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Using `no_std` is useful when either the crate is targeting a "
"platform that does not support the standard library or is purposefully not "
"using the capabilities of the standard library. Those capabilities are "
"mainly dynamic memory allocation (e.g. `Box` and `Vec`) and file and network "
"capabilities (e.g. `std::fs` and `std::io`)."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 当 crate 面向不支持标准库的平台，或者有意不使用标准库能力时，使"
"用 `no_std` 很有用。这些能力主要包括动态内存分配（例如 `Box` 和 `Vec`）以及文"
"件和网络能力（例如 `std::fs` 和 `std::io`）。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:92
msgid ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] Using `no_std` does not prevent the standard library from "
"being linked. It is still valid to write `extern crate std` in the crate or "
"in one of its dependencies; this will cause the compiler to link the `std` "
"crate into the program."
msgstr ""
"\\[!WARNING\\] 使用 `no_std` 并不会阻止标准库被链接。在 crate 或其某个依赖中"
"编写 `extern crate std` 仍然是有效的；这会导致编译器将 `std` crate 链接到程序"
"中。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:95
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.syntax\\] The `no_std` attribute uses the \\"
"[MetaWord\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.syntax\\] `no_std` 属性使用 \\[MetaWord\\] "
"语法。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:98
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.allowed-positions\\] The `no_std` attribute "
"may only be applied to the crate root."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.allowed-positions\\] `no_std` 属性只能应用"
"于 crate 根。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:101
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.duplicates\\] The `no_std` attribute may be "
"used any number of times on a form."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.duplicates\\] `no_std` 属性可以在一个形式上"
"使用任意多次。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:107
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.module\\] The `no_std` attribute changes "
"the [standard library prelude](names.preludes.std) to use the `core` prelude "
"instead of the `std` prelude."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.module\\] `no_std` 属性会更改[标准库 "
"prelude](names.preludes.std)，使其使用 `core` prelude 而不是 `std` prelude。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:110
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.edition2018\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.extern.no_std.edition2018\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:111
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] Before the 2018 edition, `std` is injected into the "
"crate root by default. If `no_std` is specified, `core` is injected instead. "
"Starting with the 2018 edition, regardless of `no_std` being specified, "
"neither is injected into the crate root."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 在 2018 edition 之前，`std` 默认会被注入 crate 根。如果指"
"定了 `no_std`，则改为注入 `core`。从 2018 edition 开始，无论是否指定 "
"`no_std`，二者都不会被注入 crate 根。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:114
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.lang\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.lang\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:115
msgid "Language prelude"
msgstr "语言 prelude"

#: src/names/preludes.md:117
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.lang.intro\\] The language prelude includes names of "
"types and attributes that are built-in to the language. The language prelude "
"is always in scope."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.lang.intro\\] 语言 prelude 包含语言内建的类型和属性名称。"
"语言 prelude 始终在作用域内。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:120
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.lang.entities\\] It includes the following:"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.lang.entities\\] 它包括以下内容："

