msgstr "[布尔类型](../types/boolean.md) --- `bool`"

#: src/names/preludes.md:125
msgid "[`char`](../types/char.md)"
msgstr "[`char`](../types/char.md)"

#: src/names/preludes.md:126
msgid "[`str`](../types/str.md)"
msgstr "[`str`](../types/str.md)"

#: src/names/preludes.md:127
msgid ""
"[Integer types](../types/numeric.md#integer-types) --- `i8`, `i16`, `i32`, "
"`i64`, `i128`, `u8`, `u16`, `u32`, `u64`, `u128`"
msgstr ""
"[整数类型](../types/numeric.md#integer-types) --- `i8`, `i16`, `i32`, `i64`, "
"`i128`, `u8`, `u16`, `u32`, `u64`, `u128`"

#: src/names/preludes.md:128
msgid ""
"[Machine-dependent integer types](../types/numeric.md#machine-dependent-"
"integer-types) --- `usize` and `isize`"
msgstr ""
"[机器相关整数类型](../types/numeric.md#machine-dependent-integer-types) --- "
