msgstr ""
"[浮点类型](../types/numeric.md#floating-point-types) --- `f32` 和 `f64`"

#: src/names/preludes.md:130
msgid "[Macro namespace](namespaces.md)"
msgstr "[宏命名空间](namespaces.md)"

#: src/names/preludes.md:132
msgid "\\[Built-in derive macros\\]\\[attributes.derive.built-in\\]"
msgstr "\\[内建 derive 宏\\]\\[attributes.derive.built-in\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:134
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.macro_use\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.macro_use\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:135
msgid "`macro_use` prelude"
msgstr "`macro_use` prelude"

#: src/names/preludes.md:137
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.macro_use.intro\\] The `macro_use` prelude includes "
"macros from external crates that were imported by the [`macro_use` attribute]"
"(../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-attribute) applied to an [`extern "
"crate`](../items/extern-crates.md)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.macro_use.intro\\] `macro_use` prelude 包含来自外部 crate "
"的宏，这些宏是由应用于 [`extern crate`](../items/extern-crates.md) 的 "
"[`macro_use` 属性](../macros-by-example.md#the-macro_use-attribute)导入的。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:140
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.tool\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.tool\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:141
msgid "Tool prelude"
msgstr "工具 prelude"

#: src/names/preludes.md:143
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.tool.intro\\] The tool prelude includes tool names for "
"external tools in the [type namespace](namespaces.md). See the [tool "
"attributes](../attributes.md#tool-attributes) section for more details."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.tool.intro\\] 工具 prelude 包含[类型命名空间]"
"(namespaces.md)中外部工具的工具名称。更多详情见[工具属性](../"
"attributes.md#tool-attributes)一节。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:147
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:148
msgid "The `no_implicit_prelude` attribute"
msgstr "`no_implicit_prelude` 属性"

#: src/names/preludes.md:150
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.intro\\] The _`no_implicit_prelude` "
"[attribute](../attributes.md)_ is used to prevent implicit preludes from "
"being brought into scope."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.intro\\] *`no_implicit_prelude` [属性]"
"(../attributes.md)* 用于阻止隐式 prelude 被引入作用域。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:155
msgid "// The attribute can be applied to the crate root to affect\n"
msgstr "// 该属性可以应用于 crate 根，以影响\n"

#: src/names/preludes.md:156
msgid "// all modules.\n"
msgstr "// 所有模块。\n"

#: src/names/preludes.md:159
msgid "// Or it can be applied to a module to only affect that module\n"
msgstr "// 或者可以将其应用于某个模块，从而只影响该模块\n"

#: src/names/preludes.md:160
msgid "// and its descendants.\n"
msgstr "// 及其后代。\n"

#: src/names/preludes.md:167
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.syntax\\] The `no_implicit_prelude` "
"attribute uses the \\[MetaWord\\] syntax."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.syntax\\] `no_implicit_prelude` 属性使"
"用 \\[MetaWord\\] 语法。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:170
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.allowed-positions\\] The "
"`no_implicit_prelude` attribute may only be applied to the crate or to a "
"module."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.allowed-positions\\] "
"`no_implicit_prelude` 属性只能应用于 crate 或模块。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:176
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.duplicates\\] The "
"`no_implicit_prelude` attribute may be used any number of times on a form."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.duplicates\\] `no_implicit_prelude` 属"
"性可以在一个形式上使用任意多次。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:182
msgid ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.excluded-preludes\\] The "
"`no_implicit_prelude` attribute prevents the [standard library prelude]"
"(names.preludes.std), [extern prelude](#extern-prelude), [`macro_use` "
"prelude](#macro_use-prelude), and the [tool prelude](#tool-prelude) from "
"being brought into scope for the module and its descendants."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.excluded-preludes\\] "
"`no_implicit_prelude` 属性会阻止[标准库 prelude](names.preludes.std)、"
"[extern prelude](#extern-prelude)、[`macro_use` prelude](#macro_use-prelude)"
"和[工具 prelude](#tool-prelude)被引入该模块及其后代的作用域。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:185
msgid "r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.implicitly-imported-macros\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude.implicitly-imported-macros\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:186
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] Despite `#![no_implicit_prelude]`, `rustc` currently brings "
"certain macros implicitly into scope. Those macros are:"
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 尽管有 `#![no_implicit_prelude]`，`rustc` 目前仍会将某些宏隐式引"
"入作用域。这些宏是："

#: src/names/preludes.md:189
msgid "\\[`assert!`\\]"
msgstr "\\[`assert!`\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:190
msgid "\\[`cfg!`\\]"
msgstr "\\[`cfg!`\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:191
msgid "\\[`cfg_select!`\\]"
msgstr "\\[`cfg_select!`\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:192
msgid "\\[`column!`\\]"
msgstr "\\[`column!`\\]"

#: src/names/preludes.md:193
