"Don't rely on this behavior; it may be removed in the future. Always bring "
"the items you need into scope explicitly when using `#!"
"[no_implicit_prelude]`."
msgstr ""
"不要依赖此行为；它将来可能会被移除。使用 `#![no_implicit_prelude]` 时，始终要"
"显式地将你需要的项引入作用域。"

#: src/names/preludes.md:218
