msgstr "导入"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:74
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.intro\\] All `use` declarations are "
"fully resolved during this stage of resolution. [Type-relative paths]"
"(names.resolution.type-relative) cannot be resolved at this stage and will "
"produce an error."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.intro\\] 所有 `use` 声明都会在此解析阶"
"段中完全解析。[类型相对路径](names.resolution.type-relative)不能在此阶段解"
"析，并会产生错误。"

