#: src/names/name-resolution.md:112
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.shadowing\\] Names introduced via "
"`use` declarations in an [outer scope](#r-names.resolution.general.scopes) "
"are shadowed by candidates in the same namespace with the same name from an "
"inner scope except where otherwise restricted by [name resolution "
"ambiguities](#r-names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.shadowing\\] 通过[外层作用域](#r-"
"names.resolution.general.scopes)中的 `use` 声明引入的名称，会被内层作用域中同"
"一命名空间内同名的候选遮蔽，但受[名称解析歧义](#r-"
"names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity)另有限制的情况除外。"

