"[`use` glob shadowing](../items/use-declarations.md#r-"
"items.use.glob.shadowing)"
msgstr ""
"[`use` glob 遮蔽](../items/use-declarations.md#r-items.use.glob.shadowing)"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:144
