#: src/names/name-resolution.md:146
msgid "r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity\\]"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:147 src/names/name-resolution.md:385
msgid "Ambiguities"
msgstr "歧义"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:149
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.intro\\] There are certain "
"situations during expansion-time resolution where there are multiple macro "
"definitions, `use` declarations, or modules an import or macro invocation's "
"name could refer to where the compiler cannot consistently determine which "
"candidate should shadow the other. Shadowing cannot be permitted in these "
"situations and the compiler instead emits ambiguity errors."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.intro\\] 在展开时解析期间，"
"有些情况下，一个导入或宏调用的名称可能指向多个宏定义、`use` 声明或模块，而编"
"译器无法一致地确定哪个候选应遮蔽另一个候选。在这些情况下不能允许遮蔽，编译器"
"会改为发出歧义错误。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:152
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.glob-vs-glob\\] Names may "
"not be resolved through ambiguous glob imports. Glob imports are allowed to "
"import conflicting names in the same namespace as long as the name is not "
"used. Names with conflicting candidates from ambiguous glob imports may "
"still be shadowed by non-glob imports and used without producing an error. "
"The errors occur at time of use, not time of import."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.glob-vs-glob\\] 名称不得通过"
"有歧义的 glob 导入来解析。只要名称未被使用，glob 导入允许在同一命名空间中导入"
"相互冲突的名称。来自有歧义 glob 导入且具有冲突候选的名称，仍可被非 glob 导入"
"遮蔽，并且可以使用而不产生错误。错误发生在使用时，而不是导入时。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:163
msgid ""
"// OK: This brings conficting names in the same namespace into scope\n"
"// but they have not been used yet.\n"
msgstr ""
"// OK：这会把同一命名空间中相互冲突的名称引入作用域\n"
"// 但它们尚未被使用。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:170
msgid ""
"// The error happens when the name with the conflicting candidates\n"
"    // is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 当具有冲突候选项的名称\n"
"    // 被使用时，会发生错误。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:172
msgid "// ERROR: `Ambig` is ambiguous.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: `Ambig` is ambiguous.\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:186
msgid "// OK: No name conflict.\n"
msgstr "// OK: No name conflict.\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:188
msgid ""
"// This is permitted, since resolution is not through the\n"
"    // ambiguous globs.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这是允许的，因为解析并不是通过这些\n"
"    // 有歧义的 glob 导入进行的。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:195
msgid ""
"Multiple glob imports are allowed to import the same name, and that name is "
"allowed to be used if the imports are of the same item (following "
"reexports). The visibility of the name is the maximum visibility of the "
"imports."
msgstr ""
"允许多个 glob 导入导入同一个名称；如果这些导入（跟随重导出后）指向同一个项，"
"则该名称允许被使用。该名称的可见性是这些导入中的最大可见性。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:203
msgid "// This reexports the same `Ambig` item from a second module.\n"
msgstr "// 这会从第二个模块重新导出同一个 `Ambig` 项。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:208
msgid ""
"// These both import the same `Ambig`.\n"
"    //\n"
"    // The visibility of `Ambig` is `pub` because that is the\n"
"    // maximum visibility between these two `use` declarations.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这两者都导入同一个 `Ambig`。\n"
"    //\n"
"    // `Ambig` 的可见性是 `pub`，因为这是\n"
"    // 这两个 `use` 声明之间的最大可见性。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:217
msgid ""
"// `Ambig` can be used through the `m3` globs and still has\n"
"    // `pub` visibility.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 可以通过 `m3` 的 glob 使用 `Ambig`，并且它仍具有\n"
"    // `pub` 可见性。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:223
msgid "// Therefore, we can use it here.\n"
msgstr "// 因此，我们可以在这里使用它。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:229
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.glob-vs-outer\\] Names in "
"imports and macro invocations may not be resolved through glob imports when "
"there is another candidate available in an [outer scope](#r-"
"names.resolution.general.scopes)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.glob-vs-outer\\] 当[外层作用"
"域](#r-names.resolution.general.scopes)中有另一个可用候选时，导入和宏调用中的"
"名称不得通过 glob 导入解析。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:232
msgid "r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.panic-hack\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.panic-hack\\]"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:233
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] When one of \\[`core::panic!`\\] or \\[`std::panic!`\\] is "
"brought into scope due to the [standard library prelude](./preludes.md#r-"
"names.preludes.std), and a user-written [glob import](items.use.glob) brings "
"the other into scope, `rustc` currently allows use of `panic!`, even though "
"it is ambiguous. The user-written glob import takes precedence to resolve "
"this ambiguity."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 当 \\[`core::panic!`\\] 或 \\[`std::panic!`\\] 之一由于[标准库 "
"prelude](./preludes.md#r-names.preludes.std)进入作用域，并且用户编写的 [glob "
"导入](items.use.glob)将另一个带入作用域时，即使存在歧义，`rustc` 目前也允许使"
"用 `panic!`。用户编写的 glob 导入会优先用于解析此歧义。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:236
msgid ""
"In Rust 2021 and later, \\[`core::panic!`\\] and \\[`std::panic!`\\] operate "
"identically. But in earlier editions, they differ; only \\[`std::panic!`\\] "
"accepts a \\[`String`\\] as the format argument."
msgstr ""
"在 Rust 2021 及之后，\\[`core::panic!`\\] 和 \\[`std::panic!`\\] 的行为相同。"
"但在更早的 edition 中它们不同；只有 \\[`std::panic!`\\] 接受 \\[`String`\\] "
"作为格式实参。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:238
msgid "E.g., this is an error:"
msgstr "例如，这是一个错误："

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:248
msgid "And this is accepted:"
msgstr "而这是被接受的："

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:260
msgid "Don't rely on this behavior; the plan is to remove it."
msgstr "不要依赖这种行为；计划是移除它。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:262
msgid ""
"For details, see [Rust issue #147319](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/"
"issues/147319)."
msgstr ""
"详情见 [Rust issue #147319](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/"
"147319)。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:270
msgid "// Outer `ambig` candidate.\n"
msgstr "// 外层 `ambig` 候选项。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:277
msgid ""
"// Cannot resolve `ambig` through this glob\n"
"    // because of the outer `ambig` candidate above.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 无法通过这个 glob 导入解析 `ambig`\n"
"    // 因为上面有外层 `ambig` 候选项。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:280 src/names/name-resolution.md:303
#: src/names/name-resolution.md:347 src/names/name-resolution.md:418
#: src/names/name-resolution.md:476 src/names/name-resolution.md:498
msgid "// ERROR: `ambig` is ambiguous.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: `ambig` is ambiguous.\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:285
msgid "// As above, but with macros.\n"
msgstr "// 与上面相同，但使用宏。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:307
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] These ambiguity errors are specific to expansion-time "
"resolution. Having multiple candidates available for a given name during "
"later stages of resolution is not considered an error. So long as none of "
"the imports themselves are ambiguous, there will always be a single "
"unambiguous closest resolution."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 这些歧义错误是展开时解析特有的。在解析的后续阶段中，给定名称有多"
"个可用候选并不视为错误。只要导入本身没有歧义，总会有一个单一且无歧义的最近解"
"析。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:324
msgid "//      ^---- This `AMBIG` is resolved during primary resolution.\n"
msgstr "//      ^---- 这个 `AMBIG` 在主解析期间被解析。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:328
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.path-vs-textual-macro\\] "
"Names may not be resolved through ambiguous macro reexports. Macro reexports "
"are ambiguous when they would shadow a textual macro candidate for the same "
"name in an [outer scope](#r-names.resolution.general.scopes)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.imports.ambiguity.path-vs-textual-macro\\] 名"
"称不得通过有歧义的宏重导出来解析。当宏重导出会遮蔽[外层作用域](#r-"
"names.resolution.general.scopes)中同名的文本宏候选时，这些宏重导出就是有歧义"
"的。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:332
msgid "// Textual macro candidate.\n"
msgstr "// 文本宏候选项。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:336
msgid "// Path-based macro candidate.\n"
msgstr "// 基于路径的宏候选项。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:343
msgid ""
"// This reexport of the `path_based` macro definition\n"
"    // as `ambig` may not shadow the `ambig` macro definition\n"
"    // which is resolved via textual macro scope.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这次将 `path_based` 宏定义重新导出\n"
"    // 为 `ambig`，不能遮蔽通过文本宏作用域\n"
"    // 解析的 `ambig` 宏定义。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:351
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This restriction is needed due to implementation details in the "
"compiler, specifically the current scope visitation logic and the complexity "
"of supporting this behavior. This ambiguity error may be removed in the "
"future."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 需要这项限制是由于编译器中的实现细节，具体来说是当前的作用域访问"
"逻辑以及支持此行为的复杂性。此歧义错误将来可能会被移除。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:354
msgid "r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros\\]"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:357
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.intro\\] Macros are resolved by "
"iterating through the available scopes to find the available candidates. "
"Macros are split into two sub-namespaces, one for function-like macros, and "
"the other for attributes and derives. Resolution candidates from the "
"incorrect sub-namespace are ignored."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.intro\\] 解析宏时，会遍历可用作用域以查"
"找可用候选。宏分为两个子命名空间，一个用于类函数宏，另一个用于属性和 derive。"
"来自错误子命名空间的解析候选会被忽略。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:360
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.visitation-order\\] The available "
"scope kinds are visited in the following order. Each of these scope kinds "
"represent one or more scopes."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.visitation-order\\] 可用的作用域种类会"
"按以下顺序访问。每种作用域种类都代表一个或多个作用域。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:363
msgid ""
"[Derive helpers](../procedural-macros.md#r-macro.proc.derive.attributes)"
msgstr ""
"[derive 辅助属性](../procedural-macros.md#r-macro.proc.derive.attributes)"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:364
msgid ""
"[Textual scope macros](../macros-by-example.md#r-macro.decl.scope.textual)"
msgstr "[文本作用域宏](../macros-by-example.md#r-macro.decl.scope.textual)"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:365
msgid ""
"[Path-based scope macros](../macros.md#r-macro.invocation.name-resolution)"
msgstr "[基于路径的作用域宏](../macros.md#r-macro.invocation.name-resolution)"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:366
msgid "[`macro_use` prelude](./preludes.md#r-names.preludes.macro_use)"
msgstr "[`macro_use` prelude](./preludes.md#r-names.preludes.macro_use)"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:367
msgid "[Standard library prelude](./preludes.md#r-names.preludes.std)"
msgstr "[标准库 prelude](./preludes.md#r-names.preludes.std)"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:368
msgid "[Builtin attributes](./preludes.md#r-names.preludes.lang)"
msgstr "[内置属性](./preludes.md#r-names.preludes.lang)"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:370
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] The compiler will attempt to resolve derive helpers that are "
"used before their associated macro introduces them into scope. This scope is "
"visited after the scope for resolving derive helper candidates that are "
"correctly in scope. This behavior is slated for removal."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 编译器会尝试解析在其关联宏将它们引入作用域之前使用的 derive 辅助"
"属性。这个作用域会在用于解析已正确进入作用域的 derive 辅助属性候选的作用域之"
"后访问。此行为计划移除。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:373
msgid ""
"For more info see [derive helper scope](../procedural-macros.md#r-"
"macro.proc.derive.attributes.scope)."
msgstr ""
"更多信息见 [derive 辅助属性作用域](../procedural-macros.md#r-"
"macro.proc.derive.attributes.scope)。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:375
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This visitation order may change in the future, such as "
"interleaving the visitation of textual and path-based scope candidates based "
"on their lexical scopes."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 此访问顺序将来可能会改变，例如根据文本作用域候选和基于路径的作用"
"域候选的词法作用域交错访问它们。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:378
msgid ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] Starting in edition 2018 the `#[macro_use]` prelude is "
"not visited when \\[`#[no_implicit_prelude]`\\]\\"
"[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude\\] is present."
msgstr ""
"\\[!EDITION-2018\\] 从 edition 2018 开始，当存在 \\"
"[`#[no_implicit_prelude]`\\]\\[names.preludes.no_implicit_prelude\\] 时，不会"
"访问 `#[macro_use]` prelude。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:381
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.reserved-names\\] The names `cfg` and "
"`cfg_attr` are reserved in the macro attribute [sub-namespace](../names/"
"namespaces.md#r-names.namespaces.sub-namespaces)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.reserved-names\\] 名称 `cfg` 和 "
"`cfg_attr` 保留在宏属性[子命名空间](../names/namespaces.md#r-"
"names.namespaces.sub-namespaces)中。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:384
msgid "r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.ambiguity\\]"
msgstr "r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.ambiguity\\]"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:387
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.ambiguity.more-expanded-vs-outer\\] "
"Names may not be resolved through ambiguous candidates inside of macro "
"expansions. Candidates inside of macro expansions are ambiguous when they "
"would shadow a candidate for the same name from outside of the first "
"candidate's macro expansion and the invocation of the name being resolved is "
"also from outside of the first candidate's macro expansion."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.ambiguity.more-expanded-vs-outer\\] 名"
"称不得通过宏展开内的有歧义候选来解析。当宏展开内的候选会遮蔽来自第一个候选的"
"宏展开之外的同名候选，并且正在解析的名称的调用也来自第一个候选的宏展开之外"
"时，宏展开内的这些候选就是有歧义的。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:398
msgid "// Introduce outer candidate definition for `ambig` macro invocation.\n"
msgstr "// 为 `ambig` 宏调用引入外层候选定义。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:403
msgid ""
"// Introduce a second candidate definition for `ambig` inside of a\n"
"// macro expansion.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 为 `ambig` 引入第二个候选定义，它位于一次\n"
"// 宏展开中。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:407
msgid ""
"// The definition of `ambig` from the second invocation\n"
"// of `define_ambig` is the innermost canadidate.\n"
"//\n"
"// The definition of `ambig` from the first invocation of\n"
"// `define_ambig` is the second candidate.\n"
"//\n"
"// The compiler checks that the first candidate is inside of a macro\n"
"// expansion, that the second candidate is not from within the same\n"
"// macro expansion, and that the name being resolved is not from\n"
"// within the same macro expansion.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 来自第二次调用 `define_ambig` 的 `ambig` 定义\n"
"// 是最内层的候选项。\n"
"//\n"
"// 来自第一次调用 `define_ambig` 的\n"
"// `ambig` 定义是第二个候选项。\n"
"//\n"
"// 编译器会检查第一个候选项是否位于一次宏\n"
"// 展开中，第二个候选项不来自同一\n"
"// 宏展开内部，并且正在解析的名称也不来自\n"
"// 同一宏展开内部。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:421
msgid "The reverse is not considered ambiguous."
msgstr "相反的情况不被视为有歧义。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:430
msgid "// Swap order of definitions.\n"
msgstr "// 交换定义的顺序。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:435
msgid ""
"// The innermost candidate is now less expanded so it may shadow more\n"
"// the macro expanded definition above it.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 最内层候选现在展开得更少，因此它可以进一步遮蔽\n"
"// 其上方由宏展开产生的定义。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:441
msgid ""
"Nor is it ambiguous if the invocation being resolved is within the innermost "
"candidate's expansion."
msgstr "如果正在解析的调用位于最内层候选的展开之内，也不构成歧义。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:450
msgid "// Define innermost candidate.\n"
msgstr "// 定义最内层候选。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:455
msgid ""
"// Invocation of `ambig` is in the same expansion as the\n"
"        // innermost candidate.\n"
msgstr ""
"// `ambig` 的调用与\n"
"        // 最内层候选处于同一展开中。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:464
msgid ""
"It doesn't matter if both definitions come from invocations of the same "
"macro; the outermost candidate is still considered \"less expanded\" because "
"it is not within the expansion containing the innermost candidate's "
"definition."
msgstr ""
"即使两个定义都来自同一个宏的调用，也无关紧要；最外层候选仍被视为“展开程度较"
"低”，因为它不在包含最内层候选定义的展开之内。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:479
msgid ""
"This also applies to imports so long as the innermost candidate for the name "
"is from within a macro expansion."
msgstr "只要该名称的最内层候选来自宏展开之内，这也适用于导入。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:495
msgid ""
"// Introduce innermost candidate for\n"
"    // `ambig` mod in this macro expansion.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 为本次宏展开中的\n"
"    // `ambig` mod 引入最内层候选。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:502
msgid ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.ambiguity.built-in-attr\\] User-"
"defined attributes or derive macros may not shadow built-in non-macro "
"attributes (e.g. inline)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[names.resolution.expansion.macros.ambiguity.built-in-attr\\] 用户定义的属"
"性或 derive 宏不得遮蔽内置非宏属性（例如 inline）。"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:507 src/names/name-resolution.md:531
msgid "// with-helper/src/lib.rs\n"
msgstr "// with-helper/src/lib.rs\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:509
msgid ""
"//                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"//                                   User-defined attribute candidate.\n"
"// ...\n"
msgstr ""
"//                                             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n"
"//                                   用户定义的属性候选。\n"
"// ...\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:522
msgid "// ERROR: `non_exhaustive` is ambiguous.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: `non_exhaustive` is ambiguous.\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:526
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] This applies regardless of the name the built-in attribute is a "
"candidate for:"
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 无论内置属性是作为哪个名称的候选，这都适用："

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:535
msgid "//                                             ^^^^^^\n"
msgstr "//                                             ^^^^^^\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:536
msgid "//                                 User-defined attribute candidate.\n"
msgstr "//                                 用户定义的属性候选。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:547
msgid "//            ^----- Built-in attribute candidate via reexport.\n"
msgstr "//            ^----- 通过重新导出的内置属性候选。\n"

#: src/names/name-resolution.md:550
msgid "// ERROR: `helper` is ambiguous.\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: `helper` is ambiguous.\n"

