msgid ""
"The following grammar specifies the arguments that can be passed to the `asm!"
"`, `global_asm!` and `naked_asm!` macros."
msgstr ""
"以下语法指定了可以传递给 `asm!`、`global_asm!` 和 `naked_asm!` 宏的参数。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:111
msgid "r\\[asm.scope\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.scope\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:112 src/glossary.md:140
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "作用域"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:114
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.scope.intro\\] Inline assembly can be used in one of three ways."
msgstr "r\\[asm.scope.intro\\] 内联汇编可以通过三种方式之一使用。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:117
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.scope.asm\\] With the `asm!` macro, the assembly code is emitted in "
"a function scope and integrated into the compiler-generated assembly code of "
"a function. This assembly code must obey [strict rules](#rules-for-inline-"
"assembly) to avoid undefined behavior. Note that in some cases the compiler "
"may choose to emit the assembly code as a separate function and generate a "
"call to it."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.scope.asm\\] 使用 `asm!` 宏时，汇编代码会在函数作用域中发出，并集成到"
"编译器生成的函数汇编代码中。此汇编代码必须遵守[严格规则](#rules-for-inline-"
"assembly)，以避免未定义行为。注意，在某些情况下，编译器可能会选择将汇编代码作"
"为单独的函数发出，并生成对它的调用。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:122 src/inline-assembly.md:133
#: src/inline-assembly.md:144 src/inline-assembly.md:225
#: src/inline-assembly.md:237 src/inline-assembly.md:317
#: src/inline-assembly.md:335 src/inline-assembly.md:560
#: src/inline-assembly.md:564 src/inline-assembly.md:568
#: src/inline-assembly.md:572 src/inline-assembly.md:575
#: src/inline-assembly.md:584 src/inline-assembly.md:722
#: src/inline-assembly.md:763
msgid "\"/* {} */\""
msgstr "\"/* {} */\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:126
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.scope.naked_asm\\] With the `naked_asm!` macro, the assembly code is "
"emitted in a function scope and constitutes the full assembly code of a "
"function. The `naked_asm!` macro is only allowed in [naked functions]"
"(attributes/codegen.md#the-naked-attribute)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.scope.naked_asm\\] 使用 `naked_asm!` 宏时，汇编代码会在函数作用域中发"
"出，并构成函数的完整汇编代码。`naked_asm!` 宏只允许用于 [naked 函数]"
"(attributes/codegen.md#the-naked-attribute)。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:138
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.scope.global_asm\\] With the `global_asm!` macro, the assembly code "
"is emitted in a global scope, outside a function. This can be used to hand-"
"write entire functions using assembly code, and generally provides much more "
"freedom to use arbitrary registers and assembler directives."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.scope.global_asm\\] 使用 `global_asm!` 宏时，汇编代码会在函数外部的全"
"局作用域中发出。这可用于用汇编代码手写整个函数，并且通常为使用任意寄存器和汇"
"编器指令提供大得多的自由度。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:147
msgid "r\\[asm.ts-args\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.ts-args\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:148
msgid "Template string arguments"
msgstr "模板字符串参数"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:150
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.syntax\\] The assembler template uses the same syntax as "
"[format strings](std::fmt#syntax) (i.e. placeholders are specified by curly "
"braces)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.syntax\\] 汇编器模板使用与[格式字符串](std::fmt#syntax)相同的"
"语法（即，占位符由花括号指定）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:153
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.order\\] The corresponding arguments are accessed in order, "
"by index, or by name."
msgstr "r\\[asm.ts-args.order\\] 对应的参数会按顺序、按索引或按名称访问。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:160
msgid "// This\n"
msgstr "// 这个\n"

