#: src/inline-assembly.md:905 src/inline-assembly.md:1045
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1101 src/inline-assembly.md:1274
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1286 src/inline-assembly.md:1299
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1316
msgid "\"Test not supported on this arch\""
msgstr "\"Test not supported on this arch\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:185
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.one-or-more\\] An `asm!` invocation may have one or more "
"template string arguments; an `asm!` with multiple template string arguments "
"is treated as if all the strings were concatenated with a `\\n` between "
"them. The expected use is for each template string argument to correspond to "
"a line of assembly code."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.one-or-more\\] 一次 `asm!` 调用可以有一个或多个模板字符串参"
"数；带有多个模板字符串参数的 `asm!` 会被视为所有字符串之间用 `\\n` 连接在一"
"起。预期用法是每个模板字符串参数对应一行汇编代码。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:191
msgid "// We can separate multiple strings as if they were written together\n"
msgstr "// 可以把多个字符串分开写，就像它们写在一起一样\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:193
msgid "\"mov eax, 5\""
msgstr "\"mov eax, 5\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:193 src/inline-assembly.md:1011
msgid "\"mov ecx, eax\""
msgstr "\"mov ecx, eax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:193 src/inline-assembly.md:528
#: src/inline-assembly.md:847 src/inline-assembly.md:992
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1015
msgid "\"rax\""
msgstr "\"rax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:193
msgid "\"rcx\""
msgstr "\"rcx\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:198
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.before-other-args\\] All template string arguments must "
"appear before any other arguments."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.before-other-args\\] 所有模板字符串参数都必须出现在任何其他参"
"数之前。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:203
msgid "// The template strings need to appear first in the asm invocation\n"
msgstr "// 模板字符串需要首先出现在 asm 调用中\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:205 src/inline-assembly.md:1205
msgid "\"ud2\""
msgstr "\"ud2\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:205
msgid "// ERROR: unexpected token\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: unexpected token\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:210
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.positional-first\\] As with format strings, positional "
"arguments must appear before named arguments and explicit [register operands]"
"(#register-operands)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.positional-first\\] 与格式字符串一样，位置参数必须出现在命名"
"参数和显式[寄存器操作数](#register-operands)之前。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:214
msgid "// Named operands need to come after positional ones\n"
msgstr "// 命名操作数需要位于位置操作数之后\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:216
msgid "\"/* {x} {} */\""
msgstr "\"/* {x} {} */\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:216 src/inline-assembly.md:225
msgid ""
"// ERROR: positional arguments cannot follow named arguments or explicit "
"register arguments\n"
msgstr ""
"// ERROR: positional arguments cannot follow named arguments or explicit "
"register arguments\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:223
msgid "// We also can't put explicit registers before positional operands\n"
msgstr "// 也不能将显式寄存器放在位置操作数之前\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:225 src/inline-assembly.md:237
#: src/inline-assembly.md:506 src/inline-assembly.md:520
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1424
msgid "\"eax\""
msgstr "\"eax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:231
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.register-operands\\] Explicit register operands cannot be "
"used by placeholders in the template string."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.register-operands\\] 模板字符串中的占位符不能引用显式寄存器操"
"作数。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:235
msgid ""
"// Explicit register operands don't get substituted, use `eax` explicitly in "
"the string\n"
msgstr "// 显式寄存器操作数不会被替换，请在字符串中显式使用 `eax`\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:237
msgid "// ERROR: invalid reference to argument at index 0\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: invalid reference to argument at index 0\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:243
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.at-least-once\\] All other named and positional operands "
"must appear at least once in the template string, otherwise a compiler error "
"is generated."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.at-least-once\\] 所有其他命名操作数和位置操作数都必须在模板字"
"符串中至少出现一次，否则会生成编译器错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:247
msgid "// We have to name all of the operands in the format string\n"
msgstr "// 必须在格式字符串中命名所有操作数\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:249
msgid "// ERROR: multiple unused asm arguments\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: multiple unused asm arguments\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:255
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.opaque\\] The exact assembly code syntax is target-specific "
"and opaque to the compiler except for the way operands are substituted into "
"the template string to form the code passed to the assembler."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.opaque\\] 确切的汇编代码语法是目标特定的，并且除了操作数被替"
"换进模板字符串以形成传递给汇编器的代码这一方式之外，对编译器是不透明的。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:258
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.llvm-syntax\\] Currently, all supported targets follow the "
"assembly code syntax used by LLVM's internal assembler which usually "
"corresponds to that of the GNU assembler (GAS). On x86, the `.intel_syntax "
"noprefix` mode of GAS is used by default. On ARM, the `.syntax unified` mode "
"is used. These targets impose an additional restriction on the assembly "
"code: any assembler state (e.g. the current section which can be changed "
"with `.section`) must be restored to its original value at the end of the "
"asm string. Assembly code that does not conform to the GAS syntax will "
"result in assembler-specific behavior. Further constraints on the directives "
"used by inline assembly are indicated by [Directives Support](#directives-"
"support)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.ts-args.llvm-syntax\\] 目前，所有受支持目标都遵循 LLVM 内部汇编器所用"
"的汇编代码语法，该语法通常对应于 GNU 汇编器（GAS）的语法。在 x86 上，默认使"
"用 GAS 的 `.intel_syntax noprefix` 模式。在 ARM 上，使用 `.syntax unified` 模"
"式。这些目标对汇编代码施加一个额外限制：任何汇编器状态（例如可用 `.section` "
"改变的当前节）都必须在 asm 字符串结束时恢复为其原始值。不符合 GAS 语法的汇编"
"代码会导致汇编器特定的行为。内联汇编所用汇编器指令的进一步约束由[指令支持]"
"(#directives-support)指明。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:264
msgid "r\\[asm.attributes\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.attributes\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:267
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.attributes.supported-attributes\\] Only the [`cfg`](conditional-"
"compilation.md#the-cfg-attribute) and [`cfg_attr`](conditional-"
"compilation.md#the-cfg_attr-attribute) attributes are accepted semantically "
"on inline assembly template strings and operands. Other attributes are "
"parsed but rejected when the assembly macro is expanded."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.attributes.supported-attributes\\] 只有 [`cfg`](conditional-"
"compilation.md#the-cfg-attribute) 和 [`cfg_attr`](conditional-"
"compilation.md#the-cfg_attr-attribute) 属性在内联汇编模板字符串和操作数上会被"
"语义上接受。其他属性会被解析，但在展开汇编宏时被拒绝。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:274 src/inline-assembly.md:278
msgid "\"abort\""
msgstr "\"abort\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:275
msgid "\".cfi_startproc\""
msgstr "\".cfi_startproc\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:276
msgid ""
"// ...\n"
"    \"ret\""
msgstr ""
"// ...\n"
"    \"ret\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:279 src/inline-assembly.md:1548
msgid "\".cfi_endproc\""
msgstr "\".cfi_endproc\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:283
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] In `rustc`, the assembly macros implement handling of these "
"attributes separately from the normal system that handles similar attributes "
"in the language. This accounts for the limited kinds of attributes supported "
"and may give rise to subtle differences in behavior."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 在 `rustc` 中，汇编宏对这些属性的处理独立于语言中处理类似属性的常"
"规系统。这解释了受支持属性种类有限的原因，也可能产生行为上的细微差异。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:286
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.attributes.starts-with-template\\] Syntactically there must be at "
"least one template string before the first operand."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.attributes.starts-with-template\\] 从语法上讲，在第一个操作数之前必须"
"至少有一个模板字符串。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:290
msgid ""
"// This is rejected because `a = out(reg) x` does not parse as a\n"
"// template string.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 这会被拒绝，因为 `a = out(reg) x` 不会被解析为\n"
"// 模板字符串。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:294
msgid ""
"// ERROR.\n"
"    \"\""
msgstr ""
"// ERROR.\n"
"    \"\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:302
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:303
msgid "Operand type"
msgstr "操作数类型"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:305
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands\\] Several types of operands are "
"supported:"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands\\] 支持多种类型的操作数："

#: src/inline-assembly.md:308
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.in\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.in\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:309
msgid "`in(<reg>) <expr>`"
msgstr "`in(<reg>) <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:310 src/inline-assembly.md:326
#: src/inline-assembly.md:357
msgid ""
"`<reg>` can refer to a register class or an explicit register. The allocated "
"register name is substituted into the asm template string."
msgstr ""
"`<reg>` 可以指代寄存器类或显式寄存器。分配到的寄存器名称会替换到 asm 模板字符"
"串中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:311 src/inline-assembly.md:358
msgid ""
"The allocated register will contain the value of `<expr>` at the start of "
"the assembly code."
msgstr "在汇编代码开始时，分配到的寄存器将包含 `<expr>` 的值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:312
msgid ""
"The allocated register must contain the same value at the end of the "
"assembly code (except if a `lateout` is allocated to the same register)."
msgstr ""
"在汇编代码结束时，分配到的寄存器必须包含相同的值（除非 `lateout` 被分配到同一"
"寄存器）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:315
msgid "// ``in` can be used to pass values into inline assembly...\n"
msgstr "// ``in` 可用于把值传入内联汇编...\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:321
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] If the value's type is smaller than the register, the value of "
"the upper bits is platform-specific. Some targets zero out the upper bits, "
"while others leave them untouched."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 如果值的类型小于寄存器，则高位的值是平台特定的。一些目标会将高位"
"清零，而其他目标则保持高位不变。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:324
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.out\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.out\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:325
msgid "`out(<reg>) <expr>`"
msgstr "`out(<reg>) <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:327
msgid ""
"The allocated register will contain an undefined value at the start of the "
"assembly code."
msgstr "在汇编代码开始时，分配到的寄存器将包含未定义值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:328
msgid ""
"`<expr>` must be a (possibly uninitialized) place expression, to which the "
"contents of the allocated register are written at the end of the assembly "
"code."
msgstr ""
"`<expr>` 必须是一个（可能未初始化的）位置表达式，汇编代码结束时，分配到的寄存"
"器的内容会写入其中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:329
msgid ""
"An underscore (`_`) may be specified instead of an expression, which will "
"cause the contents of the register to be discarded at the end of the "
"assembly code (effectively acting as a clobber)."
msgstr ""
"可以指定下划线（`_`）来代替表达式，这会导致寄存器的内容在汇编代码结束时被丢弃"
"（实际上起到 clobber 的作用）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:333
msgid "// and `out` can be used to pass values back to rust.\n"
msgstr "// 而 `out` 可用于把值传回 Rust。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:339
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.lateout\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.lateout\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:340
msgid "`lateout(<reg>) <expr>`"
msgstr "`lateout(<reg>) <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:341
msgid ""
"Identical to `out` except that the register allocator can reuse a register "
"allocated to an `in`."
msgstr "与 `out` 相同，只是寄存器分配器可以复用分配给某个 `in` 的寄存器。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:342 src/inline-assembly.md:389
msgid ""
"You should only write to the register after all inputs are read, otherwise "
"you may clobber an input."
msgstr ""
"只有在读取完所有输入之后，才应该写入该寄存器；否则可能会 clobber 某个输入。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:346
msgid ""
"// `lateout` is the same as `out`\n"
"// but the compiler knows we don't care about the value of any inputs by "
"the\n"
"// time we overwrite it.\n"
msgstr ""
"// `lateout` 与 `out` 相同，\n"
"// 但编译器知道，到我们覆盖它时，\n"
"// 我们已经不关心任何输入的值。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:350
msgid "\"mov {}, 5\""
msgstr "\"mov {}, 5\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:355
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.inout\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.inout\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:356
msgid "`inout(<reg>) <expr>`"
msgstr "`inout(<reg>) <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:359
msgid ""
"`<expr>` must be a mutable initialized place expression, to which the "
"contents of the allocated register are written at the end of the assembly "
"code."
msgstr ""
"`<expr>` 必须是一个已初始化的可变位置表达式，汇编代码结束时，分配到的寄存器的"
"内容会写入其中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:363
msgid "// `inout` can be used to modify values in-register\n"
msgstr "// `inout` 可用于在寄存器中修改值\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:365 src/inline-assembly.md:381
#: src/inline-assembly.md:395 src/inline-assembly.md:1086
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1097
msgid "\"inc {}\""
msgstr "\"inc {}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:370
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.inout-arrow\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.inout-arrow\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:371
msgid "`inout(<reg>) <in expr> => <out expr>`"
msgstr "`inout(<reg>) <in expr> => <out expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:372
msgid ""
"Same as `inout` except that the initial value of the register is taken from "
"the value of `<in expr>`."
msgstr "与 `inout` 相同，只是寄存器的初始值取自 `<in expr>` 的值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:373
msgid ""
"`<out expr>` must be a (possibly uninitialized) place expression, to which "
"the contents of the allocated register are written at the end of the "
"assembly code."
msgstr ""
"`<out expr>` 必须是一个（可能未初始化的）位置表达式，汇编代码结束时，分配到的"
"寄存器的内容会写入其中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:374
msgid ""
"An underscore (`_`) may be specified instead of an expression for `<out "
"expr>`, which will cause the contents of the register to be discarded at the "
"end of the assembly code (effectively acting as a clobber)."
msgstr ""
"对于 `<out expr>`，可以指定下划线（`_`）来代替表达式，这会导致寄存器的内容在"
"汇编代码结束时被丢弃（实际上起到 clobber 的作用）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:375
msgid "`<in expr>` and `<out expr>` may have different types."
msgstr "`<in expr>` 和 `<out expr>` 可以具有不同类型。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:379
msgid "// `inout` can also move values to different places\n"
msgstr "// `inout` 也可以把值移动到不同位置\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:386
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.inlateout\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.inlateout\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:387
msgid "`inlateout(<reg>) <expr>` / `inlateout(<reg>) <in expr> => <out expr>`"
msgstr "`inlateout(<reg>) <expr>` / `inlateout(<reg>) <in expr> => <out expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:388
msgid ""
"Identical to `inout` except that the register allocator can reuse a register "
"allocated to an `in` (this can happen if the compiler knows the `in` has the "
"same initial value as the `inlateout`)."
msgstr ""
"与 `inout` 相同，只是寄存器分配器可以复用分配给某个 `in` 的寄存器（如果编译器"
"知道该 `in` 与 `inlateout` 具有相同初始值，就可能发生这种情况）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:393
msgid "// `inlateout` is `inout` using `lateout`\n"
msgstr "// `inlateout` 是使用 `lateout` 的 `inout`\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:400
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.sym\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.sym\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:401
msgid "`sym <path>`"
msgstr "`sym <path>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:402
msgid "`<path>` must refer to a `fn` or `static`."
msgstr "`<path>` 必须指向 `fn` 或 `static`。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:403
msgid ""
"A mangled symbol name referring to the item is substituted into the asm "
"template string."
msgstr "指向该项的经名称修饰的符号名会替换到 asm 模板字符串中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:404
msgid ""
"The substituted string does not include any modifiers (e.g. GOT, PLT, "
"relocations, etc)."
msgstr "替换进去的字符串不包含任何修饰符（例如 GOT、PLT、重定位等）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:405
msgid ""
"`<path>` is allowed to point to a `#[thread_local]` static, in which case "
"the assembly code can combine the symbol with relocations (e.g. `@plt`, "
"`@TPOFF`) to read from thread-local data."
msgstr ""
"`<path>` 允许指向 `#[thread_local]` static；在这种情况下，汇编代码可以将该符"
"号与重定位（例如 `@plt`、`@TPOFF`）组合起来，以读取线程局部数据。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:410
msgid "\"Hello from inline assembly\""
msgstr "\"Hello from inline assembly\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:411
msgid ""
"// `sym` can be used to refer to a function (even if it doesn't have an\n"
"// external name we can directly write)\n"
msgstr ""
"// `sym` 可用于引用函数（即使它没有\n"
"// 可供我们直接书写的外部名称）\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:414 src/inline-assembly.md:992
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1010 src/inline-assembly.md:1012
#: src/inline-assembly.md:1036
msgid "\"call {}\""
msgstr "\"call {}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:418
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.const\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.const\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:419
msgid "`const <expr>`"
msgstr "`const <expr>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:420
msgid ""
"`<expr>` must be an integer constant expression. This expression follows the "
"same rules as inline `const` blocks."
msgstr ""
"`<expr>` 必须是整数常量表达式。该表达式遵循与内联 `const` 块相同的规则。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:421
msgid ""
"The type of the expression may be any integer type, but defaults to `i32` "
"just like integer literals."
msgstr "该表达式的类型可以是任意整数类型，但和整数字面量一样，默认是 `i32`。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:422
msgid ""
"The value of the expression is formatted as a string and substituted "
"directly into the asm template string."
msgstr "该表达式的值会被格式化为字符串，并直接替换到 asm 模板字符串中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:425
msgid "// swizzle [0, 1, 2, 3] => [3, 2, 0, 1]\n"
msgstr "// 重排 [0, 1, 2, 3] => [3, 2, 0, 1]\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:429
msgid ""
"// Pass a constant value into an instruction that expects an immediate like "
"`pshufd`\n"
msgstr "// 将常量值传入期望像 `pshufd` 这样的立即数的指令\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:432
msgid "\"pshufd {xmm}, {xmm}, {shuffle}\""
msgstr "\"pshufd {xmm}, {xmm}, {shuffle}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:442
msgid "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.label\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.operand-type.supported-operands.label\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:443
msgid "`label <block>`"
msgstr "`label <block>`"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:444
msgid ""
"The address of the block is substituted into the asm template string. The "
"assembly code may jump to the substituted address."
msgstr "该块的地址会替换到 asm 模板字符串中。汇编代码可以跳转到替换后的地址。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:445
msgid ""
"For targets that distinguish between direct jumps and indirect jumps (e.g. "
"x86-64 with `cf-protection` enabled), the assembly code must not jump to the "
"substituted address indirectly."
msgstr ""
"对于区分直接跳转和间接跳转的目标（例如启用了 `cf-protection` 的 x86-64），汇"
"编代码不得间接跳转到替换后的地址。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:446
msgid "After execution of the block, the `asm!` expression returns."
msgstr "该块执行完毕后，`asm!` 表达式返回。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:447
msgid "The type of the block must be unit or `!` (never)."
msgstr "该块的类型必须是单元类型或 `!`（never）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:448
msgid ""
"The block starts a new safety context; unsafe operations within the `label` "
"block must be wrapped in an inner `unsafe` block, even though the entire "
"`asm!` expression is already wrapped in `unsafe`."
msgstr ""
"该块会开启新的安全上下文；`label` 块内的 unsafe 操作必须包裹在内部 `unsafe` "
"块中，即使整个 `asm!` 表达式已经包裹在 `unsafe` 中。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:453 src/inline-assembly.md:1223
msgid "\"jmp {}\""
msgstr "\"jmp {}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:454
msgid "\"Hello from inline assembly label\""
msgstr "\"Hello from inline assembly label\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:459
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.operand-type.left-to-right\\] Operand expressions are evaluated from "
"left to right, just like function call arguments. After the `asm!` has "
"executed, outputs are written to in left to right order. This is significant "
"if two outputs point to the same place: that place will contain the value of "
"the rightmost output."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.operand-type.left-to-right\\] 操作数表达式按从左到右的顺序求值，就像"
"函数调用实参一样。`asm!` 执行后，输出按从左到右的顺序写入。如果两个输出指向同"
"一位置，这一点就很重要：该位置将包含最右侧输出的值。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:464
msgid "// y gets its value from the second output, rather than the first\n"
msgstr "// y 的值来自第二个输出，而不是第一个输出\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:466
msgid "\"mov {}, 0\""
msgstr "\"mov {}, 0\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:466
msgid "\"mov {}, 1\""
msgstr "\"mov {}, 1\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:471
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.operand-type.naked_asm-restriction\\] Because `naked_asm!` defines a "
"whole function body and the compiler cannot emit any additional code to "
"handle operands, it can only use `sym` and `const` operands."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.operand-type.naked_asm-restriction\\] 由于 `naked_asm!` 定义整个函数"
"体，而编译器无法发出任何额外代码来处理操作数，因此它只能使用 `sym` 和 "
"`const` 操作数。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:474
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.operand-type.global_asm-restriction\\] Because `global_asm!` exists "
"outside a function, it can only use `sym` and `const` operands."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.operand-type.global_asm-restriction\\] 由于 `global_asm!` 位于函数之"
"外，它只能使用 `sym` 和 `const` 操作数。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:478
msgid "// register operands aren't allowed, since we aren't in a function\n"
msgstr "// 这里不在函数中，因此不允许使用寄存器操作数\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:481
msgid "// ERROR: the `in` operand cannot be used with `global_asm!`\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: the `in` operand cannot be used with `global_asm!`\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:490
msgid "// `const` and `sym` are both allowed, however\n"
msgstr "// 不过，`const` 和 `sym` 都是允许的\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:492
msgid "\"/* {} {} */\""
msgstr "\"/* {} {} */\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:495
msgid "r\\[asm.register-operands\\]"
msgstr "r\\[asm.register-operands\\]"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:496
msgid "Register operands"
msgstr "寄存器操作数"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:498
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.register-or-class\\] Input and output operands can "
"be specified either as an explicit register or as a register class from "
"which the register allocator can select a register. Explicit registers are "
"specified as string literals (e.g. `\"eax\"`) while register classes are "
"specified as identifiers (e.g. `reg`)."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.register-or-class\\] 输入和输出操作数既可以指定为显"
"式寄存器，也可以指定为寄存器类，由寄存器分配器从该类中选择一个寄存器。显式寄"
"存器用字符串字面量指定（例如 `\"eax\"`），而寄存器类用标识符指定（例如 "
"`reg`）。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:503
msgid ""
"// We can name both `reg`, or an explicit register like `eax` to get an\n"
"// integer register\n"
msgstr ""
"// 可以命名 `reg`，也可以命名像 `eax` 这样的显式寄存器，\n"
"// 以获得整数寄存器\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:506 src/inline-assembly.md:1035
msgid "\"mov eax, {:e}\""
msgstr "\"mov eax, {:e}\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:511
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.equivalence-to-base-register\\] Note that explicit "
"registers treat register aliases (e.g. `r14` vs `lr` on ARM) and smaller "
"views of a register (e.g. `eax` vs `rax`) as equivalent to the base register."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.equivalence-to-base-register\\] 注意，显式寄存器会"
"将寄存器别名（例如 ARM 上的 `r14` 与 `lr`）以及寄存器的较小视图（例如 `eax` "
"与 `rax`）视为等同于基寄存器。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:514
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.error-two-operands\\] It is a compile-time error "
"to use the same explicit register for two input operands or two output "
"operands."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.error-two-operands\\] 为两个输入操作数或两个输出操"
"作数使用同一个显式寄存器是编译时错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:518
msgid "// We can't name eax twice\n"
msgstr "// 不能两次命名 eax\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:520
msgid "// ERROR: register `eax` conflicts with register `eax`\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: register `eax` conflicts with register `eax`\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:526
msgid "// ... even using different aliases\n"
msgstr "// ... 即使使用不同的别名也不行\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:528 src/inline-assembly.md:540
msgid "\"ax\""
msgstr "\"ax\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:528
msgid "// ERROR: register `rax` conflicts with register `ax`\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: register `rax` conflicts with register `ax`\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:534
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.error-overlapping\\] Additionally, it is also a "
"compile-time error to use overlapping registers (e.g. ARM VFP) in input "
"operands or in output operands."
msgstr ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.error-overlapping\\] 此外，在输入操作数或输出操作数"
"中使用重叠的寄存器（例如 ARM VFP）也是编译时错误。"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:538
msgid "// al overlaps with ax, so we can't name both of them.\n"
msgstr "// al 与 ax 重叠，所以不能同时命名它们。\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:540
msgid "\"al\""
msgstr "\"al\""

#: src/inline-assembly.md:540
msgid "// ERROR: register `al` conflicts with register `ax`\n"
msgstr "// ERROR: register `al` conflicts with register `ax`\n"

#: src/inline-assembly.md:546
msgid ""
"r\\[asm.register-operands.allowed-types\\] Only the following types are "
"allowed as operands for inline assembly:"
msgstr ""
