#: src/inline-assembly.md:1067
msgid ""
"On AArch64 `x18` only included in the clobber list if it is not considered "
"as a reserved register on the target."
msgstr ""
"在 AArch64 上，只有当 `x18` 在目标上不被视为保留寄存器时，它才会被包含在 "
