#: src/const_eval.md:89
msgid "// Const blocks are similar to initializers of `const` items.\n"
msgstr "// const 块类似于 `const` 项的初始化器。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:95
msgid "// This is not allowed as 1) the temporary scope is extended to the\n"
msgstr "// 这是不允许的，因为 1) 临时作用域被延长到\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:96
msgid "// end of the program and 2) the temporary has interior mutability.\n"
msgstr "// 程序结束，且 2) 该临时项具有内部可变性。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:108
msgid "// Even though this borrow is mutable, it's not of a temporary, so\n"
msgstr "// 尽管此借用是可变的，但它不是对临时项的借用，所以\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:109
msgid "// this is allowed.\n"
msgstr "// 这是允许的。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:115
msgid "// Even though this borrow is of a value with interior mutability,\n"
msgstr "// 尽管此借用是对具有内部可变性的值的借用，\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:116
msgid "// it's not of a temporary, so this is allowed.\n"
msgstr "// 但它不是对临时项的借用，所以这是允许的。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:124
msgid "// This shared borrow of an interior mutable temporary is allowed\n"
msgstr "// 这个对内部可变临时项的共享借用是允许的，\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:125
msgid "// because its scope is not extended.\n"
msgstr "// 因为其作用域未被延长。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:130
msgid "// Even though the borrow is mutable and the temporary lives to the\n"
msgstr "// 尽管该借用是可变的，并且由于提升，该临时项会存活到\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:131
msgid "// end of the program due to promotion, this is allowed because the\n"
msgstr "// 程序结束，但这是允许的，因为该借用\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:132
msgid "// borrow is not in tail position and so the scope of the temporary\n"
msgstr "// 不在尾部位置，因此该临时项的作用域\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:133
msgid "// is not extended via temporary lifetime extension.\n"
msgstr "// 不会通过临时生命周期延长而被延长。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:135
msgid "//                                              ~~\n"
msgstr "//                                              ~~\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:136
msgid "//                                     Promoted temporary.\n"
msgstr "//                                     被提升的临时项。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:139
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] In other words --- to focus on what's allowed rather than what's "
"not allowed --- shared borrows of interior mutable data and mutable borrows "
"are only allowed in a [const context](#const-context) when the borrowed "
"[place expression](expr.place-value.place-memory-location) is _transient_, "
"_indirect_, or _static_."
msgstr ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] 换句话说，为了聚焦于允许的情况而非不允许的情况，只有当被借用的[位"
"置表达式](expr.place-value.place-memory-location)是 *瞬时的*、*间接的* 或 "
"_static_ 时，内部可变数据的共享借用和可变借用才允许出现在 [const 上下文]"
"(#const-context)中。"

#: src/const_eval.md:142
msgid ""
"A place expression is _transient_ if it is a variable local to the current "
"const context or an expression whose temporary scope is contained inside the "
"current const context."
msgstr ""
"如果一个位置表达式是当前 const 上下文局部的变量，或是其临时作用域包含在当前 "
"const 上下文内的表达式，则它是 *瞬时的*。"

#: src/const_eval.md:145
msgid "// The borrow is of a variable local to the initializer, therefore\n"
msgstr "// 该借用是对初始化器局部变量的借用，因此\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:146
msgid "// this place expression is transient.\n"
msgstr "// 此位置表达式是瞬时的。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:151
msgid "// The borrow is of a temporary whose scope has not been extended,\n"
msgstr "// 该借用是对作用域未被延长的临时项的借用，\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:152
msgid "// therefore this place expression is transient.\n"
msgstr "// 因此此位置表达式是瞬时的。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:157
msgid "// When a temporary is promoted but not lifetime extended, its\n"
msgstr "// 当临时项被提升但生命周期未被延长时，其\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:158
msgid "// place expression is still treated as transient.\n"
msgstr "// 位置表达式仍被视为瞬时的。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:162
msgid ""
"A place expression is _indirect_ if it is a [dereference expression]"
"(expr.deref)."
msgstr "如果一个位置表达式是[解引用表达式](expr.deref)，则它是 *间接的*。"

#: src/const_eval.md:168
msgid "A place expression is _static_ if it is a `static` item."
msgstr "如果一个位置表达式是 `static` 条目，则它是 _static_。"

#: src/const_eval.md:175
msgid ""
"\\[!NOTE\\] One surprising consequence of these rules is that we allow this,"
msgstr "\\[!NOTE\\] 这些规则的一个令人意外的结果是，我们允许这样写，"

#: src/const_eval.md:180
msgid "//                                    ~~~~~~~\n"
msgstr "//                                    ~~~~~~~\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:181
msgid "// Empty arrays are promoted even behind mutable borrows.\n"
msgstr "// 即使位于可变借用之后，空数组也会被提升。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:184
msgid "but we disallow this similar code:"
msgstr "但不允许下面这段类似的代码："

#: src/const_eval.md:188
msgid "//               ~~~~~~~\n"
msgstr "//               ~~~~~~~\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:189
msgid "//           Tail expression.\n"
msgstr "//           尾表达式。\n"

#: src/const_eval.md:192
msgid ""
"The difference between these is that, in the first, the empty array is "
"[promoted](destructors.md#constant-promotion) but its scope does not undergo "
"[temporary lifetime extension](destructors.scope.lifetime-extension), so we "
"consider the [place expression](expr.place-value.place-memory-location) to "
"be transient (even though after promotion the place indeed lives to the end "
"of the program). In the second, the scope of the empty array temporary does "
"undergo lifetime extension, and so it is rejected due to being a mutable "
"borrow of a lifetime-extended temporary (and therefore borrowing a non-"
"transient place expression)."
msgstr ""
"二者的区别在于，在第一个示例中，空数组会被[提升](destructors.md#constant-"
"promotion)，但它的作用域不会经历[临时生命周期延长]"
"(destructors.scope.lifetime-extension)，因此我们认为该[位置表达式]"
"(expr.place-value.place-memory-location)是瞬时的（尽管在提升之后，该位置确实"
"会存活到程序结束）。在第二个示例中，空数组临时值的作用域确实会经历生命周期延"
"长，因此它会因作为对生命周期被延长的临时值的可变借用而被拒绝（也因此借用了非"
"瞬时的位置表达式）。"

#: src/const_eval.md:194
msgid ""
"The effect is surprising because temporary lifetime extension, in this case, "
"causes less code to compile than would without it."
msgstr ""
"这种效果令人意外，因为在此情形下，临时生命周期延长会使可编译的代码少于没有它"
"时的情况。"

#: src/const_eval.md:196
msgid ""
"See [issue #143129](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/143129) for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"更多细节见 [issue #143129](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/143129)。"

